window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4201,"title":"Chapter 4201 A Fifth-Stage Ruler","paragraphs":["4201 A Fifth-Stage Ruler","In his opinion, Jian Wushuang was only a fourth-stage Ruler. Even if he broke through successfully and became a fifth-stage Ruler, he would not be a match for him.","As time slowly passed, the vortex grew larger and larger, like a black hole that could devour the starry sky. Its momentum was terrifying to the extreme.","The Demonic Wind Ruler and the others did not leave. Instead, they sat cross-legged by the river of enlightenment, waiting for Jian Wushuang to come out of seclusion.","One day passed...","Two days had passed...","In the blink of an eye, two years had passed.","The riverbank of the river of enlightenment was now surrounded by people. they were all furious and stared at the turbulent whirlpool in the river of enlightenment with hostility.","Ever since the whirlpool appeared, the law energy in the river of enlightenment became chaotic and was sucked away by the whirlpool. They did not even cultivate in the river of enlightenment.","Thus, they were currently filled with pent-up anger and wanted to vent it.","“Rumble!”","Finally, on a certain day two years later, the surface of the entire river of enlightenment began to boil violently. Like boiling water, fist-sized bubbles appeared.","It was as if a monster was about to walk out of the river of enlightenment.","“Jian Wushuang is coming out!”","“Hmph, Jian Wushuang is finally coming out. i’ve been waiting for a long time.”","“Apologize! Jian Wushuang must apologize to us!”","On the riverbank, many new disciples of the Divine Life Palace were clamoring.","As for the Demonic Wind Ruler, he slowly straightened his body and gloomily looked at the river of enlightenment.","...","At this moment, at the bottom of the river of enlightenment.","A huge rock covered in aquatic grass suddenly trembled.","Kachaa.","A crack instantly appeared on the huge rock.","Kacha kacha kacha.","Then, more and more cracks appeared. Finally, with a loud bang, the rock exploded completely, revealing a cold figure in black clothes and black hair who was sitting cross-legged.","“A fifth-stage chief Ruler...it’s finally done.” A low and cold voice came out of the black figure’s mouth.","The next moment.","The man in black slowly raised his head and opened his eyes.","In an instant, two rays of divine light flashed through his eyes like lightning that tore through the night!","“I...I...you’ve become even stronger.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. He could feel that after he had finished digesting the divine medicine in his body, the abundant divine power was about to burst his divine body!","Jian Wushuang had an illusion that he could crush a star and a galaxy with a raise of his hand!","“Lord River Spirit, thank you again.”","Jian Wushuang looked at River Spirit, who was sitting on the ground and looking up at the sky with a smile.","“Don’t talk to me, I just want some peace and quiet.” The River Spirit waved his hand weakly.","Jian Wushuang could not help but smile.","“Lord River Spirit, please take your time to rest. I’ll take my leave.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at him.","It had been ten thousand years. He should go out and take a look.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot and his whole body shot up into the sky!","...","Bang!","A beam of golden light shot out of the river of enlightenment!","“Jian Wushuang!”","“He’s finally out!!”","In an instant, countless cold snorts sounded.","The Demonic Wind Ruler squinted his eyes and took a step forward, dashing toward Jian Wushuang.","“You are Jian Wushuang?”","He stood in front of Jian Wushuang and sized him up. Then, he asked with an unfriendly look.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was strange. Why were there so many people surrounding him the moment he came out?","Although he was confused, Jian Wushuang did not think too much about it. He cupped his hands politely and replied, “Yes, it’s me. What’s the matter?”","“Do you know that because of you, the principles of the river of enlightenment are in chaos and we can’t cultivate anymore?” Demonic Wind Ruler asked.","“Oh, I’m sorry.” Jian Wushuang replied. Perhaps he had not paid attention to the strength at the last moment of his breakthrough, causing him to absorb too much aura of principles at once.","After saying that, Jian Wushuang flew away.","After ten thousand years of closed-door cultivation, Jian Wushuang could not help but miss home.","Looking at Jian Wushuang’s back, the Demonic Wind Ruler’s expression turned gloomy.","“An apology and that’s it?” Demonic Wind Ruler said coldly.","His fans, as well as the new disciples of the Divine Life Palace, were all talking at once.","“How can there be such a rude person in this world?”","“I can’t leave. I have to leave something behind as the price!”","“Hmph, it’s because of him that so many of us can’t cultivate. How can an apology be enough to let it go?”","“Right, they must compensate us for our losses!”","They did not try to hide their voices, so Jian Wushuang could hear them.","Jian Wushuang stopped.","He frowned and turned around to look at the new disciples of the Divine Life Palace. He said indifferently, “How do you want to compensate?”","The new disciples of the Divine Life Palace could not help but look at each other.","It seemed that Jian Wushuang was a pushover.","They were overjoyed. They had never thought that Jian Wushuang would be so easy to talk to and agree to the compensation.","The fear in his heart instantly disappeared.","“I want 10000 Universe Origin Stones!”","“I want a godly medicine!”","“I want a principles treasure!”","They all shouted at the same time.","A look of contempt appeared on Demonic Wind Ruler’s face.","It seemed that Jian Wushuang was only so-so.","“Be quiet.” He pressed his hand down.","Instantly, the noisy crowd quieted down.","“Mm.” Demonic Wind Ruler nodded, satisfied with his prestige.","“Jian Wushuang, when I first came to the Divine Life Palace, I heard people saying that you were the number one genius. However, I didn’t believe it and wanted to see for myself. How is it?”","The Demonic Wind Ruler looked at Jian Wushuang with a fake smile.","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to reply, he smiled and continued, “Jian Wushuang, don’t say that I’m bullying you. Since you’ve just become a fifth stage great Ruler, I’ll let you have one move first. How about it?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly became strange. The current him was afraid that even the Ninth Kalpa King, who was comparable to a Supreme, would not dare to say that he would give him a first move. However, this hothead who came out of nowhere actually said that he would give him a first move?","“Oh? are you sure?” Jian Wushuang blinked his eyes and said.","“Hmph, I, Demonic Wind, always keep my word. If I say I’ll let you have one move, then I’ll let you have one move. Is this a lie?” The Demonic Wind Ruler harrumphed coldly in displeasure, “Jian Wushuang, I promise you that if I lose, all the compensation will be written off. What do you think?”","Jian Wushuang replied with a faint ‘hmm’, then swept his gaze across the faces of Demonic Wind Ruler’s fans. he raised his eyebrows and asked, “You all agree with what he said.”","..."]},{"number":4202,"title":"Chapter 4202 The Lord","paragraphs":["4202 The Lord","“Of course!”","“Whatever Demonic Wind Ruler says!”","“That’s right. As long as you can defeat Demonic Wind, we won’t ask for any compensation!”","The new disciples of the Divine Life Palace, who followed the Demonic Wind Ruler’s lead, all began to shout and express their loyalty.","Jian Wushuang nodded and fixed his eyes on the Demonic Wind Ruler. He sighed and said, “Then come.”","“Come on!”","The Demonic Wind Ruler puffed out his chest and looked at Jian Wushuang fearlessly.","Jian Wushuang shook his head. Controlling his power, he carefully extended a finger and pointed at the Demonic Wind Ruler.","“Eh? Jian Wushuang, are you looking down on me? Please use your full strength!”","Looking at Jian Wushuang’s soft finger, the Demonic Wind Ruler raised his thick eyebrows and said unhappily.","However, before he could finish his sentence...","The finger gently touched the Demonic Wind Ruler’s chest.","Bang!","Instantly, a massive boom rang out, and the entire fourth mountain range seemed to be on the verge of collapse.","Under this finger, the world lost its color, and it was a scene of destruction!","...","Demonic Wind Ruler’s expression was one of shock. Before he could even finish speaking, he was sent flying backwards, creating a three-hundred-meter deep crater in the ground!","His divine body was on the verge of collapse. He had almost been killed by this finger.","In an instant, the entire riverbank of the river of enlightenment was silent.","It was as if everyone was frozen in time. Their mouths were wide open as they looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","“This...this is too fierce, right?!!”","“They’re not on the same level at all!!!”","Jian Wushuang could not help but raise his eyebrows. He had tried his best to control his power, afraid that he would accidentally kill the Demonic Wind Ruler.","“Do you still want compensation?” Jian Wushuang looked at the crowd by the river of enlightenment and asked.","“No...I don’t want it.”","“Senior Wushuang, as long as you are happy.”","The new disciples of the Divine Life Palace almost fell to the ground in fear when they heard Jian Wushuang’s question. They could only feel their teeth chattering when they replied.","“Then I...he left?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said.","“Take care, take care.”","The new disciples of the Divine Life Palace sneered.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and took a step forward. He suddenly turned into a golden light and disappeared from everyone’s sight.","To him, this was just a small interlude.","After a while, the news that Jian Wushuang had broken through to the fifth level of Ruler and defeated Demonic Wind Ruler with one finger spread to the Divine Life Palace.","Most of the senior disciples of the Divine Life Palace smiled faintly when they heard the news. To them, it was normal for Jian Wushuang to defeat the Demonic Wind Ruler with one finger. It would be strange if Jian Wushuang was defeated by the Demonic Wind Ruler.","As for the new disciples of the Divine Palace who had never seen Jian Wushuang’s skills, they were all shocked. They no longer looked down on Jian Wushuang, but were full of fear and respect.","Just as everyone was marveling at Jian Wushuang’s unparalleled talent, he suddenly received a message from the Ruler Blood Wave, inviting him to the Supreme shrine.","Jian Wushuang, come to the Supreme shrine!","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he replied. He turned around and headed toward the Supreme shrine instead of the sixth mountain range.","Along the way, many Rulers of the fourth and fifth level raised their heads and looked at Jian Wushuang with envy.","“This is Jian Wushuang. He’s so young.”","“Jian Wushuang has only been in the Divine Life Palace for a short time, but he has already broken through from a third stage great Ruler to a fifth stage great Ruler. I can’t help but be impressed by his speed of advancement.”","Jian Wushuang is indeed worthy of the title of the number one genius in the Divine Life Palace.","The countless Rulers of the Divine Life Palace sighed.","The Rulers, who had wanted to compete with Jian Wu, shook their heads and extinguished their thoughts.","Although Jian Wushuang was still a fifth stage Ruler, he had already reached a level that they could not catch up to.","After a while, Jian Wushuang stepped into the Supreme shrine under the gaze of the Rulers who were guarding the door.","The Blood Wave Master was the only one in the divine Hall. He was looking at Jian Wushuang with a smile.","“Ruler Blood Wave.” Jian Wushuang lowered his head slightly and greeted him respectfully.","“I heard that you’ve broken through to the fifth stage great Ruler realm?” Ruler Blood Wave sensed the divine power aura on Jian Wushuang and a look of relief flashed across his face. “Hehe, very good. As expected of the person I personally picked. If you continue to develop at this rate, you will definitely become an Overlord in the future.”","He was happy that Jian Wushuang had made a breakthrough, but what made him happy was Jian Wushuang’s attitude toward him.","He did not see any pride or self-satisfaction in Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was as calm and composed as when he first met him. He had a modest, confident, and powerful heart.","“Supreme Blood Wave, is there something you need from me?” Jian Wushuang asked.","The Blood Wave Ruler’s expression gradually turned solemn as he said in a deep voice, “Jian Wushuang, do you know about the ancient starry sky road?”","“The ancient path of stars?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He had never heard anyone say these words before. “I really don’t know. Please explain in detail, Ruler Blood Wave.”","Ruler Blood Wave said, “Jian Wushuang, you’ve just arrived in the depths of the universe. It’s normal that you don’t know about the ancient path of stars. Fine. I’ll tell you about it first.”","“The ancient path of the starry sky is divided into two paths. One is the Ruler path of the starry sky, which can only be used by Rulers. The other is the Ruler path of the starry sky. Generally speaking, the people on these two paths don’t interfere with each other, and they rarely meet.”","These two ancient starry sky paths were personally opened by the great master of our universe. The opportunities and treasures inside are countless. Compared to the opportunities in the Tarot Ruins, they are much higher.","“Of course, this is nothing worth mentioning. The most important thing is that His Excellency will personally pay attention to these two ancient paths!”","“Jian Wushuang, do you know what this means? This meant that if you performed well on the ancient path of stars, you would be able to enter the eyes of that Lord! And once you truly enter the eyes of that Lord, that would be a heaven-defying fortune!”","“That Lord?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He could not think of anyone else in the universe worthy of being addressed as ‘Lord’ by the Ruler Blood Wave.","“Supreme Blood Wave, may I ask who that Lord is?” Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and asked.","Ruler Blood Wave pondered for a moment before replying, “You have yet to break through to the Supreme-being realm, so you can’t know who that Lord is. “You’ll naturally know who he is after you break through to the Supreme-being realm.”"]},{"number":4203,"title":"Chapter 4203 Breaking Through to the Supreme-Being Realm?","paragraphs":["4203 Breaking Through to the Supreme-Being Realm?","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows in surprise. Was the identity of the Lord so mysterious?","He did not even have the qualifications to know his name if he was not a Supreme martial artist?","“Jian Wushuang, you should not ask about the identity of that Lord now. Even if you know it by chance, it’s not a good thing for you.” The Blood Wave Ruler said in a deep voice.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded. He was not a hothead and naturally knew that he should not ask about things he should not.","When the Blood Wave Ruler saw this, he could not help but smile and say, “Jian Wushuang, I can’t tell you the identity of that Lord, but I can tell you some secrets related to it.”","“Have you heard of the myriad tribes gathering?” Supreme Blood Wave asked after a pause.","“This...I don’t know.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands. He had mentioned the Grand Clan Gathering before Ruler Whitefloat left, but it was no different from not knowing.","“The Grand Tribe Gathering is held once every 50 chaos cycles,” The Ruler Blood Wave replied. “Every power in the universe, whether it’s the Undying Divine Kingdom, the Ancient Holy Lands, or even the famous lone warriors of the universe, will attend. It can be said to be a gathering of the most powerful experts in the universe.","“Originally, only Supreme-beings can get an entrance ticket to this Grand meeting. However, that Lord has specially relaxed the conditions for this Grand meeting of the universe’s myriad races, allowing Rulers to enter.","“And this is only the beginning. That Lord will choose ten people from the Grand Tribe Gathering to become his children and listen to his lectures.","“Jian Wushuang, don’t look down on your identity as a boy. Do you know why your previous owner of the Tarot Ruins, the Tarot supremacy, became an invincible supremacy?”","Jian Wushuang was shocked and said with uncertainty, “Hmm...could it be that Tarot supremacy is one of the servants of that Lord?”","The Blood Wave Ruler nodded his head and replied, “That’s right. Back then, Supreme Tarot was extremely talented in the way of the sword, and his performance was eye-catching in the Grand Tribe Gathering. Thus, he was given a seat by that Lord and became one of the seven people who would listen to his teachings for a hundred years. It was also this opportunity that allowed Supreme Tarot to truly soar and become one of the top unparalleled Supremes in the universe.","“Speaking of which, the Tarot Divine Sword was given to Supreme Tarot by that Lord.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang felt his heart palpitate.","Even Supreme Tarot was just a child under that Lord?","Then...just how high was that Lord’s status?","Jian Wushuang did not dare to think further.","“Jian Wushuang, this is a rare opportunity. My suggestion is that you go to the ancient path of the Ruler of stars. Maybe you will have a chance to enter the universe myriad Clan Gathering. Even if you can’t be one of the ten seats, the gains you will get from the universe myriad Clan Gathering will be beyond your imagination.” The Blood Wave Ruler said with a smile.","“This...I need to think about it.” Jian Wushuang thought for a while and replied.","Jian Wushuang did not know much about the ancient path of stars. He was never a reckless person. If the ancient path of stars was really suitable for him, he would naturally not miss the grand event of the entire universe.","“That’s natural.” The Blood Wave Ruler nodded with a smile.","The two of them chatted for a while more. At this moment, the disciple in charge of guarding the door outside the hall suddenly rushed in.","“Lord Blood Wave, the Nine...the Ninth Kalpa King is about to break through to the Supreme-being realm!”","“What?”","The Ruler Blood Wave and Jian Wushuang were both shocked. Then, they looked at each other and smiled.","“Good, good, good. It seems that our Divine Life Palace will soon have another Ninth Kalpa King Supreme! Let’s go and take a look!”","After saying that, the Ruler Blood Wave and Jian Wushuang walked out of the supreme shrine.","As soon as he walked out of the divine Palace, Jian Wushuang saw a fierce wind roaring above the entire Divine Life Palace. Dark clouds rolled, as if a disaster was coming from the sky.","“The Ninth Kalpa King has been at the Ultimate Ruler realm for more than forty chaos cycles. If he succeeds in breaking through and becomes an Ruler, he’ll definitely make a huge splash.” The Blood Wave Ruler said.","Jian Wushuang nodded. As a perfect-level special life form like him, the Ninth Kalpa King’s battle strength was comparable to that of an ordinary supreme. Jian Wushuang was also looking forward to seeing the Ninth Kalpa King break through to the supreme level and to what extent his terrifying battle strength would reach.","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang and the Blood Wave Master headed toward the residence of the Ninth Kalpa King at the same time.","After a while, Jian Wushuang and the Blood Wave Master arrived at the residence of the Ninth Kalpa King in the sixth mountain range.","On the peak of a mountain, the Ninth Kalpa King sat cross-legged with his white hair draped over his shoulders. His turbulent and terrifying divine power was like a violent wave, slapping the surrounding void and making cracking sounds.","Countless disciples of the Divine Life Palace came to watch, and their faces were full of envy.","This was breaking through to the Supreme-being realm, the top combat power in the entire universe. No matter where he went, he was a worthy behemoth.","Divine Marquis Qingfeng was also among them. He held a pot of wine in his hand and looked at the Ninth Kalpa King in the distance. He was a little envious, but he also laughed happily. “Ninth Kalpa King, you’ve finally taken this step.”","In the distance, a servant was pacing back and forth restlessly, his face full of worry. From time to time, he raised his head to look at the Ninth Kalpa King, wanting to say something, but he was afraid that he would disturb the Ninth Kalpa King, so he could only sigh.","With a flash of golden light, Jian Wushuang and Ruler Blood Wave landed beside slave one.","“Don’t worry. With the Ninth Kalpa King’s ability, he can pass through the supreme level safely.” The Blood Wave Ruler extended his hand and patted First Slave’s shoulder.","“Lord Blood Wave!” The First Slave hurriedly greeted.","“You’re welcome!”","The Ruler Blood Wave waved his hand indifferently and looked at the Ninth Kalpa King.","First Slave lowered his eyes and looked respectful. He stole a glance at Jian Wushuang, who was beside him, and his expression was complicated.","Rumble!","More and more dark clouds gathered in the sky. It was a gray patch, thick to the extreme, giving people an extremely oppressive feeling.","“Roar! Roar! Roar!”","The wind howled, lightning flashed, and silver Snakes danced. In an instant, the sky turned black.","“It’s starting!” The Blood Wave Ruler’s eyes narrowed as he spoke.","Everyone quickly looked at the Ninth Kalpa King.","“Bang!”","With a deafening explosion, a crack suddenly appeared in the thick clouds, shooting out beams of light.","At this moment, it was like the beginning of the world and the Dawn of Chaos. Qi activity surged and endless immortal radiance fell.","..."]},{"number":4204,"title":"Chapter 4204 Forbidden","paragraphs":["4204 Forbidden","“Today, I’ll go through Ninth Kalpa to prove my Supreme great Dao!”","Under the endless celestial light, the Ninth Kalpa King, who was sitting cross-legged on the peak of the mountain, suddenly opened his eyes. In his eyes, countless divine patterns derived from the great Dao circulated. His aura and divine power suddenly began to transform. At a speed visible to the naked eye, it began to become stronger, and then he stepped toward a completely different place.","“Whoosh!”","A ray of golden light, with the Ninth Kalpa King as the center, suddenly shot out and connected the heaven and earth!","!!","At this moment, countless great Daos evolved, countless divine powers circulated, countless celestial halos descended, countless colorful clouds filled the air, and countless stars shone. It was as if an ancient Celestial King had descended.","“Supreme martial artist, complete!”","A low voice came out of the Ninth Kalpa King’s mouth.","The next moment, they saw the Ninth Kalpa King stand up in the endless immortal radiance.","Between heaven and earth, a roar that shook the nine heavens and ten lands was heard, as if the firmament was celebrating for the Ninth Kalpa King.","“You may leave.”","The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head. Suddenly, his words were followed by principles, and the strange phenomenon in the entire sky began to dissipate.","A moment later, the world returned to its clear state.","The Ninth Kalpa King stood on the peak of the mountain with his hands behind his back. His white clothes fluttered in the mountain wind, and he remained silent for a long time.","More than forty chaos cycles had passed!","He, the Ninth Kalpa King, had been stuck at the level of an Ultimate Ruler for more than forty chaos cycles!","No one could understand his feelings. What ‘number one Ruler’, what ‘comparable to a Supreme’, he, the Ninth Kalpa King, had never cared about these titles.","From the beginning to the end, what he wanted was to break through to the Supreme martial artist realm!","And today, the Ninth Kalpa King had finally fulfilled his long-cherished wish and achieved the supreme seat!","From then on, no matter how big the universe was, he, the Ninth Kalpa King, would be invincible and look down on all directions!","“Master...”","Looking at the Ninth Kalpa King, First Slave could not help but burst into tears. If there was only one person in the world who could feel the Ninth Kalpa King’s feelings, it would be First Slave.","He had accompanied the Ninth Kalpa King for as many years as the Ninth Kalpa King had been trapped at the Ruler level. He was filled with loyalty and had never changed.","Just as he was about to walk up and say something to the Ninth Kalpa King, he saw the Ruler Blood Wave pat his shoulder and smile. “First Slave, let your master calm down for now.”","Hearing this, first servant was stunned for a moment before he nodded.","After nearly half an incense’s time, the Ninth Kalpa King finally let out a breath of turbid air. His mood calmed down, and a smile hung on his face.","Ruler Blood Wave, Jian Wushuang, Divine Marquis Qingfeng...the Ninth Kalpa King glanced around and greeted everyone.","“Congratulations!”","“Congratulations!”","“Congratulations!”","Everyone responded with a smile.","Ninth Kalpa King nodded, then his eyes fell on Jian Wushuang’s face again. With a smile on his face, he strode toward Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, the Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes were bright and his body was surrounded by immortal radiance. He was like a piece of unpolished jade, and his whole person was filled with a sense of flawlessness.","“Jian Wushuang, I was thinking of fighting you after you reached the realm of the Ultimate Ruler. Now, it seems that I have to go first.” The Ninth Kalpa King said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang felt that it was a pity. The two of them were perfect-level creatures. Whether it was their super power or their comprehension of the universe principles, there was not much difference between them. If they could fight at the level of an Ultimate Ruler, it would definitely improve the two of them greatly.","“It’s fine. Wait for me. We’ll fulfill this promise after I reach the supremacy stage.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with determination as he replied.","“Alright!” The Ninth Kalpa King nodded with a smile.","Rumble!","At this moment, the sky suddenly changed, and a huge human face appeared.","The Daoist’s face was filled with wrinkles, and his eyes were turbid. This was none other than Supreme Gai Fu.","“Ninth Kalpa, come to the Supreme shrine quickly. Leave behind the Supreme mark and become the new Supreme of the Divine Life Palace.” An old and indifferent voice came from the giant face.","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King nodded and replied respectfully, “Yes.”","In the Divine Life Palace, the person the Ninth Kalpa King respected the most was naturally Supreme Gai Fu, who had brought him to the Divine Life Palace from a remote part of the universe. The reason why he had been in such a hurry to break through and prove himself over the past 40-odd chaos cycles was mainly because he did not want to disappoint Supreme Gai Fu.","Fortunately, he had finally broken through to the supreme martial artist level, and all the past events had faded away with the wind.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll come to find you later. let’s go,” the Ninth Kalpa King said. He then took a step and turned into a golden light, disappearing from everyone’s sight.","After the Ninth Kalpa King left, the crowd gradually dispersed.","As Jian Wushuang flew toward the manor, a thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","He had just become a fifth-stage Ruler, and he would not be able to become an Ultimate Ruler for a while. There was no point in staying in the Divine Life Palace, so he might as well go out and see if he could find some opportunities.","Back in the manor, Leng Rushuang was cultivating in seclusion. Although she did not say anything about Jian Wushuang’s continuous breakthroughs, she was under great pressure.","She did not want to see the gap between her and Jian Wushuang getting bigger and bigger.","A moment later, the Ninth Kalpa King arrived as promised.","He had changed into a white robe with golden threads, which was the symbol of a Ruler in the Divine Life Palace.","“Jian Wushuang.”","The two of them sat down by the lake, a pot of hot tea was boiling in the middle, and a faint steam was rising.","The Ninth Kalpa King picked up a cup of hot tea, took a sip, and asked, “Jian Wushuang, where do you plan to go next?”","“I don’t know,” Jian Wushuang replied, “maybe he’ll go to the ancient starry sky road.”","“Oh? The ancient path of stars?” The Ninth Kalpa King raised his eyebrows and replied, “Jian Wushuang, this is such a coincidence. Speaking of which, I was also preparing to go to the ancient starry sky road to gain experience.”","Jian Wushuang thought of something and asked, “Ninth Kalpa, are you also going for the Grand Tribe Gathering?”","The Ninth Kalpa King nodded and said, “Of course. Jian Wushuang, you may not know this, but the gathering of all the Supreme experts in the universe will be held there. If you can get an entrance ticket, the reward will be great. It’s enough to cover your hundreds of millions of years of hard cultivation. It can be said that in the depths of our universe, there’s no one who doesn’t want to participate in the gathering of all clans.”","He paused.","The Ninth Kalpa King continued, “And the only chance to participate in the myriad tribes meeting is to go to the ancient road of stars. The longer you walk on the ancient road and the further you walk, the more likely you are to be selected by that Lord to enter the myriad tribes meeting. If your performance is outstanding in the myriad tribes meeting, you may have the chance to become that Lord’s preaching boy.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and asked in surprise, “Ninth Kalpa, you also know about that Lord?”","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King put down his teacup, pondered for a moment, and said, “Regarding that lord, I went to the supreme shrine just now after I broke through to the supreme being realm. The Supreme Gai Fu told me about that lord’s name, which is a taboo existence in the universe.”"]},{"number":4205,"title":"Chapter 4205 Set Off","paragraphs":["4205 Set Off","Jian Wushuang sighed softly. As expected, only a Supreme would be qualified to know the identity of the Lord.","This seemed to be an unspoken rule of the universe, a rule that only circulated among the Supreme-beings.","“Ninth Kalpa King, when will you set off?” Jian Wushuang cleared his throat and asked.","“It should be soon. Jian Wushuang, the Ruler ancient path of stars is not far from the Ruler ancient path of stars. We can go there together.” The Ninth Kalpa King replied.","!!","Jian Wushuang smiled and replied, “I was thinking the same thing.”","“Hahaha, Jian Wushuang, let’s make a promise. We’ll go to the ancient starry sky road together.” The Ninth Kalpa King laughed heartily.","The two of them chatted for a while more before the Ninth Kalpa King left.","As for Jian Wushuang, he started to prepare to go to the ancient starry sky Road.","Before heading to the ancient path of stars, Jian Wushuang planned to increase his strength again.","In terms of cultivation, there was basically no need to think about it in a short period of time. No matter how much Jian Wushuang improved, the effect would be minimal.","However, this did not mean that Jian Wushuang could not become stronger.","He had only understood the surface of the eternal night sword technique, and there was still a lot of room for improvement.","The star slashing sword, a unique killing swordsmanship comprehended by Jian Wushuang, was also not yet complete. Jian Wushuang would strive to execute the star slashing sword to its complete state during this period of time. By then, the power of the star slashing sword would probably have a tremendous change.","And...Jian Wushuang decided to try activating the Tarot Divine Sword.","...","Ten years passed.","In a secret room in Jian Wushuang’s Manor in the sixth mountain range.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and his aura was restrained. There was no fluctuation of divine power.","In front of his knees, there was a dark golden sword covered with mysterious blood-red runes. There was a vertical eye on the hilt of the sword.","Waves of demonic aura emanated from the sword. It was the Tarot Divine Sword that shook the entire universe!","“Jian Wushuang, let’s go to the ancient path of stars!”","At this moment, a deep voice suddenly sounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“You’re finally leaving?” Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a bright light flashed in his eyes.","The next moment.","“God sealing vine,” Jian Wushuang waved his hand and ancient vines shot out from his sleeve. They wrapped around the Tarot Divine Sword inch by inch, starting from the tip.","Instantly, the demonic aura on the Tarot Divine Sword was completely sealed.","Jian Wushuang picked up the Tarot Divine Sword, put it into a deep red sandalwood sword case, and carried it on his back.","Then, Jian Wushuang stood up and walked outside.","Outside the mountain range, the Ninth Kalpa King was standing in the void with his hands behind his back.","Seeing Jian Wushuang come out, he nodded and said, “Jian Wushuang, can we leave now?”","“Sure.” Jian Wushuang sent a message to Leng Rushuang, who was in the midst of a breakthrough, and nodded.","“Then let’s go.” The Ninth Kalpa King said indifferently.","A moment later, the two of them arrived at the gate of the Divine Life Palace. The Ninth Kalpa King waved his hand, and a pitch-black universe boat suddenly expanded in the wind and suppressed the starry sky.","The two of them entered universe boat.","Boom!","With a loud boom, universe boat let out a roar and accelerated. It turned into a small black dot and disappeared from the Divine Life Palace.","...","The ancient starry sky path was located in the deepest part of the universe and was extremely far from the Divine Life Palace.","However, there were still nearly 90000 years to go before the Grand Clan Gathering, so the two of them were not in a hurry and did not deliberately rush.","Within universe boat.","“Jian Wushuang, how much do you know about the situation on the ancient path of stars?” The Ninth Kalpa King asked casually.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile bitterly. He shook his head and said, “I don’t know anything.”","The Ninth Kalpa King took a deep breath, and his expression gradually became serious as he replied, “Then let me tell you. The ancient path of stars is filled with heaven’s favorites. Almost all of the strongest heaven’s favorites in the universe are gathered here. There are countless experts, such as the eldest Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, the young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, and some Divine Sons and holy virgins from some ancient sacred grounds. Every one of them is like me, an invincible existence among Rulers.","“Even when I was an Ultimate Ruler, I didn’t dare to be too careless on the ancient path of stars.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression turned grave.","The universe was vast and there were countless geniuses. Jian Wushuang was not arrogant enough to think that he was invincible in the Ruler realm.","“Jian Wushuang, I heard that there are a total of 18 cities on the ancient road of stars. The number of people in each city is fixed. If you want to go far on the ancient road of stars, you have to drive out the people in the city and replace their positions.","“The further you go on the ancient path of stars, the more powerful each city becomes. As for the last few cities, even I, who was an Ultimate Ruler, couldn’t tell how strong they were.” The Ninth Kalpa King said in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes.","The 18 cities...it sounded really exciting.","A surging fighting spirit flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. The more the Ninth Kalpa King said so, the more he looked forward to it.","...","As time passed, universe boat continued to move forward in the universe. After 800 years, the Ninth Kalpa King and Jian Wushuang finally arrived at the Supreme ancient starry road.","“Jian Wushuang, I’m here. I have no use for this universe boat. You can take it.”","Ninth Kalpa King walked down from universe boat and looked at Jian Wushuang deeply. “Jian Wushuang, live well. I look forward to the moment we meet at the gathering of all races in the universe.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, cupped his hands, and replied, “Definitely!”","Soon, the Ninth Kalpa King took a step and disappeared from the supreme starry road.","The rest of the time, Jian Wushuang traveled alone.","He followed the location of the ancient path of stars that the Ninth Kalpa King had given him and traveled all the way in the universe.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and continued to comprehend the eternal night divine power.","He could slowly feel that his comprehension of the eternal night sacred art was rising rapidly after he broke through to become a fifth stage great Ruler.","A hundred years had passed.","Jian Wushuang had finally reached the ancient path of stars.","The ancient path of the master star system was much more lively than the desolate ancient path of the Supreme star system. Many huge universe boats were standing in the starry sky, and people were coming and going.","A huge black hole, like a monster’s mouth, was suspended in the starry sky.","Jian Wushuang kept seeing powerful ultimate realm Rulers walking in and out of the whirlpool with indifferent expressions.","This huge black hole had always been the entrance to the ancient path of stars.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and looked at the entrance of the ancient path of stars with great interest."]},{"number":4206,"title":"Chapter 4206 Rogue Cultivator Alliance","paragraphs":["4206 Rogue Cultivator Alliance","If fifth and fourth stage Rulers could be seen occasionally in the Tarot Ruins, then there were no cultivators below the Ultimate Ruler level on the ancient path of stars!","Even these Ultimate Rulers were powerful and imposing. They were all experts who had reached the top of the Ultimate Rulers!","Jian Wushuang could not help but look forward to what it would be like on the ancient path of stars.","“This ancient path of stars truly lives up to its name. There are no weaklings at the outermost area.”","!!","Jian Wushuang complimented and then walked down from universe boat. He put universe boat away and walked toward the gate of the ancient road of stars.","“Halt!”","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to step into the ancient path of stars, two Ultimate Rulers crossed their halberds and blocked Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown and said indifferently, “What do you mean?”","“If you wish to enter, you can. However, you have to pay a million Universe Origin Stones.” The two Ultimate Rulers glanced at Jian Wushuang indifferently and said expressionlessly.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. One million Universe Origin Stones was just a small number to him. However, it did not mean that he would be a fool and allow others to scam him.","He had never heard of anyone saying that one had to pay Universe Origin Stones to enter the ancient path of stars.","“Why don’t they need to hand over the Universe Origin Stones?” Jian Wushuang glanced at him and said indifferently.","Next to him was a peak Ultimate Ruler who walked in without any obstacles.","“They are Ultimate Rulers, so they naturally don’t need to pay Universe Origin Stones. You, on the other hand, are merely a fifth-stage great Ruler. Can you be compared to them?” The two guards sized up Jian Wushuang and sneered.","“I’ll be honest with you. We are the subordinates of the first city’s city lord, Ruler Bone Armor. If you wish to enter the ancient starry sky path, you must obediently follow the rules and pay a million Universe Origin Stones!”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","“So what if I don’t hand it over?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold.","“You won’t hand it over...”","The two guards grinned hideously as they raised their halberds and stabbed at Jian Wushuang!","“Then get out!!!”","Bang!","A violent divine power suddenly followed the halberd and stabbed at Jian Wushuang’s chest!","“You’re looking for death!”","Jian Wushuang’s face flashed with a touch of anger. He raised his hand and slapped at the two guards!","The guards of the two gates were both experts among the Ultimate Rulers. Seeing that Jian Wushuang did not escape but instead turned his hand to slap them, the two guards could not help but look at each other and laugh.","“Is this person an idiot? A mere fifth-stage great Ruler dares to overestimate his abilities and attack us?”","“Chi Mu, we’ve been guarding this place for so long, but this is the first time we’ve met such an interesting person. Don’t be in a hurry to kill him, just let him play with us.”","The two of them laughed and talked, not taking Jian Wushuang’s palm seriously at all. Their eyes were full of teasing.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He had seen so many idiots like them, so he was naturally not angry.","Bang!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s palm hit the two halberds hard!","The vast and vigorous divine power directly smashed the two halberds into dust in an instant!","“He brought it upon himself...what?”","In an instant, the contemptuous sneers on the two guards’ faces froze, and they could not help but cry out in shock.","How can a Ruler have such terrifying divine power?!","Before they could finish their words, Jian Wushuang’s palm had turned them into meat paste, starting from their heads.","The two of them had been destroyed!","“Idiot.”","Jian Wushuang withdrew his hand expressionlessly. He did not even bother to use the Wuqi Divine Sword to deal with an ordinary Ultimate Ruler. He just used the most primitive divine power to crush and destroy him.","Some of the surrounding Ultimate Rulers were not too surprised when they saw this. After a slight pause, they went back to their own business.","The ancient path of stars gathered all the geniuses of the universe, and many of them were able to kill enemies of a higher level. They were already used to it.","“I just don’t know which Divine Son or Holy Son this new guy is from.”","They shook their heads and strode away.","At the entrance, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and his body suddenly flew up. He then shot toward the entrance of the ancient path of stars.","The ancient path of stars seemed to be an extremely long dark passage. Jian Wushuang flew at full speed for a long time before he gradually saw a glimmer of light.","Slowly, the light grew brighter and brighter. In the next moment, Jian Wushuang’s vision was suddenly filled with light.","A huge and lofty city appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","The city was unimaginably huge. Just the city walls alone were a hundred thousand feet tall. A huge plaque hung above the city walls with the words ‘first city’ carved on it!","“I heard from the Ninth Kalpa King that there are a total of 18 cities on the ancient path of stars. These 18 cities are the 18 checkpoints. It seems that the first city is the first checkpoint.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and continued to look down.","At the entrance of the city, a huge stone stele was erected. On the stele, one thousand names were carved in a golden light. The first name on the stele was the bone-armored Ruler that the two guards had mentioned at the entrance of the ancient path of stars. He was the city Lord of the first city!","“No wonder those two guards dared to be so arrogant. They must be relying on this Ruler Bone Armor.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and muttered to himself.","He continued to look around.","Countless Ultimate Rulers were sitting cross-legged below the city walls. No one disturbed anyone, and they were all cultivating in seclusion.","Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to break into the city. Instead, he sat down cross-legged and planned to understand the rules of the ancient path of stars first.","“Sir, you must have just arrived on the ancient path of stars, right?” At that moment, a voice suddenly came from behind Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang turned around and saw a chubby young man looking at him with a smile.","“May I know what’s the matter?” Jian Wushuang frowned, stepped back a little, and asked.","The chubby youth replied with a smile, “Don’t be nervous, Sir. Let me introduce myself first. My name is Ruler Wu Hai. You can call me Wu Hai. May I know your name?”","“Blood Sword.” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently.","“Sir Blood Sword, I have a piece of advice for you. Are you willing to listen?” Ruler Wu Hai cupped his hands and said.","“Just say it.” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently.","“Alright,” he said. Ruler Wu Hai paused for a while. The honest and kind expression on his face gradually turned solemn."]},{"number":4207,"title":"Chapter 4207 Breaking Into the City","paragraphs":["4207 Breaking Into the City","“Blood Sword, I see that you’re only a fifth stage Ruler. This cultivation level is fine in the outside universe, but it’s quite dangerous on the ancient path of stars filled with prodigies. Therefore, I advise you to join our rogue cultivator alliance. We’re made up of ordinary Rulers like you and me who have no roots or are weak. On the ancient path of stars, we can look out for each other and have an extra layer of protection. What do you think?”","After saying that, Ruler Wu Hai pointed to the distance. Jian Wushuang looked in the direction he pointed and saw more than 20 Ultimate Rulers with ordinary auras smiling and nodding at Jian Wushuang in a friendly manner.","Jian Wushuang withdrew his gaze and said indifferently, “Thank you for your kind intentions, Ruler Wu Hai. However, I don’t think I’ll be able to join you. I’ve always been a loner and I’m afraid it’ll be difficult for me to integrate into the group.”","“Blood Sword, we’re easy to get along with. If you don’t join us, how do you know you won’t be able to blend in?” Ruler Wu Hai said hurriedly.","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and sat down with his legs crossed. He slowly closed his eyes and started to cultivate.","Seeing that, Ruler Wu Hai knew that Jian Wushuang was driving him away. he sighed and said, “You’re on your own then, Blood Sword.”","After waiting for a while, Ruler Wu Hai did not get any reply from Jian Wushuang. He shook his head and left.","After Wu Hai left, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a sneer appeared on his face.","Did he think that Jian Wushuang was a fool who had never seen the world?","....","The twenty-plus ordinary Ultimate Rulers were off in the distance.","“Wu Hai, that brat refused to join us?”","“Failed?”","This group of ordinary Ultimate Rulers frowned and asked.","“Hmph, this kid is lucky.” Ruler Wu Hai’s face turned gloomy and his eyes flickered with malevolence. His previous kind and honest appearance had completely disappeared.","The twenty of them knew that they would not be able to perform well on the ancient road of stars and were not the opponents of the geniuses. Thus, they joined forces and killed newcomers like Jian Wushuang at the entrance of the first city.","The strategy he used was similar to what he had used to deceive Jian Wushuang. He took advantage of the newbies’ desire to find a group and lure them into the ancient road of stars. After that, they joined forces to kill them.","“Let’s go to the next one.”","With a kind and honest smile on his face again, Ruler Wu Hai walked toward a newcomer in the distance who looked apprehensive.","“Your Excellency, may I know how to address you?” As if he had seen Jian Wushuang, Ruler Wu Hai said with a smile and a kind light flickering in his eyes.","...","“The ancient path of stars really is filled with all sorts of people.” Jian Wushuang sighed with emotion.","In the distance, the newbie who had been deceived by Ruler Wu Hai was following him excitedly. He walked into the crowd and was then led away.","Jian Wushuang could not help shaking his head. He was not a newbie who had just traveled the universe, so he naturally knew what was going on.","“Whoosh!”","At that moment, Jian Wushuang saw a middle-aged Ultimate Ruler who was sitting not far away from him. He took a step forward and walked toward the first city’s city gate.","“Someone wants to challenge the people in the city again. Have they entered the city?”","Ruler Qing Lin has already stayed at the first city’s entrance for three thousand years. He must be confident that he would win this time.","“Hahaha, in my opinion, the people in this city should be changed.”","Many people who were cultivating around them saw this scene and started to discuss in low voices.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. It seemed that the situation here was not much different from what the Ninth Kalpa King had said. The number of people in the first city was fixed. If he wanted to enter the city and continue to walk toward the back, he would have to squeeze out the people in the city and take their place.","As everyone discussed, they looked at the stone tablet that recorded the rankings.","Not long after, the stone tablet suddenly glowed with a golden light, and the ranking changed.","[1st Place: Bone Insect]","[2nd Place: Mu Chong]","...","[1000th Place: Qing Lin!]","Then, Jian Wushuang saw a skinny old man fly out of the city with a terrible look on his face.","This person must have been originally ranked 1000.","In other words, this person’s seat had been taken by the middle-aged Ruler.","The scrawny old man glanced at the first city unwillingly. Without saying anything, he sat down cross-legged with a dark expression and began to cultivate.","Golden light flickered on the stone stele as the Ruler Qing Lin’s ranking continued to rise, only stopping when he reached the center.","This scene immediately caused a wave of gasps to ring out from outside the first city’s gates.","“632nd place!”","“Ruler Qing Lin is in for it this time!”","The laws and regulations in that city are far more concentrated than those outside. Perhaps Ruler Qing Lin will have the opportunity to attack the second city!","Time passed slowly. Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to break into the city. instead, he watched quietly.","During this time, Jian Wushuang saw many people trying to break into the city. However, most of them failed and only a few succeeded.","What was worth mentioning was that Ruler Wu Hai had also gone to the city and succeeded. His ranking was not low either, even slightly higher than that of Ruler Qing Lin, ranking him at 518th place.","As for the newbie who was taken away by Wu Hai, Jian Wushuang never saw him again.","A few days later, Jian Wushuang stood up and walked toward the city gate expressionlessly.","After a few days of observation, he had completely understood the rules of the ancient path of stars, so there was no need for him to sit here and waste time.","“Eh? A fifth-stage chief Ruler?”","“A fifth-stage Ruler barging into a city? That’s quite rare.”","“Who is this fifth stage chief Ruler?”","Some of the Ultimate Rulers outside the city let out soft cries of surprise upon seeing this.","As for the people from the Rogue cultivator Alliance, their eyes narrowed and they sneered.","“Isn’t this the kid who rejected us back then?”","“It seems like this kid is quite confident in himself.”","“Humph! Hope this person doesn’t meet Wu Hai in his heart. Otherwise...hahaha, I’m afraid this person won’t be able to come out alive.”","With a calm expression, Jian Wushuang walked toward the city gate step by step. With a low muffled sound, the city gate opened and Jian Wushuang stepped in.","“Rumble!”","The city gate slowly closed and Jian Wushuang’s figure disappeared from everyone’s sight.","The crowd outside the city gate raised their heads and looked at the stone tablet outside the city gate with interest.","It was rare to see a fifth stage Ruler barging into a city."]},{"number":4208,"title":"Chapter 4208 Defeating the Enemy With a Single Finger","paragraphs":["4208 Defeating the Enemy With a Single Finger","A gust of wind blew and Jian Wushuang looked around calmly.","He saw that the city was barren, but the divine power aura and law aura were unusually thick.","The city was densely built with countless low palaces. In front of each Palace, there was a wooden tablet with different numbers.","From 1,000 to 1st place, a total of 1000 low palaces were arranged in a ‘one’ shape.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. From the moment he stepped into the first city, he could sense that there seemed to be a pair of invisible eyes watching him.","Jian Wushuang knew that it was not an illusion. If he was not wrong, the owner of the eyes should be ‘that lord’.","Jian Wushuang did not care. He walked to the entrance of the Thousandth Palace, took off his wooden token, and knocked on the door.","Bang!","The next moment, a burly man walked out of the hall with a giant hammer in his hand.","“Eh? A fifth-stage chief Ruler?” The burly man sized up Jian Wushuang and saw that his aura was only at the fifth level. He was curious.","Then, he shook his head and said in a rough voice, “I am the God of tremendous strength. Kid, you want to challenge me?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said with a calm expression, “Yes.”","“Then let’s start!”","Immediately, an invisible wave surged in the void and covered the place where the two of them were.","The invisible fluctuation was extremely vast and terrifying. Even Jian Wushuang could not help but feel surprised.","This should be the rule of the ancient road to determine the winner and the loser. It also protects the battle so that the aftershocks won’t affect the people around them. Jian Wushuang’s mind was racing.","“Roar!”","The burly man let out a furious roar. His skin turned red and his veins twisted like tree roots.","He lifted the giant hammer and smashed it at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm as he faced the unparalleled hammer. He slowly raised his finger and pointed it at the burly man.","Bang!","With a soft explosion, the giant hammer was shattered into pieces.","Jian Wushuang’s finger stopped in front of the burly man’s forehead in disbelief.","“Thanks for letting me win.”","With a calm expression, Jian Wushuang continued to walk toward another palace.","“H-how is this possible??” The burly man’s eyes widened and he looked at Jian Wushuang’s back in shock.","Then, cold sweat appeared on his forehead.","That finger just now, if it had pushed forward another three inches, it would have taken his life.","First city, outside the city gates.","He succeeded?!","“How is that possible? Wasn’t this person a fifth stage great Ruler? Could I have seen wrongly?”","“Could this person be a Divine Son Young Emperor nurtured by some top force?”","“Defeat an enemy across the border? Tsk, tsk, this is not common.”","Many Rulers began to discuss this with interested expressions.","They weren’t that shocked. After all, the geniuses of the entire universe had gathered on the ancient path of stars. They had seen a few people who could cross levels and kill enemies. They were already used to it.","On the stone stele, the words ‘Herculean Ruler’ on the thousandth position slowly disappeared and were replaced by the words ‘Blood Sword’!","“When the Herculean Ruler comes out, ask him what’s going on. Why can’t he even defeat a fifth-stage great Ruler?”","Some of the Ultimate Rulers who were familiar with the Ruler of tremendous strength said with a laugh.","Bang!","It did not take long for the crowd to see the mighty Ruler walk out of the city gates in a daze.","“What’s up with that Blood Sword, mighty Ruler? Can you tell us?”","“Hahaha, Herculean Ruler, you’ve really lost a great deal of face this time. You were actually defeated by a fifth stage fellow.”","“That kid, did he give you some benefits?”","The friends of the Herculean Ruler laughed and teased him.","The herculean Ruler rolled his eyes at these words and snorted, “Who do you think I am? You’re even giving me benefits?”","After a pause, the Herculean Ruler took a deep breath and said with a solemn expression, “You guys haven’t seen how terrifying this man’s methods are, so don’t talk nonsense.”","After saying that, Ju Li stopped talking and sat down cross-legged with a complicated look in his eyes.","Even now, he still had lingering fear.","That finger was too terrifying.","He was convinced of his loss.","“Tremendous force? Is he really as terrifying as you said? Why don’t you tell everyone how you lost?”","The surrounding Ultimate Ruler laughed nonchalantly. In their opinion, the Herculean Ruler was just trying to find a way out of this embarrassing situation. After all, only by making Jian Wushuang sound powerful enough would he not be embarrassed.","The Herculean Ruler glanced at the faces of the Ultimate Rulers. Taking a deep breath, he extended a finger and said slowly, “This person defeated me with a single finger.”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone present was shocked.","“What? He only used one finger?”","“Is what you said true, mighty Ruler?”","At this moment, everyone’s expression changed. It should be known that there was a huge difference between defeating an enemy with one finger and defeating an enemy with great effort.","Just as everyone was asking the Herculean Ruler questions, someone in the crowd suddenly cried out, “Look, the Blood Sword’s ranking has risen again!”","Everyone quickly looked at the stone tablet.","The two words ‘Blood Sword’ on the stone tablet were rising at an unstoppable speed!","999th place, Blood Sword.","998th place, Blood Sword.","865th place, Blood Sword!","...","Blood Sword, 633rd place!","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang’s ranking on the stone tablet rose to six hundred and sixty-third, only one rank lower than Ruler Qing Lin!","At this moment, there was a dead silence outside the city gate. Everyone was so shocked by the scene in front of them that their eyes almost fell out.","They could only watch as Jian Wushuang’s ranking rose without any pause!","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang’s ranking had already risen by a step.","“I remember that the last time I was in the first city, the one who advanced so quickly was the First Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom.” One of the Ultimate Rulers said, swallowing.","“Doesn’t that mean that this person is a heaven’s favorite that can stand shoulder to shoulder with the first Prince?” An Ultimate Ruler was speechless.","In the crowd, only the people from the Wandering Cultivator Alliance did not look good.","“Hmph, how can this person be mentioned in the same breath as the First Prince? The First Prince is an unparalleled Ruler of the entire universe. Where did this guy come from?” One of the final Rulers of the Wandering Cultivator Alliance snorted coldly in disdain.","When everyone heard this, they could not help but look at him, but they did not refute him."]},{"number":4209,"title":"Chapter 4209 Wu Hai","paragraphs":["4209 Wu Hai","“I didn’t expect that. I’ve still underestimated this person. However, this Blood Sword should have reached this point. Wu Hai is ranked 518th. If this Blood Sword encounters Wu Hai, he will definitely not have an easy time.” The other Ultimate Ruler of the Wandering Cultivator Alliance snickered.","However, in the time it took for everyone to discuss, Jian Wushuang’s ranking had suddenly surpassed Ruler Qing Lin’s and reached an even higher position.","...","The first city, inside the city.","“Thanks for letting me win.”","Jian Wushuang said expressionlessly and then continued to walk toward the palace.","From the beginning to the end, Jian Wushuang had only used one finger.","No matter what kind of Ultimate Ruler he was, Jian Wushuang could crush him with just one finger and boundless divine power.","As time passed, Jian Wushuang’s ranking rose sharply. In just a few minutes, he had reached the 519th place.","The next one was Ruler Wu Hai, who had recruited Jian Wushuang before.","With a calm expression, Jian Wushuang walked to the door of the palace with the number ‘518’ and knocked on it.","Immediately after that, Ruler Wu Hai walked out.","“Eh? It’s you?”","When Ruler Wu Hai saw Jian Wushuang, he was startled. Then, an uncertain look flashed across his face.","He was no fool. Otherwise, he would not have killed so many new disciples at the first city’s city gates and never met with any trouble.","The fact that Jian Wushuang could reach this position naturally meant that Jian Wushuang’s strength was far beyond his imagination.","“Blood Sword, I didn’t think you’d be able to reach this position. No wonder you weren’t willing to join us back then.” A kind smile appeared on Ruler Wu Hai’s face again. Combined with his honest and chubby face, he looked rather harmless.","Jian Wushuang sneered in his heart. This person was a smiling tiger. He looked honest and kind, but in fact, he might have some bad tricks up his sleeve.","“Let’s start, Ruler Wu Hai,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“Blood Sword, I don’t think we need to fight. I’ve used all my strength to climb to this position, but you look so relaxed. I know my own limits, I’m not your match.” Ruler Wu Hai scratched his head and smiled honestly.","“Oh? Are you serious?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said with a faint smile.","“That’s for sure. Sir Blood Sword, I’ve stayed on the ancient path of stars for so long. I may not have learned much, but I’ve cultivated a pair of good eyes. In the future, Sir Blood Sword will definitely become a dragon-like figure in the sky. I don’t need to make a fool of myself, I’m willing to admit defeat.” Ruler Wu Hai said with a smile.","After saying that, he turned around and walked toward the palaces behind Jian Wushuang.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s deep eyes no longer cared about him and he continued to walk toward the top palace.","At this moment, a sudden change occurred!","Ruler Wu Hai turned around abruptly. The kind smile on his chubby face turned into a brutal and murderous look. He took out a pitch-black banner with his right hand and charged at Jian Wushuang.","In an instant, a terrifying black mist gushed out and transformed into a huge mouth that slashed at Jian Wushuang’s head with the howls of evil spirits from the netherworld!","As for Jian Wushuang, he continued to walk forward as if he had not noticed the terrifying killing intent behind him.","Seeing that, Ruler Wu Hai revealed a fierce smile.","He could already imagine the scene of Jian Wushuang’s divine body being torn apart by the evil ghost in the banner.","“Blood Sword, go to hell!!!” Ruler Wu Hai’s face was extremely ferocious.","However, he did not realize that a cold sword light had already shot out from Jian Wushuang’s fingertips and was coming for him.","Chi!","Without any obstruction, the cold sword light cut through the black mist as if it was a knife cutting through tofu and pierced through the space between Wu Hai’s eyebrows.","In an instant, the overbearing and sharp sword intent directly destroyed every inch of divine power in Wu Hai’s divine body.","Before his death, Ruler Wu Hai was still wearing a proud and fierce smile.","Jian Wushuang did not turn back, he did not even stop. His black hair rose slightly as he continued to walk forward.","...","Outside the city gates, the many Ultimate Rulers were watching unblinkingly.","“It’s going to be Ruler Wu Hai’s turn soon. Wu Hai has always been cunning and cruel. He’s not an easy character to deal with. I wonder if Blood Sword can get through this safely.”","The Ultimate Rulers were all casually discussing this matter.","At this moment, they no longer had any teasing expressions on their faces.","Everyone could tell that although the Blood Sword was only at the fifth level, his battle-power was definitely one of the most terrifying geniuses among Rulers.","Hence, they started to look forward to Jian Wushuang. They were looking forward to seeing how far Jian Wushuang could go.","After all, if they could witness the rise of a heaven’s favorite, it would be a great story in the future.","Outside the city gate, only those from the Wandering Cultivator Alliance had ugly expressions.","“Hmph, who do they think the Blood Sword is? Was he the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom or the Young Emperor of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom? Or the divine sons and holy sons from the ancient holy lands and immortal inheritances? And the rise of a heaven’s favorite? Isn’t that too much of a legend?” One of the Rulers of the Wandering Cultivator Alliance said sourly.","As their leader, they naturally had to support Wu Hai. In return, they tried their best to belittle Jian Wushuang.","“Guys, look! The Blood Sword’s ranking has stopped!”","As expected, as if to verify their guess, Jian Wushuang suddenly stopped when he rose to the 529th place.","“Hahaha. I knew it. How could this Blood Sword be a match for Ruler Wu Hai?”","The Wandering Cultivator Ruler who had belittled Jian Wushuang earlier burst into laughter.","However, before he could finish laughing, it was as if his throat was suddenly grabbed by someone. His arrogant and proud laughter came to an abrupt end, and his face turned into the color of pig liver.","A burst of golden light flickered on the stele. The name that belonged to Wu Hai was slowly wiped away by an invisible hand.","“Wu Hai. He was defeated by that kid?” The Ruler called out in disbelief.","“He didn’t lose, he died.”","An Ultimate Ruler not far from him shook his head, his eyes shining.","As people who had been on the ancient path of stars for many years, they could naturally see the difference between defeat and death.","If it was just a defeat, then other than the Ruler at the bottom of the stone stele, who would be driven out of the city, the others would only drop one rank.","And if one died inside, the name belonging to that person would be directly erased!","“Die...he’s dead?”","When the people from the Wandering Cultivator Alliance heard this, they were terrified to the extreme."]},{"number":4210,"title":"Chapter 4210 Divine Lord Mu Chong","paragraphs":["4210 Divine Lord Mu Chong","When the Ultimate Rulers saw the two golden words ‘Blood Sword’ on the stone tablet, they felt a chill run up their spines and up to their heads. Their bodies trembled and they did not dare to speak anymore.","“The Blood Sword has yet to stop. I’m afraid that its target is the first city’s city Lord who is ranked first.” The Ultimate Ruler who had revealed the truth earlier muttered to himself.","The rules of the ancient path of stars did not necessarily state that one had to be near the first city in order to be able to challenge The Second City. If one wanted to, even if one was ranked last in the first city, one could still challenge the people in The Second City.","For example, the first city’s city Lord, Ruler Bone Armor, was the strongest person in the first city. Naturally, he had the power to enter the second or even the third city.","!!","However, rather than being the last in the second and third cities, he might as well be the governor of the first city. That would be more practical.","...","On the streets of the first city, Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm as he walked slowly.","The Wuqi Divine Sword, which was attached to his waist, had not been unsheathed from the beginning to the end. To Jian Wushuang, these Ultimate Rulers were enough to crush him when he was a fourth-level Ruler, let alone now that he had broken through to the fifth-level Ruler.","No one could take a single move from him.","510th place.","438th place.","219th place...","Third place!","Jian Wushuang’s speed did not stop for a moment. In just half a day, he had risen to the third place!","At that moment, not only the people outside the city began to pay attention to Jian Wushuang’s ranking, but even those who had been defeated by Jian Wushuang in the first city had walked to the streets and followed Jian Wushuang without saying a word.","In the beginning, there was only one person following Jian Wushuang.","As more and more people were defeated by Jian Wushuang, his ranking became higher and higher. Gradually, the number of people following Jian Wushuang also became a dense black mass at a speed visible to the naked eye.","They followed Jian Wushuang from a distance and looked at his back with respect.","Among them, there were many who had looked down on Jian Wushuang when they first saw that he was only at level five. But now, they were completely convinced by the strength that Jian Wushuang had displayed and were in awe of him.","Thump thump thump.","Under countless gazes, Jian Wushuang took off the wooden token of the Second Palace and knocked on the door of the Second Palace.","A moment later, a handsome young man in white walked out of the palace with a cold face and a scimitar in his hand.","First city, second place, Divine Lord Mu Chong!","In the first city of the ancient road of the star Palace, the rankings on the stone stele were constantly changing. After all, everyone was an Ultimate Ruler, and the stronger ones had long since walked ahead of them. Thus, the remaining Ultimate Rulers were actually not too far apart in terms of strength, and it was a common thing for the rankings to change.","However, in these thousands of years, only two people’s names had never changed!","The two of them were the first and second ranked Bone Armor God, Divine Lord Mu Chong!","It was said that Divine Lord Mu Chong’s talent was astonishing. From the start of his cultivation to becoming an Ultimate Ruler, he had only spent a few chaos cycles. He might not be comparable to the divine sons and Divine Sons of the universe, but he was still one of the top geniuses among ordinary Ultimate Rulers!","For thousands of years, ever since Divine Lord Mu Chong stepped onto the ancient path of stars, he had firmly occupied second place and had never changed his position!","“I wonder if the Blood Sword will be able to defeat divine Lord Mu Chong with its previous battle record.”","“Divine Lord Mu Chong is the first city’s pride and joy. We don’t know how many people have lost to him. Even though the Blood Sword has displayed extraordinary power, it’s still unknown if it can be a match for Divine Lord Mu Chong.”","“That’s right. It has been close to a few thousand years since Divine Lord Mu Chong has fought. no one can say for sure how strong he has become.”","Outside the city, quite a few Ultimate Rulers were looking at the stone stele and discussing it.","If someone had told them that a Ruler of the fifth level could rise from the last place all the way to the third place in the first city, they would have scoffed at it and treated it as a joke.","But now, the fact was right in front of them. They no longer looked down on Jian Wushuang.","However, Divine Lord Mu Chong had used tens of thousands of years to build up his reputation. Hence, they were more inclined to believe that Divine Lord Mu Chong would win.","At the same time, a heated discussion erupted in the first city.","“Although Divine Lord Mu Chong is very strong, the strength of the Blood Sword can not be underestimated. One must know that the Blood Sword has only used one finger to reach this point!”","“I bet that the Blood Sword will win this battle!”","“No matter what, there’s going to be a good show to watch this time.”","The people in the city knew more about Jian Wushuang’s terror than the people outside the city!","The outsiders only saw Jian Wushuang’s ranking rise, but they did not see that the opponent he had defeated had only used one finger from the beginning to the end!","As everyone discussed, Divine Lord Mu Chong walked out of the palace.","He did not pay attention to the discussion but looked at Jian Wushuang up and down. Then he frowned and said, “A fifth-stage chief Ruler?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm. He had heard this question more than a hundred times since he entered the ancient path of stars.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded frankly.","“Interesting,” Divine Lord Mu Chong smiled and continued, “it’s not easy to reach this point as a fifth stage great Ruler. Even if your talent isn’t as good as mine, it shouldn’t be too far off. How about this? I’ll give you a chance. Cultivate to the level of an Ultimate Ruler first, then come fight me.”","With that, Divine Lord Mu Chong planned to return to the palace. He was originally very interested but after thousands of years, someone had finally walked up to him and attacked him.","When the results came out, he only saw a fifth stage Ruler. He immediately felt that the meaning was dull.","He had become famous at a young age and had always been proud. In his opinion, even if his opponent was not the Young Emperor of a Divine Kingdom or the Divine Son of a sacred land, he should at least be a top-tier Ultimate Ruler.","What was a mere fifth stage chief Ruler worth?","Many of the Ultimate Rulers who saw this could not help but shake their heads.","“Divine Lord Mu Chong is still as arrogant as ever.”","“Hmph, it seems like Divine Lord Mu Chong’s arrogance has grown to the point where he is conceited over the past few thousand years.”","“In my opinion, the Blood Sword has arrived at the right time. It’s about time the first city of the ancient path of stars is reshuffled!”","They were discussing in low voices.","As for Jian Wushuang, he squinted his eyes and a strange expression appeared on his face."]},{"number":4211,"title":"Chapter 4211 I’ve Overestimated You","paragraphs":["4211 I’ve Overestimated You","This was the first time he had encountered someone saying something like ‘your talent is not as good as mine’. Even the Ninth Kalpa King, who was also a perfect creature, admitted that he was inferior to Jian Wushuang in terms of talent.","Jian Wushuang did not feel angry when he heard this. Instead, he felt that it was a bit fresh.","“It seems...are we finally going to meet an expert?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and a hint of battle intent finally surged in his eyes.","!!","All the opponents he had met along the way had made him lose all interest in fighting. His hands had long been itching to fight.","As for the person in front of him, although he did not look very strong, from the way he spoke, he should be someone who was extremely confident in his own combat strength.","And confidence often came from the affirmation of one’s own strength.","In other words, he was very strong!","“It seems like I can’t deal with them casually anymore.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","Chi!","In the next moment, the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand. Jian Wushuang looked at Divine Lord Mu Chong and his eyes were filled with fighting spirit. “Divine Lord Mu Chong, let’s fight.”","“What?”","Divine Lord Mu Chong stopped in his tracks and turned to look at Jian Wushuang. He raised his eyebrows and said, “Are you sure?”","“I’m sure,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Fine, I hope this battle won’t leave you with the shadow of fear.” Divine Lord Mu Chong sighed and shook his head as if he was feeling sorry for Jian Wushuang.","Then, he picked up the cold moon scimitar and took a step forward. Suddenly, he turned into an afterimage and slashed at Jian Wushuang.","“Nine Dao slash!” Divine Lord Mu Chong shouted.","“Whoosh!”","In an instant, the Cold Moon Saber in his hand slashed out a Cold Moon Saber light. After the Cold Moon Saber light shot out from the saber, it instantly split into nine saber lights that were a thousand feet long. They folded the void and slashed down like lightning!","Waves of sharp divine power and universe principles covered the blade light. It was extremely powerful and mysterious, dazzling and unrivaled.","“Nine Dao slash! This is the ultimate technique of Divine Lord Mu Chong!”","“These nine slashes aren’t as simple as one splitting into nine. These nine slashes are like rising and falling waves, each stronger than the last. Nine slashes are enough to instantly kill an ordinary Ultimate Ruler!”","Behind Jian Wushuang, the many Ultimate Rulers’ eyes narrowed as they spoke.","However, Jian Wushuang frowned.","From Jian Wushuang’s point of view, the divine power fluctuations from the nine blade lights were much stronger than those of the Ultimate Rulers he had met before.","However, that was all.","“It seems...just like this?” Jian Wushuang felt the divine power fluctuation on the nine blade lights and he could not help but frown.","“No, there must be something wrong! This person is so confident, he can’t be this weak!” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. Then, he held the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand tightly and unleashed twenty percent of his divine power to slash at the nine saber lights!","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had used a sword since he had broken through to the fifth stage Ruler realm!","Even though the stroke only contained 20% of Jian Wushuang’s divine power, the power that was unleashed was much stronger than the full-power attack that Jian Wushuang had unleashed when he was a fourth stage Ruler.","“Rumble!”","In an instant, the heavens and earth lost their color as a scarlet sword energy slashed out like a sun-swallowing python!","This strike was like a stone that caused a thousand waves, shocking everyone!","There were no words that could describe the terror in everyone’s eyes when they saw the sword. At that moment, the entire First City trembled as the scarlet sword light crushed countless Qi activities. It carried a power that could destroy the heavens and earth as it slashed down on Divine Lord Mu Chong!","Bang!","The moment the scarlet sword radiance collided with the nine blood moon blade radiances, the nine blood moon blade radiances were crushed.","After the Scarlet sword radiance dimmed a little, it slashed down at Divine Lord Mu Chong once again!","“This?”","Divine Lord Mu Chong’s expression changed drastically and he could no longer maintain the calm and self-confidence on his face. He looked at the destructive sword that was descending from the sky and his lips started to tremble.","“How can he be this strong?” At that moment, not only did Divine Lord Mu Chong’s expression change, the Ultimate Rulers behind Jian Wushuang were also shocked and gasped.","They had expected that Jian Wushuang would be very strong, but they had not expected him to be so powerful when he really attacked!","“Break!!!”","Divine Lord Mu Chong’s handsome face was flushed red as he roared.","In an instant, several defensive nomological treasures were taken out by Divine Lord Mu Chong to block the sword!","This was not enough. Mu Chong bit the tip of his tongue and used a secret technique that burned his divine power to strike out 999 times to block the sword!","“Rumble!”","In that instant, a series of explosions rang out and a huge crater was created in the First City, raising a huge cloud of dust.","However, under the laws of the ancient path of stars, these giant pits were quickly restored to their original state.","Finally, the smoke and dust gradually dispersed.","Divine Lord Mu Chong’s hair was disheveled and he was in an extremely sorry state. He panted heavily and was no longer as calm as he was before.","Jian Wushuang could not help but let out a long ‘huh’ when he saw this.","“Just this much strength?”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and suddenly understood. He had probably overestimated Divine Lord Mu Chong.","Before he had stepped onto the ancient path of stars, both the Blood Wave Ruler and the Ninth Kalpa King had instilled in him the idea that everyone on the ancient path of stars was very powerful.","As a result, Jian Wushuang maintained a ‘cautious’ attitude ever since he stepped onto the ancient path of stars.","This caused him to subconsciously overestimate Divine Lord Mu Chong’s strength when he first met him.","Jian Wushuang retracted his thoughts and cupped his hands at Divine Lord Mu Chong. He said indifferently, “Thanks for letting me win.”","When Divine Lord Mu Chong heard this, his lips twitched.","He was proud, but he was not a narrow-minded person. He could feel that Jian Wushuang had stopped at the last moment. Otherwise, he would not be standing here safe and sound.","“Thank you for stopping, sir.” Taking a deep breath, Divine Lord Mu Chong said with heartfelt admiration.","Jian Wushuang nodded and continued to walk toward the First City.","“Wait.”","At that moment, Divine Lord Mu Chong suddenly called out to him.","Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at Divine Lord Mu Chong with a puzzled expression.","“Sir Blood Sword, based on your level of power, you shouldn’t be in the First City. The city behind you should be the place for you to fight for power. Hence, Sir Blood Sword, why don’t you head straight to the Second City?” Divine Lord Mu Chong said respectfully.","After Jian Wushuang displayed his power, Divine Lord Mu Chong naturally could not treat Jian Wushuang with the same attitude as before.","The strong were respected, and this was the hard truth everywhere."]},{"number":4212,"title":"Chapter 4212 Ruler Bone Armor","paragraphs":["4212 Ruler Bone Armor","“Oh?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. After a moment of silence, he said with a faint smile, “You don’t want me to challenge Ruler Bone Armor?”","“Yes.” Divine Lord Mu Chong nodded and replied sincerely, “Blood Sword, there’s something you don’t know. Ruler Bone Armor isn’t from the First City. He’s just an important figure from the city behind us who had intentionally placed him in the First City. He’s far more powerful than we are. If you go find Ruler Bone Armor and lose, it’s fine, but if you win, you’ll automatically strip him of his position as City Lord. At that time, it’s hard to avoid the great figure behind him from bearing a grudge against you.”","Divine Lord Mu Chong said those words from the bottom of his heart. He said those words because Jian Wushuang had stopped at the last moment and spared his life.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and asked with a smile, “Is this Ruler Bone Armor strong?”","“He is much stronger than me,” Divine Lord Mu Chong replied.","Jian Wushuang smiled and did not reply. Instead, he extended his hand and patted Divine Lord Mu Chong’s shoulder. He then turned around and strode toward the last palace in the First City!","Jian Wushuang had come to the ancient path of stars with the intention of fighting with experts. How could Divine Lord Mu Chong’s words make Jian Wushuang back down?","In the deepest part of the First City, an extremely large and Grand Palace stood tall!","This palace was much larger than the other palaces. Looking at it from a distance, one could not help but feel a sense of submission.","The two words ‘bone armor’ were carved into the ceiling of the palace. This was where the first-ranked Ruler Bone Armor was located!","“Ruler Bone Armor...I hope it won’t disappoint me.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. Then, he raised his head and looked at the huge palace with a flash of light in his eyes.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang strode toward the huge palace.","Behind him, the people who had been defeated by Jian Wushuang looked at each other and then followed Jian Wushuang.","When Divine Lord Mu Chong saw this, he gritted his teeth and walked into the crowd.","At the same time, on the stone tablet outside the First City.","The words ‘Divine Lord Mu Chong’ that had been engraved on the second row flashed with golden light and vanished.","It was replaced by the words ‘Blood Sword’!","First City, second place, Blood Sword!","“Second place!”","“The Blood Sword is in second place!!”","“Even Divine Lord Mu Chong is no match for the Blood Sword?!”","“The Blood Sword is about to reach the pinnacle of the First City!”","At this moment, countless people outside the First City’s city gates burst into an uproar.","Divine Lord Mu Chong’s position as second in the First City has never wavered. No one has been a match for him in the past ten thousand years and he’s even known as the First City’s chosen with the most potential!","But today, this genius had been defeated by a younger fifth stage Ruler!","“This is the rise of a chosen!”","“I’m sure that among the last eight cities, there will definitely be a seat for Blood Sword in the future!”","“Although Blood Sword’s cultivation is only at the fifth level, his battle-power, in my opinion, is enough to fight against peak Rulers, or even the nearly invincible Ultimate Rulers!” Zhao Feng’s eyes flashed.","“If the Blood Sword is at the Ultimate Ruler realm, it’ll probably be able to fight against the most monstrous geniuses in the universe, right?”","At this moment, countless people were looking at the two golden words ‘Blood Sword’ on the stone tablet. They were fanatical and fascinated.","In just one day, they had watched Jian Wushuang rise from the last place to the second place in the First City!","They had seen many people successfully pass the First City and enter the Second City. However, it was rare to see someone like Jian Wushuang, who started from the last place and challenged all the way to the second place without taking a break.","For a fifth stage Ruler to be able to do this was unprecedented!","“This is how a man should be.” An Ultimate Ruler sighed.","“Do you guys think that Blood Sword will continue down this path and challenge the Ruler Bone Armor to complete the First City’s grand slam? Or will they pass by Ruler Bone Armor and head directly to The Second City?”","“In my opinion, based on Blood Sword’s personality, I’m afraid he’ll choose to ascend to the top of the First City. You must know that it’s a Grand feat to ascend to the top of the First City as a mere stage five great emperor.”","“It’s hard to say. The Ruler Bone Armor wasn’t from the First City to begin with. He’s just an important figure from the last eight cities who had been specially sent to the First City. His power is far greater than that of the First City’s people. Even if the Blood Sword can win against him, I’m afraid it won’t be an easy battle. It’ll affect his future.”","“That’s right. Even though I’d love to see the Blood Sword ascend to the top of the First City, I’d rather the Blood Sword avoid the Ruler Bone Armor. Otherwise, if the Blood Sword were to fight to the death with the Ruler Bone Armor in the First City, it’d be extremely disadvantageous to the other cities.”","“That’s right, the Blood Sword is destined to belong to the people of the later cities. We shouldn’t waste too much time and energy in the First City.”","At this moment, countless people looked at the ranking of ‘Blood Sword’ on the stone tablet with anticipation and some worry.","What they did not know was that Jian Wushuang had already arrived at the governor’s residence in the First City.","This palace was much more majestic than the other palaces. It was filled with scarlet lanterns and it appeared rather eerie in the desolate and dark First City.","Thump thump thump.","“I’m here to experience it.” Jian Wushuang was thin and tall. He took off the wooden token hanging on the mansion and said lightly.","“Alright,” he said.","A hoarse voice came from the City Lord’s mansion.","Creak! Creak!","Then, they saw the gate of the City Lord’s mansion open slowly, letting out an old and unpleasant sound.","In the endless darkness of the City Lord’s mansion, a hunchbacked and thin old man in a blood-red robe walked out step by step.","A cold and gloomy aura was emitted from his body.","“Ruler Bone Armor!”","“Bone Spine City Lord!”","The eyes of the Ultimate Rulers behind Jian Wushuang narrowed.","The Ruler Bone Armor was a nightmarish existence in the First City. Almost no city trespasser would challenge him.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. The Ruler Bone Armor seemed to be much stronger than the people he had met before.","A gust of cold wind blew past, ruffling the Ruler Bone Armor’s blood-red robes and revealing his shriveled, pitch-black skin. “Blood Sword, right? I know you. You killed two of my Rulers at the entrance to the ancient path of stars.”","Jian Wushuang did not deny it. He nodded and replied, “Not bad.”"]},{"number":4213,"title":"Chapter 4213 Bone Devil","paragraphs":["4213 Bone Devil","“It’s not a big deal. I originally didn’t want to make things difficult for you because of your talent. But unfortunately...if I’m not mistaken, you’re from the Divine Life Palace, aren’t you, Blood Sword?” Ruler Bone Armor growled.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank!","The Divine Life Palace was different from the other top powers in the universe. It was more like a big family, gathering all the special creatures that were wandering in the universe.","These special beings did not have the same clothes or the same cultivation techniques. Each of them had their own unique cultivation method, completely different from the Undying God nations or the ancient sacred lands.","Therefore, people who came out of the Divine Life Palace were rarely recognized.","After Jian Wushuang stepped onto the ancient path of stars, he did not deliberately reveal the aura of a special living being. He had fought with nearly a thousand Ruler realm experts, many of whom were knowledgeable, but none of them recognized him.","“I’m afraid that in the entire universe, only people from the cosmos divine Palace can quickly recognize my identity as someone from the Divine Life Palace...”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and replied indifferently, “So what if I am? So what if I’m not?”","“If you’re not, I don’t mind forming a good relationship with someone with good talent and potential like you.” The Ruler Bone Armor suddenly paused.","The next moment!","His skinny face was suddenly filled with ferocity!","“If you’re from the Divine Life Palace, then I’m sorry, but you must die in the First City today!","“Blood Sword, don’t try to quibble. I’m the direct disciple of cosmos temple’s Supreme Black Eagle. I’m definitely not mistaken","“Today, I’m going to get rid of Cosmos Divine Hall’s future threat!","“Go to hell!”","Boom!","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to speak, he took a step forward and slapped his five skinny fingers at Jian Wushuang with an infinite amount of coldness!","“Cosmos Divine Palace? The Black Eagle Ruler?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a strong killing intent!","Cosmos Divine Palace! The Black Eagle Supreme!","He could not be more familiar with it!","Back when he was being hunted down in nine Phoenix great star area, the Black Eagle Supreme from cosmos shrine recognized that he was a special creature and wanted to take the opportunity to kill him. If not for the timely rescue of the Nine Emperor Pavilion’s master Slayer, he would have died at the hands of the Black Eagle Supreme!","He would never forget such a life-and-death feud!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned extremely cold as he looked at the approaching Ruler Bone Armor. He sneered and said, “You’re wrong about something.”","“What?” The Ruler Bone Armor paused for a moment, and a mocking smile appeared on his face. “What did I say wrong?”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and fixed his gaze on the Ruler Bone Armor.","The next moment!","A low and sinister laugh rang out!","“Don’t you understand? the one who’s going to die today isn’t my Blood Sword, but you!!!”","Boom!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang held Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and slashed at Ruler Bone Armor!","The power of this strike far exceeded the one that had defeated Divine Lord Mu Chong!","A terrifying power exploded, stirring up the surrounding Qi activity and white waves!","Roar roar roar.","At this moment, a voice that sounded like the wailing of gods and devils or the low chanting of Buddhas came from the Wuqi Divine Sword.","Bang!","Finally, the Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand collided with the Ruler Bone Armor’s claw-like palm.","A vast shock wave immediately exploded from the point of contact between the two, directly flattening ten inches of the surrounding land!","“Not good! Quickly retreat!”","“The shockwaves from the battle between the two are too terrifying!!”","The Ultimate Rulers who were watching the battle behind Jian Wushuang immediately retreated.","Divine Lord Mu Chong’s heart jolted.","He had thought that even if Jian Wushuang was strong, he would not be much stronger than him. However, after seeing Jian Wushuang’s sword, he suddenly understood.","The gap between him and Jian Wushuang was an insurmountable chasm!","Rumble!","As the aftershock gradually dissipated, everyone hurriedly looked up and saw a skinny figure being sent flying backward and crashing onto the ground.","That figure was none other than the Ruler Bone Armor!","Jian Wushuang stood still with his black hair flying in the wind. His eyes were shining with divine light.","“Who can you kill with such weak strength?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He raised his chin and looked down at Ruler Bone Armor, who had fallen to the ground in the distance.","“Cough, cough. Cough...”","The Ruler Bone Armor staggered to his feet and looked at Jian Wushuang with great difficulty. His face was filled with shock and anger.","He was clearly a Ruler of the fifth level. How could he be so powerful?","“Blood Sword, you...”","Before he could stand up.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold as he struck down with his sword again. The sharp and cold sword light directly pressed Ruler Bone Armor down again.","“Bone Armor, who gave you the confidence to say you can kill me?”","Pfft!","A deep gash appeared on Ruler Bone Armor’s divine body.","He raised his head and stared at Jian Wushuang. His face was livid. “Blood Sword, who are you?”","As a member of Cosmos Divine Hall and a personal disciple of the Black Shadow Supreme, Ruler Bone Armor naturally knew a lot about the Divine Life Palace.","As far as he knew, there were not many experts in the Divine Life Palace at the Ruler level. He believed that the only one who could defeat him was the Ninth Kalpa King.","But...the person in front of him was completely different from the Ninth Kalpa King’s description.","Who could this person be?","“Killing you is not for the Ninth Kalpa King to make a move.” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","Ruler Bone Armor’s face instantly darkened upon hearing this.","“Blood Sword, do you really think that you’ve already won?” Ruler Bone Armor took a deep breath and suddenly said.","“Show me your strongest ability.” Jian Wushuang was not surprised at all.","Which of the experts who could travel the universe and reach the level of an Ultimate Ruler did not have a few secret techniques?","“Very good. Blood Sword, you said it. I hope you don’t regret it!”","The Ruler Bone Armor stuck out his tongue and licked his chapped lips, a cruel light in his eyes.","In the next moment, he stretched out his trembling hand and slowly formed a seal.","“Forbidden technique, bone devil!!!”","Boom!","The Ruler Bone Armor’s shriveled body began to lose its color as if the last drop of blood had been sucked out of it.","The vast divine power in his body started to burn at a terrifying speed.","Pfft!","There was a gash on his back.","Puff! Puff! Puff! Puff! Puff!","More and more cracks appeared on his body! More and more!","Then, a shocking scene happened.","Sharp, pitch-black bone spikes shot out of his body!","In the space of a few breaths, the Ruler Bone Armor had transformed from a wizened old man into a bent-over monster covered in bone spikes!"]},{"number":4214,"title":"Chapter 4214 The Bug","paragraphs":["4214 The Bug","“This is?”","“Bone demon!”","“Not good! The Blood Sword is in danger!”","In an instant, the Ultimate Rulers behind Jian Wushuang exclaimed in shock!","“Oh?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and a hint of surprise flashed in his eyes.","He could sense that the Ruler Bone Armor’s aura had increased several times over after using this forbidden technique.","“This move is not bad.” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“Blood Sword, let’s see who’s going to die!”","Ruler Bone Armor unleashed a terrifying sound wave that was like metal grinding against metal.","The next moment, he took a step forward and disappeared in an instant. Only a huge Sonic Boom could be seen from the place where he had been standing!","bang!","Then, he instantly appeared above Jian Wushuang and his five fingers turned into sharp bone spikes and grabbed at Jian Wushuang!","This grab was many times stronger than before. It was like five black waterfalls tearing the sky apart as they ruthlessly grabbed at Jian Wushuang’s head!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and he blocked it with his sword.","Clang!","Ruler Bone Armor’s five fingers instantly struck weeping Wu, causing a series of sparks to fly.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang snorted coldly. He flipped his right hand and divine power burst forth, sending the Ruler Bone Armor flying.","“Blood Sword, it’s useless. You can’t kill me!”","The Ruler Bone Armor laughed maniacally and flipped over on the ground. He stood up unscathed and charged at Jian Wushuang again.","Only a shallow white mark was left on the spot where Jian Wushuang had sent Ruler Bone Armor flying!","Although Jian Wushuang did not use all his divine power, his Wuqi Divine Sword had the limit of a Supreme treasure of laws!","“Blood Sword, do you think that the greatest increase in my strength after using this forbidden technique is my divine power?”","Ruler Bone Armor let out a wild laugh as he muttered to himself, you’re wrong. My greatest improvement is my unparalleled defense!","Ruler Bone Armor laughed confidently. He was confident that no one other than the invincible Ultimate Rulers of the universe would be able to kill him.","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang asked back with an expressionless face.","Ruler Bone Armor was truly hard to deal with after using his forbidden art. If he was still a fourth-stage Ruler and had not used those killing techniques, he probably would not have been able to kill him so quickly.","But now...","After breaking through to the fifth stage Ruler realm, Jian Wushuang’s strength had increased by more than a little.","From the beginning to the end, Jian Wushuang had not even used 20% of his divine power, not to mention his origin power of sword principle at the third stage of perfection, his universe principles at the peak, and the many killing moves that were enough to kill an invincible Ultimate Ruler!","One should know that those killing moves were the real reason why Jian Wushuang could suppress the Rulers of the world!","“Blood Sword, I’m invincible now!”","“Hahahaha!” Ruler Bone Armor raised his head and laughed, his voice transforming into terrifying soundwaves that forced the weaker Ultimate Rulers to back away.","In his opinion, Jian Wushuang had used up all his tricks.","“Invincible? You’re still so blindly confident.” Jian Wushuang’s expression was indifferent. He turned his right hand and put away the Wuqi Divine Sword.","“Eh? He abandoned his sword? Hahaha, Blood Sword, are you planning to admit defeat?” A hint of delight appeared on the Ruler Bone Armor’s pitch-black, bony face.","The next moment, he lowered his head and said with killing intent in his eyes, “Blood Sword, since you’ve admitted defeat, it’s my turn now!”","“Bone spike, go!”","He shouted and suddenly, all the bone spurs in his body rotated and shot out. They were like heavy javelins that contained terrifying divine power and shot toward Jian Wushuang fiercely!","It was so grand that it covered the sky and the sun!","It was unstoppable!","In an instant, the Rulers behind Jian Wushuang could not help but gasp and exclaim.","“This...each of these bone spikes is a low-grade nomological true treasure!”","“If these bone spikes were alone, they might not be much, but when gathered together, they are enough to kill a peak Ultimate Ruler!”","“Ruler Bone Armor’s power does not belong to the First City!”","“I’ve always heard that Ruler Bone Armor was originally from the Fifth City. It was only because of the powerful figure behind him that he was sent to the First City to hold the fort. Now, it seems that the rumors are true!”","“Sigh, if it wasn’t for the Ruler Bone Armor, the Blood Sword could have easily crushed anyone in the First City and reached the peak. It’s a pity that the Blood Sword has run into someone who doesn’t belong to the First City.”","The crowd looked at Jian Wushuang as they discussed quickly.","In their opinion, Jian Wushuang had abandoned his sword because he knew that he couldn’t break through the Ruler Bone Armor’s defense and was ready to admit defeat.","Jian Wushuang looked calm and suddenly asked, “Do you know what you should do to deal with a clamoring bug.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone present was confused.","The bug...what did that mean?","Before they could say anything, an extremely profound aura of the universe principles suddenly burst out from Jian Wushuang’s body!","They swore that they had never felt such strong presence of the principles of the universe in their lives!","“That is...” Jian Wushuang was expressionless as he continued to speak.","Bang!","Before he could finish his words, Jian Wushuang took a step forward with the help of the universe law. His entire body instantly turned into an afterimage. Like a ghost, he dodged the tens of thousands of pitch-black bone spikes and appeared in front of Ruler Bone Armor in a flash!","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He reached out his right hand at lightning speed and grabbed at the Ruler Bone Armor’s throat!","The grab was extremely fast, and with the power of the laws of the universe, it was filled with a profound feeling. Ruler Bone Armor seemed to have become a fool under this grab, unable to move at all.","“...If it’s a bug, then I’ll just pinch it to death!”","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang grabbed the Ruler Bone Armor’s throat with his right hand and lifted him up.","Jian Wushuang’s unfinished sentence came to an end!","All of this happened so fast that it seemed like it was completed in a flash!","In an instant, the entire place fell into dead silence as everyone was dumbfounded!","Du du du du du!","The pitch-black and thick bone spikes then shot into the place where Jian Wushuang had been standing!","“This!”","How could this be?!!","“Just how strong is the Blood Sword?”","Countless people looked at each other and exclaimed in shock.","They did not expect that in just an instant, the situation would change so drastically!"]},{"number":4215,"title":"Chapter 4215 The Master of Blood Sword City","paragraphs":["4215 The Master of Blood Sword City","As for Ruler Bone Armor, he was lifted up by Jian Wushuang’s five fingers. He felt as if the five fingers were like five unparalleled mountains, strangling his throat. No matter how he struggled and roared, he could not move at all.","“What...how did he become so much stronger all of a sudden?” Ruler Bone Armor’s face turned pale.","“Why would I need a sword to kill you?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. Between his five fingers, there was a vast and vigorous divine power and a sharp sword essence that could tear the sky and the earth. They exploded at the same time!","!!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The Ruler Bone Armor’s body trembled as if it had been struck by a giant hammer thousands of times.","A crack immediately appeared on his dry and dark skin.","His self-proclaimed invincible defense had been broken!","“No!”","The Ruler Bone Armor immediately let loose a cry of alarm upon seeing the crack.","For the first time, he felt the threat of death!","Jian Wushuang turned a deaf ear to his words. Ice-cold sword essence slithered between his five fingers like snakes and kept exploding in the body of the Ruler Bone Armor!","“Bang bang bang!”","“Bang bang bang!”","One crack, two cracks, three cracks...","In just a few short moments, cobweb-like cracks appeared on the Ruler Bone Armor’s shriveled skin. He had reached his limit!","Finally!","“Bid farewell to the world. Don’t worry, your master will come down to accompany you soon.”","Jian Wushuang grabbed Ruler Bone Armor by the neck and pulled him up to him. he then whispered something in his ear.","Then, the divine power and sword essence in Jian Wushuang’s hands exploded again!","Kachakachaa!","Ruler Bone Armor’s body instantly split apart, and then with a loud boom, his body exploded into dust!","In the ancient path of stars, the First City’s number one Ruler, the Ruler Bone Armor, had died!","The whole place was dead silent.","At that moment, everyone held their breath and looked at Jian Wushuang with great respect.","First place!","Everyone knows that from this moment on, the First City’s sky has changed!","From now on, the Blood Sword will replace the Ruler of the bone armor and become the First City’s city lord!","The crowd was silent for a few seconds before they erupted.","“The City Lord of Blood Sword City!”","“The City Lord of Blood Sword City!”","“The City Lord of Blood Sword City!!!”","Countless people lowered their heads and roared in a fanatical manner.","For a moment, the two words ‘Blood Sword’ filled the sky, and terrifying sound waves soared into the sky.","Countless Ultimate Rulers stared at Jian Wushuang’s back with fanatical eyes!","Legendary!","To them, the fact that Jian Wushuang had defeated nine hundred and ninety-nine opponents in a row from the last person in the First City to kill Ruler Bone Armor with his fifth stage Ruler power was simply a legend!","And they were so lucky to be able to witness the legendary realm!","Under the fanatical gazes, Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back and an indifferent expression on his face, as if he had just done something insignificant.","“You’re all dismissed.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and walked straight to the governor’s office of the First City.","There, the words ‘bone banner’ had disappeared and were replaced by the words ‘Blood Sword’!","Jian Wushuang hung up his wooden token and walked into the city lord mansion under everyone’s respectful gaze.","...","At the same time, outside the First City’s gates.","Countless people were focused on the ranking on the stone tablet, not even daring to blink their eyes!","At this moment, there was complete silence outside the city gates. Everyone wanted to see if the Blood Sword could create a miracle and reach the top!","A moment later, the ranking on the stone tablet suddenly flashed with a golden light!","“It’s coming, it’s coming! The rankings are about to change!”","“So, Blood Sword really did challenge the Ruler Bone Armor. I wonder if he’ll succeed!”","Countless people looked over, not even daring to take a deep breath!","Finally, the golden light gradually dissipated!","First City, first place, Blood Sword!","“Boom!”","In an instant, the crowd was in an uproar!","“First place! Blood Sword ascends to First City’s first rank!”","“A miracle! The Blood Sword really did defeat Ruler Bone Armor!”","“Hahahaha, I knew that the Blood Sword would defeat the bone Chi, but you didn’t believe me. I was right, wasn’t I? I just don’t know if the Blood Sword will continue down this path, or will it become like the bone armor Overlord and remain in the First City to dominate the world.”","“I’m more and more certain that the Blood Sword will become a powerful figure on the ancient path of stars. He might even be able to compete with the top geniuses in the universe!”","Countless people either exclaimed or laughed as they discussed.","When the people from wandering cultivator alliance saw this, they felt like they had eaten a fly and retreated.","...","At this moment, in the First City’s governor’s residence.","Jian Wushuang sat on a futon with his legs crossed. The strong aura of rules gushed toward him like the sea.","“On this ancient path of stars, the further one goes, the stronger the aura of laws will be. Hence, it also creates a scene where the strong become stronger and the weak become weaker.”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and a thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","To him, be it the Ruler Bone Armor or the First City, they were all just small interludes on the ancient path of stars.","His gaze had never once been set upon the First City.","Therefore, when the other Ultimate Rulers saw that Jian Wushuang had reached the top, they were all excited and fanatical. However, Jian Wushuang himself was not affected at all.","The First City’s power is not worth mentioning. I wonder how powerful they will be in the later stages of the city.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. If he only relied on divine power, his current power should have reached the top level of an Ultimate Ruler.","With the addition of universe laws and sword principle Origin Energy, Jian Wushuang could easily kill a top-tier Ultimate Ruler!","Ruler Bone Armor, for example, was an expert even at the peak-level of the Ultimate Ruler level!","With the addition of sky-opening, star-slashing, and his innate divine power, Jian Wushuang was confident that he could kill the invincible Ultimate Ruler!","Such invincible Ultimate Rulers were like Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and the others who had been in the Tarot Ruins.","Back then, Jian Wushuang had used all his skills and the eternal night sword to kill this invincible Ultimate Ruler. However, after breaking through to the fifth stage great Ruler and mastering the star slashing sword, Jian Wushuang was confident that if he met Prince Zhennan, the Third Prince, and the others again, he could kill them without relying on the ‘eternal night’ in the Tarot sword manual!","As for using a great super power like ‘eternal night’, Jian Wushuang was confident that he would not be defeated even if he were to fight against a truly invincible Ultimate Ruler like the Ninth Kalpa King, who even had the battle strength of a Supreme!","If he were to activate the Tarot sword, Jian Wushuang was not sure how powerful it would be.","Time passed by slowly. Jian Wushuang did not stay in the First City for long. After he had recovered his divine power, Jian Wushuang left the First City quietly and headed to the Second City.","The First City is only an appetizer. The true experts have long since reached the depths of the ancient path of stars.","Jian Wushuang turned back to look at the First City. he then took a deep breath and left the First City without any hesitation!"]},{"number":4216,"title":"Chapter 4216 The Fifth City","paragraphs":["4216 The Fifth City","When Jian Wushuang became the First City’s Governor, he also said, “In a grand palace in the eighth city.”","There were a few candles in the hall, and the dim yellow light of the candles flickered, making the hall look rather gloomy.","A devilish young man with long black hair draped over his shoulders was sitting on a large chair in a relaxed manner.","Beneath him were two peak Ultimate Rulers. They trembled as they bent their backs and knelt at his feet like servants.","!!","“Master, that Bone Armor guy is dead.”","The servant on the left said carefully.","“Oh? Who did it?”","The evil-looking young man raised his eyebrows.","“Master, this profound light mirror has recorded the scene when that Bone Armor fellow was killed.”","The servant lowered his head, moved his knees, and carefully handed over a dark light mirror.","“Yes.”","The demonic young man nodded and took the dark light mirror. He looked down and saw that it was playing the scene of Jian Wushuang crushing Ruler Bone Armor to death.","After a while.","The devilish young man pinched the dark light mirror with his slender fingers, and it immediately shattered into pieces.","“What trash. Not even a fifth-stage chief Ruler is a match for him.”","The devilish young man snorted in disdain. He then raised his head as a look of contemplation flashed in his eyes.","“This person’s name is Blood Sword, right...”","Du, du, du.","His fingers were rhythmically tapping on the armrest of the chair.","When the two servants saw this, they did not even dare to breathe loudly.","A moment later, the evil-looking young man lowered his head and looked at the two peak Ultimate Rulers kneeling in front of him. He said indifferently, “The two of you, head to the Fifth City to stop Blood Sword. If you can’t bring his head back, you don’t have to come back. Do you understand?”","The two servants trembled when they heard this.","“Yes, master.”","“Yes, Your Majesty! The two servants quickly responded and respectfully took their leave.”","After the two servants left, the already gloomy hall became even colder.","The devilish young man shook his head. He leaned back on the chair and slowly closed his eyes.","At the same time, in the distant Divine Life Palace.","The mist was faint, and a pot of warm spiritual tea was boiling on a stone table. The Ruler Blood Wave and the Supreme Giant Axe were sitting opposite each other, chatting and laughing.","After the tea was completely boiled.","“Giant Axe, come and have a taste. I’ve specially asked a good friend to take this tea from the first tea tree in the universe. It has a miraculous effect of calming the mind.” The Blood Wave Ruler rolled up his sleeves and poured a cup of tea as he smiled.","Supreme Giant Axe curled his lips upon hearing this. He had never been very interested in drinking tea. He only felt that it was a waste of time to take it slow.","Gulp.","Supreme Giant Axe picked up the cup of tea and gulped it down like a cow.","The Blood Wave Ruler chuckled and shook his head when he saw this. however, he didn’t mind. He and Giant Axe Ruler had been good friends for many years and had always understood his character.","He picked up the teacup and sipped the spiritual tea in it. He smiled and said, “Giant Axe, have you been paying attention to the news from the ancient path of stars?”","“What news?” Supreme Giant Axe raised his eyebrows and asked.","The Blood Wave Ruler clapped his hands and laughed. “Three days ago, I received a message from a good friend on the Supreme ancient path of stars. Something big happened with the Ninth Kalpa King.”","“What’s the big deal?” There was a hint of doubt in Supreme Giant Axe’s eyes. Could it be that something had happened to the Ninth Kalpa King?","However, looking at the Blood Wave’s expression, it did not seem like something had happened to the Ninth Kalpa King.","The Blood Wave Ruler smiled and said, “The Ninth Kalpa King killed Supreme fixed light!”","“What? The Ninth Kalpa King killed Supreme fixed light?” Supreme Giant Axe was startled upon hearing this.","He had heard of Supreme dingguang before. He was not very powerful and was considered to be at the bottom of the Supreme-being realm. However, he was still a genuine Supreme-being! It was extremely difficult to kill them!","The fall of a Supreme-being was a world-shaking event for the entire universe.","“The Ninth Kalpa King has just stepped into the supremacy stage, but he’s already able to kill a supremacy of the same level? Is this news true?” Giant Axe Ruler said with slight disbelief.","The Blood Wave Ruler nodded and smiled. “This matter has already spread throughout the Ruler starry sky ancient road. Naturally, it can’t be false.”","The Ruler Blood Wave paused for a moment and laughed bitterly. he seemed to be laughing at himself, but he also seemed to be pleased. “Perfect-level living beings truly are extraordinary. When I first broke through to the Ruler level, I had to spend an entire chaos cycle in secluded meditation before I was able to fully control my transformed Ruler divine body.”","“Hahaha, Blood Wave, we supreme martial artists who relied on hard work to reach this stage naturally can’t compare to those heaven’s favorites in terms of talent.” Supreme Giant Axe laughed heartily and changed the topic. “This time, it’s very likely that the Ninth Kalpa King will be able to go to the universe gathering of all races with us.”","The Blood Wave Ruler replied with an ‘en’ before saying, as long as the Ninth Kalpa King does not die on the Supreme starry sky ancient road, the chances of him participating in the Grand gathering of all races in the universe should be very high.","After a pause, the Blood Wave Ruler sighed and raised his head. “Jian Wushuang should have entered the ancient path of stars by now. I just don’t know how he’s doing. After all, the competition on the Ruler ancient path of stars is far more intense than the Ruler ancient path of stars.”","“I knew it. You’re worried about Jian Wushuang.” The Blood Wave Ruler smiled and continued, “Don’t worry. Jian Wushuang has always been smart. We don’t need to worry about him.”","“That’s true.” The Blood Wave Ruler smiled and said, “After Ninth Kalpa King killed Supreme fixed light, I’m looking forward to seeing what Jian Wushuang will be like after he breaks through to the Supreme level.”","“I think he should be similar to the Ninth Kalpa King.” Giant Axe Ruler replied.","The Blood Wave Ruler shook his head with a smile and did not reply.","He was the only one who knew that Jian Wushuang was a special creature that was a perfect creature!","If Jian Wushuang broke through to the Supreme level, he would probably be much stronger than the current Ninth Kalpa King.","....","Time passed by.","In the blink of an eye, sixty years had passed.","At the city gates of the Fifth City on the ancient path of the starry sky.","The void suddenly distorted. Then, a young man in a black robe, a hood, and a red sword case on his back stepped out of the void and stepped into the Fifth City.","There was a chubby yellow-robed cultivator beside the young man.","“Blood Sword, this is the Fifth City.”","The chubby yellow-robed cultivator said with a sneer.","“Yes.”","The black-haired young man nodded and looked around. The Fifth City was bustling with activity. There were markets, restaurants, and everything one could think of. Many Ultimate Rulers were passing by in a hurry on the streets.","This person was Jian Wushuang, who had been around for 60 years!"]},{"number":4217,"title":"Chapter 4217 The Divine Lord Invites You","paragraphs":["4217 The Divine Lord Invites You","In sixty years, Jian Wushuang had conquered four cities and reached the top of the four cities. Finally, he reached the Fifth City!","In terms of overall strength, the cultivators in the first four cities were indeed stronger than the previous one. To Jian Wushuang, it was not much of a difference. the enemies he encountered were often settled with one sword. occasionally, when he encountered difficult enemies, no one could resist Jian Wushuang’s ‘sky-opening’.","The chubby yellow-robed cultivator was called Ruler Hao Jin. Jian Wushuang had met him in the third city when he had been besieged by many experts.","It was none of Jian Wushuang’s business. However, the group of people happened to block his way. Jian Wushuang killed all the experts with ease. The yellow-robed cultivator saw this and immediately hugged Jian Wushuang’s leg, refusing to let go.","!!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang took it with him.","“This is the Fifth City?”","Jian Wushuang was not surprised. Starting from the Second City, there was no limit to the number of people on the ancient path of stars. This caused many Ultimate Rulers who could not continue to move forward to gather in First City.","“Let’s go in.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, collected his thoughts, and walked toward the street step by step.","Ruler Hao Jin quickly followed behind Jian Wushuang.","On the roadside, many Ultimate Rulers looked at Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin. At first, they were surprised, but then their eyes flickered, as if they were thinking about something.","“Blood Sword, the strongest person in the Fifth City is Yin Yang Divine Lord.” Ruler Hao Jin seemed rather reserved under the gazes of the other Ultimate Rulers, and he carefully introduced them.","“Yin Yang Divine Lord?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and looked at Ruler Hao Jin with interest. He said, “Continue.”","“Alright,” he said. Ruler Hao Jin nodded and replied, “Blood Sword, I don’t know much about the Yin Yang Divine Lord. I only heard that the Yin Yang Divine Lord’s origin is mysterious and his strength is unprecedentedly powerful. He wasn’t originally from the Fifth City, but he suddenly descended from the depths of the ancient road.","“After he descended upon the Fifth City, Yin Yang Divine Lord killed the original city Master of the Fifth City in just three moves and became the current controller of the Fifth City.”","At this point, Ruler Hao Jin paused, as if he had thought of something. He patted his head and said, “By the way, there’s one more thing. I almost forgot to mention that Yin Yang Divine Lord isn’t alone.”","“Not just one person?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and asked in confusion, “What do you mean?”","“Yes, the Yin Yang Divine Lord and the Yang Divine Lord are both top experts among the Ultimate Rulers. They cultivate the same techniques and have a high understanding of the origin power of yin and yang. It is said that even the nearly invincible Rulers will find it difficult to deal with them when they work together.” Ruler Hao Jin continued to ramble on.","“This is interesting.”","Jian Wushuang replied casually, but his eyes were looking elsewhere.","He could sense that ever since he stepped into the Fifth City, the people of the Fifth City had been looking at him strangely.","That feeling was like a wolf that had been starving for a long time, and a lamb that had finally come to its door.","Although the people of the Fifth City were trying their best to hide the greed and cruelty in their eyes, Jian Wushuang had seen this kind of gaze too many times and naturally saw through it at a glance.","Jian Wushuang frowned, suppressed his thoughts, and continued to walk forward.","In a restaurant next to the Imperial Road, by the window.","“You, look, isn’t that black-robed fifth stage great Ruler the person the Divine Lord has put a bounty on?”","An Ultimate Ruler, who had been casually glancing at the Imperial Road, suddenly trembled when he saw Jian Wushuang and quickly said, “Eh? who was it? That Sir Divine Lord, the person with the one million Universe Origin Stones bounty?”","Immediately, all the people in the restaurant crowded over and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Fifth stage, sword case on the back...there’s no mistaking it, this person must be the one the Divine Lord has put a bounty on!”","“Let’s go and inform the Divine Lord of this person’s appearance! Don’t let anyone else get there first!”","They all took a deep breath and suppressed the excitement in their hearts. Then, they hurried toward the City Lord’s mansion.","For a moment, conversations similar to those in restaurants were staged all over the Fifth City.","As for Jian Wushuang, he still didn’t know that he had already become the target of public criticism. He just subconsciously frowned more and more.","“There’s something strange about the Fifth City.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He could see that as he went deeper into the Fifth City, many Ultimate Rulers on the roadside swept in the same direction after taking a glance at him.","“B-B-B-Blood Sword, there’s something wrong with the way they’re looking at us.”","At this moment, Ruler Hao Jin also noticed that the atmosphere was a little off, and he swallowed his saliva.","“Did we offend some big shot? That can’t be right, we just stepped into the Fifth City and haven’t even spoken to anyone, how could we have provoked anyone?” Ruler Hao Jin was rather puzzled.","Jian Wushuang suddenly thought of something and squinted his eyes.","Provoke?","If there was anyone that he had offended, there was only one person.","He was the First City’s Ruler Bone Armor!","At this moment, a series of heavy footsteps suddenly came from the ground.","Peng, peng, peng.","Peng, peng, peng.","Then, Jian Wushuang saw a group of black-armored guards holding long axes, wearing black armor and helmeted hats with a white feather on them, walking toward him expressionlessly.","They stopped in front of Jian Wushuang. The leading black-armored guard first took a look at Jian Wushuang’s face and then took out a dark light mirror from his waist, as if to confirm his identity.","In the end, the leading black-armored guard put away the dark light mirror and asked expressionlessly, “Are you the Blood Sword?”","“It’s me.” Jian Wushuang nodded his head calmly.","“Blood Sword, our Divine Lord has invited you to come with us.” The black guard said expressionlessly.","Before Jian Wushuang could say anything, Ruler Hao Jin, who was following behind Jian Wushuang, quivered and asked hurriedly, “Sir, may I ask why sir Divine Lord is looking for us?”","“Eh? And who are you?” The leading black-armored guard gave Ruler Hao Jin a once-over, then frowned. “It’s none of your business, so quickly step aside.”","“I...”","Before he could continue, Jian Wushuang extended his hand and stopped him.","He looked at the black-armored guard indifferently and said calmly, “Bring me there.”","The black-armored guard nodded and smiled faintly, “Let’s go, Sir Divine Lord. I’ve been waiting for you for a long time.”","..."]},{"number":4218,"title":"Chapter 4218 Committing Suicide","paragraphs":["4218 Committing Suicide","Jian Wushuang followed the divine armor guard and walked into the distance. He sneered in his heart.","“Forget it. I just hope that Yin Yang Divine Lord can be stronger. It would be boring if he died after a few slashes.”","...","The Fifth City was much more vast than the previous cities. Jian Wushuang followed behind the team of black armored guards and walked for the time for three incense sticks to burn before they arrived at the City Lord Mansion where Yin Yang Divine Lord was.","!!","The City Lord’s mansion was built as tall as the city walls. There was a huge Yin Yang picture drawn on the gate, on which Dao intent was abundant and nomological principles were rich.","“Blood Sword, we just arrived in the Fifth City and have never dealt with Yin Yang Divine Lord. Why do you think he’s looking for us?” Ruler Hao Jin followed behind Jian Wushuang and said while swallowing his saliva.","“I don’t know either.” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Even though he had guessed that the Yin Yang Divine Lord was related to Ruler Bone Armor, he would only know if they were truly related after they met.","“Blood Sword, I don’t know why, but I have a bad feeling about this.” Ruler Hao Jin said softly.","“Oh? What bad feeling?” Jian Wushuang asked, dumbfounded.","“I don’t know how to explain it to you. However, you should know that at our level, we can more or less sense what’s about to happen. I have a feeling that the Yin Yang Divine Lord is up to no good.” Ruler Hao Jin shook his head and sighed.","Then, he rolled his eyes and said hesitantly, “Blood Sword...why don’t we take advantage of the fact that we haven’t entered the city Lord’s mansion and escape?”","Jian Wushuang replied with a faint smile, “Hao Jin, I can understand your worries, so you shouldn’t go in. As for me...”","Bang!","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and pushed the door of the Yin Yang illustration open.","He sneered, “...As for me, I’d like to see what kind of tricks this Yin Yang Divine Lord is playing!”","The heavy door was slowly pushed open.","A beam of light shot out from the crack of the door.","“Blood Sword, the Divine Lord is waiting for you inside. Please enter.” The black-armored guard stood in front of the door and extended a hand inside. He said expressionlessly, “Please!”","At the same time, the team of black armored guards surrounded Jian Wushuang and cut off his retreat.","Jian Wushuang nodded and walked into the mansion.","Ruler Hao Jin’s expression instantly turned into one of struggle and hesitation.","Even a fool could tell that Yin Yang Divine Lord definitely had ulterior motives. It was easy to enter the City Lord’s mansion but difficult to come out.","When he saw Jian Wushuang’s figure walking further and further away and was about to disappear from the governor’s mansion, Ruler Hao Jin finally gritted his teeth and shouted, “Blood Sword, wait for me!”","After he finished speaking, he saw the black armored guards on both sides with cold and expressionless faces. He took a deep breath and ran toward Jian Wushuang in big steps.","There were rockery, pavilions, and stone buildings in the city Lord’s mansion, but it was deathly silent. Under this deathly silent atmosphere, it seemed a little depressing.","Jian Wushuang turned to look at Ruler Hao Jin, who had caught up with him. He raised his eyebrows and asked, “Hao Jin, why did you follow us?”","Ruler Hao Jin puffed out his chest and chuckled. “My life was saved by you. If I were to back down now, wouldn’t that make me seem too disloyal?”","“It’s fine. It’s none of your business that Yin Yang Divine Lord is looking for me.” Jian Wushuang laughed. He did not say anything when he saw Ruler Hao Jin’s determined expression.","A moment later, the two of them passed through a long corridor, and a dark hall appeared in front of them.","He saw two old men in Yin Yang Taoist robes sitting in the middle of the hall.","Needless to say, the two elders were naturally Divine Lords Yin Yang.","One of the two old men had a head full of red hair, and his eyes were like fire. His entire body emitted a fierce aura, and the corners of his robe were scattered with a few sparks.","The other man was wearing a black robe, and his aura was as heavy as water. Between his eyes, there was a faint blue divine light flashing.","These two people were the two servants who had knelt at the feet of the evil-looking young man in the eighth city.","However, at this moment, the two servants were no longer as cautious as they had been when they were at the feet of the evil-looking young man. They sat in the hall and looked at Jian Wushuang with contempt. They were extremely arrogant.","“You’re Blood Sword?” Yin Divine Lord, who was sitting on the right, asked indifferently.","“it’s me.” Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back and replied in a neither humble nor overbearing manner, “Divine Lords, why are you looking for me?”","“Don’t you know why I’m looking for you?” The Yang Divine Lord, who had a violent personality, snorted when he heard this.","Then, a domineering and scorching aura, as if it had taken a physical form, pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","Ruler Hao Jin, who was standing behind Jian Wushuang, felt his heart sink.","This was to give the Blood Sword a taste of its might!","Initially, he was still thinking about whether he could find an opportunity to end things amicably. However, looking at the Yin Yang Divine Lord’s appearance, he was afraid that things would not end well.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a faint sneer.","Lower his horse’s might?","Bang!","All of a sudden, Jian Wushuang’s third level of sword essence burst out. A sword essence that could tear the world apart suddenly soared up!","As soon as the sword essence was released, it completely minced the aura that was pressing down on the Yang Divine Lord. Then, like the rising tide of the sea, it slapped toward the Yin Divine Lord!","“How audacious!”","“Impudent!”","Instantly, Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord glared at each other and anger surged on their faces.","Bang!","Finally, the sword intent that could tear the sky and the earth collided with him. Yin Yang Divine Lords quickly used their divine power and stretched out their hands to slap the sword intent away.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang did not care. The sword essence was released casually and he did not want to kill the two.","After dispersing the sword essence, Yin Yang Divine Lords stared at Jian Wushuang and their eyes were extremely cold.","“Blood Sword, this old man can’t be bothered to beat around the bush. Let me ask you, were you the one who killed Ruler Bone Armor?” Yin Yang Divine Lord said at the same time with a cold expression.","“What? The Blood Sword killed Ruler Bone Armor?”","Ruler Hao Jin was shocked upon hearing this. as someone from the third city, he had naturally experienced the First City before.","Thus, he knew a bit about the Ruler Bone Armor’s identity.","He was someone who had been placed in the First City by a powerful figure in the back city.","Ruler Hao Jin instantly understood.","He raised his head and looked at Yin Yang Divine Lord. He was afraid that the two of them were also arranged by the big shot to kill Jian Wushuang.","“I was the one who killed him,” Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back and replied indifferently.","He had always been frank and honest in his actions.","He had killed Ruler Bone Armor, and so he naturally wouldn’t deny it.","“Good, this old man likes straightforward people like you. Blood Sword, don’t say that this old man doesn’t give you a chance. You can kill yourself now and save us the trouble of fighting. You’ll die a little easier.” When Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord heard this, their eyes lit up and they laughed coldly."]},{"number":4219,"title":"Chapter 4219 Breaking 24 With a Single Sword","paragraphs":["4219 Breaking 24 With a Single Sword","“Suicide?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but laugh as if he had heard a funny joke.","The next moment.","After Jian Wushuang laughed, he looked at Yin Yang Divine Lord and said in disdain, “Who the hell are you two, are you even worthy of me killing myself?”","!!","The moment he said that, Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord turned pale.","“You’ve got guts, boy!”","“Blood Sword, you deserve to die!!”","Yin Divine Lord and Yin Divine Lord shouted sternly.","Then, the two of them waved their hands and shouted, “Black-armored guards, kill!”","Boom! Boom!","Two groups of Ultimate Rulers, wearing black armor and heavy helmets and holding long axes, rushed in from outside the hall.","“Kill!”","A muffled sound came from the two teams of black armored guards.","When Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord saw this, the corners of their lips curled up into a mocking smile. “Blood Sword, we wanted to give you a chance to kill yourself, but you didn’t cherish it. Don’t blame us for being merciless.”","“Blood Sword, don’t blame us. If you want to blame someone, blame yourself for killing that trash, Bone Armor, and angering our master.”","After saying that, Yin Yang Divine Lord closed their eyes and did not look anymore.","Each of the black-armored guards had the cultivation of an Ultimate Ruler. There were twenty-four of them, and even if the two of them worked together, they would have a headache.","They did not think that Jian Wushuang would be able to survive the two teams of black armored guards.","In an instant, the two teams of black armored guards leaped up at the same time. They gathered their divine power into the divine axes in their hands and hacked at Jian Wushuang!","Twenty-four axe lights flickered, lighting up the hall!","“Not good! Blood Sword, retreat!”","Ruler Hao Jin’s face changed dramatically as he hurriedly called out.","“Retreat?”","Jian Wushuang sneered and a cold light flashed in his eyes.","“They’re just clay chickens and pottery dogs.”","Clang!","With a sword cry, the Wuqi Divine Sword was instantly unsheathed!","Jian Wushuang turned over his right hand and the blood-red Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","Then, Jian Wushuang swung his sword and the power of the third level of origin of sword principle burst out.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","The 24 white axe lights hit the Wuqi Divine Sword and 24 loud sounds were heard.","Jian Wushuang felt his hand become heavy. The joint attack of the twenty-four black armored guards was extraordinary. Even if he only relied on his divine power to take it head-on, he would still find it difficult.","“Is this the Fifth City’s strength?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. The Fifth City was indeed much stronger than the previous cities. Even the strength of any black armored guard could be ranked in the top 100 in the past.","“Unfortunately, if you want to kill me with this bit of strength, it’s far from enough.”","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang sneered and his divine power that was twelve thousand times stronger suddenly burst forth. He lifted it up fiercely!","Kachacha!","A blood-red sword light flashed!","In an instant, the twenty-four black armored guards retreated, their divine bodies trembling.","There was even a crack on the black axe.","“Kill!”","The twenty-four black armored guards looked at each other. Only a pair of eyes could be seen from their helmet-covered faces, and they flashed with determination.","The 24 black-armored guards charged at Jian Wushuang again!","“Blood Sword, I’ll help you!”","“Die! Ruler Hao Jin gritted his teeth upon seeing this. A saber appeared in his hand, and he charged at the twenty-four black armored guards.","However, Hao Jin’s Ruler was only at the third city’s level. How could he be a match for the black-armored guard?","He was only blocked by the axe for three breaths of time before he was forced back by the axe!","Jian Wushuang could not help but laugh and shake his head.","Then, Jian Wushuang turned his eyes and looked at the black-armored guard who had jumped up at the same time and swung his long axe at him. His eyes gradually turned cold.","“You’re not done, are you?”","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang’s finger ran across the blade of the Wuqi Divine Sword and he shouted, “Split open the sky!!!”","In an instant, the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand emitted the wailing of gods and the low chanting of Buddhas!","An extremely sharp sword ray condensed on the blade of Wuqi Divine Sword!","Waves of earth-shattering power were emitted from the blade.","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows and raised his right hand that was holding the Wuqi Divine Sword. Then, he hacked down at the twenty-four black armored guards!","“Rumble!”","With an explosive sound, the sword light slashed at the 24 black armored guards!","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s twelve thousand times divine power and the origin power of the third level of sword principle burst out without any restraint!","Bang!","As if doomsday had arrived, the entire hall was instantly torn apart. The thick eaves were directly blown away, raising countless dust.","The twenty-four black armored guards were so angry that their eyes almost popped out of their sockets!","First, the pitch-black long axes in their hands were crushed inch by inch under the suppression of the sword light. Then, cracks appeared on the true treasure armors of the 24 black-armored guards. In the end, with a loud explosion, the armors and the 24 of them were turned into powder!","He had killed twenty-four Ultimate Rulers with a single sword swing!","Under this sword, all twenty-four black armored guards were killed. Not a single one survived!","This sword caused a stir in the entire city!","In the Fifth City, regardless of whether they were walking on the Imperial Road or cultivating in seclusion, at this moment, all of them raised their heads and looked at the position of the City Lord’s mansion.","“What happened?”","“Let’s go! There’s a battle in the City Lord’s mansion!”","“Who’s fighting in the City Lord’s mansion?”","“Could it be that someone has gone to challenge the Yin Yang Divine Lords? This person’s cultivation in the way of the sword is very strong!”","All of a sudden, countless people heard the news and took big steps toward the City Lord’s mansion.","Even though the City Lord’s mansion was protected by the rules of the ancient starry sky road, it had also been reduced to ruins.","Smoke and dust filled the air. Among the ruins, Jian Wushuang’s black hair flew in the wind and he was fighting with his sword.","Behind him, Ruler Hao Jin fell to the ground, dumbfounded by Jian Wushuang’s sword.","“Isn’t my savior a little too strong?” Ruler Hao Jin was tongue-tied in shock.","From the beginning to the end, he had followed Jian Wushuang and saw that Jian Wushuang was calm and composed when he defeated his enemies. Therefore, he had never thought about how strong Jian Wushuang was.","Who would have thought that Jian Wushuang’s attack would be so earth-shattering!","“Blood Sword, we’ve underestimated your strength. It’s not an injustice for Gu Chi to die in your hands.”","A gust of wind blew past, carrying away the smoke and dust.","Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord’s faces were extremely gloomy as they spoke.","Originally, the evil-looking young man had ordered them to kill Jian Wushuang. They had thought that it was a wonderful job and that their main purpose was to relax. Killing Jian Wushuang was just a side mission.","However, Jian Wushuang’s sword attack made them realize that the Blood Sword was much more difficult to deal with than they had imagined."]},{"number":4220,"title":"Chapter 4220 Yin and Yang","paragraphs":["4220 Yin and Yang","“You talk too much.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm and he looked at Yin Yang Divine Lords indifferently.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang’s body swayed and he charged toward the Yin Yang Divine Lords.","“Hmph, arrogant!”","!!","Yin Yang Divine Lords looked at each other and shouted in unison, “Divine power, Flame Dragon!”","“Sacred art, ten thousand miles of ice and frost!”","In an instant, the temperature in the area where Jian Wushuang was at dropped sharply. An extremely cold power of principles fell and countless broken arms and ruins turned into ice sculptures.","Under the power of the cold, everything slowed down. A thin layer of frost formed on Jian Wushuang’s Wuqi Divine Sword.","Moreover, the frost continued to extend upwards along the blade of Wuqi Divine Sword as if it was going to freeze Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly. He could feel that under the power of the ice, the divine power that was boiling in his body started to slow down.","And this was not the end!","The divine power in the Yang Divine Lord’s hands surged. He pulled with both hands, and countless divine power gathered and turned into a huge flaming dragon that could swallow the sun.","“Go!”","The Yang Divine Lord’s red hair flew in the wind as he pushed forward. In an instant, the huge fire dragon flowing with lava let out a roar that shook the nine heavens and ten lands. It bared its fangs and brandished its claws as it bit at Jian Wushuang!","The two killing moves from Yin Yang Divine Lords were aimed at Jian Wushuang!","Even Jian Wushuang’s face turned grave when he saw the two killing moves.","After the Yin Yang Divine Lords was done, he immediately put his hands behind his back and looked at each other with a touch of pride on his face.","Before the two of them were subdued by the evil-looking young man, they were famous Ultimate Rulers in the universe and the big shots of the eighth city.","They were confident that it would not be a problem for them to take down Jian Wushuang, who was only a fifth stage great Ruler, with their combined strength.","“Roar roar roar!”","The Yang Divine Lord’s fierce divine power had transformed into a magma dragon. It hovered in the sky, and a huge heat wave was spewing out of its nose, burning the void.","On the ground, thousands of miles of glaciers had formed. The ground under Jian Wushuang’s feet was covered in frost. The broken walls and ruins had turned into huge ice sculptures. The whole world seemed to have turned into a World of Ice and snow.","The nomological origin power that the two of them had comprehended, one extreme yin and one extreme yang, could change the world and was extremely terrifying when they executed it together.","Jian Wushuang held the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and stepped into the void as if he was trapped in a world of ice and fire. His expression became a little serious.","“As expected of an expert from the back city. He’s much stronger than the Rulers of the first five cities.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","The ancient path of stars was worthy of being the place where all the Rulers of the universe gathered. Not only were there many Ultimate Rulers, but their quality was also several levels higher than the outside world.","If this Yin Yang Divine Lord was in the outside world, he would definitely not appear as a Supreme. He was an existence that could dominate a region at the Ruler realm. However, in the end, he had become someone’s servant on the ancient path of stars. He had not even entered the back eight cities where true experts were.","Jian Wushuang had long heard that the 10th city was the dividing line among the 18 cities on the ancient road of stars. The real experts, the abnormal existences among the Rulers and the geniuses, all fought in the last eight cities.","Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and looked at Yin Yang Divine Lord indifferently. He said, “This principles of yin and yang isn’t bad. If I continue to grow, I might be able to reach the threshold of a One Thought Divine Kingdom.","Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord stood with their hands behind their backs. When they heard what Jian Wushuang said, they lifted their eyelids and looked at Jian Wushuang in disdain. “Blood Sword, you do have a good eye. Since you understand how powerful we are, you should obediently surrender and follow us to see our master. If you make master happy, maybe if he’s in a good mood, he’ll take you in as a slave and spare your life, considering your talent.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Ruler Hao Jin, who had been stunned by Yin Yang Divine Lord’s attack, looked at Jian Wushuang with anticipation.","He hoped that Jian Wushuang would go and seek refuge with the master behind the Yin Yang Divine Lords.","If the Yin Yang Divine Lords were already so powerful, how terrifying would their master be?","A fine bird chooses a tree to live in, and a wise minister chooses his master.","On the ancient path of stars, it was extremely normal for the weak to rely on the strong.","After all, there were experts everywhere on the ancient path of stars, and the killing was extremely brutal and tragic. If one could rely on an expert, it was equivalent to finding a powerful backing for themselves.","What’s more, if the great beings they were attached to were lucky enough to stand out in the ancient path of stars and obtain the qualification to participate in the universe banquet of all races, then they would naturally be able to rise to the heavens and follow them to the universe banquet.","It could be said that other than those who were extremely confident in their own strength or those few heaven-defying existences who had stepped into the peak of the universe Overlord realm, others would more or less choose to follow the strong.","For example, wasn’t he, Ruler Hao Jin, dependent on Jian Wushuang now?","Finally, Jian Wushuang sighed under the expectant gaze of Ruler Hao Jin and said, “Yin Yang Divine Lords, you either want me to kill myself or make me your master’s slave. What kind of person do you take me for?”","“What kind of person did you take me for?” When the Yin Yang Divine Lords heard that, they laughed and said, “Blood Sword, oh Blood Sword, don’t you even understand the principle of the weak submitting to the strong?”","After laughing, the Yin Yang Divine Lords faces turned cold and he snorted, “Blood Sword, don’t be ungrateful. This is the last chance I’m giving you. In your life, you have to understand that you have to grasp opportunities. Otherwise, once you miss it, it won’t come back again. Do you understand?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang didn’t bother to say anything more. He sneered, “Idiot.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate any longer. He stomped heavily and created a huge pit on the frozen floor. His body shot out like a cannonball and he charged toward Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord!","“I’m giving you face, but you don’t want it.”","Yin Yang Divine Lords snorted, “Flame Dragon, go!","“Ten thousand miles of ice seal, rise!!!”","Boom!","Immediately, the magma dragon in the sky opened its mouth and roared, spitting out a huge fiery dragon breath. Then, it wagged its tail and bit Jian Wushuang fiercely!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and he poured his divine power into the Wuqi Divine Sword. Then, he swung the ‘sky-opening’ sword again and slashed at the magma dragon!","Chi chi chi chi!","Under Jian Wushuang, icicles as thick as mountains rose from the ground and stabbed at Jian Wushuang with a cold and terrifying force!","“Get lost!”","The light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes grew by three inches. He shouted coldly and stomped his right foot on the ice peak!","For a time, Jian Wushuang was fighting one against two and he was fighting with the Yin Yang Divine Lords at the same time!"]},{"number":4221,"title":"Chapter 4221 The Master, Heavenly Snake Playboy","paragraphs":["4221 The Master, Heavenly Snake Playboy","Bang!","The Wuqi Divine Sword flashed with a blood-red light and slashed at the head of the magma dragon!","Rumble!","A thunder-like explosion rang out!","!!","“Roar!”","The Flame Dragon roared in pain. On its head, a deep sword mark started from its head and extended all the way to its tail, as if it was going to cut the Flame Dragon in half!","under this strike, the magma dragon formed by divine power and the laws of yin and yang shrunk by half, and its divine power was obliterated.","Bang!","The huge Ice Peak that was heading toward Jian Wushuang was crushed by Jian Wushuang’s foot!","Jian Wushuang’s sword and kick had broken the two killing moves of Yin Yang Divine Lord!","“This kid!”","When Yin Yang Divine Lord saw this, his pupils shrank and his expression turned ugly.","This scene fell into the eyes of many Rulers of the Fifth City who had come from all directions to watch the battle.","They stopped in their tracks and their bodies trembled.","“There’s, there’s actually someone fighting with the Divine Lord!”","“Isn’t this the person that Sir Divine Lord put a bounty on?”","“This person is so strong! He’s only a fifth stage great Ruler, but he’s able to fight Yin Yang Divine Lords at the same time without being at a disadvantage!”","They all looked up at Jian Wushuang and their breathing became rapid.","“Yin Yang Divine Lords, that’s all you’ve got. Where did you get the confidence to ask me to kill myself? You dare to say you want me to be your slave?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he looked at Yin Yang Divine Lord and Yin Yang Divine Lord.","When the Yin Divine Lord and the Yang Divine Lord heard this, their faces turned extremely gloomy. They looked at each other, and the hot-tempered Yang Divine Lord immediately said, “Blood Sword, don’t be so smug.”","After saying that, Yin Divine Lord’s expression turned serious again. “Yang Divine Lord, don’t hold back. be careful not to fail miserably.”","Although the Yang Divine Lord had a violent temper, he was not a brainless person. He nodded and said in a deep voice, “Yin Divine Lord, then let’s use that move to suppress this kid.”","“Alright,” he said. Yin Divine Lord nodded.","Immediately, Yin Divine Lord’s aura rose sharply.","The two nomological powers, one Yin and one Yang, rose up and intertwined in the air, gradually merging together.","The principles of Yin and Yang that the two of them had comprehended were from the same source and complemented each other. At this moment, they were able to merge together without any obstruction.","After the two principles merged together, they gradually practiced and turned into a Yin Yang array diagram that swept across the world!","This Yin Yang array pattern covered the sky and ground, and its terrifying power crushed all the Qi movement like a millstone that could destroy the world!","“Oh?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and a hint of surprise appeared on his face.","It was no wonder that even though both Ruler Bone Armor and Yin Yang Divine Lord were servants of that important figure in the back city, Ruler Bone Armor had been assigned to the First City.","The difference in strength between the two was too great.","“Blood Sword, go to hell!!”","At the next moment, the Yin Yang Divine Lord shouted at the same time!","In an instant, the Yin Yang formation map pressed down on Jian Wushuang with a mighty power that could destroy a star!","This is the trump card of Yin Yang Divine Lord!","Yin Yang Divine Lord, you are indeed an expert from the back city. You are much stronger than us!","For a moment, the powerhouses of the Fifth City who had come from all directions to watch shook their heads and exclaimed.","“Blood Sword, hold on!!”","As for Ruler Hao Jin, he stared at this scene fixedly. He did not even dare to breathe loudly, and his heart was in his throat.","In the void, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and his black hair was flying.","He looked at the huge Yin Yang array diagram that was like a sun that was coming toward him. He took a deep breath and said, “Slash...star!”","Bang!","In an instant, the surging wind, the floating dust, everything in the air turned into the purest energy and rushed toward Jian Wushuang’s hand.","Not only that, but the Rulers and experts standing in the distance also seemed to be drawn to Jian Wushuang’s hands.","It was so grand that it covered the sky and the sun!","In the end, all of it was poured into Jian Wushuang’s hand and turned into a silver sword rainbow that was a thousand feet long!","Jian Wushuang had comprehended this sword move when he fought Ninth Kalpa King in the Divine Life Palace’s trial arena.","After Jian Wushuang broke through to the fifth level of Ultimate Ruler, he had reached the realm of great completion!","This sword was enough to destroy a star!","this sword was enough to split the milky way!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang held the thousand-foot sword rainbow in his hand. His black hair flew in the air and the divine light in his eyes suddenly grew three inches!","“Slash!”","“Boom!”","Immediately, the silver sword rainbow slashed down!","This sword directly created a sky-shaking wave, and the sky seemed to be split in half by this sword!","Bang!","In an instant, the 300-meter-long silver sword rainbow fiercely collided with the Yin Yang sword pattern!","like a knife cutting through tofu, the yin yang array diagram was split 5000 feet!","Like a chaotic night being torn apart by lightning, the yin yang sword pattern was instantly shattered!","This sword was as destructive as rotten wood and destroyed everything!","It was extremely overbearing!","“What!”","In an instant, Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord’s bodies trembled violently. The shock and anger in their eyes turned into fear!","As for the silver sword rainbow, after it split the Yin Yang formation, it only paused for a moment before it slashed toward Yin Yang Divine Lord again!","“Run!”","Seeing this, Yin Yang Divine Lord’s eyes were filled with anger and he turned around to escape!","“Can you escape?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. Holding the silver sword rainbow, he looked like a god.","“Innate divine power, original universe.”","Jian Wushuang said coldly, “In an instant, an invisible domain descended on the entire place and Yin Divine Lord and Yang Divine Lord’s footsteps slowed down.”","The silver sword rainbow finally slashed down!","“How dare you, thief? My master is the heavenly snake playboy!”","Yin Yang Divine Lord was horrified and divine power surged in his body in an attempt to resist!","However, in the face of absolute power, everything was useless.","The violent Yang Divine Lord’s divine body was covered in cracks like shattered glass under the sword!","Immediately after, Yang Divine Lord’s divine body collapsed in an instant, and countless divine powers were crushed into powder by the silver sword rainbow!","When Yin Divine Lord saw this, his face turned ashen and pale.","Boom!","Then, the silver sword rainbow that had killed the Yang Divine Lord fell on the Yin Divine Lord again!","Yin Divine Lord’s divine body started to disintegrate at a speed visible to the naked eye. Countless divine powers were obliterated.","“I’m done for.”","Yin Divine Lord heaved a long sigh and gave up struggling.","Just as all the divine power in his body was about to be completely crushed and his life was hanging by a thread.","Suddenly.","That silver sword rainbow actually quickly dissipated.","..."]},{"number":4222,"title":"Chapter 4222 The Sixth City","paragraphs":["4222 The Sixth City","“Eh? What’s going on?”","Yin Divine Lord’s face was filled with joy. he thought that someone had saved his life.","He quickly looked up.","However, Jian Wushuang withdrew the Wuqi Divine Sword and looked at him expressionlessly.","!!","“Blood Sword, what do you mean by this?”","Yin Divine Lord asked, but his tone was less aggressive and provocative.","Although he did not know why Jian Wushuang had spared his life at the last moment, he was glad to have survived Jian Wushuang’s attack.","At that moment, he did not dare to provoke Jian Wushuang again.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void with his hands behind his back and said indifferently, “I’ll keep your life for now. Go back and tell the heavenly snake playboy behind you to wait for me. I’ll come to you in person soon.”","Hearing this, Yin Divine Lord’s pupils shrank.","“Blood Sword, you’re really not going to kill me?” Said Yin Divine Lord in disbelief.","“I’ll only let you live for a few days. I’ll give you a chance to be buried with your master.” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently.","When Yin Divine Lord heard this, he was overjoyed.","“Hahaha, Blood Sword, you asked for this!”","“Alright, Blood Sword, let’s wait and see!” Yin Divine Lord did not dare to say anything as he was afraid that if he said something wrong, he would anger Jian Wushuang and cause him to change his mind.","After saying that, Yin Divine Lord turned around and fled into the distance in a sorry state.","Jian Wushuang shook his head nonchalantly. To him, Yin Divine Lord was just an ant that he could kill with a flip of his hand. If he wanted to kill him, he could do it at any time.","It was Heavenly Snake Playboy who was behind this that Jian Wushuang really wanted to kill!","In the distance.","“Blood Sword!”","Ruler Hao Jin was so excited that his entire body was trembling. He looked at Jian Wushuang with a fanatical gaze.","He won!","The Blood Sword actually won!","Yin Yang Divine Lord was a well-known Ultimate Ruler in the Ruler realm. Before he was subdued by Heavenly Snake Playboy, he was one of the top figures in the universe Ruler realm. Even Ruler Hao Jin had heard of Yin Yang Divine Lord before he stepped onto the ancient starry sky path!","However, the two of them had been defeated by the Blood Sword, and the Yang Divine Lord had died immediately!","If the Blood Sword had not taken the initiative to stop in the end, Yin Divine Lord would have died there and there would be no more Yin Yang Divine Lord in the world!","“Strong! He was too strong! The Blood Sword’s strength is definitely enough to compete with the top geniuses on the ancient path of stars!” There was a glint in Ruler Hao Jin’s eyes. At that moment, he was completely convinced by Jian Wushuang. He made up his mind that no matter what they encountered on the ancient path of stars in the future, he would follow Jian Wushuang closely!","Such a powerful yet gentle and humble backer was simply hard to come by in ten thousand years!","He had to hold her tightly!","In the void, Jian Wushuang lowered his head and smiled at Ruler Hao Jin. Then, under the reverent gazes of the Rulers of the Fifth City, he walked down from the sky.","At this moment, he had retracted all of his divine power, but it was as if he was stepping on a stairway to heaven with every step he took. His entire body seemed to be lifted up by the heaven and earth.","He was dressed in a simple black robe and his aura was only that of a fifth stage Ruler. Everyone present was at a higher level than him.","However, at this moment, everyone raised their heads to look at him. No one dared to show any presumptuous expression on their faces.","Pfft.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and glanced at Ruler Hao Jin. He said indifferently, “This matter is over, let’s go.”","“Yes!”","Ruler Hao Jin rubbed his face and agreed excitedly. Then, he flew over and followed Jian Wushuang.","Seeing Jian Wushuang walking over, the crowd automatically made way for him in silence.","Their expressions were complicated. In the beginning, they had thought that Jian Wushuang was a soft persimmon that they could squeeze as they pleased because of the one million Universe Origin Stones that Yin Yang Divine Lord had offered.","Therefore, when Jian Wushuang stepped into the Fifth City, they did not bother to hide the greed in their eyes.","However, in less than a day, this person, who they had looked down on in the beginning, had become an existence that they could not even look up to!","The black-armored guards who had captured Jian Wushuang were also among the crowd. They had escaped because they had been guarding the gate of the mansion of the governor and had not been killed by Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, their hearts were filled with extreme fear.","Fortunately, he had not offended Jian Wushuang in any way, except for his cold attitude.","The crowd automatically opened up a path for Jian Wushuang to pass through.","Among these people, there was no lack of people who had secretly informed Yin Yang Divine Lord when he had first arrived in the Fifth City. However, at this moment, they all lowered their heads respectfully and did not dare to look into Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","Finally, Jian Wushuang stepped on the steps of the passage gate of the Fifth City.","The Sixth City was right behind them.","Just as Jian Wushuang was halfway through the passage door.","“We’re waiting...farewell, Lord Blood Sword.”","“We’re waiting...farewell, Lord Blood Sword!”","In the crowd, a person first whispered words of respect, and then more and more people began to shout!","Lord Blood Sword, we will see you off!","Finally, the words ‘Lord Blood Sword’ resounded throughout the Fifth City and soared into the sky!","The strong should be respected!","No matter where it was, this was a matter of course!","Jian Wushuang had won the greatest respect with his own strength!","Jian Wushuang did not stop walking and disappeared into the passage door.","The onlookers looked at the passage door where Jian Wushuang was no longer there. Inexplicably, they all had a sudden realization.","From now on, the ancient path of stars would probably become lively because of the Blood Sword.","There were even more people who sighed in their hearts.","“Last night, I entered the mortal world, and no one knew me. From today onwards, I’m the Lord of Heaven!”","...","Whoosh.","After passing through a dark passage, Jian Wushuang’s field of vision suddenly brightened.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin appeared at the exit of the Sixth City’s passageway.","“Blood Sword, this is the Sixth City. This place can no longer be called a city. The space within it is much wider than the first five cities. We usually call this place the sixth secret realm, the grotto-heaven world.” Ruler Hao Jin explained.","Jian Wushuang nodded. He immediately released his divine power and discovered that the vastness of this place was far beyond the range of his senses. His divine power, which could cover the stars, could only cover a corner of this place.","Indeed, this place should not be called a city anymore. It would be more appropriate to call it a heavenly passage world."]},{"number":4223,"title":"Chapter 4223 Help!","paragraphs":["4223 Help!","The 18 cities on the ancient path of stars could be said to be 18 small worlds. The further one walked, the wider the area of the small world and the denser the law aura.","Jian Wushuang could not help but sigh. What kind of great power did that lord have to be able to open up such a stunning ancient starry sky road?","And this was only the ancient path of stars for the Ruler realm.","The starry sky ancient path of the Ruler realm was probably even more vast and mysterious than this place.","!!","“This kind of heaven-defying means is simply unimaginable.”","Jian Wushuang exclaimed in his heart. He somewhat understood why the Ruler Blood Wave had told him that if he did not become a Supreme, he would not even be qualified to know the identity of that lord.","This made Jian Wushuang look forward to it. If he could really stand out on the ancient path of stars and get an invitation to the universe banquet of all races, he would be able to meet that lord there.","Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin walked casually in the sixth secret realm. Perhaps it was because the area had become vast, but the cultivators here were not as dense as those in the first five cities. After walking for a long time, they might see a Ruler realm expert who was walking in a hurry.","When the Ruler experts saw Jian Wushuang, they were extremely surprised as if they had seen a rare treasure.","“It’s rare to see a fifth stage great Ruler in the Sixth City.”","The Ruler realm experts sized up Jian Wushuang and left after clicking their tongues.","Jian Wushuang frowned. He knew that he was a fifth-level Ruler and would be too conspicuous in the Sixth City, where the top Ultimate Rulers gathered. He simply waved his sleeves and used a secret technique to block his cultivation fluctuations.","Under this secret technique, only a super expert like the Ultimate Ruler would be able to see Jian Wushuang’s cultivation.","After covering his aura, Jian Wushuang nodded in satisfaction.","Then, Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin chatted as they moved forward. They were not in a hurry.","“Lord Blood Sword, I didn’t expect that I, Hao Jin, would be able to step into the Sixth City one day.”","Ruler Hao Jin could not help but sigh as he looked at the rapidly retreating mountains beneath his feet and sensed the rich aura of the Sixth City’s principles.","Once upon a time, he was just an insignificant character in the Third City. Anyone could step on his head. If he had not met Jian Wushuang by chance, he would have lost his life in the hands of others.","He had never thought that he would one day step into the Sixth City.","“Hao Jin, the Sixth City is only the beginning. our steps are far from just the Sixth City.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Hahaha, Lord Blood Sword, to tell you the truth, when I first saw you, I knew that you would become a dragon among men, a great figure on the ancient path of stars.” Ruler Hao Jin laughed loudly.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang smiled noncommittally.","Just as the two of them were chatting and walking forward.","Suddenly!","Help!","A crisp cry suddenly came from the distance.","Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin looked over and frowned.","He saw a purple-clothed young woman rushing over with a panicked expression.","Behind this young woman were five burly Ultimate Rulers, who were topless and wearing iron armors. They were chasing after her with cold smiles on their faces.","“Holy Maiden Jiuxi, stop now. Give up your futile struggle.” One of the five Ultimate Rulers laughed coldly.","As these words fell, the distance between the two quickly closed.","The woman in purple, who was called Holy Maiden Jiuxi, was struggling with her words. She looked around anxiously.","then, she noticed Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin in the distance.","She gritted her teeth, changed her direction, and dashed toward Jian Wushuang and the other man.","“I’m the Holy Maiden of Jiuxi Holy Land. I’m being chased by evil people. I hope you can help me. I’ll be grateful in the future.” Holy Maiden Jiuxi shouted anxiously.","“Jiuxi Holy Land?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He had heard of Jiuxi Holy Land before. It was also a big power in the universe, but its strength was not at the top. It would be an exaggeration to say that it was a Holy Land.","“Lord Blood Sword, should we help?” Ruler Hao Jin asked.","“Help? Why? Just because she’s the Holy Maiden Jiuxi?” Jian Wushuang shook his head and spoke indifferently.","The various forces on the ancient road of stars were complicated. Although Jian Wushuang was not afraid, he did not want to get involved in the muddy water for no reason.","After saying that, Jian Wushuang turned around and planned to move forward in another direction.","A flash of despair appeared in saint jiuxi’s eyes.","The five armored men, who were closely watching this scene, immediately laughed and said, “Kid, you’re tactful.”","After saying that, the five armored men looked at Holy Maiden Jiuxi again and sneered, “Holy Maiden Jiuxi, don’t try to play tricks and expect others to save you. I can tell you clearly that no one in the top ten cities would dare to save you, let alone the Sixth City. After all, you’re the person Heavenly Snake Playboy has ordered to be arrested.”","Hearing that, Jiuxi’s body trembled and her face turned pale.","“Alright, I’ll go with you.” The Holy Maiden Jiuxi stopped and said dejectedly.","She knew that she could not escape.","“That’s right. Jiuxi Holy Land, you should know that it’s your good fortune to be chosen by Mr. Heavenly Snake. Many people want to be favored by him, but he doesn’t even care.”","“Holy Maiden Jiuxi, don’t blame us. We’re just helping Heavenly Snake. We’re counting on you to put in a good word for us in front of Heavenly Snake after you become his cultivation partner.","The five armored Ultimate Rulers all smiled.","With that, the five of them rushed to Holy Maiden Jiuxi and were about to take her away.","“Wait.”","At this moment, an indifferent voice suddenly came from the distance.","“What?”","The five Ultimate Rulers turned to look, their eyes narrowing.","“That kid? Didn’t he leave?”","The person who had spoken was naturally Jian Wushuang.","“Did you just say Heavenly Snake Playboy?” Jian Wushuang approached step by step and said expressionlessly.","“How audacious! How can you call the name of Heavenly Snake Playboy?”","One of the five men in armor shouted.","“Shut up.”","The leader of the group, the burly man in iron armor, waved his hand to stop the man from speaking. He turned to look at Jian Wushuang and said in a deep voice, “Sir, since you know who the Heavenly Snake Playboy is, you should also know that he never allows others to interfere in his matters. Are you going to interfere in his affairs now? Have you thought about the consequences?”"]},{"number":4224,"title":"Chapter 4224 The Heavenly Snake Tribe","paragraphs":["4224 The Heavenly Snake Tribe","The burly man’s tone was calm, and the more he spoke, the heavier his tone became. It was full of oppression.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile, “Are you using Heavenly Snake Playboy to pressure me now?”","The leader of the group replied expressionlessly, “Sir, I’m not trying to pressure you with my words. I just hope that you can think about the implications of this. As far as I know, no one who dares to meddle in Playboy’s affairs is still alive.”","“Oh? Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then his tone suddenly became cold. He laughed in a low voice, “I’m sorry, but I don’t like to care about the consequences, especially about Heavenly Snake Playboy.”","!!","The next moment!","The Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand was suddenly unsheathed!","A sharp blood-red sword light shot up into the sky!","“Split open the sky!”","Clang!","The sword-light instantly slashed toward the five Ultimate Rulers!","“Impudent!”","Audacious!!!","The five armored men’s expressions changed drastically as they shouted.","Then, the five of them used their super powers at the same time to block Jian Wushuang’s sword!","Bang!","A huge explosion sounded, and the ground began to shake.","A moment later, the sword light gradually dissipated. The five armored men were turned into dust under this sword without a trace!","A single sword strike had killed all five of the final Rulers!","The sky gradually became clear again. The sword essence that belonged to Jian Wushuang turned into divine power and disappeared in the void.","The place where the five armored men had been standing had turned into nothingness.","Under Jian Wushuang’s sword, the five of them were crushed into ashes before they could even scream.","“You...you killed them?”","Holy Maiden Jiuxi covered her mouth and asked in disbelief with widened eyes.","Jian Wushuang looked at her indifferently and replied, “What? I can’t kill them?”","“No, no, I just wanted you to help me stop them. I didn’t want you to kill them.” The Holy Maiden Jiuxi said in a daze.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile, “Holy Maiden Jiuxi, do you think I killed them to help you?”","Jian Wushuang did not wait for her reply. He looked at Ruler Hao Jin and said, “What are you still doing there? Let’s go.”","Then, Jian Wushuang walked away slowly.","He had killed the five Ultimate Rulers only because they were Heavenly Snake Playboy’s subordinates. It had nothing to do with Holy Maiden Jiuxi.","Since the five people were dead, Jian Wushuang naturally didn’t want to have anything to do with Holy Maiden Jiuxi.","“Alright.”","Ruler Hao Jin responded loudly, then quickly waved his hand at Holy Maiden Jiuxi. He chuckled, “Goodbye, Holy Maiden Jiuxi.”","After saying that, he quickly followed Jian Wushuang and walked away.","Holy Maiden Jiuxi stood there in a daze. When Jian Wushuang and Ruler Haojin were about to disappear from her sight, she shivered and shouted, “Your Excellency, please wait for me.”","After saying that, she quickly chased after Jian Wushuang.","After a while, she came to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Holy Maiden Jiuxi, is there anything else?” Jian Wushuang frowned and asked indifferently.","“Your Excellency, may I know how to address you?” Jiuxi asked after taking a deep breath.","“Blood Sword.” Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and spat out two words.","The Holy Maiden Jiuxi nodded and said seriously, “Sir Blood Sword, do you know that you’ve caused a great disaster?”","“Oh? A great disaster?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and replied with a faint smile, “Why do you say that?”","Hearing that, Jiuxi’s expression turned serious. She took a deep breath and said, “The five people who chased me were the Rulers under Heavenly Snake Playboy. I see that you have some enmity with him, Sir Blood Sword?”","“I guess so.” Jian Wushuang replied casually.","Jiuxi nodded and continued, “Your Excellency Blood Sword, do you know about Heavenly Snake Playboy?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but raise his eyebrows. Speaking of Heavenly Snake Playboy, he only knew his name, but he did not know the specific information.","“I’d like to hear the details.” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","The Holy Maiden Jiuxi nodded and said slowly, “Heavenly Snake Playboy is the current young clan leader of the Heavenly Snake Clan in the universe. Not only does he have the support of the Heavenly Snake Clan, but his own combat strength is also extremely powerful. He can be said to be invincible among Rulers.","He came to the ancient road of stars 8000 years ago. When he first arrived, he went through 10 cities and entered the last eight cities. He fought with the top geniuses of the universe and caused a sensation.","It was said that if he had not been too arrogant and domineering in the last eight cities, which made a monstrous heaven’s pride expert unhappy and drove him out of the last eight cities, he would not be in the top ten cities now.","However, although he had been driven out of the back eight cities, in terms of combat power, he was definitely at the top of the Ruler level and could not be underestimated.","And now, among the top ten cities, except for Lord Lan who guards the Tenth City, Heavenly Snake Playboy was the most respected.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded. He was not surprised to hear that Heavenly Snake Playboy’s battle strength was comparable to an unrivaled Ruler.","After a pause, Jian Wushuang asked indifferently, “In that case, why don’t you just follow Heavenly Snake Playboy? As far as I know, the Heavenly Snake Clan is a big clan in the universe, and their strength is no worse than your Jiuxi Holy Land.”","Hearing that, Jiuxi’s eyes were filled with fear. She said hurriedly, “That’s because you haven’t seen Heavenly Snake Playboy and don’t know how abnormal he is!”","“What?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and his eyes were filled with curiosity.","“Sir Blood Sword, do you know Saintess Zixia?” The Jiuxi Holy Land asked.","“I know a little.” Jian Wushuang nodded. Saintess Zixia was the current saintess of another Holy Land. In terms of strength, that Holy Land was a bit stronger than the Jiuxi Holy Land.","“Then do you know? After Saintess Zixia was captured by Heavenly Snake Playboy, her whole body was sucked dry! All the divine power in his body was taken away by Heavenly Snake Playboy! Even now, the Holy Land where Saintess Zixia is located still has a deep blood feud with the Heavenly Snake tribe!”","Jiuxi’s tone became extremely frightened as she spoke.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and nodded to show that he understood.","Jiuxi panted slightly. After a while, she calmed down and said seriously, “Blood Sword, Heavenly Snake Playboy is a vengeful man. You killed his men, so he will not let you go. Therefore, I advise you to quickly withdraw from the ancient path of stars. Don’t let your emotions get the better of you and endanger your life.”"]},{"number":4225,"title":"Chapter 4225 The Reward","paragraphs":["4225 The Reward","Jiuxi looked at Jian Wushuang sincerely.","These words came from the bottom of her heart.","Jian Wushuang had saved her life, and she really did not want to see Jian Wushuang lose his life in vain.","“You don’t have to worry about that.” Jian Wushuang replied with a faint smile.","!!","Jiuxi thought Jian Wushuang did not believe her, so she said seriously, “Blood Sword, I wasn’t exaggerating at all. In fact, Heavenly Snake Playboy’s strength is even more terrifying than what I said...”","Before she could finish, someone suddenly patted her shoulder.","She turned her head in confusion.","Ruler Hao Jin glanced at her, then shook his head and chuckled. “Holy Maiden Jiuxi, I think you’re wrong. It’s not Heavenly Snake Playboy who is going to let Lord Blood Sword go, but Lord Blood Sword who is not willing to let him go! Do you understand?”","After that, the two of them ignored her and continued to walk forward.","“This...”","Holy Maiden Jiuxi was stunned.","She looked at the backs of the two people and suddenly felt that there seemed to be layers of fog on these two people, extremely mysterious.","“Forget it, forget it. He saved my life after all. I can’t just watch him die.”","Jiuxi gritted his teeth and followed closely.","At the same time, in the eighth city, there was a Grand Hall. There was no light inside, and it looked extremely gloomy.","At this moment, the tightly shut door was slowly pushed open, and a trace of light gradually spread in through the crack in the door.","Then, he saw Yin Divine Lord walking in with his back bent and his heart trembling in fear.","“Master.”","After stepping into the hall, he quickly knelt down on the floor with a plop. Then, he put his hands on the ground and moved his knees inch by inch as he walked in.","In the deepest part of the hall, there was a blood-red chair.","A devilish young man with long black hair draped over his back, wearing a long robe that dragged the floor, slowly opened his eyes.","His face was hidden in the darkness, and a hoarse voice came from his throat.","“Yin slave, what about the Blood Sword’s head?”","Yin Divine Lord, who had an awe-inspiring presence in the Fifth City, was now like a quail with its head lowered. He trembled and buried his head in the ground as he said, “Master, the Blood Sword is too powerful. The Yang Divine Lord and I are no match for it.”","In the depths of the darkness of the hall, there was a moment of silence.","Then, the hoarse voice sounded again.","“What about Yang slave?”","“Master, the Yang Divine Lord was killed by the Blood Sword in one strike.” Yin Divine Lord replied respectfully.","“Oh? If he’s dead, How did you come back alive?” The devilish young man asked without any emotions in his voice.","“Master, the Blood Sword asked me to pass on a message to you. That’s why I came back alive.” Yin Divine Lord replied.","“Give me a word?” The demonic youth exclaimed in surprise, and then the corners of his mouth curled up. “What did he say?”","Hearing that, Lord Yin did not dare to say what Jian Wushuang had said. He hesitated for a long time before he gritted his teeth and said quickly, “The Blood Sword, he...he told you to wait for him here, and it won’t be long before he comes to visit me personally and lets me be buried with you.”","After he finished speaking, Yin Divine Lord did not even dare to breathe loudly. His head that was buried in the ground lowered even more.","As for the devilish young man, he was silent for a moment before he burst out laughing.","“Hahaha, interesting, very interesting! He actually asked me to wait for him at the city? And that you’d be buried with me?”","This laughter was extremely terrifying. The entire hall shook violently because of this unbridled laughter.","The evil-looking young man laughed so hard that tears were rolling down his face. He wiped his eyes and looked at Yin Divine Lord, who was kneeling on the ground. “Yin slave, you really listen to him.”","Hearing this, Lord Yin’s heart turned cold and he quickly said, “Master, you’ve misunderstood...”","Without waiting for him to finish, the devilish young man stuck out his scarlet tongue and licked the corner of his mouth. He laughed eerily and said, “Yin slave, you are so obedient to him. How do you think I should reward you?”","In an instant, Yin Divine Lord felt a chill run up his spine and up his head.","Only he knew how terrifying the ‘reward’ that the devilish young man had mentioned was!","“Master, please spare me! Master, please spare me this time! I don’t want to die!” Yin Divine Lord cried out in fear.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","He raised his head and kept kowtowing to beg for mercy, making loud banging sounds on the floor.","“Dead? I won’t, I’m just sending you to a beautiful place.” The devilish young man laughed slyly.","The next moment!","A huge snake tail suddenly shot out from the darkness!","Bang!","The snake’s tail wrapped around Yin Divine Lord’s body and pulled him back into the darkness.","Ah!","In the hall, Yin Divine Lord’s shrill cry could be heard.","After a while, the hall quieted down, leaving only the hissing sound of a poisonous snake. It was extremely eerie.","In the deepest part of the hall, the evil-looking young man opened his mouth and bit deeply into Lord Yin’s neck with his two fangs. Countless divine power flowed through the two fangs of the evil-looking young man and into his body.","Yin Divine Lord could no longer make a sound. his body was trembling and his legs were shaking on the ground. He could only stare at the evil young man with a frightened look.","His face gradually turned from green to white, and then to gray.","Gradually, there was no more movement from Lord Yin.","“You’re all useless.”","He opened his mouth and stuck out his forked tongue, licking the corner of his mouth.","He shook his head and the snake tail that was wrapped around Yin Divien Lord slowly loosened.","Bang!","Yin Divine Lord’s corpse fell to the ground. His eyes were wide open as if he had seen something extremely terrifying before he died.","The evil-looking young man ignored him and stood up from his seat. He walked into the darkness and arrived at the entrance of the palace.","His eyes shrank slightly under the light. They were golden snake-like vertical pupils!","Behind him was a long snake tail covered in pitch-black scales.","He was Heavenly Snake Playboy!","“Blood Sword? Hehehehe, interesting, really interesting. I’m looking forward to the moment I see you more and more.”","Heavenly Snake Playboy chuckled in a low voice, and his voice was extremely cold.","“When the time comes, how should I reward you?”","...","The Sixth City.","Jian Wushuang, Ruler Hao Jin, and Holy Maiden Jiuxi had already reached the central area of the Sixth City.","A majestic city appeared beneath their feet.","“Sir Blood Sword, this is the center of the Sixth City. Most of the Supreme Rulers of the Sixth City are gathered here.” The Holy Maiden Jiuxi introduced.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Yes, go in.”"]},{"number":4226,"title":"Chapter 4226 Browsing the Ancient","paragraphs":["4226 Browsing the Ancient","As they entered the city, the number of Ultimate Rulers instantly increased. one Ultimate Ruler after another hurriedly brushed past the three.","“Junior Sister Jiuxi, are you alright?”","At this moment, a surprised voice suddenly came from the distance.","Then, they saw a group of young men and women in purple clothes, who were dressed the same as Holy Maiden Jiuxi, flying toward them.","!!","“Who are they?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes.","“Sir Blood Sword, they are people from the same Holy Land as me.”","When Holy Maiden Jiuxi saw them, she smiled and waved at them.","A moment later, the group of young men and women walked over.","The one who had shouted earlier was a young man with an imposing appearance and a face as clear as Jade.","“Sir Blood Sword, this is eldest martial brother Lange. He is also the leader of the Jiuxi Holy Land’s expedition to the ancient path of stars.”","“Senior Brother Kuang Yi...”","The Holy Maiden Jiuxi introduced them one by one with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded at them as a greeting.","“Junior Sister Jiuxi, this is?” Senior Brother Lange looked at Jian Wushuang and asked in confusion.","“Senior brother, this is Sir Blood Sword. His strength is unfathomable. It was because of him that I was able to escape the pursuit of the armored guards under Heavenly Snake Playboy.” The Holy Maiden Jiuxi introduced with a smile.","“It’s like this? Then I’ll have to properly thank Sir Blood Sword.” Lange looked at Jian Wushuang and cupped his hands with a smile. “Your Excellency Blood Sword, thank you for saving Junior Sister Jiuxi. Otherwise, if she had fallen into the hands of Heavenly Snake Playboy, the consequences would have been unimaginable.”","“You’re too polite.” Jian Wushuang glanced at him and replied indifferently.","“You’re too kind. If you were able to save Junior Sister Jiuxi from the iron-skirted Ruler, you must be very strong. Sir Blood Sword, you must be a prodigy from some Holy Land or Divine Kingdom, right?” Lange’s heart skipped a beat, and then he asked with a smile.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and replied indifferently, “Ruler Lange thinks too highly of me. I’m just a nameless nobody who doesn’t deserve the title of ‘chosen’.”","Lange’s chin was raised a little. He smiled and said, “You’re too humble, Sir.”","Then, he turned over his right hand and an Interspatial Ring appeared. He handed it to Jian Wushuang and said, “Your Excellency, there are 100000 Universe Origin Stones in this Interspatial Ring. As a senior brother, I’m here to thank you on behalf of Junior Sister Jiuxi.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently. after a long time, he shook his head and said, “No need. Saving Holy Maiden Jiuxi was just something I did in passing.”","“This...” Lange glanced at Jian Wushuang and no longer insisted. He put away the Interspatial Ring.","After a few more words of courtesy, Holy Maiden Jiuxi stood beside Jian Wushuang and said with a smile, “Blood Sword, do you have a place to go now?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied frankly, “Not at the moment.”","“Blood Sword, why don’t you come with us?” Holy Maiden Jiuxi replied with a smile. “I can tell you more about Heavenly Snake Playboy along the way.”","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and then nodded, “Alright,” he said.","“Sir Blood Sword, Junior Sister Jiuxi, this isn’t the place to talk. Let’s talk as we walk. I also have some things I want to ask you.” Lange laughed and interrupted.","“Eldest Senior Brother, what’s the matter?” The Holy Maiden Jiuxi asked in confusion.","“Come here, i’ll tell you slowly.” Lange looked at Jian Wushuang, then turned to Holy Maiden Jiuxi and said, “Alright,” he said.","Jiuxi walked into the crowd where Lange and the others were.","The two sides continued to move forward, one in front and one behind.","Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin fell behind. Ruler Hao Jin looked at the back of Lange and the others and muttered unhappily, “Lord Blood Sword, the people from the Jiuxi Holy Land are too stingy. You saved the life of their Holy Land’s saintess, yet you want to pay them off with 100000 Universe Origin Stones? This isn’t even enough to pay for the usage fee of the cosmos passage.”","Jian Wushuang smiled but did not reply.","“Hmph!” Ruler Hao Jin snorted coldly. “Lord Blood Sword, look at them. They’re intentionally keeping a distance from us. It’s as if they’re afraid of being with us.”","“Alright, stop talking. Saving Holy Maiden Jiuxi was just an act of convenience.” Jian Wushuang patted Ruler Hao Jin’s shoulder and said indifferently.","Ruler Hao Jin nodded and said no more. However, he still looked at the backs of Lange and the others with a disgruntled expression.","Not far ahead.","“Junior Sister Jiuxi, do you know the origin of that Blood Sword? You’re actually hanging out with him?” Lange’s face, which had been full of smiles, immediately sank and said. Holy Maiden Jiuxi was stunned. She raised her eyebrows and asked, “Eldest Senior Brother, what do you mean by this? what’s the word ‘mixed’?”","“I...” Lange saw that Holy Maiden Jiuxi’s face did not look good, and said slowly, “Junior Sister Jiuxi, I’m just worried that you’ll be used by bad people. “Think about it, you don’t even know the origin of the Blood Sword, and it’s such a person who doesn’t know the origin that offended Heavenly Snake Playboy for you, a stranger. Do you think it’s possible?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the other Jiuxi disciples echoed, “Yes, I’ve never heard of this Blood Sword. Senior brother just asked him where he came from, but he refused to say. I think he must have some ulterior motives!”","“Hmph, Junior Sister Jiu Yi, in my opinion, this Blood Sword is either using you to get close to the Jiuxi Holy Land to build a relationship, or he is simply one of Heavenly Snake Playboy’s men and is just acting in front of you!”","Holy Maiden Jiuxi’s eyes turned cold. She glanced at them and said, “Do you guys know what you’re talking about? That Blood Sword saved my life!”","“Junior Sister, don’t be so agitated. Everyone is only saying this out of worry.” Lange comforted her and then said, “How about this? Tell us how the Blood Sword saved you.”","Holy Maiden Jiuxi took a deep breath and nodded slowly. Then, she told him how Jian Wushuang had saved her.","“What? That Blood Sword actually killed five of the iron-skirted Rulers?”","“It’s over, it’s over. He’s completely offended Heavenly Snake Playboy this time. He won’t let this matter rest.”","“Sigh, we were thinking of going to Heavenly Snake Playboy to apologize to him and settle this matter. But now it seems that it’s impossible to settle this!”","“That Blood Sword is really a big threat. Not only did it offend the Heavenly Snake Playboy, but it also dragged us into this. Now, the Heavenly Snake Playboy will definitely not let us off.”","“Yes, what should we do now? Heavenly Snake Playboy will definitely come to find trouble with us.”"]},{"number":4227,"title":"Chapter 4227 The Night Banquet","paragraphs":["4227 The Night Banquet","The Jiuxi Holy Land disciples sighed.","Holy Maiden Jiuxi was slightly stunned. She looked at her senior brothers who were usually full of pride and confidence. She could not believe it.","She had thought that after she finished speaking, these senior brothers would forget about Jian Wushuang and even join forces with him to fight against Heavenly Snake Playboy.","She did not expect that her senior brothers were so afraid of Heavenly Snake Playboy that their first reaction was to think that Jian Wushuang had implicated them when they heard that she was being chased by a Ruler under Heavenly Snake Playboy and then saved by Jian Wushuang.","!!","How absurd was this?","Gradually, the disbelief in her eyes turned into a strong sense of unfamiliarity and disappointment.","Ruler Lange’s expression had been ugly to begin with, but he sharply caught Jiuxi’s expression. His eyes flickered as he glared at the disciples behind him. “What are you all saying? That Blood Sword saved the Holy Maiden Jiuxi, which is a great favor to the Jiuxi Holy Land. Why do you blame him?”","After he finished speaking, the saint land disciples immediately shrank back in fear. However, there was still a hint of resentment in their eyes.","“Eldest apprentice-brother, the Blood Sword only needed to drive the five iron-skirted Rulers away. Why did you kill them? Now, we’ve completely fallen out with Heavenly Snake Playboy. When Heavenly Snake Playboy is really angry, Blood Sword can just leave without a word. No one knows him anyway. But what should we do? Why should the people killed by the Blood Sword be blamed on us?” The disciple called kuang yi muttered.","“Shut up!”","Ruler Lange glared at him, then turned to Holy Maiden Jiuxi. He let out a sigh and smiled wryly. “Junior Sister Jiuyi, don’t blame me for being straightforward. Although what Junior Brother Kuang Yi said was a little harsh, it wasn’t without reason. What the Blood Sword did was indeed too reckless.”","“It would have been the best way to negotiate with Heavenly Snake Playboy. after all, no matter how strong Heavenly Snake Playboy is, he has to give face to the Jiuxi Holy Land, right? Now that we’ve killed his men, the peace talks are impossible.”","Hearing this, Holy Miaden Jiuxi looked at the faces of Lange and Kuang Yi and felt a chill in her heart.","So, the senior brothers that she had admired in the past was such a group of people who were afraid of death?","Holding on to her last hope, Holy Miaden Jiuxi took a deep breath and asked, “Senior brother, what should we do now?”","Ruler Lange chuckled. “Don’t worry, Junior Sister. I’m not someone who’s afraid of trouble. However, Heavenly Snake Lord is very powerful right now. With just the few of us, we’re no match for him.”","Holy Maiden Jiuxi frowned upon hearing this.","Ruler Lange continued to laugh. “Junior Sister, don’t worry. I’ve already found out that the governor of the Sixth City, Divine Lord Tiancang, is preparing to host a banquet tonight to welcome the geniuses and rookies of the Sixth City. I happen to be on his invitation list. Later on, I’ll bring all of you to attend his banquet.”","At this point, Lange’s face showed a touch of pride, as if it was an extremely proud thing to be invited by a Divine Lord Tiancang.","After a pause, he continued, “Junior Sister, you may not know this, but Divine Lord Tiancang has always been at odds with Heavenly Snake Playboy. In the early years, his clan was almost exterminated by Heavenly Snake Playboy. We might be able to persuade Divine Lord Tiancang at the banquet to fight with us to resist Heavenly Snake Playboy.”","“In this case, no matter how powerful Heavenly Snake playboy is, he would have some scruples.”","Hearing this, Holy Maiden Jiuxi’s heart skipped a beat.","She naturally knew who Divine Lord Tiancang was. He was a veteran Ultimate Ruler who had been at the level of an Ultimate Ruler for more than ten chaos cycles. His power was unquestionable, and he was definitely an expert among the Ultimate Rulers.","If Divine Lord Tiancang could really help them fight against Heavenly Snake Playboy, they might really have a chance to do so.","“Alright,” he said.","The Holy Maiden Jiuxi nodded and said, “Senior brother, I’ll tell Sir Blood Sword about this. After all, I’m involved in Sir Blood Sword killing the Ruler under Heavenly Snake Playboy. I’ll have to invite him to attend Divine Lord Tiancang’s banquet.","“This...” Lange hesitated for a moment, but he nodded helplessly when he saw Jiuxi’s determined look. “Alright, as long as the Blood Sword is well-behaved and doesn’t cause trouble at Divine Lord Tiancang’s banquet, it will be fine.”","Hearing that, Holy Maiden Jiuxi smiled slightly and did not reply. She turned around and walked toward Jian Wushuang and the other man.","Lange looked at Jiuxi’s back as she left. His eyes gradually narrowed, and he snorted.","...","“Blood Sword, come with us to Divine Lord Tiancang’s banquet later.” Jiuxi walked to Jian Wushuang and said with a sweet smile.","“Divine Lord Tiancang? A banquet?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“Yes, Divine Lord Tiancang is recognized as the number one person in the Sixth City. We might be able to seek his protection and fight against Heavenly Snake Playboy together.” The Holy Maiden Jiuxi smiled.","Then, Holy Maiden Jiuxi told Jian Wushuang about Divine Lord Tiancang.","After hearing this, Jian Wushuang pondered for a while and shook his head, “I won’t be attending Divine Lord Tiancang’s banquet. You guys can go on your own. I’ll deal with Heavenly Snake Playboy myself.”","Hearing that, Jiuxi became anxious and quickly said, “Sir Blood Sword, that Heavenly Snake Playboy is very powerful. We are definitely not his match alone. Only by gathering all our strength can we have a chance to fight him...”","“Junior Sister, if Sir Blood Sword doesn’t want to go, then don’t force him. Perhaps Sir Blood Sword is bold and doesn’t need our help?”","Lange suddenly came over and said with a fake smile.","“Senior brother!”","Hearing this, Jiuxi was furious. She looked at Lange with fire in her eyes.","She had always been a sensitive person, so how could she not see the hidden hostility between Lange and Jian Wushuang?","Lange ignored him and looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile, saying, “Sir Blood Sword, am I right?”","Jian Wushuang replied calmly, “You’re right.”","After a pause, Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said calmly, “Ruler Lange, Holy Maiden Jiuxi, why don’t we part ways here?”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang did not care whether they agreed or not. He took Ruler Hao Jin and walked into the distance."]},{"number":4228,"title":"Chapter 4228 The Arrival","paragraphs":["Home Legend of Swordsman Chapter 4228 – 4228 The Arrival","Chapter 4228 – 4228 The Arrival","4228 The Arrival","“Your Excellency Blood Sword!”","Holy Maiden Jiuxi was anxious. She was about to chase after him, but Lange stopped her.","“Little Junior Sister! don’t forget, you and we are on the same side! That Blood Sword is just an outsider, why do you care so much about him? And as you can see, I didn’t drive him away, he left on his own!”","Lange’s face darkened, and he said in an unfriendly tone.","!!","Holy Maiden Jiuxi ignored him and wanted to catch up with Jian Wushuang, but Lange’s big hand held her down and she could not move.","After a while, Jian Wushuang’s figure gradually disappeared from her sight. Jiuxi had to give up resisting and looked at Lange coldly.","Lange’s heart trembled when he saw Holy Maiden Jiuxi’s eyes. He saw unfamiliarity and disappointment in Jiuxi’s eyes.","“Junior Sister Jiuxi, let’s go. Divine Lord Tiancang’s banquet is about to begin.” Lange forced a smile on his face and said.","Jiuxi nodded her head and followed Lange.","Lange took a deep breath, and his eyes flashed with determination.","“Junior Sister Jiuxi, I must let you see that I’m the only person you can rely on in this world!","“As for the Blood Sword, Hmph, if he wants to court his own death, then so be it!”","Originally, in the universe, there was no such thing as day and night. However, because the lord who opened the ancient path of stars said that there was, there was night and day, and the stars changed.","That night, the sky of the Sixth City was filled with stars.","Jian Wushuang was sitting cross-legged in the void with Ruler Hao Jin standing behind him respectfully.","Lord Blood Sword, Divine Lord Tiancang’s banquet has begun. Ruler Hao Jin said softly.","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked down through the endless nebula.","In the center of the vast Sixth City, in a magnificent hall, a song and dance filled the air. Many cultivators of the Sixth City, as well as geniuses like Lange, were sitting cross-legged, chatting and laughing as they toasted each other.","Divine Lord Tiancang’s banquet was a Grand occasion for the entire Sixth City. Basically, all the prominent figures of the Sixth City were invited to the banquet.","“Lord Blood Sword, with your abilities, it would be easy for you to enter Divine Lord Tiancang’s banquet. Are we really not going?” Ruler Hao Jin asked.","Jian Wushuang looked away and shook his head, “No need. I just hope that they don’t come out and cause trouble when I’m looking for Heavenly Snake Playboy.”","Then, Jian Wushuang stood up and said, “Let’s go. It’s time for us to meet that Heavenly Snake Playboy.”","“That’s true.” When Ruler Hao Jin recalled how Jian Wushuang had killed Yang Divine Lord with a single stroke, he could not help but smirk and a confident look appeared on his face.","He was now extremely confident in Jian Wushuang’s battle strength and no longer had any doubts.","That night, in the bustling Sixth City, Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin left the Sixth City quietly like lonely passersby and disappeared into the vast night.","Ten days later.","Jian Wushuang had killed the City Lord of the Seventh City, Supreme Ruler Brilliant, in an unrivaled manner, and ascended to the top of the Seventh City!","13 days later.","Jian Wushuang had entered the Eighth City!","...","The Eighth City, the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","“My Lord, the Blood Sword has entered the Eighth City!” In the dark hall, a servant hurriedly walked in and kneeled on the ground.","Hiss hiss hiss.","A sound similar to a snake flicking its tongue came from the deepest part of the hall. Then, an evil young man with golden vertical pupils and long black hair draped over his back walked out of the darkness.","“Tsk, tsk, tsk, you’ve really made me wait.” Heavenly Snake Playboy twisted his neck, making a cracking sound.","He was not afraid of Jian Wushuang’s arrival at all. On the contrary, his eyes were filled with curiosity and interest.","“Where is he now?” Heavenly Snake Playboy lowered his head and asked.","“Sir, the Blood Sword should have just passed through the gate of the Eighth City.” The servant replied respectfully.","Heavenly Snake Playboy nodded and put his hands behind his back. He looked through the hall and toward the city gate in the distance.","In his eyes, rays of golden light flickered.","“Go and find the Blood Sword first. Tell him that I’ll be waiting for him in the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace in three days.” Heavenly Snake Playboy said.","“Yes.” Hearing this, the servant decided to leave.","At this moment, Heavenly Snake Playboy’s faint voice was heard again.","“Go and inform Mo Luo, Hei Teng, and the others. Three days later, we will intercept and kill the Blood Sword in front of this Divine Palace!”","The servant’s heart could not help but tremble when he heard this, and he respectfully took his leave.","Looking at the back of his servant, Heavenly Snake Playboy stuck out his forked tongue and licked his lips with a cruel look in his eyes.","...","At the city gate of the eighth city.","Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin walked slowly.","Some of the former Ultimate Rulers of the Eighth City narrowed their eyes when they saw the two of them. They quickly discussed in low voices, “I’ve heard that someone in the first eight cities killed a Ruler under Playboy and said that he would raze the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace to the ground. It seems to be him!”","“This person is the Blood Sword? Let’s go, we need to stay away from him!”","“Is this the person who wants to challenge Playboy?”","“The ignorant are fearless. Blood Sword must be a proud Son of Heaven to be able to come to the Eighth City. It’s a pity that he shouldn’t have challenged Playboy!”","The Ultimate Rulers of the Eighth City were discussing and sizing up Jian Wushuang and Nangong wuque.","They seemed to be afraid of being associated with Jian Wushuang and quickly kept their distance from him.","“Lord Blood Sword, it seems that the eighth city doesn’t welcome us.” Ruler Hao Jin noticed the gazes of the surrounding people, and his lips twitched.","Jian Wushuang smiled and replied, “Why do we need their welcome?”","“That’s true.” Ruler Hao Jin nodded, his lips curling up.","Then, he opened his eyes wide and glared at the Ultimate Rulers who were discussing in low voices on the side of the road. he fiercely berated, “What are you looking at? Yes, I’m talking about you!”","“You’re still looking? Do you think I won’t beat you up?”","“Hey, why don’t you try looking at another one?”","The faces of the Ultimate Rulers by the side of the road immediately turned red with anger.","“You’re looking for death!”","Just as they were about to flare up, they seemed to have thought of something and sneered, “Hmph, you’ve offended Heavenly Snake Playboy anyway. You won’t live long.”","“So, the people who came to challenge Playboy are just a bunch of people who are good at talking?”","“Hmph, I’ll see how you guys die later!”","They crossed their arms and sneered.","“Hmm...” Ruler Hao Jin rolled up his sleeves, looking as if he were about to explode.","“Alright, don’t put on an act here.” Jian Wushuang could not help laughing and patted Ruler Hao Jin’s shoulder.","Ruler Hao Jin could not help but scratch his head when he heard this. He chuckled and replied, “I’m just a fox exploiting the tiger’s might to scare them. who told them to look down on others first?”"]},{"number":4229,"title":"Chapter 4229 Three Days Later","paragraphs":["4229 Three Days Later","“Whoosh!”","At that moment, a golden light suddenly shot out from the depths of the Eighth City!","Then, the golden light faded and an old man stood in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Are you the Blood Sword?” The old man looked down at Jian Wushuang and asked indifferently.","!!","“It’s me.” Jian Wushuang stopped smiling and nodded calmly.","“Blood Sword, I’m a servant of the Heavenly Snake Playboy! The Playboy has ordered me to inform you...”","Before he could finish.","“You’re just a mere servant. Do you think you’re worthy of standing on top and talking to me?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and he struck out a finger.","Bang!","A sharp sword light instantly shot out from Jian Wushuang’s fingertips!","“Blood Sword, you!”","The old man’s expression changed. Just as he was about to say something, he saw the sharp sword light coming down on his head. It broke through his defense and pressed on his shoulder.","“Get down here!” Jian Wushuang said in an indifferent voice.","The next moment, the old man was directly cut down by the sword and knelt on the ground.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked down at the old man with his chin. He said indifferently, “Now you’re telling me why Heavenly Snake Playboy ordered you to come.”","The old man’s face turned red. He looked up at Jian Wushuang and quickly said, “Blood Sword! Playboy ordered me to tell you that he will be waiting for you in the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace in three days!”","“Three days later?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. After a moment of silence, he nodded and said, “Alright, then go back and tell your master that the Blood Sword will come on time three days later and raze the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace to the ground!”","Hearing this, a touch of anger flashed in the old man’s eyes. He was scared out of his wits by Jian Wushuang’s sword. He did not dare to say anything more. After a cold snort, he hurriedly jumped up from the ground and shot into the distance.","After the old man left, Ruler Hao Jin hurriedly said, “Lord Blood Sword, Heavenly Snake Playboy said three days later. I’m afraid there’s a trap.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied, “It’s fine.”","At the same time, he raised his head indifferently and looked at the Lord’s residence of the Eighth City, where the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace was located. He narrowed his eyes.","“Heavenly Snake Playboy, don’t let me down.”","“Lord Blood Sword, where are we going now?” Ruler Hao Jin scratched his head.","“Let’s find a place to rest,” Jian Wushuang said.","After they left, the Eighth City was in an uproar!","The news that Heavenly Snake Playboy would challenge Jian Wushuang to a battle in the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace spread like wildfire.","Three days later, Heavenly Snake Playboy challenged Blood Sword to a battle at the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace!","“The Blood Sword has announced that he will come to the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace and raze it to the ground in three days!”","“This is the first time someone has challenged Heavenly Snake Playboy since he came to the Eighth City!”","All of a sudden, rumors about the battle between Jian Wushuang and Heavenly Snake Playboy spread everywhere.","The words ‘Blood Sword’ spread across the Eighth City at an extremely fast speed, causing a commotion.","“Then who is the Blood Sword?”","“What’s the origin of the Blood Sword?”","Many more people started to guess Jian Wushuang’s identity.","...","The night was dark, at the gate of the Eighth City.","A group of young men and women in purple carefully passed through the passage door and entered the Eighth City.","Seeing that there was no one outside the passage, the group of young men and women immediately heaved a sigh of relief.","“Heavenly Snake Playboy is very powerful in the Eighth City. Almost everyone in the Eighth City is under his command. We should be more careful this time.”","The young man leading the group of young men and women had an imposing appearance and a face as clear as jade.","“Eldest Senior Brother is right.”","“Senior Brother Lange, you’re so thoughtful.”","The group of young men and women in purple nodded in agreement.","This group of young men and women were the Jiuxi Holy Land disciples led by Lange!","Holy Maiden Jiuxi was among them. Her face was blank, and she didn’t respond.","Lange glanced at her and shook his head. Then he turned to a big man with a beard and asked, “Divine Lord Tiancang, what’s our plan to kill Heavenly Snake Playboy?”","The bearded man stood with his hands behind his back and his aura was as majestic as an unmoving mountain. He was the city Lord of the Sixth City, Divine Lord Tiancang!","He had a blood feud with Heavenly Snake Playboy, but he had been holding back because he was weaker than Heavenly Snake Playboy.","At the banquet, Lange only told them about his plan to kill Heavenly Snake Playboy. The two sides immediately agreed and came to the Eighth City.","Divine Lord Tiancang said, “Heavenly Snake Playboy is very powerful. Although we might be able to fight him if we work together, we should still be careful. I suggest that we find out more information first and sneak into the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace. Then, we can find a way to kill him when he is unprepared!”","Ruler Lange instantly nodded in deep understanding.","“Junior Brother Kuangyi, Junior Brother Xunshan,” he turned around and ordered. “You two sneak into the city and find out more about Ruler Heavenly Snake.”","“Yes!”","Two Jiuxi Holy Land disciples stepped out from behind and cupped their hands.","Ruler Lange turned to look at a mountain outside the city, then said to the others, “Let’s go. We’ll wait for the news there.”","A moment later, the group disappeared at the entrance of the passage.","...","A day passed by in the blink of an eye.","It was the second last day before the battle between Jian Wushuang and Ruler Heavenly Snake.","Outside the Eighth City, on the pitch-black mountain.","Ruler Evergrace and Ruler Mountainseeker, who had gone out to scout for information, had returned.","“Senior brother, something bad has happened. The Blood Sword is openly challenging the Heavenly Snake Playboy! The two of them have agreed to fight in the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace two days later!”","Ruler vast and mountain seeker both hurriedly walked over.","“What? That Blood Sword is openly challenging Heavenly Snake Playboy?”","Lange’s face darkened and he said, “Is this Blood Sword an idiot? Did he think that he could challenge Heavenly Snake Playboy just because he killed a Ruler under him? You’re so arrogant!”","“Lange, mind your words. Don’t insult Sir Blood Sword!”","The Holy Maiden Jiuxi, who had been expressionless, suddenly changed her expression.","Lange snorted and did not say anything more.","When Divine Lord Tiancang heard that, he could not help but ask, “Lange, who was that Blood Sword?”","“Blood Sword? He’s just a nobody, not worth mentioning.”","Lange immediately told them about Jian Wushuang and said with a cold expression, “That Blood Sword is seeking his own death. I can’t care about that. I’m just afraid that it will delay our plan. The Blood Sword is going to visit the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace. The Heavenly Snake Divine Palace will definitely be on guard. I’m afraid it won’t be easy for us to sneak in.”","When Divine Lord Tiancang heard that, he was first enlightened before he waved his hand and said with a cold smile, “It’s okay. We’ll let the Blood Sword be the cannon fodder first. After the Blood Sword is killed by Heavenly Snake Playboy, we’ll come out from the dark and kill him in one blow!”","Lange’s eyes flickered.","“That’s a good plan,” he said with a cold smile, “then let’s kill the Blood Sword first.”","Jiuxi’s heart sank when she heard the conversation."]},{"number":4230,"title":"Chapter 4230 Snake Slaying (Part One)","paragraphs":["4230 Snake Slaying (Part One)","Three days passed by in a flash.","In a pavilion, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the ground and his eyes suddenly opened.","A light flashed across Jian Wushuang’s eyes!","“Time’s up. We’re going to flatten the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace!”","!!","Jian Wushuang stood up and walked toward the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","Ruler Hao Jin followed behind Jian Wushuang.","On this day, the entire Eighth City was shaken!","...","Inside the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","Heavenly Snake Playboy also stood up and stuck out his forked tongue, licking the corner of his mouth.","“Blood Sword, it’s time to give you a reward.”","At the end of the Imperial Road in the Eighth City.","Jian Wushuang stood up and stepped forward.","In the beginning, Jian Wushuang’s speed was extremely slow. As time passed, Jian Wushuang’s footsteps became faster and faster. Finally, he turned into a bolt of lightning between heaven and earth. With a thunderclap under his feet, his body soared into the sky!","“Blood Sword, pay your respects to the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace!”","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang’s voice was like rolling thunder falling from the sky. It suddenly exploded in the sky above the Eighth City, the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace!","At this moment, everyone in the Eighth City was gathered here, and everyone was watching!","“It’s starting!”","Everyone raised their heads and looked at Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the void above the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace. They narrowed their eyes at the same time.","They knew that the battle between the Blood Sword and Heavenly Snake Playboy had begun!","The next moment, more than 20 Ultimate Rulers in iron skirts rushed out of the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","They held long axes in their hands and wore battle armors. They looked like the legendary divine generals of the heavenly court. They took a step forward and stopped Jian Wushuang outside the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","“Blood Sword, Playboy has ordered that if you want to fight him, you’ll have to get past us first!”","The twenty iron-skirted Rulers had powerful auras. They were at the Ultimate Ruler realm, just like the five iron-skirted Rulers that Jian Wushuang had killed in the Fifth City.","“These are the 28 iron-clad guards of Heavenly Snake Playboy!”","“It seems that if the Blood Sword wants to defeat Lord Heavenly Snake, it must first defeat the strength of his subordinates!”","“If that’s the case, even if this Blood Sword can really fight with Heavenly Snake Playboy in the end, I’m afraid he won’t have much divine power left.”","When the crowd saw this scene, they all started discussing.","At the back of the crowd, Ruler Lange and Divine Lord Tiancang were also watching the scene.","Ruler Lange shook his head and laughed coldly, “This Blood Sword is really stupid. It had to provoke Heavenly Snake Playboy so openly. Look at what happened now. Heavenly Snake Playboy has countless Rulers under him. I’d like to see how many of them can the Blood Sword kill!”","“Lange,” Divine Lord Tiancang said, “this Blood Sword is just a brainless man. We don’t need to care about him.”","He paused.","“Lange,” Divine Lord Tiancang said, “we’ll be ready at any time. as soon as Heavenly Snake Playboy comes out, we’ll kill him with one strike!”","Ruler Lange nodded in response.","Outside the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. Back when he was in the Tarot Ruins, he had the power of a fourth-level Ruler and defeated the Allied forces of Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and the Ruler Silver Roc.","Now that he had reached the fifth level of the Ruler realm, his strength had increased severalfold. These twenty-some iron-skirted Rulers were nothing in his eyes.","“Fine, I’ll cut off your wings then come back and kill you.”","Jian Wushuang murmured to himself. Then, the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand. The fierce and overbearing sword essence soared into the sky as if it was going to cut the sky in half!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang looked down at the twenty iron-skirted guards and his eyes were extremely cold!","“Whoever stops me will die!”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and the Wuqi Divine Sword flashed. The two of them turned into a sword light that pierced through the sky, the sun, and the moon and charged at the twenty-odd iron-skirted guards!","“Reject!”","More than 20 iron-skirted guards had serious expressions on their faces. They took a step forward in unison and hacked down with their long axes!","The axe lights suddenly merged together and turned into a light wave that could split the sky and earth. Then, it hacked toward Jian Wushuang!","But...it was all useless!","A blood-colored sword light slashed through the twenty-some iron-skirted Rulers, and their divine bodies began to collapse!","The sword-light pierced through the twenty-some iron-skirted Rulers!","Whoosh!","Then, Jian Wushuang’s figure appeared behind the twenty-odd iron-skirted Rulers.","At this moment, the twenty-some iron-skirted Rulers finally crumbled, their bodies turning into dust and scattering into the air.","He had killed more than twenty Ultimate Rulers with a single sword strike!","In an instant, everyone in the city was shocked.","These twenty-some iron-skirted Rulers weren’t strong individually, but when they worked together, even the top-tier Ultimate Rulers would have to retreat.","Ruler Lange, Divine Lord Tiancang, and the others behind the crowd narrowed their eyes.","“Hmph, I didn’t think that I would underestimate this Blood Sword.”","Ruler Lange’s eyes flashed as he let out a cold snort.","As for Divine Lord Tiancang, he squinted his eyes and shook his head, “These twenty-plus iron-skirted guards are just ordinary people amongst the Ultimate Rulers. They aren’t much. If I were in their position, I would be able to do the same.”","Ruler Lange nodded, then replied, “You’re right. The 20 iron-skirted guards are just appetizers. If the Blood Sword is so weak, it’s still far from Ruler Heavenly Snake Playboy’s level.”","At the same time.","In the depths of the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","Heavenly Snake Playboy sat on the big chair, his golden vertical pupils shining. He directly saw Jian Wushuang, who had killed more than 20 iron-skirted guards with one stroke.","“Tsk, tsk. No wonder the yin-yang slaves are no match for this person. He does have some strength.”","Heavenly Snake Playboy said with a faint smile on his face.","The next moment, he stuck out his forked tongue, which was covered in saliva, and said, “Moluo, hei Teng, help me take care of this Blood Sword.”","“Yes.”","A muffled sound came from behind Heavenly Snake Playboy.","Then, he saw two rays of red light behind the big chair that Heavenly Snake Playboy was sitting on in the endless darkness.","Then...it was a pair of huge scarlet eyes!","This pair of eyes was as large as a hanging red lantern, emitting a dark red light. It did not look like a human, but a huge monster.","Immediately, the pair of eyes rose continuously as if a monster had awakened from its deep sleep and stood up from the earth.","Boom! Boom!","The huge hall began to emit a dull sound.","The next moment, a human-shaped monster that was nearly 100 feet tall walked out from behind Heavenly Snake Playboy.","The monster was huge, like an iron tower, and it exuded a terrifying aura.","His skin was dark and his muscles were bulging like steel. His veins were as thick as his arms and they were twisted like tree roots.","The monster’s eyes were like red lanterns, emitting a red light. two fangs protruded from its lower lip and rose to its nostrils. on top of its head, there was a pair of curved and sharp horns that pierced into the sky as if they were going to pierce through the heavens."]},{"number":4231,"title":"Chapter 4231 Snake Slaying (Part two)","paragraphs":["4231 Snake Slaying (Part two)","“Tian she, the two of us have already recovered nearly 50% of our strength. We will settle the matter between us after we help you deal with this person.”","A muffled sound came from the monster’s mouth.","“Good. Moluo and Hei Teng, as long as you kill the man in the main hall, you will be able to regain your freedom and return to the back eight cities.”","Heavenly Snake Playboy nodded.","The monster with fangs and horns did not say anything else and walked out of the hall.","The ground shook with every step he took!","His figure completely walked out of the darkness, and on his shoulder sat a young boy with a wooden flute in his hand and his hair tied into a small braid.","Step by step, the huge monster disappeared from the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","As for Heavenly Snake Playboy, he was still sitting on the big chair with a faint smile on his face. no one could tell what he was thinking.","“The last eight cities...” He raised his head and muttered to himself.","...","Outside the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm as if he had just done something insignificant. He continued to walk forward step by step.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to step into the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","His vision above him suddenly turned black, and all the light was blocked.","“Eh? What’s going on?”","Jian Wushuang frowned and looked up in confusion.","A huge and ferocious human face suddenly appeared above him. The pair of huge red lantern-like eyes were staring at him!","“This is?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He could feel that the divine power of the monster in front of him was as vast as the ocean.","“The Moluo clan!”","In an instant, the people of the Eighth City who were watching the battle from afar exclaimed.","The Moluo clan was not considered a big clan in the universe due to their scarcity. However, every Moluo was extremely powerful!","They did not cultivate principles or divine arts, but their bodies were naturally strong. With a palm and a foot, they had the power to tear the sky apart and crush the stars!","Every single Moluo had the ability to cross realms in battle!","Everyone looked at this Moluo and started discussing in low voices.","“I heard that Heavenly Snake Playboy had once saved a Moluo when he was in the Eighth City. I didn’t expect that Moluo would return to the Eighth City with him!”","“Moluo has the combat strength of the last eight cities. Although I heard that he was seriously injured and I don’t know if he has recovered his strength, it’s enough to kill all Rulers below the invincible Ruler realm!”","“Guys, look! That’s Black Phoenix!”","“The Black Phoenix is Moluo’s companion. It’s in charge of learning divine abilities and absolute arts to control Moluo’s body. Every Moluo that possesses the Black Phoenix will be much more powerful than an ordinary Moluo!”","Exclamations and discussions could be heard.","Jian Wushuang looked at the huge monster in front of him and could not help but frown.","Bang!","Before he could think further, Moluo had already raised his huge pitch-black arm and pressed it down on him!","Before the arm pressed down, the wind it brought with it had already distorted the void and created a terrifying sound barrier!","“Good!”","The divine light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly increased by three inches. He quickly pulled out the Wuqi Divine Sword and slashed at the palm that covered the sky!","Suddenly, a sharp and cold sword essence shot up into the sky. Jian Wushuang no longer held back and the third level of sword principle origin exploded at the same time with his divine power that was more than 13000 times stronger. He slashed at the palm fiercely!","The Wuqi Divine Sword slashed at the giant palm. Ever since it had been strengthened by the sword spirit of the Tarot sword, the indestructible Wuqi Divine Sword had actually encountered an obstacle. It could only draw out a long string of golden sparks.","The palm actually stopped for a moment before it pressed down on Jian Wushuang again.","“What? Unscathed?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and his face was filled with surprise. at the same time, he quickly stepped on his right foot and jumped back to avoid the palm.","Bang!","An earth-shattering explosion rang out. when Moluo’s palm slammed onto the ground, a huge five-fingered handprint pit that was hundreds of feet deep was formed!","A white blast of air rose into the sky. At this moment, the void made a ‘kacha’ sound similar to that of glass breaking.","In the Eighth City, the expressions of the many Ultimate Rulers who were watching the battle from afar changed when they saw this palm.","One should know that the ancient path of stars was protected by the rules set by that lord. If Moluo’s palm could cause such a terrifying destructive force under the rules, even a small planet would be shattered by this palm if it was in the outside world!","“Little guy, don’t struggle.”","Moluo let out a low and cold voice.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and his eyes finally showed a touch of solemness.","As expected, the ancient path of stars was indeed the place where all the geniuses of all the races in the universe gathered. Even the current him had no choice but to be on guard against Moluo, who had walked out from the last eight cities.","Furthermore...","Jian Wushuang looked at the child holding a wooden flute sitting cross-legged on Moluo’s shoulder. The seriousness in his eyes grew.","Compared to the huge and terrifying Moluo, this child, who had not spoken a single word since the beginning and had his eyes tightly shut, posed an even greater threat to him.","Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and shouted coldly, “Split open the sky!”","Boom!","As soon as he finished speaking, the Wuqi Divine Sword trembled rapidly, letting out the cries of gods and devils, and the low chanting of Buddhas.","Then, a huge blood-red sword light was slashed out!","This sword strike was poignant to the extreme. It folded the void and came slashing down toward Moluo’s head!","“Roar!”","Under this strike, Moluo opened his mouth and let out a roar that shook the nine Heavens and ten lands. The terrifying sound waves actually condensed into a substance at this moment and spread out from Moluo’s mouth in circles!","However, in the face of Jian Wushuang’s killer move, the sky-opening sword move, the sound wave only lasted for a few seconds before it was broken by the blood-red sword light. Then, it went for Moluo’s head again!","Moluo’s pair of huge scarlet pupils immediately contracted. he raised his arms to block the attack.","Clang!","The blood-red sword light brought with it a poignant sword shadow as it hacked onto Moluo’s arms ferociously!","This time, it only caused a series of sparks. However, it was accompanied by Moluo’s furious roar of pain.","On his arm, there was a shallow white mark.","“Little brat, you’ve angered me!”","Moluo bellowed furiously. He immediately stomped his feet heavily and dashed toward Jian Wushuang.","Thump thump thump thump!","The entire Eighth City was quaking rapidly because of Moluo’s rapid speed.","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting intent. As he faced Moluo, who was dashing toward him, he did not show any signs of backing down. He also charged toward Moluo at a high speed!","The speed of the two became faster and faster, and finally, like two meteorites, they collided together!","Bang!","The Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand struck Moluo’s fist fiercely, causing both of them to shake."]},{"number":4232,"title":"Chapter 4232 Snake Slaying (Part Three)","paragraphs":["4232 Snake Slaying (Part Three)","“Continue!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He turned his right hand and changed his move quickly. Once again, he thrust his sword at Moluo’s throat!","Clang!","The tip of the Wuqi Divine Sword was pointed at Moluo’s throat. A sharp and overbearing sword intent exploded, instantly blasting a huge white spot on Moluo’s throat.","As for Moluo’s right palm, it also slammed onto Jian Wushuang’s body and pressed him to the ground!","“What an annoying little fellow!”","Moluo’s voice was low and deep. his huge palm pressed down on Jian Wushuang and slammed down on the ground at an extremely fast speed.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","The strong wind howled by Jian Wushuang’s ears. Under the palm, Jian Wushuang had the illusion that he was being pressed down by a hundred thousand mountains. The great power contained in the palm was not something he could resist at all.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes began to flash quickly.","Bang!","The palm finally hit the ground.","Ka-chak.","Under this palm, the earth began to crack inch by inch as if there was an earthquake. The cracks spread like a spider web, and the entire Eighth City was blown into pieces.","One pavilion after another fell, and some of the Ultimate Rulers standing on the ground paled and hurriedly rose to their feet.","“Blood Sword!”","“What?” Ruler Hao Jin’s heart instantly leaped into his throat as he cried out in alarm.","“Your Excellency Blood Sword!”","Jiuxi also clenched her fists tightly, looking extremely nervous.","Rumble!","The smoke and dust gradually dispersed. The ground split apart where Moluo’s giant palm had slammed down. Pavilions and halls collapsed, leaving behind broken walls and ruins.","Moluo was panting heavily. Two streams of red mist were spurted out from his nostrils.","“Little brat, go to hell!”","He lowered his head to look at his palm, and the corners of his mouth unconsciously curled up.","He could feel that his destructive slap had hit Jian Wushuang perfectly.","He also believed that his palm, which could shatter stars, could turn Jian Wushuang into a meat paste.","He slowly raised his palm and looked down.","“Eh? What’s going on?”","All of a sudden, Moluo’s two spear-like eyebrows twisted. Under his palm, other than a huge pit that was dozens of feet deep, where was Jian Wushuang’s figure?","The next moment!","“Sundering stars!”","A cold shout suddenly exploded in his ears!","Moluo quickly turned his head and saw Jian Wushuang stepping in the air. With his black hair flying in the air, he held a silver sword rainbow and slashed at him fiercely!","How could it be so fast?!","Moluo’s expression changed. He could feel that his palm had hit Jian Wushuang at the first moment. Then, when did Jian Wushuang escape?","Pfff!","Before he could react, the silver sword rainbow in Jian Wushuang’s hand instantly pierced through the heaven and earth. Carrying the power to destroy stars, it slashed toward Moluo’s huge arm!","“Roar!”","Moluo opened his mouth and roared loudly. He could feel that the power of this sword was even more terrifying than all the previous sword lights!","The silver sword rainbow emitted a world-destroying power that even made him feel a sense of threat.","Moluo had only felt this sense of threat from those geniuses and geniuses in the eight cities behind him.","Bang!","Without any obstruction, the silver sword rainbow cut off Moluo’s right arm like a knife cutting through tofu!","Bang!","The huge, pitch-black arm crashed into the ground, causing the Eighth City to shake.","As for Moluo, he immediately covered the area where his arm was broken with his other hand. He roared madly with eyes filled with hatred and anger.","Countless drops of divine blood fell like a blood rain.","The Moluo clan specialized in cultivating their physical bodies. They were different from ordinary cultivators. They were not like ordinary cultivators who could be immortal as long as their divine power was still present.","Once their divine bodies were injured, it was a fatal blow. Without several thousand years, they couldn’t recover.","“Little brat, you’ve completely infuriated me!”","Moluo’s scarlet eyes were wide open. His chest was heaving up and down violently as he panted.","At this moment, he was truly enraged.","Moluo trampling!!!","Moluo opened his mouth and roared. He raised his giant foot and stomped on the ground ferociously.","Bang!","There was a loud explosion!","Immediately, it was as if a tsunami had occurred in the Eighth City, and the city trembled madly.","Countless floorboards were flipped up, and the buildings that were still standing collapsed one after another!","The entire Eighth City was reduced to ruins in an instant!","Immediately after, a huge shock wave spread out in all directions from Moluo!","This shock wave swept past like a hurricane. Wherever the shock wave passed, the ground collapsed by a few hundred feet!","“Is this the combat power of the last eight cities?”","“He’s too strong! As expected of an expert from the back eight cities!”","“It’s hard to imagine that someone as powerful as Moluo could be injured to the point of near death in the last eight cities. Just how heaven-defying are those top geniuses of the last eight cities?”","At this moment, countless people cried out in horror.","There were even some who laughed bitterly at themselves.","“We are both Omega Rulers, but the difference between us is so great.”","Someone sighed.","No matter if it was Jian Wushuang or Moluo, they both admitted that they were far from being a match for him.","...","Bang!","The battle was still ongoing!","The shock wave rushed toward Jian Wushuang like a tide.","Under the shock wave, Jian Wushuang was like a small boat in a raging sea. It was as if he would be crushed by the shock wave at any time.","“The principles of the universe, the power of will!”","Jian Wushuang snorted coldly without any expression. In an instant, the tenfold power of will granted to him by the laws of the universe was activated!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s aura began to soar!","“Suppress!”","Jian Wushuang shouted and stomped his right foot heavily.","Instantly, the mountains and seas calmed down, and the shockwaves that had swept through everything gradually calmed down.","Jian Wushuang stood still in the shock wave like a sea-stabilizing needle.","When Moluo saw this scene, his huge pupils immediately contracted.","Immediately after, he roared again, “Moluo’s charge!!”","Bang!","Moluo stomped his right foot heavily and bent his body. His curved and sharp horns pointed straight at Jian Wushuang.","In the next moment, Moluo started to step down with his right foot and started to dash toward Jian Wushuang!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Just like the legendary kuafu chasing after the sun, Moluo’s every step caused the Eighth City to tremble.","His speed was getting faster and faster!","In the end, Moluo’s body turned into a huge black light and charged forward ferociously!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and shouted again, “Sundering stars!”","Bang!","A silver sword rainbow was slashed out by Jian Wushuang and it slashed toward Moluo!","And this was not the end.","Jian Wushuang laughed in a low voice.","“Sundering stars!”","“Sundering stars!”","“Sundering stars!”","Several sundering stars were unleashed from the Wuqi Divine Sword in succession and bombarded Moluo!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Immediately, Moluo’s charging figure began to slow down gradually as the silver sword rainbows slashed at his body.","In the end, Moluo could no longer bear it as he roared in pain. His body stopped moving."]},{"number":4233,"title":"Chapter 4233 Snake Slaying (Part Four)","paragraphs":["4233 Snake Slaying (Part Four)","At this moment, Moluo’s huge and burly body was covered with sword marks that were so deep that his bones could be seen. These sword marks were densely intertwined like a spider web, looking extremely terrifying.","Pfft!","Scarlet divine blood spurted out of his body, as if it was raining blood in the Eighth City.","“Huchi huchi huchi.”","Moluo panted heavily. Two streams of red mist spurted out from his nose.","“You’re a good opponent. You shouldn’t risk your life for Heavenly Snake Playboy. Let him come out himself.”","Jian Wushuang stepped in the void and said indifferently.","Upon hearing this, Moluo’s expression changed.","He did not reply, but turned his head to look at the child sitting on his shoulder.","“Black Phoenix, what should we do now?”","The child’s eyes were still closed. His hoarse voice resounded in Moluo’s mind.","“This man is right. We don’t have to risk our lives for Heavenly Snake Playboy.”","Moluo hesitated for a moment before he said, “But I promised Heavenly Snake that I would help him get rid of this person.”","“We’ve already done enough for Heavenly Snake.”","“This...”","“Moluo, if I were to take action, the strength that we have recovered with great difficulty will return to its original state. You should think about it clearly. I won’t stop you.” After he finished speaking, the child who was sitting on Moluo’s shoulder did not speak anymore.","Moluo raised his head and fixed his gaze on Jian Wushuang.","The Moluo clan had always kept their promises. They would never go back on their words once they had made a promise.","Jian Wushuang looked at Moluo and could not help but sigh softly. He then shook his head.","“Alright, I’ll do as you wish.”","Jian Wushuang raised the Wuqi Divine Sword again and executed the star slashing sword again. He then slashed at Moluo!","a cold light exploded and thousands of silver rainbows condensed!","All of Jian Wushuang’s divine power was poured into the Wuqi Divine Sword and he slashed it down at Moluo’s head!","“Roar!”","Moluo opened his mouth and roared loudly. He similarly charged forward.","Just as the silver sword rainbow was about to strike Moluo’s body, the child sitting on his shoulder was about to open his eyes.","A sudden change occurred!","A huge snake tail shot out from the depths of the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace!","Clang!","This snake tail directly swept past Moluo and fiercely slapped the silver sword rainbow!","Kachacha!","Immediately, the silver sword rainbow broke into pieces like glass being cracked by an iron whip.","After smashing the silver sword rainbow, the snake’s tail immediately retracted at an even faster speed.","Jian Wushuang took half a step back and raised his head to look in the direction of the snake tail.","An evil-looking young man with an inverted triangle face, golden vertical pupils, and long hair draped over his back walked out from the depths of the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace while flicking his snake’s tongue and making a heart-stopping ‘ssss’ sound.","“Heavenly Snake playboy?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and there was a flash of light.","The crowd watching the battle from a distance was already in an uproar with the appearance of this evil-looking young man.","“It’s Heavenly Snake Playboy!”","“It seems like Heavenly Snake Playboy can’t hold back anymore. Is he going to do it himself?”","“We haven’t seen Heavenly Snake Playboy in action for tens of thousands of years. I didn’t expect that he would be forced out by the Blood Sword this time!”","“The Blood Sword can force Heavenly Snake Playboy to attack personally. Even if he loses, he should be proud!”","Many of the Ultimate Rulers in the Eighth City exclaimed in surprise.","Ruler Lange and the others immediately lowered their heads when they saw Heavenly Snake Playboy.","A person’s name was like a tree’s shadow. The three words, Heavenly Snake Playboy, were definitely the most intimidating name in the top ten cities!","At this moment, Ruler Lange and the others realized that when they saw Heavenly Snake Playboy, they did not even have the courage to look him in the eye. It was as if they were afraid that Heavenly Snake Playboy would see them and know that they had come to kill them.","Nothing had happened, but he felt extremely guilty.","Among them, only Holy Maiden Jiuxi and Divine Lord Tiancang did not avoid their eyes. They looked at Heavenly Snake Playboy with hatred.","Among the two of them, one was almost killed by the people sent by Heavenly Snake Playboy, and the other’s entire clan was almost devoured by Heavenly Snake Playboy. Their fear of Heavenly Snake Playboy had long disappeared, leaving only resentment.","“Senior Brother Lange, are we really going to kill Heavenly Snake Playboy for Junior Sister Jiuxi?”","Ruler Kuangyi stood behind Lange as he said. He secretly raised his eyes and glanced at Ruler Heavenly Snake, who was walking out of the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","Lange’s expression changed when he heard this.","The Holy Maiden Jiuxi was the person with the highest status in the Jiuxi Holy Land, aside from the master of the Holy Land. Although he was the senior brother of this group of disciples, in terms of status, he was on the same level as the Holy Maiden Jiuxi.","Therefore, if he wanted to rise up in the Jiuxi Holy Land, or even fight for the position of holy land master in the future, he would have to rely on the Holy Maiden Jiuxi.","Thinking of this, Lange gritted his teeth and pretended to be righteous. “Hmph, what are you afraid of? Isn’t there a cannon fodder in front?”","Lange raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang with a touch of jealousy in his eyes.","He understood that after this battle, regardless of whether the Blood Sword won or lost, the name of the Blood Sword would definitely resound throughout the top ten cities on the ancient road of stars.","At the same time, he had no choice but to admit that this person called Blood Sword was probably much stronger than him in terms of strength.","When he thought of how Holy Maiden Jiuxi had treated Jian Wushuang, the fire of jealousy in his heart burned even more.","“Divine Lord Tiancang, when the Blood Sword is killed by Heavenly Snake Playboy, we will attack and kill him while he is relaxed!”","Lange turned to look at Divine Lord Tiancang and said coldly.","Divine Lord Tiancang nodded his head and he looked at Jian Wushuang with a deep fear.","He wasn’t a fool. Through the fight between Jian Wushuang and Moluo, he had already seen that Jian Wushuang’s fighting power was definitely not below his. in fact, he might even be stronger.","“It’s a pity. This Blood Sword is very capable. If he had joined forces with me, the chances of killing Heavenly Snake Playboy would have been greatly increased.” Divine Lord Tiancang’s eyes flashed and he shook his head, “However, this person chose to face it alone. I really don’t know if I should say that he is blindly arrogant or just plain stupid.”","...","Outside the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","“Moluo, leave the following matters to me.” Heavenly Snake Playboy approached him step by step. Finally, he stepped on the void and stood beside Moluo. He then spoke.","“Alright, Heavenly Snake. I, Moluo, will owe you a favor this time. The next time you return to the eight cities, I can help you with one more thing.” Moluo replied in a rough voice.","Then, he seemed to have thought of something and added, “That is, if you can return to the back eight cities.”","After he finished speaking, Moluo looked at Jian Wushuang deeply and left the place with big strides."]},{"number":4234,"title":"Chapter 4234 Snake Slaying (Part Five)","paragraphs":["4234 Snake Slaying (Part Five)","Translator: Larbre Studio","Jian Wushuang did not stop Moluo from leaving. Instead, he looked at Heavenly Snake Playboy indifferently.","He could feel that Moluo was not at his peak during the fight with him just now. It seemed that Moluo was injured and had been suppressing his own power. Moreover, someone was sitting on Moluo’s shoulder. The boy with the wooden flute, who posed a greater threat to him, had not made a move yet.","If it wasn’t for this moment, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t mind going all out and having a real battle with Moluo.","However, the person he wanted to kill the most now was not Moluo, but Heavenly Snake Playboy!","He and Heavenly Snake Playboy did not seem to have any sparks, but they had long understood that in the Eighth City, only one of them would survive!","As the Eighth City trembled, Moluo disappeared from the Eighth City’s universe passage.","Only Jian Wushuang and Heavenly Snake Playboy were left outside the door of the Heavenly Snake Divine Palace.","“Heavenly Snake playboy, let’s have a battle.” Jian Wushuang held the Wuqi Divine Sword and said calmly.","Hearing this, Heavenly Snake Playboy’s eyes flickered, and then a faint, strange smile appeared on his face. He shook his head and said, “There’s no rush, Blood Sword. A delicious meal must be cooked with patience in order to become delicious.”","“Delicacies? Cooking?” Jian Wushuang frowned and asked expressionlessly, “What do you mean?”","“Blood Sword, can’t you feel it? The pure divine power aura on your body is too delicious, too mesmerizing!” Staring at Jian Wushuang, Ruler Heavenly Snake stretched out his forked tongue and licked the corner of his mouth. saliva dripped from his tongue as he closed his eyes, intoxicated.","The next moment, he suddenly opened his eyes and laughed in a low voice, “So, Blood Sword, I’m going to eat you bit by bit. Only then can I enjoy my food!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Ruler Heavenly Snake’s handsome face started to rot!","The corners of his mouth curled all the way to the back of his ears, as if someone had used a pair of scissors to completely cut his mouth open from both sides.","Ruler Heavenly Snake suddenly opened his mouth and his forked tongue shot out like a javelin. It carried a poison that was strong enough to kill an Ultimate Ruler and stabbed at Jian Wushuang.","“Food? You’re looking for death!”","A cold glint flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. He quickly raised his Wuqi Divine Sword and slashed at Ruler Heavenly Snake’s tongue!","Bang!","However, Jian Wushuang’s sword hit nothing!","“An afterimage?”","Then, Jian Wushuang felt a huge force hit his chest.","Jian Wushuang’s figure retreated rapidly, leaving a long air wave in the air.","“What a fast speed!”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and his expression was extremely solemn.","Heavenly Snake Playboy’s forked tongue retracted like an iron chain. With his hands behind his back, he chuckled and said in a strange voice, “Blood Sword, come quickly. I can’t wait to give you the ‘reward’.”","“You’re just pretending.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He stomped his right foot heavily and suddenly shot out like a cannonball, turning into a sword light and charging toward Heavenly Snake Playboy.","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang slashed down with his sword, and the sharp sword light cut through the world.","“Blood Sword, you’re too slow!”","Heavenly Snake Playboy only tilted his head slightly and dodged Jian Wushuang’s slash. Then, his body twisted and disappeared from Jian Wushuang’s sight.","“Where is it?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and immediately spread out his divine power to find Heavenly Snake Playboy’s position.","“Are you looking for me?” A cold voice sounded behind Jian Wushuang’s ears.","There was a flash of killing intent in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. Without looking back, he pulled out his sword and raised it up.","Bang!","A huge snake tail, like a giant axe that could split the sky, hacked down at Jian Wushuang and collided with the Wuqi Divine Sword!","If Jian Wushuang was slower by even a second, he would have been hit by the snake tail!","“Eh, your reaction isn’t bad.”","Heavenly Snake Playboy flicked his tongue, twisted his body again, and disappeared behind Jian Wushuang!","The next moment, a snake tail suddenly sprang out from under Jian Wushuang’s feet, twisted his leg, and pulled it down with force!","Bang!","Immediately, Jian Wushuang was caught by the snake’s tail and thrown down from the void into a pavilion that had been turned into ruins in the Eighth City.","As smoke and dust filled the air, a golden light flickered in Ruler Heavenly Snake’s eyes. He pierced through the void and stomped again, shooting toward the pavilion.","Peng peng peng!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","Immediately, the sound of Jian Wushuang and Heavenly Snake’s rapid fighting could be heard from the dust-filled ruins.","“Did you guys notice? The Blood Sword is being suppressed!”","“The Heavenly Snake Clan dominates the universe with their speed. Although the Blood Sword’s offensive power is strong, it’s useless if it can’t touch Lord Heavenly Snake Playboy.”","“Lord Heavenly Snake Playboy is too fast!”","In the distance, countless cultivators of the Eighth City who were watching the battle were discussing in low voices.","As Rulers who had reached the Eighth City, they had good eyesight. From the few exchanges between Jian Wushuang and Heavenly Snake Playboy, they could tell that Jian Wushuang’s attack power was not inferior to Heavenly Snake Playboy’s.","Where the Jiuxi Holy Land disciples and Divine Lord Tiancang were.","“Lange, I don’t think this Blood Sword can last much longer. Let’s get ready and attack at any time.”","Divine Lord Tiancang stared at Jian Wushuang and Heavenly Snake Playboy, who were fighting in the smoke and dust, and said in a deep voice.","“I’ve already prepared it.”","Ruler Lange nodded, and a long, snow-white spear instantly appeared in his hands.","...","Whoosh!","A snake tail suddenly shot out. Jian Wushuang quickly pulled out his sword and split it.","“It’s too fast.”","Jian Wushuang’s face was gloomy and he kept looking around. He could only passively block the huge snake tail that was shooting out from the void.","He had already exerted the tenfold will power given to him by the laws of the universe. However, even so, it was extremely difficult to even catch a glimpse of Heavenly Snake Playboy, let alone fight him.","Even though he could see Heavenly Snake Playboy’s figure occasionally, he had already disappeared after he slashed down with his sword.","The feeling of punching cotton made Jian Wushuang extremely disgusted.","Hiss hiss hiss hiss.","The hissing sound of Heavenly Snake Playboy flicking his tongue came from all directions. Then, a cold and eerie laugh was heard.","“Blood Sword, give up struggling. I will reward you well. I’ll crush your bones bit by bit, absorb all of your divine power bit by bit, and burn your soul in divine fire for tens of thousands of years. What do you think of this reward?”","As he spoke, Ruler Heavenly Snake’s figure shuttled back and forth in the void around Jian Wushuang.","“You’re noisy.”","Jian Wushuang casually slashed the snake’s tail and took a deep breath. He muttered to himself, “I can’t go on like this. Otherwise, I’ll be exhausted to death here.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed and he made a decision in an instant.","Innate divine power, original universe!"]},{"number":4235,"title":"Chapter 4235 Snake slaying (Part Six)","paragraphs":["4235 Snake slaying (Part Six)","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, an extremely mysterious force descended on the scene!","The area within 1000 feet of Jian Wushuang suddenly turned into a pitch-black domain.","The original universe had a strong suppressive power. As long as Jian Wushuang was within the domain of the original universe, his power would increase by a large margin while his opponent’s power would be greatly weakened!","Immediately, Jian Wushuang looked up and saw Heavenly Snake Playboy standing not far to his right. He quickly moved to the side.","“I’ve found you.”","Jian Wushuang sneered, stepped with his right foot, and rushed toward Heavenly Snake Playboy!","Whoosh!","“Split open the sky!”","A half-moon-shaped blood-red sword light struck out instantly and landed on Heavenly Snake Playboy.","Wuwuwuwuwu!","Heavenly Snake Playboy did not expect that Jian Wushuang would be able to capture his position. The sword directly cut his shoulder, leaving a deep cut.","“Eh? You can see me now?”","The cold smile on Heavenly Snake Playboy’s face disappeared, and he frowned.","“Heavenly Snake, go to hell!”","A cold voice was heard and Jian Wushuang charged again with his sword!","Clang!","A huge sword light instantly locked onto him, containing rich universe laws, and slashed at him ruthlessly!","Looking at the huge sword light, Heavenly Snake Playboy’s mouth pulled up into a strange smile again. He sighed and said, “The prey is starting to resist.”","A trident appeared in Heavenly Snake Playboy’s hand.","Heavenly Snake Playboy turned his right hand and also slashed out a halberd light containing rich universe principles toward Jian Wushuang!","Bang!","The trident radiance and the sword radiance collided. At the point of contact, a huge circular shock wave exploded and spread out in all directions.","Jian Wushuang and Heavenly Snake Playboy quickly exchanged thousands of moves!","With the help of the original universe, Jian Wushuang and Heavenly Snake Playboy’s speed finally reached the same level!","Jian Wushuang’s divine power was far stronger than Heavenly Snake Playboy’s!","The situation was reversed in an instant!","“Disgusting little bug.”","Jian Wushuang sneered in a low voice. The Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand continuously slashed out thousands of sharp sword Qi, which bombarded Heavenly Snake Playboy like bombs!","“Secret skill, sun devouring!!”","Facing the thousands of sharp sword Qi, Heavenly Snake Playboy’s face turned cold. He opened his mouth and bit at the thousands of sword Qi!","Boom!","As Heavenly Snake Playboy opened his mouth, a huge phantom of a snake appeared behind him!","The phantom of the giant snake opened its mouth and bared its fangs. With a fierce bite, it swallowed all the sword Qi.","Then, the giant snake Phantom opened its mouth again and bit Jian Wushuang!","“Sundering stars!”","Jian Wushuang sneered and the Wuqi Divine Sword immediately turned into a silver sword rainbow and slashed at the giant snake phantom!","Bang!","With an explosive sound, the giant snake phantom collapsed.","Jian Wushuang followed him with a leap. He stretched out his five fingers and grabbed Heavenly Snake Playboy’s head.","“Now, who is the prey?”","Jian Wushuang sneered and poured all the divine power that was twelve thousand times more than his divine body into his right hand. He grabbed Heavenly Snake Playboy’s head and pressed it to the ground.","Bang!","A huge pit appeared in the ground.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand, grabbed Heavenly Snake Playboy’s head, and pushed him toward a wall!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Jian Wushuang grabbed Heavenly Snake Playboy’s head and pushed him forward, breaking hundreds of walls.","The sharp sword essence wrapped around Jian Wushuang’s fingers and exploded on Heavenly Snake Playboy’s head.","“Poor little bug.”","Jian Wushuang sneered and threw Ruler Heavenly Snake into a small lake in the Eighth City with his right hand.","Countless people were dumbfounded.","No one had expected that the situation would be reversed so quickly. It was so fast that before they could react, Heavenly Snake Playboy had been crushed by Jian Wushuang.","The domain formed by the original universe gradually dissipated.","Jian Wushuang held the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and walked toward the lake step by step.","“Whoosh!”","At this moment, the water in the small lake was overturned, and turbulent waves rose up. A huge black python suddenly swept out of the small lake and opened its mouth to roar.","“Blood Sword, I’ve decided. Not only will I crush your divine body inch by inch, but I’ll also slaughter your entire clan and kill all the people close to you in this world!”","The giant python stared at Jian Wushuang with an extremely cold gaze and spoke in the human language.","The next moment!","Heavenly Snake Playboy, who had transformed into his original body, suddenly rushed out of the lake and rushed toward Jian Wushuang!","Pa pa pa pa!","A sound barrier-breaking explosion burst out beside his huge snake!","His speed was more than ten times faster now that he had returned to his original form!","Jian Wushuang’s vision blurred for a moment and he felt an extremely disgusting stench coming at him.","It opened its huge mouth and bit him ruthlessly, swallowing him!","“Not good! The Blood Sword is going to be swallowed by Heavenly Snake Playboy!”","“Legend has it that the stomach of the Heavenly Snake tribe is a small world of its own. Even the stars and the galaxy will be rapidly corroded and digested after being swallowed by the Heavenly Snake tribe!”","“If the Blood Sword is swallowed by Heavenly Snake Playboy, there’s no possibility of him surviving!”","“The two of them are too strong! This is the first time I’ve seen the true form of the Heavenly Snake tribe!”","In the distance, countless Rulers of the Eighth City, who were watching the battle, had their eyes flashing wildly.","As for Ruler Hao Jin and Holy Maiden Jiuxi, they clenched their fists tightly and did not even dare to breathe loudly as they watched this scene.","The snake’s mouth reeked of blood. Jian Wushuang raised his Wuqi Divine Sword and blocked the snake’s mouth that was closing.","Waves of cold Yin Qi came from deep inside Heavenly Snake Playboy’s body. Jian Wushuang knew that no matter how strong his divine body was, he would not be able to survive once Heavenly Snake Playboy swallowed him.","Roar!","Heavenly Snake Playboy roared madly. Jian Wushuang was in his mouth, but he could not bite the Wuqi Divine Sword that was supporting his upper jaw.","“Blood Sword, let’s see how long you can last.” Heavenly Snake Playboy’s cold voice rang in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","And then, drops of venom, enough to kill an Ultimate Ruler, flowed through his fangs and onto the Wuqi Divine Sword.","Immediately, the Wuqi Divine Sword, which was dripping with venom, let out a sizzling sound as it was burned.","Black spots the size of fingernails appeared on the Wuqi Divine Sword where the poison had dripped, and black poisonous smoke rose.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. He was afraid that even the Wuqi Divine Sword, which had reached the limit of a principles cardinal treasure, would not be able to last long under the poison.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang’s expression became calm again. He said word by word, “Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”","“Slash...star!”","Boom!","In an instant, countless forces surged around Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang did not hold back any of his trump cards. Except for the Tarot Divine Sword and ‘eternal night’, he used all of his strength!","“Today, I, Blood Sword, will show the world what I’m capable of!”"]},{"number":4236,"title":"Chapter 4236 Snake Slaying (Part Seven)","paragraphs":["4236 Snake Slaying (Part Seven)","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s aura was extremely powerful. A pressure from the depths of his soul suddenly descended!","This was the power of intimidation!","In an instant, time seemed to have frozen. Everything began to slow down, as if they had fallen into a quagmire.","Under this power, Heavenly Snake Playboy actually felt that he was extremely small, and he had a feeling of wanting to worship him.","This was the way a higher being looked down on a lower being.","This was a complete suppression of inferior lifeforms from the soul and bloodline of a perfect lifeform!","Jian Wushuang took advantage of this brief moment of sluggishness and immediately shot out of Heavenly Snake Playboy’s mouth. Then, he slashed down with the Wuqi Divine Sword!","“Sundering Stars!”","Bang!","In an instant, a thousand-foot long sword rainbow condensed in Jian Wushuang’s hand. Like a god descending to the world, his black hair fluttered and the silver sword rainbow slashed toward Heavenly Snake Playboy’s head!","Ka ka ka!","At this moment, the void trembled because of this sword intent, and it let out a cracking sound.","Suddenly, the silver sword rainbow fell directly on the giant python that Heavenly Snake Playboy had transformed into, opening a deep wound.","“Roar!”","Heavenly Snake Playboy let out an extremely shrill scream. Divine blood spurted out from his snake body and splattered on the ground, burning countless holes in the ground.","Under this sword, Heavenly Snake Playboy’s divine power was obliterated. The sharp sword will continued to wring in his body, killing the divine power in his body.","Roarrrr!","Due to the excruciating pain, Ruler Heavenly Snake writhed on the ground. His huge tail smacked the entire Eighth City, causing it to shake.","At this moment, the countless cultivators of the Eighth City who were watching the battle from afar were shocked to the extreme.","“Heavenly Snake Playboy...he’s been defeated?”","“Tu...snake-slaying? Is Heavenly Snake Playboy really going to die at the hands of the Blood Sword?”","“Something big has happened! This is going to be a big problem!”","“Invincible! The Blood Sword is invincible!”","“Who can block the Blood Sword?”","When countless people saw this scene, their faces were first filled with shock, and then they shouted in disbelief.","Ruler Lange and the others also had looks of disbelief on their faces.","“Did this Blood Sword really defeat Heavenly Snake Playboy?” Lange’s eyes flashed with disbelief.","Behind him, the Jiuxi Holy Land disciples were so frightened that their eyes almost popped out.","Divine Lord Tiancang’s eyes flickered continuously and his gaze toward Jian Wushuang was filled with fear.","However, he quickly calmed down after taking a deep breath.","In his expectation, Jian Wushuang should have been killed by Heavenly Snake Playboy. Then, he would take advantage of Heavenly Snake Playboy’s relaxed vigilance to kill Jian Wushuang in one blow!","But now, although the expectations were different, the effect was no different.","“Lange, now is the time. It’s our turn to attack!” A cold glint flashed in Divine Lord Tiancang’s eyes as he turned around and shouted.","Bang!","At once, Divine Lord Tiancang stomped his feet and shot up into the sky, shooting toward Heavenly Snake Playboy!","Lange’s eyes flickered with thoughts. He looked at Jian Wushuang coldly and sneered, “Blood Sword, Blood Sword, you are indeed very strong. However, I will be taking the head of Heavenly Snake Playboy!”","Whoosh!","He held the snow-white divine spear in his hand and also swept up.","“Junior Sister Jiuxi, watch how I cut off the head of Heavenly Snake Playboy!” He looked back at Holy Maiden Jiuxi and said proudly.","The next moment!","Divine Lord Tiancang and Ruler Lange did not hesitate any longer and charged toward Heavenly Snake Playboy at the same time!","“Heavenly Snake, those who commit injustice are doomed to destruction. Do you know who I am?” Divine Lord Tiancang laughed and a blue saber appeared in his hand. Lightning rolled on the saber and it slashed toward Heavenly Snake Playboy!","“Heavenly Snake Playboy, remember, Lange is the one who killed you! Hahaha!” Lange laughed as well. His body flashed and he stabbed toward Heavenly Snake Playboy’s head with his snow-white spear!","This change had come too quickly.","It was so fast that Jian Wushuang did not even have time to react.","By the time Jian Wushuang reacted, Divine Lord Tiancang and Ruler Lange had already passed him and were closing in on Heavenly Snake.","“Idiot!”","Jian Wushuang’s face suddenly turned extremely gloomy.","Heavenly Snake Playboy was now in an extremely dangerous situation. Even he planned to avoid it.","If the two of them rushed forward now, was it really certain that Heavenly Snake playboy would die?","Heavenly Snake Playboy, who was sprawled on the ground with divine blood gushing out of his mouth, raised his head and looked at Divine Lord Tiancang and Ruler Lange, who were shooting toward him. His golden vertical pupils suddenly showed joy.","Buzzzzzz!","Before Divine Lord Tiancang and Ruler Lange could get close to him, his huge snake tail shot out and wrapped around Divine Lord Tiancang’s body, pulling him fiercely!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Divine Lord Tiancang’s expression changed drastically. He felt that after being wrapped by the snake’s tail, he could not use any of his divine power. The lightning that was rolling on the divine knife in his hand exploded on the snake’s tail, but it only left a black mark.","“How is that possible?” Divine Lord Tiancang was shocked.","Ruler Lange’s face instantly went pale with terror.","He looked at Divine Lord Tiancang, who was struggling, and he felt his entire body tremble in fear.","Run!!!","Ruler Lange took a step forward, immediately preparing to flee.","Before he could take two steps.","A forked tongue shot out of Heavenly Snake Playboy’s mouth, wrapped around Ruler Lange, and pulled him back toward Heavenly Snake Divine Lord!","“No!”","Ruler Lange struggled and howled.","However, it was of no use.","If Heavenly Snake Playboy had not met Jian Wushuang, he would definitely be the most terrifying existence in the top ten cities on the ancient road of stars. How could he resist?","Ruler Lange was instantly swallowed by Heavenly Snake Playboy, and his huge, sharp fangs stabbed into his neck.","Ruler Lange’s divine power was constantly being sucked away by Heavenly Snake Playboy.","Ruler Lange began to struggle madly, but after a few seconds, he gradually stopped moving. His hands and feet went limp, and in the end, his divine body turned into dust.","Heavenly Snake Playboy’s injuries and the divine power that Jian Wushuang had obliterated immediately recovered at a speed that was visible to the naked eye.","The cultivators of the Eighth City, who were watching the battle from afar, shook their heads without any pity when they saw this.","“This person is truly stupid to the extreme.”","“Hmph, who is Lange? Does he really think that anyone can step on his head?”","“Does this person think he’s a Blood Sword? Is Heavenly Snake Playboy someone he can provoke?”","“He really deserved to die. He can’t do anything right, but he’s good at ruining things.”","The Rulers who were watching the battle looked at the people from the Jiuxi Holy Land with ridicule.","The next moment, they let out a long sigh."]},{"number":4237,"title":"Chapter 4237 Snake Slaying (Part Eight)","paragraphs":["4237 Snake Slaying (Part Eight)","“It’s a pity for the Blood Sword. It took me so much effort to severely injure Heavenly Snake Playboy and kill him. But now, because of this idiot, Heavenly Snake Playboy has recovered.”","“The Blood Sword is in danger.”","The spectators looked at Jian Wushuang and shook their heads with a sigh.","“Jiuxi Holy Land, I, Hao Jin, won’t rest until you’re dead!”","!!","“Die!” Ruler Hao Jin’s eyes almost popped out of his head as he charged toward the Jiuxi disciples!","On the other side.","Heavenly Snake Playboy’s snake tail swung again and he swallowed Divine Lord Tiancang.","In an instant, the huge wound on Heavenly Snake Playboy’s body that was cut by Jian Wushuang’s star-slashing sword rainbow began to recover. In just a few breaths, it was completely healed.","“Hiss hiss hiss...”","Heavenly Snake Playboy slowly raised his head and let out a cold smile.","“Blood Sword, it seems like even the heavens don’t want me to die.” He looked at Jian Wushuang and said sarcastically.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and he replied indifferently, “If I can kill you once, I can kill you a second time.”","“Is that so?”","Heavenly Snake Playboy chuckled without a care.","The next moment!","“Blood Sword, you should die!!!”","His face suddenly became distorted and his huge golden vertical pupils were filled with ruthlessness and madness. He bounced up from the ground again and shot toward Jian Wushuang.","“You’re the one who should die!”","Jian Wushuang snorted coldly with an expressionless face. He lowered his head to look at the black spot on the Wuqi Divine Sword that had been scalded by the venom. With a flip of his right hand, he put the Wuqi Divine Sword back into his Interspatial Ring.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and his expression became calm. He closed his eyes and slowly said, “Divine body, appear.”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body emitted a sound similar to frying beans.","A wave of energy that came from the deepest part of his soul and the deepest part of his perfect life form began to gush out!","Under this power, his divine body started to grow.","One miles...two miles...three miles...","Ten thousand miles...thirty thousand miles...sixty thousand miles...","At this moment.","Everyone’s face froze and their eyes widened in disbelief.","An unimaginable giant, tens of thousands of miles tall and surrounded by endless immortal radiance, appeared in front of Heavenly Snake Playboy.","His face was surrounded by chaos, only revealing a trace of his appearance. He looked exactly the same as Jian Wushuang. His power was indescribable and powerful beyond comprehension. It was as if he could break the universe with a raise of his hand and destroy the earth with a step. Heavenly Snake Playboy, who was originally huge, was like an ant under the feet of the giant.","Under countless shocked gazes, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes. Two bolts of lightning flashed across his eyes.","Other than having divine power and a soul that far surpassed cultivators of the same realm, special creatures also had a divine body at its strongest state!","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had revealed his divine body to the world!","The entire Eighth City was shocked!","What is this?!!","Heavenly Snake Playboy’s speed came to a sudden halt. He raised his head and looked at the giant surrounded by countless immortal light, and his golden vertical pupils shrank.","A cold Qi rushed to his head!","For the first time, Heavenly Snake Playboy felt fear in his heart.","“Retreat!”","Heavenly Snake Playboy’s eyes flickered. He was uncertain about the giant who had transformed into Jian Wushuang’s divine body. He immediately made a decision to avoid the sharp edge first.","In an instant, Heavenly Snake Playboy was about to shoot into the distance.","Looking at Heavenly Snake Playboy who was far away, Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change at all and he spoke calmly.","“Suppress!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang was like a god who controlled the life and death of the world and set the law. An indescribable divine power gathered in Jian Wushuang’s giant hand and pressed down on Heavenly Snake Playboy.","Boom!","No words could describe the horror of this palm.","The entire world was covered by a giant palm. There was no light, no earth, and no sky.","Under this palm, Heavenly Snake Playboy seemed to have turned into a small snake that was at the mercy of others and was suppressed by Jian Wushuang’s hand!","“Roar roar roar!”","Heavenly Snake Playboy screamed and howled. However, no matter how he struggled, he could not move at all, as if he was being pressed down by a million mountains!","The sharp and fierce sword essence was activated by Jian Wushuang. It exploded between his five fingers and bombarded Heavenly Snake Playboy continuously.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Heavenly Snake Playboy’s snake body kept exploding, condensing, and exploding again. This process was repeated thousands of times.","As Heavenly Snake Playboy let out a shrill roar, everyone was shocked to see this scene. They felt a chill down their spine as if they had fallen into an ice cellar.","“This is too terrifying!” Countless people’s lips trembled as they spoke.","After a while.","When Jian Wushuang raised his palm again, it had already turned into nothingness.","Heavenly Snake Playboy had been completely annihilated.","Kacha kacha kacha.","Jian Wushuang’s 68000-mile-long divine body gradually shrank and returned to normal after a while.","At that moment, the entire Eighth City fell into a deathly silence. It was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop.","No one was discussing it, and no one made a sound.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang and they were all shocked.","Until now, their minds were still filled with Jian Wushuang’s indomitable and 68000-mile divine body.","The same thought appeared in their minds at the same time.","‘I want to compete with the heavens!’","...","After returning to his normal form, Jian Wushuang’s aura was extremely weak and he almost fell from the sky.","“The price of using the divine body once is too great.”","Jian Wushuang laughed bitterly. Outsiders only thought that he had killed Heavenly Snake Playboy with a flip of his hand. Only he knew how much he had paid.","At this moment, his divine power was almost completely exhausted, and his entire body was in pain as if it had been stabbed by needles. His divine body was on the verge of exploding.","“But it’s good, it’s not like I didn’t gain anything.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and turned his head to look at the place where Heavenly Snake Playboy had died.","He saw two sharp fangs and an Interspatial Ring floating in the air.","Drops of pitch-black venom dripped down the fangs, corroding the ground and creating huge pits.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and took the two poisonous fangs and Heavenly Snake Playboy’s Interspatial Ring.","Then, Jian Wushuang took out a few divine herbs from his Interspatial Ring that could quickly replenish divine power. He sat down cross-legged to recover his divine power.","Each of these divine herbs was extremely precious. However, to Jian Wushuang, who had obtained the complete treasures of the Tarot Ruins, they were nothing.","When his divine power had recovered slightly, Jian Wushuang stood up and walked toward the crowd.","in an instant, everyone automatically made way for him and looked at Jian Wushuang with extreme respect.","Jian Wushuang walked past them slowly and finally stopped in front of the Jiuxi Holy Land disciples.","It was time to settle some scores.","“Sir Blood Sword.”","Jiuxi had a complicated expression on her face as she called out softly."]},{"number":4238,"title":"Chapter 4238 Recovery","paragraphs":["4238 Recovery","“You, get out of the way,” Jian Wushuang looked at Holy Maiden Jiuxi and said.","Jiuxi opened her mouth and wanted to say something. In the end, she sighed and stepped aside silently.","Instantly, the Jiuxi Holy Land disciples standing behind the Holy Maiden Jiuxi, such as Kuangyi and Xunshan, changed their expressions and asked, “Blood Sword, what do you want to do?”","“Blood Sword, don’t go too far. We’re disciples of Jiuxi Holy Land!”","!!","“The Blood Sword...”","Pa!","Before they could finish, Jian Wushuang raised his palm and slapped them.","This slap did not contain any divine power, but it still landed on the faces from the vast and unfettered God.","“I’ve already killed Heavenly Snake Playboy. Why would I care about the Jiuxi Holy Land?” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","At once, the faces of Ruler Kuangyi and the others turned red with anger, but they did not dare to say anything. They could only cover their faces and lower their heads, not daring to look at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang had killed Heavenly Snake Playboy with one palm. It was so fierce that they had long been scared out of their wits. Their previous questions were just a show of aggression. When Jian Wushuang’s palm came, they could not even do the most basic dodging.","“Idiot.”","In the end, Jian Wushuang looked at them coldly and turned to leave.","If it were not for the disciples of Jiuxi Holy Land, he would not have needed to use his divine body.","Ruler Hao Jin followed Jian Wushuang closely. Before he left, he glared at the Jiuxi Holy Land and snorted. “Let me tell you, Lord Blood Sword is very broad-minded. He only slapped you once and let it go. However, I, Hao Jin, am a narrow-minded person. If I see you on the Ancient Path of Stars path in the future, I’ll kill anyone I see!”","Then, he quickly followed Jian Wushuang and walked away.","After Jian Wushuang left, the deathly silent crowd began to boil with excitement!","He killed Heavenly Snake Playboy with Blood Sword palm and became the first in the Eighth City!","“When the divine manifestation appears, the world is shocked! The Blood Sword is proof of his invincibility!”","“The Heavenly Snake Playboy killed by the Blood Sword is the number one person in the top ten cities of the Ancient Path of Stars!”","In an instant, the battle between Jian Wushuang and Heavenly Snake Playboy spread like a hurricane. Not only did it spread to the Eighth City, but it also spread to the other grotto-heaven cities and worlds on the Ancient Path of Stars Road at an extremely fast speed!","The Seventh City, the Sixth City, the Fifth City...","Even the Ninth City and Tenth City after the Eighth!","The name ‘Blood Sword’ had completely shaken the ancient road of stars!","For a moment, the name ‘Blood Sword’ was in the limelight. In the top ten cities on the Ancient Path of Stars, everyone was talking about the battle between the Blood Sword and Heavenly Snake Playboy.","Some said that Jian Wushuang was the deity of a top power in the universe and that he had come to the Ancient Path of Stars Road to train. Some said that Jian Wushuang was the son of a top supreme and that he had supreme secret techniques...","For a time, discussions about Jian Wushuang filled the top ten cities on the ancient road of stars. However, there were thousands of people and the stories that came out of their mouths naturally came into countless versions.","However, when the news reached them from the First City, which was extremely far away, the entire top ten cities on the ancient path of the starry sky were shaken!","The Blood Sword that killed Heavenly Snake Playboy was only a fifth stage Ruler!","Countless people could not believe it. The Blood Sword that could kill Heavenly Snake Playboy, an invincible Ultimate Ruler, was only at the fifth-level Ruler!","“Freak! A heaven-defying genius!”","“The Blood Sword was only a fifth stage great Ruler, but he was able to kill Heavenly Snake Playboy, who was an unrivaled Ultimate Ruler. When the Blood Sword reaches the level of an Ultimate Ruler, who in the universe can stop him unless the Supremes appear?”","“I’m afraid that even those monstrous geniuses from the depths of the Ancient Path of Stars are only at this level?”","“The Blood Sword will definitely become one of the new powerhouses on the Ancient Path of Stars!”","If they were shocked when they found out that Jian Wushuang had killed Heavenly Snake Playboy, they were shocked now!","Countless people went crazy!","...","The changes in the outside world were like a Whirlpool. Jian Wushuang, who had caused all this, was sitting cross-legged on a mountain in the Eighth City.","The night wind blew and the stars twinkled. Jian Wushuang was wearing a black robe and sitting cross-legged. Countless divine power surrounded his body and nourished his divine body.","His exhausted divine power was quickly recovering.","After a while, Jian Wushuang slowly let out a breath of turbid air and opened his eyes. a divine light quietly flashed in his eyes.","“I’ve finally recovered.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. After killing Heavenly Snake Playboy, he was not in a hurry to leave the Eighth City. Instead, he found a mountain outside the Eighth City to recover his divine power.","After several dozen days of rest, his exhausted divine power had finally recovered.","As for Jian Wushuang, he finally had a clear idea of his strength after the battle with Heavenly Snake Playboy.","“If I use all my techniques, I’ll be able to kill an invincible Omega Ruler, but the price will be enormous.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","The ‘eternal night’ sword and the Tarot Divine Sword were naturally not included in the list of techniques he had mentioned.","When he was a Ruler of the fourth level, he had killed the Third Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom and Lord Zhennan of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom with one strike.","Although Heavenly Snake Playboy was strong, he was not much stronger than the Third Prince and Lord Zhennan.","If Jian Wushuang directly activated ‘eternal night’, it would be enough to kill Heavenly Snake Playboy in an instant. Even if he were to face the Ninth Kalpa King, Jian Wushuang was confident that he could fight him. However, doing so would naturally violate the original intention of Jian Wushuang coming to the ancient road of stars.","‘Eternal night’ was powerful, but it was someone else’s sword principle. It was Tarot supremacy’s sword principle, not his.","If he relied on the ‘eternal night’ for everything, then no matter how powerful he became in the future, he would just be a shadow living under the body of Tarot.","Tarot supremacy was known as the number one swordsman since ancient times. His title was the sword supremacy, and no one had broken his legend.","Countless experts of the Dao of the sword followed his sword Dao and spent countless years studying it. However, the result was that they could never surpass him.","This was not what Jian Wushuang wanted.","If Jian Wushuang wanted to surpass Tarot Ruler in the future, the only way was to keep growing his own strength and create his own invincible sword principle!","Jian Wushuang was very clear about this.","“In the end, I’m still a little weak.” Jian Wushuang sighed and looked down at the Eighth City.","He saw that the Eighth City, which had been turned into ruins by him and Heavenly Snake Playboy, had gradually returned to normal in the past dozens of days.","Jian Wushuang could not help but sigh again. What kind of great power did the Lord who opened the Ancient Path of Stars have?","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the boundless starry sky."]},{"number":4239,"title":"Chapter 4239 The Nine Magnates","paragraphs":["4239 The Nine Magnates","Looking at the starry sky, Jian Wushuang could feel that after he killed Heavenly Snake Playboy, the pair of eyes that were silently watching him from behind became more obvious.","‘It seems that the further I go, the more powerful I am, and the more attention I will receive from that Lord. The chances of me getting the qualification to the Grand Clan Gathering will be higher.’ Jian Wushuang thought for a moment.","After a while.","Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and took a deep breath, “It’s time to leave this place.”","!!","The Eighth City had never been Jian Wushuang’s goal. The battle with Heavenly Snake Playboy was just one of the most ordinary battles he had fought in the past three hundred thousand years.","He would continue to move forward.","“Hao Jin, let’s go.”","He said as he strode toward the entrance of the Eighth City.","“They’re here!”","Ruler Hao Jin, who was cultivating in seclusion, shuddered when he heard Jian Wushuang’s words. He quickly stood up and followed Jian Wushuang into the distance.","No one knew that Jian Wushuang had left the turbulent Eighth City quietly and headed deeper.","Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin disappeared from the Eighth City in the dark night.","There was a distortion in the void. When Jian Wushuang opened his eyes again, he had already arrived at the ninth city.","There was not much difference between the ninth city and the Eighth City. Other than the fact that the space was more stable and the aura of rules was more intense, there was not much difference.","The two of them did not stay long in ninth city and headed straight for the City Lord’s residence.","The Lord of the Ninth City was a veteran Omega Ruler who had spent dozens of chaos cycles in the Omega Ruler realm. Although he was powerful, he was limited by his natural talent. He had already reached the end of his cultivation path, and had long since lost all desire to fight.","Jian Wushuang carried the might of killing Heavenly Snake Playboy and was extremely arrogant. The City Lord of the Ninth City naturally did not want to provoke such a strong enemy for no reason. Therefore, he only symbolically stopped Jian Wushuang and let him leave the Ninth City.","“Lord Blood Sword, the Tenth City is a dividing line on the Ancient Path of Stars. After passing through the Tenth City, you can be said to have reached the depths of the Ancient Path of Stars. The last eight cities are completely different from the top ten cities. They are the world of geniuses and geniuses. The geniuses of the top forces in the universe, as well as the divine sons and Holy Sons of the Ancient Holy Lands, all gather in the last eight cities.” Ruler Hao Jin said with a look of envy.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but look at him teasingly and said, “You’re not that strong, but you know quite a lot.”","Ruler Hao Jin’s face reddened upon hearing this, and he awkwardly scratched his head. “When I was in the Third City, I couldn’t go any further. So I could only find out about the stories of these experts for fun.”","After a pause, Ruler Hao Jin continued, “But Lord Blood Sword, do you know the Nine Magnates in the back eight cities?”","“The Nine Magnates?” Jian Wushuang was interested. He raised his eyebrows and said, “What are these Nine Magnates?”","Ruler Hao Jin thought for a moment, then said, “Tthe happenings in the eight cities are rarely spread, so I don’t know much about them. I’ve only heard that although the heaven’s pride experts are gathered in the back eight cities and the stars are dazzling, in general, the Nine Magnates are still the most respected!","“These Nine Magnates manage the last eight cities of the Ancient Path of Stars together. In the last eight cities, no matter how monstrous a genius is, they have to rely on the Nine Magnates to survive.","“These nine powerhouses are also known as the nine most powerful figures in the history of the Ancient Path of Stars! He’s also the one most likely to participate in the Grand Clan Gathering!”","“I heard that the lord who opened the Ancient Path of Stars will choose ten children to listen to the dao in the grand meeting of all races in the universe. three of these ten children will be chosen from the Ultimate Rulers. If everyone’s guess is right, these three Ruler seats should be chosen by three of the nine overlords.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and then asked, “Then who are the Nine Magnates?”","“This...I’ll have to think about it carefully.” Ruler Hao Jin lowered his head and began to think hard. Only after a few moments did he hesitantly say, “Lord Blood Sword, the eight cities on the Ancient Path of Stars are too far away from me. Therefore, I don’t know much about them. I only know a few of the Nine Magnates.”","After a pause, Ruler Hao Jin said in a deep voice, “Among the Nine Magnates, there’s the crown prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, the young emperor of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, the Blood Sky Palace’s current blood disciple, the unparalleled conqueror with the undying overlord body that’s hard to come by in a million years, and the guardian of the Tenth City, Lord Blue.”","hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","Da Feng Divine Kingdom! The Da Feng Divine Kingdom! The Blood Sky Palace!","He was not unfamiliar with these powers. Back in the Tarot Ruins, he had fought with the unrivaled Ultimate Rulers that these three powers had sent.","“I didn’t expect to encounter people from these three forces on the Ancient Path of Stars again.” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and a cold glint flashed in his eyes.","However, whether or not they would fight would have to wait and see the situation.","“Who is Lord Blue?” Jian Wushuang asked after collecting his thoughts.","At the mention of Lord Blue, a hint of admiration appeared in Ruler Hao Jin’s eyes. He said, “Lord Blue is the only big shot who remained in the top ten cities. Of course, this is not because he is weak, but because he seemed to have made a bet with someone that the loser would never be able to step into the back eight cities.","“Lord Blue’s background is mysterious. No one knows where he came from, whether he’s a man or a woman, or even what his name is. It’s only because he always wears blue clothes and wears a blue veil all year round that he’s called Lord Blue.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang immediately understood.","Given how vast the universe was, it was not impossible for a top-tier Ultimate Ruler to suddenly appear.","He was not someone who would get to the bottom of things, so he smiled and said, “It doesn’t matter to us who this Lord Blue is. As long as he’s willing to let us enter the Eighth City, it’ll be fine.”","Then, Jian Wushuang patted Ruler Hao Jin’s shoulder and said, “Let’s go,” he said.","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and entered the universe passage in the ninth city.","“Tenth city, I, Hao Jin, am here!”","Ruler Hao Jin sighed and followed Jian Wushuang. They also disappeared into the universe passage in the ninth city.","...","At the same time, in the universe, in the great void Star system, which was extremely far away from the Ancient Path of Stars path.","The first hall master of the Great Void Temple, Bing Ye, and the second hall Master, Fu’e...the hall master of the seventh Hall, Jiu kun.","The palace masters of the seven palaces stood respectfully in front of a black tower. they cupped their hands in unison and said, “We, the palace masters of the seven palaces, welcome the return of Sir divine Emperor!”"]},{"number":4240,"title":"Chapter 4240 Dragon Cage","paragraphs":["4240 Dragon Cage","Inside the Great Void Temple, the black Spire stood upright like a sword and Thunder rumbled in the sky.","The seven Hall Masters of the Great Void Temple all stood respectfully below the spire. They bowed their heads and cupped their hands, their expressions solemn.","“Rumble!”","A thunderbolt suddenly exploded in the sky!","A middle-aged man in a royal robe walked down from the sky.","This middle-aged man was the founder of the Great Void Temple, Divine Emperor Tai Xu!","“Greetings, Sir divine Emperor!”","The seven hall masters knelt on the ground and spoke at the same time.","The middle-aged man’s entire body was bathed in lightning, with lightning snakes circling around him. He nodded indifferently and said, “You may rise.”","“Yes!” The seven hall masters stood up.","“I’ve returned this time to discuss two things.” Divine Emperor Tai Xu stood with his hands behind his back and spoke indifferently.","The seven hall masters did not say a word and listened to Divine Emperor Tai Xu’s words.","“Firstly, I will no longer be the Emperor God of the Great Void Temple. I have already chosen the person who will take over the position of Emperor God.” Divine Emperor Tai Xu spoke indifferently.","As soon as these words were spoken, the palace masters of the seven palaces burst into an uproar!","“Sir Divine Emperor, you must not do this!” Immediately, a few Palace Masters walked out from among the seven Palace Masters and cupped their hands in greeting.","“When has it ever been anyone’s turn to dispute the things I’ve decided?” Divine Emperor Tai Xu looked at them indifferently.","Immediately, the hall masters trembled and did not dare to say anything more. They only had many thoughts in their minds.","However, before they could think further, Divine Emperor Tai Xu continued, “After I leave, the first hall master, Bing Ye, will be in charge of becoming Emperor God Taixu. The seven halls of the Great Void Temple will have to listen to Hall Master Bing Yi’s command. Do you understand? ”","The seven hall masters of the Great Void Temple looked at Hall Master Bing Ye with complex expressions.","Hall Master Bing Ye’s expression did not change much upon hearing this. He merely cupped his hands and said, “Celestial Emperor, don’t worry. I will definitely manage the Great Void Temple well and not let you down.”","Divine Emperor Tai Xu nodded his head in satisfaction after hearing that. then, he changed the topic and continued, “The second thing is that it’s time to remove the seal on Qiu Long and let him rule the Ancient Path of Stars.”","“What? That madman is about to be released?”","“I don’t know if it’s a good thing or a bad thing to let this madman out.”","The hall masters of the seven halls frowned. However, they also knew that with the death of Divine Son Qing Xu, the only way for the Great Void Temple to obtain a position on the Ancient Path of Stars was to release Qiu Long and head to the Ancient Path of Stars.","Divine Emperor Tai Xu’s eyes flashed and he turned to look at the black tower behind him.","He waved his hand, and the black iron gate of the Black Tower behind him slowly opened.","Behind the door was endless darkness. Gusts of old dust were blown out of the door along with a cold wind.","Then, they heard heavy panting coming from the iron gate, as if a monster was about to break out.","Chi...chi...chi...","Chi...chi...chi...","The sound of iron chains rubbing against the floor was heard. A moment later, a hunched monster gradually walked out of the darkness of the minaret.","The monster’s skin was green, and there was a row of spikes on its back. Its hands and feet were shackled with black iron.","“The taste of freedom.” The monster raised its head and sighed, slowly opening its eyes.","There were only the whites of his eyes, no eyeballs.","He turned his head to look at the seventh Palace’s Palace Master and laughed hideously, “Seven hall masters. It’s been ten chaos cycles, I suppose. Long time no see.”","When the seven Hall Masters heard this, they coldly snorted without any expression.","The monster wanted to continue speaking but Divine Emperor Tai Xu said indifferently, “Qiu Long, I let you out this time because I have something for you to do.”","“Hehe, I knew it. You guys definitely need me for something.” Hearing this, Qiu Long chuckled and then pouted, “Isn’t this your usual way of doing things? when you need me, you release me. After you’ve used me, you’ll seal me.”","Divine Emperor Tai Xu frowned when he heard that and said indifferently, “After you’ve done this, I can truly set you free.”","“Oh?” Qiu Long’s pupils shrank, and a trace of suspicion flashed through his eyes.","“Divine Emperor, are you serious?”","“When have I ever lied to you when I speak?” Divine Emperor Tai Xu replied indifferently.","“Alright!” Hearing this, Qiu Long rolled his eyes and said, “Divine Emperor, speak. What do you need me to do this time?”","“I let you out this time because I want you to represent the great void immortal sect and head to the last city on the Ancient Path of Stars to compete for the chance to participate in the myriad clan Grand meeting in the universe.” Divine Emperor Tai Xu said.","“The Ruler Ancient Path of Stars? But...a Ruler?” Hearing this, Qiu Long sneered in disdain, and a flash of ruthlessness flashed in his eyes.","Divine Emperor Tai Xu waved his right hand and the shackles on Qiu Long disappeared.","All of a sudden, an earth-shaking aura surged with Qiu Long as the center!","Qiu Long slowly straightened his back and twisted his neck, making cracking sounds.","Not long after, Divine Emperor Tai Xu left the Great Void Star area.","Just as Qiu Long was about to head for the Ancient Path of Stars, Supreme Bing Ye suddenly called out to him.","“Qiu Long, after you go to the Ancient Path of Stars, help me kill someone.”","“Oh?”","Qiu Long raised his eyebrows and became interested, “Kill who?”","Supreme Bing Ye flipped his right hand and a Mystic Light mirror appeared in his hand. He handed it to Qiu Long and said,","“Let’s kill this man in the mirror.”","Qiu Long lowered his head and looked at the mirror. He saw a cold-looking young man in a black robe holding a blood-red divine sword.","“Who is he?”","Asked Qiu Long with a frown.","“Blood Sword.”","Supreme Ying Ye spat out these two words indifferently.","...","Meanwhile, back on the ancient path of the starry sky...","Jian Wushuang and Ruler Hao Jin stepped into the Tenth City.","“Lord Blood Sword, in front of us is one of the nine overlords, Lord Blue.”","Ruler Hao Jin said as he pointed at the largest castle in the Tenth City.","“Lord Blood Sword, the first ten cities are different from the last eight cities on the Ancient Path of Stars. The City Lord of the Tenth City is also known as the pass suppression envoy. If you want to go to the last eight cities, you must obtain the pass-through document from the pass suppression envoy. Lord Blue is the pass suppression envoy of the Tenth City.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Let’s go. Let’s go and meet that Lord Blue.”","The two of them walked toward the fortress.","Along the way, many people fixed their eyes on Jian Wushuang.","“This person...the Blood Sword?”","“As expected, I knew that the Blood Sword would come to the tenth city and enter the last eight cities.”","“There are many good friends of Heavenly Snake Playboy in the last eight cities. I’m afraid that trouble will come one after another when the Blood Sword enters the Eighth City.”","“I just don’t know if he can pass Lord Blue’s test.”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless, as if he had not heard the discussion. He walked closer to the huge fortress."]},{"number":4241,"title":"Chapter 4241 God Refining Tower","paragraphs":["4241 God Refining Tower","In front of the fortress, two guards in dark Blue iron armor were guarding the gate.","Flags with the word ‘Blue’ on them were planted high in the fortress, fluttering in the wind.","“Who are you?” The two guards crossed their long poles and blocked Jian Wushuang’s way. One of them asked expressionlessly.","“Blood Sword, I’m here to visit the pass guard.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said with a smile.","“Blood Sword?”","The two guards narrowed their eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s reputation was quite well-known recently, so the two dark-Blue armored guards naturally knew him.","“Alright, Lord Blood Sword, please wait a moment. I’ll go see Lord Blue now.” The two guards cupped their hands at Jian Wushuang and then walked into the fortress.","A moment later, the armored guard walked out of the fortress and bowed. “Lord Blood Sword, Lord Blue has invited you in.”","“Many thanks.”","Jian Wushuang nodded at him and immediately strode into the fortress.","As soon as he entered the fortress, a huge spiral stone ladder appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Come on up.”","Then, Jian Wushuang heard a faint voice.","The voice was so clear that it was hard to tell if it was male or female.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied. The owner of the voice must be Lord Blue, one of the nine overlords on the ancient road of stars.","Jian Wushuang was quite curious about this Lord Blue. He wanted to see what level the so-called ‘big shot’ level of battle strength on the ancient road of stars had reached.","Jian Wushuang walked up the stone stairs while thinking.","A moment later, a red wooden door appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Bang!","The next moment, the wooden door automatically opened.","A slender figure in Blue, sitting cross-legged on the ground, appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. Her face was covered with a veil, and only her beautiful eyes were exposed.","“Lord Blue?” Jian Wushuang shouted tentatively.","“Blood Sword, come in and sit.” Lord Blue pointed at the futon opposite him.","Jian Wushuang nodded and strode into the room. He sat cross-legged in front of Lord Blue.","“Lord Blue, I’ve come to visit this time for the sake of clearing the document.”","Lord Blue hummed in acknowledgment and replied, “Blood Sword, you can just call me ‘Blue’, but I can’t give you the official document.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes.","Lord Blue glanced at Jian Wushuang, paused, and continued, “Blood Sword, the density of the laws in the first ten cities and the last eight cities are completely different. It can be said that they are two completely different worlds. If you want to pass the official document, that is not something that I can decide. That Lord has already set the rules. You have to clear the first three levels of the God Refining Tower before you can obtain the official document and enter the last eight cities.”","As he spoke, Lord Blue stretched out his hand and pointed upwards.","“Is that the Lord’s intention?”","Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and then replied in a deep voice, “Blue, then T’ll have to trouble you to bring me to the God Refining Tower.”","“It’s a small matter, not a big deal.” Blue nodded and then led Jian Wushuang out of the fortress.","Outside the fortress, Ruler Hao Jin saw Jian Wushuang coming out and asked hurriedly, “Lord Blood Sword, did you get the clearance document?”","“Not yet, wait for me here.”","Jian Wushuang replied and then followed ‘Blue’ toward a huge black tower in the Tenth City.","“Lord Blue!”","“We pay our respects to Lord Blue!”","On the way, the Ultimate Rulers of the tenth city all greeted ‘Blue’ respectfully.","‘Blue’ nodded slightly in response.","It could be seen that ‘Blue’ had a high prestige in the tenth city.","A moment later, the two of them arrived in front of the huge black tower.","This black tower had a total of nine floors, and was shaped like a L character. The higher it went, the sharper it became.","On the body of the tower, there were two words, ‘God-refining’, carved with sharp edges!","“Blood Sword, this is the God Refining Tower. The higher you go, the more difficult it will be. On the Ancient Path of Stars, no one has reached the top of the ninth level. The highest record is the one with the undying tyrant body, who reached the seventh level.” Blue introduced.","“If you want to get the clearance voucher for the Blood Sword, you only need to pass the first three levels. Do you understand my explanation?”","“Understood.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and no longer hesitated. after taking a deep breath, he strode toward the God Refining Tower.","“Blood Sword, let me remind you not to force yourself in this God Refining Tower. Try to reach as many levels as you can and don’t make things difficult for yourself. Over the years, quite a few Ultimate Rulers have died in the God Refining Tower.","“Finally, let me remind you that while it is dangerous inside the God Refining Tower, it is also a good fortune. Blue looked at Jian Wushuang’s back and said meaningfully.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks and fell into deep thought.","“Many thanks!”","Jian Wushuang thanked him and in the next moment, he walked into the God Refining Tower.","...","The first level of the God Refining Tower was a huge black space. It was surrounded by darkness.","Roarrrr!","The roars of beasts came from the void.","Then, many monsters with sharp horns on their heads and four legs on the ground walked out of the void.","Their eyes were bloodshot as they bared their teeth at Jian Wushuang, with stinky saliva dripping from the corners of their mouths.","“Yuan siphoning beast?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He was familiar with the monster. He had seen many of them when he had left the Divine Beginning Realm and traveled the universe.","The soul-devouring beasts were also known as the universe’s scavengers. Wherever a Ruler died in the universe, they would appear. They lived by absorbing the divine power and aura of a Ruler that had yet to dissipate after their death.","In terms of individual strength, these Yuan siphoning beasts were not even comparable to ordinary first-stage Rulers. However, when they grouped together, even ordinary Ultimate Rulers would have to retreat.","Every 100,000 years, there would be news of Yuan siphoning beasts killing Ruler-level cultivators. They were notorious.","“Roar!”","Accompanied by a series of roars, countless energy-devouring beasts surged out of the void and filled the space.","They stared at Jian Wushuang with their hind legs rubbing against the ground as if they were impatient to tear Jian Wushuang apart!","Bang!","Finally, when the first soul-devouring beast leaped and bit at Jian Wushuang, countless soul-devouring beasts also moved!","“Clay chickens and pottery dogs.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glinted coldly and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his right hand. Then, he slashed out a sword light and instantly, hundreds of soul-devouring beasts were crushed into powder!","In an instant, a feast of killing began, like a flower blooming at dawn."]},{"number":4242,"title":"Chapter 4242 Challenging the Tower","paragraphs":["4242 Challenging the Tower","Peng peng peng!","Jian Wushuang swept the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand, and sharp sword essence kept exploding.","Every sword intent that exploded killed no less than a hundred Yuan siphoning beasts. Huge pits were blasted open in the dense horde of Yuan siphoning beasts!","However, after these beasts died, more emerged from the darkness and charged at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. To him, no matter how many of the soul-devouring beasts came, they would not pose any threat to him.","With the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand, killing these soul-devouring beasts was as easy as chopping melons and vegetables.","“I would like to see how many energy devouring beasts there are in this God Refining Tower.”","Jian Wushuang sat down with his legs crossed and closed his eyes. He used his divine power to control the Wuqi Divine Sword and it swept through the first level of the God Refining Tower.","The Wuqi Divine Sword slithered around Jian Wushuang like a spiritual snake. the cold sword light slashed down continuously, taking the life of the soul-devouring beast.","The massacre was so intense that the sky turned dark. No less than 100000 Yuan devouring beasts had died at Jian Wushuang’s hands.","In the God Refining Tower, it was as though there was no concept of time. after an unknown amount of time, the number of yuan devouring beasts on the first level started to decrease.","Whoosh!","With a flash of blood-red sword light, the Wuqi Divine Sword killed the last soul-devouring beast. Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and stood up.","“Come.”","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and clenched his fist. The Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","And the first level of the God Refining Tower was filled with sword Qi!","In the next moment, the sword Qi was completely absorbed by the God Refining Tower.","“Eh? What’s going on?”","Jian Wushuang frowned, but before he could think further, the scene changed again.","He was still surrounded by the dark void, but Jian Wushuang could feel that the place had become different.","The space here was more stable, and there were traces of rich nomological aura in the void.","Although this principles energy could not be compared to the river of enlightenment, it was several times more than the outside world.","Tap tap tap tap.","A sound came from the void again, but this sound was different from the roar of the yuan siphoning beast. It was as if someone was walking in an orderly manner in the dark.","“The first level has the yuan siphoning beasts. What’s the second level?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and looked at the void curiously.","He did not have to wait long.","A weirdo covered in bandages, holding a rotten broken sword, and only his eyes could be seen, suddenly condensed in the void.","A...two...three...","in just a few seconds, tens of thousands of bandaged swordsmen had gathered in the void.","These bandaged swordsmen were wrapped in old and yellow bandages. Even their heads were wrapped in layers of bandages, only revealing a pair of lifeless and numb eyes.","The rotten broken swords in their hands drooped under their bodies like walking corpses. They staggered toward Jian Wushuang.","“Oh? A swordsman without consciousness? This is interesting.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and tried to slash at the bandaged swordsman.","Clang!","A loud muffled sound was heard. The bandaged swordsman, who had been cut by Jian Wushuang, numbly raised the rotten broken sword in his hand to block.","However, the difference between Jian Wushuang and the bandaged swordsman was too great. The bandaged swordsman was cut into pieces in less than a breath’s time. The sword light that Jian Wushuang casually slashed out directly cut a 1000-foot-long blood path in the group of bandaged swordsmen before it stopped and disappeared.","Jian Wushuang swung his sword a few more times and found that there was no difference from before. He shook his head in disappointment, “This bandaged swordsman is too weak. He’s only slightly stronger than the energy-devouring beast.”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang no longer had the mood to observe. He released the Wuqi Divine Sword and let it kill the bandaged swordsmen.","Clang clang clang!","The sound of swords clashing rang out as the bandaged swordsmen raised the decayed broken swords in their hands to block. However, before they could really block, the Wuqi Divine Sword was like a killing machine, quickly piercing through them.","The powerful and sharp sword intent directly blew up these already rotten swordsmen into dust.","It did not take long before the bandaged swordsmen were all killed by Wuqi Divine Sword.","Jian Wushuang opened his right hand and the Wuqi Divine Sword shot back into his hand.","“It was absorbed again?”","Jian Wushuang frowned. He could feel that the remaining sword essence on the Wuqi Divine Sword was absorbed by the surrounding void again.","“What’s going on? Or perhaps, what is this God Refining Tower trying to do?”","Jian Wushuang was lost in thought. From the first level of sword Qi to the second level of sword essence, Jian Wushuang had an illusion that the sword Qi and sword essence he was absorbing would affect their training in the God-refining area.","A moment later, the scene in front of Jian Wushuang changed again. He knew that he had reached the third level.","As long as he passed the third level, he would be able to obtain the clearance voucher to enter the eight cities.","...","...","At the same time, in the Tenth City.","Buzz! Buzz!","Two loud bell chimes suddenly sounded in the sky above the Tenth City.","The sound of the bell was filled with an ancient and vast feeling, giving people a feeling that it came from ancient times.","When they heard the two bells, all the Ultimate Rulers in the tenth city raised their heads in unison.","Someone is challenging the God Refining Tower!","The two bell chimes mean that the person who challenged the tower has already passed two levels and reached the third level!","They were all discussing.","However, there was no change in their expressions. after saying those words, they lowered their heads again. in the tenth city, they had seen many people who had passed through the two levels of the God Refining Tower. Thus, there was nothing to be surprised about.","Only a small number of people had a look of interest in their eyes as they headed toward the God Refining Tower.","Outside the God Refining Tower.","‘Blue’ did not leave. Instead, he crossed his arms and raised his head to look at the God Refining Tower.","Buzz! Buzz!","Two bell chimes came from the God Refining Tower. ‘Blue’ exclaimed when he saw this and said, “The two bell chimes came out almost at the same time. It seems that Blood Sword’s speed in breaking through the tower is very fast.”","At some point in time, Ruler Hao Jin had also arrived outside the God Refining Tower. When he heard Blue’s mumbling, a hint of pride appeared on his face. He puffed out his chest and chuckled. Lord Blue, our Lord Blood Sword is the one who personally killed Heavenly Snake Playboy. It is naturally not a problem for him to pass the first three levels of the God Refining Tower.","‘Blue’ looked at him indifferently and did not reply. instead, he continued to mutter to himself, “I remember that Heavenly Snake Playboy seemed to have reached the fifth level and was unable to go any further. I wonder how many levels this Blood Sword can reach.","After ‘Blue’ finished speaking, he continued to look up at the God Refining Tower with a pensive look in his eyes."]},{"number":4243,"title":"Chapter 4243 An Expert of the Sword","paragraphs":["4243 An Expert of the Sword","Ka-chak.","In the second level of the God Refining Tower, the surrounding void was constantly being shattered. Immediately after, the field of vision in front of Jian Wushuang changed. The intense light made him close his eyes.","When he opened his eyes again, he was already in a huge arena. The arena was still surrounded by endless darkness.","“There’s almost no time interval between the first and second levels. However, I can clearly feel the time interval between the second and third levels getting longer.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he pondered.","!!","He could vaguely sense that there seemed to be some laws that could be followed within the God Refining Tower.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked around. He saw a huge stone sculpture standing in the center of the ring.","The stone statue was tall and sturdy, with a bare upper body, and it held a huge white sword in its hand.","Most importantly, this stone statue didn’t have a head.","“What kind of monster is it this time?”","Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to attack. instead, he looked at the stone sculpture with interest.","Ka-chak.","Suddenly, the entire third level of the God Refining Tower started to shake violently.","The stone statue of the headless swordsman also began to shake, and pieces of soil began to fall off.","Bang!","Finally, there was a loud explosion, and all the rocks on the headless swordsman’s body were blown away!","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s face was filled with interest again.","The soul-devouring beasts on the first level had no thoughts and only knew how to kill. The second level’s bandaged swordsmen were like puppets. Although they still had no thoughts, they knew how to use weapons and even counterattack.","The headless swordsman in front of him could even have a short conversation.","“Unparalleled power!”","“I am the law enforcer of the great ring star field, the fallen commander of the cross sword army!”","“But you, are you here to challenge my authority?”","The headless swordsman repeated in a low voice when he saw that Jian Wushuang did not respond.","“You only know how to repeat these three sentences?”","Jian Wushuang frowned and casually slashed out a sword light!","Whoosh!","The headless swordsman let out an angry roar and raised the door-sized white sword in his hand to block!","Clang!","A loud sound of metal clashing rang out. The headless swordsman took three steps back. The Wuqi Divine Sword struck the White sword and a long string of sparks appeared.","“Oh? He blocked it?”","This time, Jian Wushuang was a little moved. One should know that even though he had just casually slashed out, it was enough to kill an ordinary Ultimate Ruler!","The energy-devouring beast from the first layer and the bandaged swordsman from the second layer could not withstand this attack.","“You are offending the dignity of the army commander of the crusader army!”","The headless swordsman growled and stomped his feet on the ground before he shot into the sky!","“Go to hell! This is the punishment for offending the regimental commander!”","The headless swordsman roared in anger. He grabbed the hilt of the White sword with both hands and slashed at Jian Wushuang!","Wisps of white smoke began to rise from the sword!","Then...it was the embodiment of the laws of the universe being integrated into sword techniques!","“Interesting.”","Jian Wushuang twitched the corner of his mouth. He was not in a hurry to use his great super power to kill the headless swordsman.","Similarly, Jian Wushuang wielded the Wuqi Divine Sword. Waves of dense universe principles were integrated into the sword technique. Then, he performed the simplest basic sword technique and attacked the headless swordsman.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","In an instant, the two exchanged hundreds of moves.","“Although this headless swordsman knows how to use the laws of the universe, it’s only the simplest use of the laws of the universe. There’s nothing worth redeeming about it.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and did not waste any more time. In a flash, he appeared behind the headless swordsman and slashed down with the Wuqi Divine Sword. The sharp sword essence completely killed the headless swordsman!","The headless swordsman crumbled into dust in an instant. Jian Wushuang frowned again. He felt that this time, not only his sword essence and divine power were absorbed by the surrounding void, but even a few traces of his universe law were also absorbed by the surrounding void after killing the headless swordsman.","Zi zi zi.","In the void, it was suddenly pulled open and a huge door appeared. Through this door, one could see the world outside the God Refining Tower.","At the same time, a token with the words ‘starry sky’ appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. now that he had passed the third level of the God Refining Tower, the starry sky token should be the pass document to enter the last eight cities. As for the void gate, it should lead to the outside of the God Refining Tower.","Jian Wushuang flipped his right hand and the universal token flew into his hand.","Jian Wushuang hesitated. He did not choose to leave, but sat down cross-legged.","He had a faint feeling that there might be an opportunity waiting for him in the God Refining Tower.","Jian Wushuang slowly closed his eyes.","....","Outside the God Refining Tower, the third bell rang.","“You’ve also passed the third level.”","Blue’s entire face was covered by a veil, only revealing a pair of beautiful eyes, which flashed with a touch of surprise.","When the third bell rang out, many Ultimate Rulers gathered in the Tenth City.","“Lord Blue!”","“We pay our respects to Lord Blue!”","These final realm cultivators first greeted Blue before raising their heads to look at the God Refining Tower. They started discussing, “Who cleared the third level of the God Refining Tower?”","“I heard that it’s the Blood Sword who just entered the Tenth City.”","“Blood Sword? That’s not surprising. He was able to kill Heavenly Snake Playboy, so the first three levels of the God Refining Tower naturally can’t pose any threat to him.”","“I just don’t know if the Blood Sword will choose to continue after passing through the Third City, or if it will give up and enter the last eight cities with the pass document.”","“It’s hard to say. The higher we go in the God Refining Tower, the more difficult it will be. It’s very likely that we will fail at the last step.”","“I wonder what kind of trial the Blood Sword will encounter in the God refinement tower. After all, the contents of the trial simulated in the God refinement tower will be different for everyone according to their cultivation technique, secret technique, laws, and so on.”","“Let’s continue watching.”","After the group of Ultimate Rulers discussed for a while, they stopped talking. Instead, their eyes flickered as they looked up at the God Refining Tower.","...","Within the God Refining Tower.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and the scene changed. The fourth level...they had arrived.","A wandering swordsman with thick black hair tied back and a sword at his waist was standing on the fourth floor.","“I am the gale swordsman who is wandering in the universe. Are you here to ask me for advice on the sword principle of gale?” The wandering swordsman looked at Jian Wushuang and said indifferently.","“Another expert in the way of the sword?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up. Apart from the soul-devouring beast on the first floor, the bandaged swordsman on the second floor, the headless swordsman on the third floor, and the man who called himself gale swordsman were all swordsmen.","Within the God Refining Tower...it was strange."]},{"number":4244,"title":"Chapter 4244 Sword Principle of Gale","paragraphs":["4244 Sword Principle of Gale","“You, are you here to ask me for advice on the gale sword principle?” The Gale Swordsman looked at Jian Wushuang again and said.","Just as Jian Wushuang thought that this Gale Swordsman was like the headless swordsman on the previous floor, who could only repeat those few lines, the Gale Swordsman spoke.","“If you’re not here to learn the sword principle of Gale, please don’t disturb my sleep. If you’re here to learn the sword principle of Gale, now is the time. Hold your sword tightly and be ready to die at any time!”","Jian Wushuang could not help but raise his eyebrows slowly.","!!","“This is really interesting.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself with a strange expression. Then, he took a step forward and charged at the Gale Swordsman!","“But you’re too noisy!”","Bang!","A sword light suddenly slashed out from the Wuqi Divine Sword and slashed at the Gale Swordsman.","“Your speed is too slow in front of me.”","The Gale Swordsman looked at Jian Wushuang’s sword and immediately stepped forward to avoid the sword light. At the same time, he quickly stabbed at Jian Wushuang with the nine heavens dark steel sword in his hand!","“I will let you know the true essence of the sword principle of Gale!”","The sword was extremely fast. Jian Wushuang felt that the Gale Swordsman in front of him seemed to know the form displacement technique. With just one step, he swept in front of him, leaving an afterimage in the void.","“Your speed is not bad.”","Jian Wushuang gasped in admiration. He pulled up the Wuqi Divine Sword in his right hand and blocked the fierce stab.","Clang!","Suddenly, a loud sound of metal clashing was heard. The nine heavens dark steel sword in the Gale Swordsman’s hand stabbed into the Wuqi Divine Sword, and a long string of sparks appeared.","Jian Wushuang flicked his right hand and forced the Gale Swordsman to retreat.","The Gale Swordsman was sent flying backward. Then, he stomped on the ground with his right foot again and charged toward Jian Wushuang.","“Listen up. The true essence of the sword principle of Gale is the speed of killing people without them noticing.”","Bang!","Suddenly, a whirlwind appeared under the Gale Swordsman’s feet. The Gale Swordsman stepped on the ground with his right foot, and his speed increased again.","“Feel the power of the wind!”","“Secret skill, Nine Gale Slashes!”","BOOM!","In an instant, countless divine power gathered on the nine heavens dark steel sword in the Gale Swordsman’s hand. Sword Qi shot out like wind blades, densely packed and uncountable!","In the end, the sword Qi interwove together and formed nine sword tornadoes that pierced through heaven and earth!","The moment these nine sword tornadoes appeared, the entire fourth level of the God Refining Tower let out an earth-shaking sound.","The Gale Swordsman pointed his divine sword at Jian Wushuang and said indifferently, “This is my Gale Sword Dao!”","Bang!","Suddenly, the nine sword blades flew toward Jian Wushuang!","“Good!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with battle intent and he was really interested.","“Split open the sky!”","Whoosh!","In an instant, a vast and vigorous divine power condensed on the Wuqi Divine Sword. The Wuqi Divine Sword immediately let out a cry of a God, a demon, and a low chant of a Buddha.","A ray of sky-opening sword energy slashed out and slashed at the nine sword blades!","BOOM!","A loud sound was heard. The heaven-opening sword light was poignant to the extreme. It crushed over directly and broke the nine tornadoes with destructive power. Then, it locked onto the Gale Swordsman again and slashed at him fiercely!","In the face of this sword strike that could split the heavens and earth, the Gale Swordsman’s long hair that was tied behind his head was blown up. His expression was calm as he said, “Congratulations on completing the challenge. My mission is complete. Enjoy my Gale sword principle!”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, the sky-opening sword light struck the Gale Swordsman’s body. A powerful and sharp sword intent burst out, directly crushing the Gale Swordsman into powder.","However, the ending this time was somewhat different from before.","At the place where the Gale Swordsman had disappeared, a black line appeared and then shot toward Jian Wushuang’s forehead.","In the next moment, the black lines entered between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows. Jian Wushuang suddenly felt that his comprehension of the sword principle of Gale emerged in his mind.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. He sat down with his legs crossed and carefully comprehended the sword principle of Gale that appeared in his mind.","After a while.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and looked down at his palm.","A small whirlwind of sword Qi condensed in his palm.","“Is this what Blue meant by ‘Danger, but also opportunity’?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. Although the sword principle of Gale was not of much use to him, it could help him comprehend the origin of sword principle.","Whether it was the sword principle of Gale or other sword principles, they all belonged to the power of the origin of sword principle. Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the third origin of sword principle had reached a bottleneck.","These sword principles were perfect for Jian Wushuang to absorb and use to break through to the third stage of sword principle origin.","“As expected, some of the power of splitting open the sky has also been absorbed by the surrounding void.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes, but he was too lazy to think about the reason. He waited quietly for the arrival of the fifth level.","...","Outside the God Refining Tower.","As the fourth bell rang, almost everyone in the tenth city, including the Ultimate Rulers, who were not in seclusion, had a change in expression. They all came to the God Refining Tower.","“The fourth floor is cleared! We’re about to reach the fifth level!”","“The Blood Sword is so fast!”","From the third level onwards, every level in the God Refining Tower will be harder to pass. However, correspondingly, the opportunities that one can obtain will also be greater.","The trials that begin after the third level are impossible to deal with unless one is the best among the Ultimate Rulers. It seems that the combat power of this Blood Sword is not exaggerated. It really has the power to kill Heavenly Snake Playboy.","“I just don’t know if Jian Wushuang can pass the fifth level. The fifth level is a barrier.”","The Ultimate Rulers all said in low voices.","As for Lord Blue, he was looking at the God Refining Tower without saying a word.","Not long after.","Weng!","The fifth bell rang!","After the bell rang, it exploded in the sky above the Tenth City and reverberated back and forth. Everyone present was shocked once again!","This time, no one in the entire Tenth City could remain calm. They all went outside the God Refining Tower to take a look to see who had the ability to pass five levels of the Divine Tower in a single day!","“He’s also passed the fifth level!!!”","“I remember that Heavenly Snake Playboy only made it to the fifth level!”","“The fifth level! Even among the elite cultivators in the last eight cities, only a small number of them have passed!”","“I heard that the Blood Sword is only a fifth stage Ruler. It’s truly impressive that it could reach this stage!”","“If the Blood Sword can break through to become an Ultimate Ruler, the last eight cities will no longer be nine overlords, but ten!”","“I just don’t know how far the Blood Sword can go?”"]},{"number":4245,"title":"Chapter 4245 Feeling the Power of God","paragraphs":["4245 Feeling the Power of God","As hurried discussions broke out, Ruler Hao Jin raised his head, a hint of pride on his face.","The current him felt a greater sense of achievement when he heard others praise the Blood Sword than when he heard them praise himself.","On the sixth level of the God Refining Tower.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was grave and he was panting slightly. he did not look relaxed at all.","!!","The trial on the fifth level of the God Refining Tower was for a Sword Saint expert who had comprehended the tyrant’s sword path from ancient times. His strength was extremely powerful. Even for him, he had to go through a fierce battle before he could kill him with extreme difficulty with the Sundering Stars sword.","Of course, after killing the Ancient Sword Saint, Jian Wushuang also gained a lot. He gained all the comprehension of the ancient sword saint’s sword principle.","Jian Wushuang could feel that his comprehension of the third level of the origin of sword essence was like a bucket that was not filled with water. As he absorbed the comprehension of the sword principle of Gale Swordsman and the ancient sword Saint, it gradually became complete and spotless.","He only needed to absorb the origin comprehension of a sword expert’s sword Dao, and he would be able to break through the third level of the sword Dao origin in the universe and reach the fourth level!","At that time, his offensive power and swordsmanship divine arts would have a tremendous change again!","As he was thinking, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and looked around.","This was the sixth floor.","The sixth level was a chaotic void. The law energy here was comparable to the Dao Comprehension River.","In the void and chaos, there was only a huge painting hanging.","In the huge painting, there was a figure wearing silver armor and holding a long sword. he looked like a guardian knight and a divine general of the ancient heavenly court.","The figure’s face was covered in silver armor, and his appearance could not be seen clearly. Only a pair of tightly shut eyes were exposed.","His figure was straight and he was filled with a dignified and inviolable aura.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a touch of coldness.","With just a glance, he could feel the threat that the silver-armored figure gave him.","The next moment.","“Mortal, do you want to challenge god’s might?”","A voice like Rolling Thunder came from the giant painting.","Then, the divine general in silver armor in the portrait suddenly opened his eyes.","Two extremely sharp beams of light burst out from his eyes.","Jian Wushuang did not reply. Instead, he took a deep breath and raised the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand.","This sword could not be avoided.","Ka-chak.","Then, a crack appeared in the middle of the portrait. The divine general in silver armor grabbed the crack with both hands and walked out.","An earth-shaking pressure suddenly descended on the entire area!","Under this pressure, the entire chaotic world seemed to tremble.","“Mortal, I am the first divine general under God Emperor daoless from 300 chaos cycles ago, Fei Hong. Countless Ultimate Rulers have died by my hands. Are you ready to pay with your life to challenge my dignity?” The flying swan divine sword was expressionless. it looked at Jian Wushuang with an oppressive gaze.","“You talk too much.”","Jian Wushuang snorted coldly and immediately controlled the Wuqi Divine Sword, turning into a sword light that charged at Divine General Fei Hong.","“My sword Dao is only for killing. Feel the power of God!”","When Divine General Fei Hong saw this, he suddenly drew the divine sword in his hand. A bloody aura instantly emanated from the divine sword in his hand!","“Split open the sky!”","Jian Wushuang’s black hair flew in the wind as he shouted coldly. The heaven-opening sword light in his hand slashed down at Divine General Fei Hong!","“A puny power.”","Divine General Fei Hong shook his head nonchalantly as he casually swung his sword at the heaven-opening sword ray!","This sword was just a casual strike, but it was filled with a sense of oppression and slaughter. It was as if there was an invisible force that wanted to drag people into a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood.","Bang!","With a loud explosion, the ever-victorious heaven-opening sword ray was split apart by a casual swing of Divine General Fei Hong’s hand.","“He’s very strong.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. With just a single exchange, he could feel that Divine General Fei Hong’s fighting power was definitely at the fighting power of an unrivaled Ruler. He was much stronger than anyone he had met in the God Refining Tower.","“The laws of the universe, the power of will!”","At that moment, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate anymore. He immediately used the ten times power of will that the universe had given him and the divine power in his body increased by ten times!","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice.","“Sundering Stars!”","The 1,000-foot sword rainbow instantly condensed. Jian Wushuang held the 1000-foot sword rainbow in his hand and slashed down at the flying swan divine sword like a peerless sword God!","This sword was enough to destroy a star.","“Oh? This sword strike is indeed remarkable.”","Divine General Fei Hong raised an eyebrow as a look of surprise flashed through his eyes.","Then, he shook his head and said, “However, that’s all there is to it.”","With that, Divine General Fei Hong’s divine sword was covered in blood as it slashed down at the sword rainbow!","The slaughter Sword Dao is indomitable. It’s the invincible sword Dao!","A blood dragon rushed out of the divine sword in Divine General Fei Hong’s hand, roaring and howling. It opened its mouth and bit the sword rainbow.","A burst of extremely overbearing sword essence immediately shot out from the blood dragon, trying to suppress the sword rainbow.","Ka ka ka!","“Ka ka ka!”","In an instant, the blood dragon and the thousand-foot sword rainbow clashed. The two sword intents kept clashing and intertwining, making a muffled sound that shattered the void.","It seems that Divine General Fei Hong’s comprehension of sword Dao origin has also reached stage three top class!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and thoughts flashed through his mind.","If Jian Wushuang could defeat the flying swan divine sword and obtain his comprehension of the origin of sword principle, he was confident that even if he could not break through to the fourth level of the origin of sword principle immediately, it would be a matter of time.","All of a sudden, Divine General Fei Hong, who had been extremely difficult to deal with, had become a hot commodity in Jian Wushuang’s eyes to improve his comprehension of sword principle.","At that moment, a decisive look flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. His divine power, which was more than thirteen thousand times stronger, burst out and the universe law was also integrated into his swordsmanship. Without any hesitation, he attacked the flying swan divine sword.","Innate divine power, original universe!","At the same time, Jian Wushuang activated the original universe, which could greatly reduce the opponent’s power. The entire sixth level of the God Refining Tower was filled with suppression of Divine General Fei Hong.","“Oh? Mortal, I have to admit that you do have the qualifications to challenge me.”","Divine General Fei Hong’s eyes narrowed and he no longer held back. His majestic and overbearing divine power and unfathomable laws of the universe burst forth.","His aura started to surge!","“Mortal, feel the power of god!!!”","BOOM!","A sword Dao battle that transcended space and time had begun."]},{"number":4246,"title":"Chapter 4246 Fei Hong (Part One)","paragraphs":["4246 Fei Hong (Part One)","Bang!","“Bang! Bang!”","In the void and chaos of the sixth level, Divine General Fei Hong and Jian Wushuang turned into two shocking sword radiances, one silver and one black. They flew around and collided with each other continuously.","The silver-winged divine sword in Divine General Fei Hong’s hand and the Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand exchanged thousands of blows in a short period of time. the vast and vigorous divine power exploded in the void.","“Split open the sky!”","“Sundering Stars!”","Jian Wushuang swiped his right hand and the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand trembled thousands of times in an instant. The two moves of sky-opening and star slashing were executed from the Wuqi Divine Sword one after another and blasted toward Divine General Fei Hong!","“Divine might!”","“God’s wrath!”","The flying swan divine sword also shouted coldly. The divine light in the eyes that were only exposed under the silver mask suddenly increased by three inches!","A pair of silver wings appeared behind him, and the silver-winged sword in his hand was instantly covered in a thick blood-red color. A destructive power shot out from the sword in his hand, carrying a terrifying aura.","“Slash!”","At once, Divine General Fei Hong leaped high into the air. The silver-winged divine sword in his hand turned into a monstrous blood dragon that slashed down at Jian Wushuang!","Peng peng peng!","The two of them retreated at the same time, their god bodies shaking.","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at his right hand. The area between his thumb and forefinger felt numb.","In the next moment, he raised his head and looked at Divine General Fei Hong with a grave look in his eyes.","This was the only person who did not lose to him in sword Dao after he came to the depths of the universe.","“Mortal, I have to admit that you have the ability to compete with gods. If you were in my era, you would be a True God of sword Dao that wasn’t weaker than me.” Divine General Fei Hong said indifferently with a solemn expression.","“You’re noisy.”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless and then he took a deep breath.","Innate divine ability, life intimidation!!","Boom!","An intimidating power from the deepest part of the soul suddenly descended on the scene. Under this power, it was as if time had fallen into a swamp and all living things had to submit to it. They knelt in front of Jian Wushuang and bowed their heads.","“This?”","Divine General Fei Hong’s expression changed instantly. Just as he was about to flare up, he felt as if millions of mountains were pressing down on him. He could not move at all and could not help but want to kneel down in front of Jian Wushuang.","“You dare to make a God submit to you?” He spat out these words with difficulty.","Jian Wushuang did not answer. Instead, his eyes flashed and he immediately charged at Divine General Fei Hong.","Whoosh!","Without any hindrance, Jian Wushuang’s Wuqi Divine Sword directly stabbed into Divine General Fei Hong’s chest. Then, a sharp sword essence burst out.","“Mortal, enjoy my Slaughter Sword Dao.”","Divine General Fei Hong looked at Jian Wushuang deeply before his divine body crumbled and he was ground into dust by the sharp sword essence.","Black lines appeared where the flying swan divine sword had disappeared and shot toward the space between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","Jian Wushuang did not resist. He sat down cross-legged and slowly closed his eyes.","A loud voice resounded in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“I, Divine General Fei Hong, the divine sword in my hand was born for slaughter!”","BOOM!","In an instant, a large amount of Divine General Fei Hong’s comprehension of sword principle, mixed with his memories, was poured into Jian Wushuang’s mind.","The world in front of Jian Wushuang started to change.","It was as if he had traveled through space and time to 500 chaos cycles ago. Jian Wushuang saw a young man of seven or eight years old with delicate features. He was holding a wooden sword and dancing around at the foot of a hill.","This was the young Divine General Fei Hong.","“Memory inheritance?”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and then slowly closed his eyes, immersing himself in the memories that belonged to Fei Hong.","...","The sun was high in the sky, and the young man’s sweat was pouring down like rain. His white clothes were completely drenched in sweat.","However, he did not give up. His eyes were filled with determination. He gritted his teeth and kept waving the wooden sword in his hand.","Again and again, the overlapping sword shadows intertwined with each other, accompanied by the heavy breathing of the youth and the chirping of cicadas in the summer.","“I, Fei Hong, will definitely become the most powerful swordsman in the world!”","The sun gradually set, and under the afterglow of the setting sun, a young man’s childish and ambitious words could be heard.","“Xiao Fei, it’s almost time to come back and eat. Your father specially bought a big black carp from the town.”","At the bottom of the hill, smoke rose in spirals as a peasant woman carried a hoe and wiped the sweat off her forehead.","“Mother, I’m coming!”","Fei Hong quickly hid the wooden sword in his hand, grabbed the black yak, and ran down the hill.","This year, Fei Hong was eight years old.","...","Time passed quickly.","This year, Fei Hong was 19 years old.","That year, the only sect in the nearby town, the Green Mountain Sword Sect, was recruiting disciples.","Fei Hong refused his parents’ wish to send him to the capital to take the imperial examination. He asked Blacksmith Wang in the village to forge a rough and ugly iron sword for him, and then sneaked out of the village and came to the gate of the Green Mountain Sword Sect.","He was mixed in with a group of young people who had also come to learn from him, and he was a little nervous.","It was said that the people living on the Green Mountain Sword Sect were all legendary Immortals, who could ride their flying swords and ride the wind for thousands of miles. They were very powerful.","As for him, he was just a cowherd boy from a farmer’s village. He had only learned a few sword moves in a daze and was really not worthy of being on the stage.","After a long wait, it was finally the Fei Hong test’s turn!","He gathered his courage and slowly walked up under the serious gaze of the old man in charge of the assessment.","“Sword soul awakening! The body of the sword spirit!”","However, the whole Green Mountain Sect was shocked when the results of the examination were announced.","Fei Hong, who had been a cowherd boy in a farmer’s house, had become the most dazzling new star in the entire Green Mountain Sect! There was no other!","He had joined the Green Mountain Sect as a disciple of the most powerful Grand Elder, and countless resources had been poured into him.","...","Time passed by, and time was merciless.","Spring, summer, autumn, and winter kept on moving.","In the blink of an eye, ten years had passed.","The young and nervous cowherd boy had become the big brother of the Green Mountain Sect, and the most dazzling star in the entire Green Mountain Sect!","At the moment, Fei Hong was twenty-nine years old. He was high-spirited, confident, and handsome. Many pretty young girls of the Green Mountain Sect had fallen head over heels for him.","Just as he was immersed in the harmonious and peaceful life of the sect...","A change suddenly occurred!","Once, when he was out on a sect mission, he had offended the young sect master of the strongest sect in this region, the purgatory sword sect. he had been killed in anger!","In an instant, a great disaster was imminent!","The Green Mountain Sect, where he had been a disciple, had been wiped out. The kind and gentle elders of the sect, as well as the lively and playful junior sisters and brothers, had all died in front of him.","He could only watch helplessly as this happened, unable to put up any resistance.","For the first time, he realized how weak he was. He realized that he was just an insignificant ant in this world.","At last, with the help of the sect master of the Green Mountain Sect, Fei Hong managed to escape and was sent out of the Green Mountain Sect."]},{"number":4247,"title":"Chapter 4247 Fei Hong (Part Two)","paragraphs":["4247 Fei Hong (Part Two)","The blow this time made Fei Hong feel disheartened. He was like a stray dog, wandering around aimlessly.","All of a sudden, he wanted to go home and see his old parents, whom he had not seen in ten years.","However, when he returned home, the scene in front of him made him break down!","Blood flowed like a river, and corpses covered the land!","All the people in the small village had been slaughtered by the people from the Purgatory Sword Sect!","His parents’ bodies were left on the side of the road, almost eaten by the wild dogs in the mountains, and they emitted a pungent smell.","At this moment, Fei Hong’s tense mind finally broke. He could not hold it in anymore and burst into tears.","He kneeled in front of his parents’ bodies, dug a hole with both hands, and shakily buried his parents’ bodies in it, one layer of yellow soil after another.","On this day, it rained heavily.","In the midst of the lightning and thunder, Fei Hong knelt in front of the grave, his hair turning white overnight.","He knelt in front of his parents ‘grave for three days and three nights.","The high-spirited eldest brother disappeared and turned into a wild man with red eyes, dry lips, and messy white hair.","This time, he raised the sword in his hand.","Just like when he was a teenager, he practiced his swordsmanship at the foot of the hill. The divine sword in his hand danced wildly in the rainy night.","The electric fan roared and thunder rumbled.","On this day, Fei Hong comprehended the slaughter sword Dao!","In the end, Fei Hong kowtowed three times in front of his parents’ grave and left with his sword.","...","Time passed, and a hundred years had passed.","In the past hundred years, Fei Hong had tested his sword all over the world, challenging all kinds of sword experts.","He had traveled all over the mountains and rivers, and his sword cultivation was improving rapidly!","Whether it was the well-known sword experts or the new sword geniuses, they all died under Fei Hong’s sword.","Not a single person survived Fei Hong’s attack.","Finally, one day, Fei Hong ascended three realms in a row and became one of the top experts in the small world.","He understood that it was time for revenge.","“Fei Hong, raise your sword and observe the ceremony of the Purgatory Sword Sect!”","On this day, Fei Hong stepped on the divine sword, and the sword Qi swept across 30000 miles, turning into a peerless sword rainbow that pierced through the sun and the moon. He flew to the sky above the Purgatory Sword Sect and said calmly, “On this day, the light of the sword shone across all nineteen continents. In this small world, countless people raised their heads and looked up at this unparalleled sword immortal who could slash the galaxy.”","“Kill!”","Countless sword experts rushed out of the Purgatory Sword Sect!","The massacre had begun.","In this battle, the sun and moon lost their light, the land sank, and the entire sky was replaced by blood.","No words could be used to describe the intensity of this battle.","Fei Hong’s expression was indifferent. The divine sword in his hand ruthlessly reaped lives one after another.","In the Purgatory Sword Sect, no one could escape Fei Hong’s slaughter, be it an old man who was at the end of his life or a young man who had just joined the sect.","Anguished wails, pleas for mercy, and cries rang out continuously in the Purgatory Sword Sect.","However, no one could move Fei Hong’s frozen heart.","The flowers that were watered with blood bloomed with their beauty.","On this day, it rained blood in the Purgatory Sword Sect.","That day, the entire Purgatory Sword Sect was slaughtered!","On this day, the Purgatory Sword Sect would no longer exist in the world!","With all the knots in Fei Hong’s heart removed, the slaughter sword doctrine had reached its completion!","When he left the Purgatory Sword Sect, the mountains of corpses and seas of blood became his background.","Suddenly, Fei Hong was confused.","In this world, he had no family, no friends, and even his enemies had disappeared.","He suddenly did not know where he should go.","He lowered his head to look at the blood-stained sword in his hand, and he understood.","In the past, as time passed, the only thing he could rely on was the sword in his hand.","He, Fei Hong, would live for the sword dao and only for killing!","...","In the remaining years, Jian Wushuang watched Fei Hong start his invincible years.","He watched as Fei Hong fought back in every battle, turning the tides and stepping into the peak of the myriad world!","He watched as Fei Hong became famous, suppressed the nine heavens and ten lands, grew up in slaughter, comprehended the slaughter sword principle, and broke through to the third level of sword principle!","He watched as Fei Hong stepped into the final Ruler realm and became an unrivaled Ruler of the world, opening up an era that belonged to him!","He saw how Emperor God Wu Dao conferred Fei Hong as the first divine general and bestowed him with the Divine Sword Silver Wing!","That day, the entire universe was shaken by it. The name of the first godly general of Fei Hong city spread across the starry sky. He was invincible!","...","The memories that belonged to Divine General Fei Hong gradually faded away. Jian Wushuang’s last image stopped at the moment when the Great Tribulation descended and Divine Sword Fei Hong fell.","Jian Wushuang had seen his ups and downs, from the cowherd boy in the farmer’s village to the high-spirited big brother of the Green Mountain sect to the famous Divine General Fei Hong in the universe. He had seen his ups and downs, from dejection to pride, and even his death.","In a short time, Jian Wushuang had read all about the legendary life of the Fei Hong Divine Sword.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes.","Two rays of light flashed across Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","As Divine General Fei Hong’s memories faded, Jian Wushuang felt that his comprehension of the third level of sword principle origin, which had been stuck, had suddenly changed.","The bucket that had been lacking a spoonful of water was finally filled with the slaughter Sword doctrine.","Jian Wushuang could clearly feel that he was only one step away from the fourth level of sword principle origin.","As long as he meditated quietly, he would be able to break through to the fourth level of the origin of sword principle.","In the sixth level of the God Refining Tower, a whirlpool suddenly appeared in the originally empty and chaotic sky.","Jian Wushuang knew that he would reach the seventh level of the God Refining Tower once he entered the whirlpool!","The 7th level was the highest record that countless geniuses had ever reached since the Ancient Path of Stars was opened!","Jian Wushuang stood up and looked up at the huge whirlpool in the sky with a determined look in his eyes.","The legend of Divine General Fei Hong had come to an end, but the legend that belonged to Jian Wushuang had just begun!","Bang!","Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot heavily and his body shot out, disappearing into the whirlpool.","...","At the same time, outside the God Refining Tower.","Buzz!","The melodious sound of a bell turned into rings of sound waves that rippled across the Tenth City.","At that moment, the entire Tenth City was in shock!","Everyone raised their heads and looked at the God Refining Tower. Their eyes were filled with extreme shock and disbelief.","“The seventh floor! The Blood Sword has reached the Seventh City!”","Since the Overlord reached the seventh level eight thousand years ago, no one has ever reached the seventh level!!","Blood Sword will become the second person to reach the top of the God Refining Tower’s seventh level after the Overlord!","“Set a new record! Starting from the seventh level, every step of the Blood Sword will create a new record!”","Countless people gasped for breath and gasped in admiration.","Even Lord Blue, one of the Nine Magnates, was shocked."]},{"number":4248,"title":"Chapter 4248 A New Legend","paragraphs":["4248 A New Legend","The entire city was shocked!","At that moment, all the people in the tenth city had gathered outside the God Refining Tower. They were a black mass as they stared at the God Refining Tower.","Legendary!","They were about to witness the rise of a legend!","Ruler Hao Jin was so excited that all the fat on his body trembled. He felt as though following the Blood Sword was the best decision he had ever made in his life!","He would be a witness to the legend!","Time slowly passed.","Jian Wushuang’s speed of breaking through the God Refining Tower had become slower than ever.","In the blink of an eye, three days had passed.","However, no one was impatient. They were all waiting to see if Jian Wushuang could create a legend.","“I remember the last time the Overlord was on the seventh floor, he stayed there for a hundred years, but he still didn’t succeed.”","“The God Refining Tower’s record up until now is the overlord and the Blood Sword reaching the seventh level. I wonder if the Blood Sword can break the record!”","“What do you guys think is inside the seventh floor? When the Overlord came out of the seventh floor, he didn’t talk about it at all.”","“Let’s wait for the Blood Sword to appear. Perhaps it will give us an answer.”","One year...","Two years...","Three years...","Jian Wushuang had been stuck on the seventh floor for ten years.","Just when everyone thought that Jian Wushuang would stay on the seventh level for a hundred years like the Overlord, a bell-like sound suddenly exploded in the sky above the Tenth City!","Boom!","The sound of the bell seemed to have traveled through the primeval universe. It carried an ancient aura and exploded in the minds of everyone in the Tenth City.","This was the first time the bell from the seventh level of the God Refining Tower had rung since the Ancient Path of Stars was opened!","It was as if it was announcing that the Blood Sword had become a new history for the God Refining Tower, and that the world was congratulating it!","“The seventh floor...you’ve passed!”","“The history of the Ancient Path of Stars will begin to be rewritten!”","Everyone in the Tenth City was dumbfounded.","Ruler Hao Jin could not help but let out a loud cry of excitement!","From now on, the Blood Sword will replace the Overlord and become the keeper of the new record in the God Refining Tower!","He will set a new benchmark for those who come to the God Refining Tower in the future!","“The Blood Sword will start a new chapter in history!”","Countless people stared at him and said with certainty.","Lord Blue’s eyes narrowed, her beautiful eyes shining with a strange light. It was impossible to tell what she was thinking.","Soon after, the eighth level of the God Refining Tower began.","Time flew by, and sixty years passed.","The eighth bell rang again!","This time, the tolling of the bell from the Eighth City could be heard throughout all 18 cities on the Ancient Path of Stars!","In the back eight cities of the starry sky, countless top geniuses raised their heads in unison, squinting at the gray sky with a touch of solemnity in their eyes.","They knew that soon, there would be a newcomer who was strong enough to be on par with them and break into the back eight cities!","At that time, perhaps the situation of the nine giants dominating the last eight cities would be broken.","And outside the God Refining Tower, it had already turned into a dead silence.","The thousands of people were all silent.","In the Tenth City, all the sounds disappeared, leaving only a strange dead silence.","They looked at the God Refining Tower in a daze. Their mouths were so wide open that an egg could be stuffed in. They had a dazed expression.","The next moment!","The Tenth City was in an uproar!","“The eighth floor!”","“God refinement realm level 9! The Blood Sword has already broken through to the eighth level and will soon reach the peak of the nine-level divine tower!”","“Rumor has it that in the ninth level of the God Refining Tower, there is a gift that was personally prepared by that lord! Tsk, tsk, but this is a gift personally prepared by that lord. I can’t imagine how precious it is!”","Countless people shouted.","“Blood Sword, number one in the God Refining Tower!” There were even people who shouted out such words in their excitement.","However, his words were immediately corrected.","“Let’s not talk about Lord Blue for now. The current Blood Sword is not only the number one person in the God Refining Tower, he is also the number one person in the top ten cities!!”","At that moment, everyone submitted to Jian Wushuang.","Even Lord Blue shook his head and muttered to himself after his eyes lit up, “Heavenly Snake died in his hands. It’s not an unjust death.”","Just as everyone was looking forward to Jian Wushuang reaching the top of the God Refining Tower.","The door of the God Refining Tower opened at this moment.","Jian Wushuang walked out of the God Refining Tower with his black hair scattered.","His steps stopped at the eighth floor.","“Did I fail the ninth level?”","“It seems so.”","The Ultimate Rulers of the Tenth City looked at each other.","“However, it’s already very powerful for the Blood Sword to reach the eighth level.”","“That’s right. Don’t forget that the Blood Sword is only a fifth stage great Ruler!”","In the next moment, they looked at Jian Wushuang with respect.","Ruler Hao Jin ran over hurriedly and hugged Jian Wushuang. He was so excited that he could not even speak properly.","“Lord, Lord Blood Sword, you’re too strong! It’s a blessing from my previous life that I, Hao Jin, can follow you!”","“You’re being too serious.”","Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","After saying that, Jian Wushuang turned to Lord Blue. He flipped his right hand and a token with the words ‘starry sky’ appeared in his hand. He smiled and said, “Blue, is this the clearance text?”","Lord Blue nodded and replied, “That’s right, this is the entry scroll, you can enter the last eight cities now.”","“Thank you,” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and replied.","“No need to thank me. You got this with your own strength.” Lord Blue waved his hand and replied without a care.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything else. He looked at Ruler Hao Jin and said, “Hao Jin, I’ll go to the last eight cities first. After you get the clearance voucher, you can enter the last eight cities and find me.”","The last eight cities were different from the top ten cities. In the top ten cities, as long as one was strong enough, Jian Wushuang could bring him to any level. However, in the last eight cities, one had to enter the God Refining Tower and obtain the pass document.","“Alright, Lord Blood Sword, I’ll be back soon.” Ruler Hao Jin puffed out his chest. For the first time, he felt boundless motivation surging through his body.","“Then, I hope we can meet again.”","Jian Wushuang smiled at him, then strode toward the entrance of the Tenth City.","Just as he was about to enter the passage, some Rulers of the Tenth City asked, “Sir Blood Sword, may I ask what kind of trial is on the seventh floor?”","Jian Wushuang stopped, thought for a while, and then replied indifferently, “It’s my own Dao.”","When everyone heard this, they could not help but be stunned.","His own dao?","Before they could ask any more questions, a white light gushed out and Jian Wushuang disappeared at the entrance of the Tenth City.","After a while, the white light gradually dissipated. Lord Blue looked at the entrance of the Tenth City, where Jian Wushuang had disappeared, and a meaningful look flashed in his eyes."]},{"number":4249,"title":"Chapter 4249 The Arrival of the Caged Dragon","paragraphs":["4249 The Arrival of the Caged Dragon","At the entrance of the Ancient Path of Stars.","A huge universe boat shot over from the distance.","On this universe boat, there was a flag with the words ‘great void’ written on it. It fluttered like a sail, making a loud sound as it suppressed the starry sky.","Then, the cabin door of universe boat opened, and a monster with a hunched waist and a back full of thorns walked out of universe boat.","!!","“This is the universe boat of the Great Void Divine Palace?”","“Yi, is this the person sent by the Great Void Divine Palace to the Ancient Path of Stars path?”","“It doesn’t look like much.”","“This time, the Great Void Divine Palace will probably be fine in the battle for the eight cities after the Ancient Path of Stars.”","Some of the Ultimate Rulers who spent most of their time at the entrance of the Ancient Path of Stars and loved to comment on the various major powers laughed and discussed.","However, before they could finish their words, their vision suddenly turned black, and then they felt a sharp pain!","Bang!","In the next moment, they stopped moving.","“It’s too noisy.”","Qiu Long shook his head and rushed over. With just one palm, he sent the right hand of the group of Ultimate Rulers flying back.","At the entrance of the Ancient Path of Stars, the many Ultimate Rulers saw this, and their eyes narrowed in fear.","He had killed the group of Ultimate Rulers without saying a word. What sort of person was this?","Qiu Long chuckled and took a step forward, his body instantly disappearing.","In the next moment, he appeared in front of the group of Ultimate Rulers.","“You, what do you want to do?” The hearts of the Omega Rulers trembled.","“Don’t be nervous.”","Qiu Long squeezed out a smile that he thought was kind and friendly. He put his hand on the shoulder of one of the Ultimate Rulers and asked, “I’m not going to eat you, why are you so nervous? I just want to ask you a question.”","The heart of the Ultimate Ruler with Qiu Long’s arm around his shoulder could not help but tremble, but he forced himself to remain calm and said, “What do you want to ask?”","Qiu Long smiled and flipped his right hand. A dark light mirror appeared in his hand.","He raised the dark light mirror and asked, “Have you seen this person before?”","“What is this?”","The Omega Ruler was startled. He stared at the black-robed, black-haired figure in the mirror, then said hesitantly, “I think I’ve seen this person before.”","“Oh? When did you see it?” Qiu Long raised his eyebrows.","The final Ruler nodded upon hearing this. He thought for a moment, then replied, “If my memory serves me right, this person came to the Ancient Path of Stars a hundred years ago. At that time, he even killed the two guards who were in charge of guarding the ancient path.”","“Where did he go now?” Qiu Long continued to ask.","The Ultimate Ruler shrugged his shoulders and replied, “Do you even need to ask? It’s naturally within the Ancient Path of Stars path.”","“Okay, I got it. Thank you so much.” Qiu Long replied with a smile.","When the Ultimate Ruler heard this, he could not help but completely relax.","It seemed that this person was not that hard to talk to.","“No need to thank me.” The Ultimate Ruler waved his hand and said in a carefree manner.","“No, I have to thank you. Therefore, I have decided to give you a gift.” Qiu Long lowered his head, and the corner of his mouth gradually curved into a strange arc.","“A present? What gift?” The eyes of the Ultimate Ruler lit up, and he instantly grew interested.","“For you...go to hell!”","Boom!","Qiu Long suddenly raised his head and a sinister smile appeared on his face.","He suddenly reached out with his right hand and grabbed the head of the Ultimate Ruler, lifting him up.","“Do you like this gift?”","Qiu Long grinned hideously with a deep voice, his eyes flashing with an extremely fierce light.","“No, don’t!!!” The Ultimate Ruler was utterly terrified.","However, before he could finish his words, his head had exploded like a watermelon!","Bang!","The final Ruler was instantly reduced to dust.","Qiu Long retracted his hand and looked at the several Ultimate Rulers who had been scared out of their wits. He patted their shoulders and squeezed out a smile that he thought was kind. He chuckled and said, “Why are you so nervous? I’m just passing by.”","After saying that, Qiu Long strode toward the entrance of the Ancient Path of Stars. A few breaths later, he disappeared into the entrance.","Seeing his back disappear, the many Ultimate Rulers finally let out a long sigh of relief.","...","The 11th city on the Ancient Path of Stars was also the first Dao city of the eight cities that followed.","After traveling through the darkness for a long time, Jian Wushuang’s field of vision gradually brightened.","An extremely desolate world with a dark sky appeared in front of him.","“This place...the last eight cities?”","Jian Wushuang looked around and saw that he had appeared on a square platform that was suspended in the air. Around the square platform, there were more than ten divine guards holding divine spears.","These divine guards were all dressed in different clothes and they did not seem to be from the same force. When they saw Jian Wushuang walking out of the passage, they immediately swarmed up.","“Your Excellency, we belong to the forces under the young emperor of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom. Would you like to join us?”","“Your Excellency, please join our Blood God!”","“Sir, we’re the people of the great prince of the great divine nation. We’re here to recruit talents. Would you consider joining us?”","“Your Excellency, how should I address you? In the God Refining Tower, how many levels did you pass?”","These divine guards all spoke at once.","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown and a look of deep thought flashed in his eyes.","He had long heard that the rules of the last eight cities were completely different from the top ten cities.","In the last eight cities, all the Ultimate Rulers, except for Lord Blue, who guarded the Tenth City, respected the Eight Magnates. Except for some experts who were extremely confident in their own strength, the others had to rely on the Eight Magnates to survive and form various forces under them.","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and replied indifferently, “Blood Sword has only passed the third level of the God Refining Tower.”","As it was his first time in the last eight cities, Jian Wushuang knew nothing about the rules there. He decided to join one of the forces temporarily to understand the situation.","In order to avoid being too high-profile and attracting attention, Jian Wushuang merely announced that he had cleared the first three levels of the God Refining Tower. After all, the first ten cities rarely communicated with the last eight cities. By the time his detailed news reached the last eight cities, it would be a long time later.","“He only cleared the third level of the God Refining Tower?”","Immediately, a hint of disappointment flashed in the eyes of the people in charge of recruitment from the various forces, and they gradually dispersed.","The expressions of the remaining forces were no longer as warm.","“You’re Sir Blood Sword, right? We are the Rulers of the great conqueror. would you consider joining our camp? What’s the matter?” A muscular and bearded Ultimate Ruler asked.","Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and nodded. “Sure.”","“Alright, Sir Blood Sword, then come with us. Haha...” The bearded Ultimate Ruler laughed heartily.","Jian Wushuang followed the bearded Ultimate Ruler and walked toward a pavilion in the distance."]},{"number":4250,"title":"Chapter 4250 Ruler Mountain Shaker","paragraphs":["4250 Ruler Mountain Shaker","Along the way, Jian Wushuang had learned that the bearded Ultimate Ruler, Ruler Mountain Shaker, was as powerful as an unrivaled Ruler. he was a well-known heaven’s favorite in the universe.","However, geniuses were everywhere in the latter eight cities. Ruler Mountain Shaker’s strength was inferior to the others, so he joined the Overlord and became one of the six leaders.","“Brother Blood Sword, since you’ve become the overlord’s subordinate, we’re brothers now. I’m sure you don’t know much about the back eight cities, so i’ll explain it to you.” Ruler Mountain Shaker said with a laugh.","“Then I’ll have to trouble you, Commander Mountain Shaker.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","!!","“Alright. First of all, the last eight cities are different from the first ten cities. The last eight cities are connected to each other, and as long as you have a pass scroll in your hand, you can go to any city without any restrictions. In other words, you can view the latter eight cities as a small world, while the eight cities are the eight great continents!”","“In the last eight cities, almost everyone will join a force because the fighting in the last eight cities is extremely fierce. One can die if they are not careful. If they only rely on fighting alone, it is almost impossible to gain a foothold in the last eight cities.” Commander Mountain Shaker said slowly.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and asked, “Commander Mountain Shaker, why are you talking about this battle?”","The commander smiled and continued, “Blood Sword, the battles in the last eight cities have been going on for a long time. For one thing, we’ve been living under the same sky, so there will always be some friction, which makes fighting inevitable. For another thing, the most important reason is the fight for The Investiture of the Gods!”","“The God Sealing Tablet?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with doubt. It was the first time he had heard of this name.","“Yes, the God Sealing Tablet is the most important thing in the eight cities! In the last eight cities, there are a total of 99 God Sealing Tablets, which represent the qualification to participate in the Great Clan Gathering. Only with the God Sealing Tablet can we, Rulers, enter the universe’s Great Clan Gathering 90000 years later!” Said Commander Mountain Shaker in a deep voice.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang immediately understood.","Almost all the Rulers who had come to the Ancient Path of Stars had come for the Great Clan Gathering, so it was easy to imagine how fierce the competition for the God Sealing Tablet would be.","The two of them talked as they walked, and soon they arrived at the pavilion in the distance.","Not long after he entered the building, a divine armor guard suddenly ran over.","“Commander Mountain Shaker, The Investiture of the Gods has been found in the 12 cities. The Overlord has invited you over. He has something to discuss with you!”","Commander Mountain Shaker’s face darkened. He turned to Jian Wushuang and said, “Blood Sword, please wait for a moment. I’ll go see the Overlord first and help you get the godly armor and identity token. Wait for me here.”","With that, Commander Mountain Shaker hurried off with the divine armor guard.","“It’s fine. Commander Mountain Shaker, you can go ahead with your work.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","After the Commander Mountain Shaker left, the pavilion immediately became quiet.","Jian Wushuang sat down with his legs crossed and his eyes flickered.","He finally understood a little about the situation in the last eight cities.","...","Time flew by, and in the blink of an eye, a month had passed.","Jian Wushuang did not waste any time and started to break through to the fourth level of sword principle origin.","He slowly closed his eyes and began to immerse himself in the comprehension of sword principle.","Back in the Tarot Ruins, he had swallowed the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass and broken through to the third level, origin of the sword.","Then, with the help of the remaining chaos sword intent from the Nine-Leaf Sword Grass, he pushed the third level of sword principle origin all the way to the peak.","After that, his comprehension of the origin of sword principle stopped and he was stuck at a bottleneck.","This continued until he entered the God Refining Tower.","“Sword principle of Gale, appear!”","Jian Wushuang opened his hands and a small whirlwind gradually formed in his palm. The sharp sword Qi shattered the void in all directions.","This was the sword principle of Gale!","Then, a Sword Saint Phantom from the ancient times appeared behind Jian Wushuang.","This was the fifth level of the Overlord’s sword path!","Then, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned red.","The scene in front of Jian Wushuang suddenly changed to the scene of Divine General Fei Hong massacring the Purgatory Sword Sect. There were mountains of corpses and seas of blood.","This was the sixth level of the slaughter Sword Dao!","The three great sword principles gushed out!","“Close!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice. In an instant, the three sword principles from the God Refining Tower slowly merged together and turned into Jian Wushuang’s own sword principles!","At this point, Jian Wushuang’s shortcomings in breaking through the fourth level of sword principle had been made up!","However, this was not the end.","“And the seventh level, my own sword Dao!”","Jian Wushuang said slowly.","In an instant, memories regarding the seventh level of the God Refining Tower came flooding in like a tidal wave!","On the seventh level, he was facing himself!","On the seventh level, Jian Wushuang finally understood why some of his power would be absorbed by the void around the God Refining Tower in the previous levels.","That was because the God Refining Tower would simulate a person that was exactly like him!","However, it was a pity that the Jian Wushuang simulated by the God Refining Tower lacked the most fundamental thing!","That was the constitution of a perfect life form!","In that battle, Jian Wushuang had clearly seen his own strengths and weaknesses in sword principle. In the end, he had used the power of his divine body to kill his simulacrum!","“Boom!”","Jian Wushuang’s body let out a muffled sound.","The stagnant comprehension of the third level of the sword principle began to break through!","Three days later.","Clang!","A shocking sword essence exploded with Jian Wushuang as the center!","This sword essence was extremely sharp, as if it wanted to cut the firmament into pieces and split the chaos. It directly shot up into the sky!","“Fourth level, complete!”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and two divine lights flashed past like lightning in the dark night.","The next moment.","The sword essence that shot up into the sky was all retracted.","Jian Wushuang stood up. After breaking through to the fourth level of sword principle origin, his aura became sharper and sharper. It was as if he was a peerless weapon, exuding a sharp and fierce power.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and immediately covered his aura, as if there was no difference from before.","At this moment, the sound of hurried footsteps could be heard outside the pavilion.","“Blood Sword.”","The bearded Ruler Mountain Shaker strode over.","He handed a black armor to Jian Wushuang and said, “Blood Sword, this is the godly armor of the Conqueror’s camp. It’s enough to block the Ultimate Ruler’s full-power attack. Put it on and come with me to the thirteenth city to fight for the God Sealing Tablet!","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate. He turned his right hand and put on the black divine armor.","“Blood Sword, from now on, you will be the divine armor guards of the sixth legion under the Overlord’s command. Let’s not delay any further and head to the 13 cities.” Ruler Mountain Shaker growled."]},{"number":4251,"title":"Chapter 4251 Fighting for the God Sealing Tablet","paragraphs":["4251 Fighting for the God Sealing Tablet","After saying this, Ruler Mountain Shaker waved his hand and barked, “Sixth Army, come quickly!”","The voice was like a thunderclap. Instantly, dozens of figures shot over from all directions.","“We pay our respects to the commander!” These figures cupped their hands and said in a deep voice.","“The 63rd Investiture of the Gods has appeared in the 13th city. The great conqueror has ordered that we must take The Investiture of the Gods!” Commander Mountain Shaker’s eyes were filled with disdain as he spoke in a deep voice.","!!","“Yes, sir!”","The several dozen divine armor guards responded.","Seeing this, Commander Mountain Shaker nodded in satisfaction and continued, “The other magnates won’t let go of The Investiture of the Gods this time. The battle will be intense, so you must be prepared.”","The several dozen God armor guards nodded. They had all come this far, so they naturally understood that opportunity and danger coexisted.","“Alright, let’s go now!”","Commander Mountain Shaker took a step forward and turned into a stream of light. He took the lead and shot into the distance.","The dozens of divine armor guards also rose into the sky and followed Commander Mountain Shaker.","Jian Wushuang was among the dozens of divine armor guards. He was not eye-catching and he looked around.","Based on his observations, each of these divine armor guards had the battle-power of a peak Ultimate Ruler, and they were probably the best of the best.","As for Commander Mountain Shaker, he was close to the level of an invincible Ruler.","“There are indeed many hidden dragons and crouching tigers in these eight cities.”","Jian Wushuang sighed slightly, “It was rare to see a top Ultimate Ruler in the universe. Perhaps only one top Ultimate Ruler would be born in a big star area after a long time.”","The Ancient Path of Stars was indeed a place where all the power of universe Rulers gathered. Peak Ultimate Rulers, who usually could do anything in the outside world, could only be ordinary divine armor guards in the back eight cities.","“Newcomer, this is your first time participating in the God Sealing Tablet battle, right? Stand behind me and don’t run around, understand?” As Jian Wushuang was deep in thought, a burly Ultimate Ruler spoke.","“Alright, thank you.”","Jian Wushuang put away his thoughts and cupped his hands with a smile.","The Ultimate Ruler nodded, then replied nonchalantly, “We’re all from the same camp. It’s too polite to say thanks. I’m the Ruler Grotto Profound. How should I address you?”","“Blood Sword.” Jian Wushuang replied.","“Oh, I see. Blood Sword, you look unfamiliar. You must have just arrived in the back eight cities, right?” Back then, in the Tenth City’s God Refining Tower, which level did you reach?” Ruler Grotto Profound asked casually.","“I didn’t go too far. I just barely passed the third level.” Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","“The third level?” Ruler Grotto Profound raised his brows, then mused to himself, “The third level is indeed a little lacking, but fortunately, you have joined our great conqueror’s camp. Otherwise, if you had joined any other camp, I’m afraid you would have become cannon fodder.”","After a pause, Ruler Grotto Profound continued, “Blood Sword, when the battle for The Investiture of the Gods begins, you must remember to hide behind me. otherwise, it’s very likely that you’ll die. do you understand?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded his head without saying anything.","He could tell that the Ruler Grotto Profound’s words were not looking down on him. On the contrary, they were meant to give him advice.","As the two of them spoke, they followed behind Commander Mountain Shaker and shot toward The Investiture of the Gods.","Soon, they passed two cities and arrived at the 13th city.","“We’re here. Stop.”","Commander Mountain Shaker walked in front and waved his hand. Everyone immediately stopped.","In front of them, a huge stone tablet appeared in front of them. Around the stone tablet, people had already surrounded it. They were facing each other, looking as if they were ready to draw their swords.","“The great prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, the young emperor of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, and the Saint of the Nine Stars Holy Land. Three of the Nine Magnates have come. I’m afraid there’ll be a fierce battle soon.” Ruler Grotto Profound’s eyes narrowed.","Commander Mountain Shaker, who was standing at the front, also had a solemn expression.","“Let’s go down.”","Commander Mountain Shaker took a deep breath and said in a deep voice. then, he took the lead and descended from the sky.","“The Overlord’s people are here too?”","Beside the stone tablet, a middle-aged man in heavy armor and holding a heavenly halberd raised his eyebrows.","Beside them was a huge flag with a drawing of a blazing sun. They must be the Rulers of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom.","“Mountain Shaker, long time no see. How are your injuries?”","A red-robed bald man from the nine-star sacred land looked at Ruler Mountain Shaker with a faint smile.","The commander of Divine Kingdom Da Feng’s side was a bare-chested man with braids and two axes.","When he saw Mountain Shaker, he snorted coldly and did not speak.","“You’re all here, how can I not come?” Commander Mountain Shaker glanced at them indifferently and said.","“Hmph, since everyone is here, let’s cut the crap. Our Da Feng Divine Kingdom wants the God Sealing Tablet!”","The big man with braids snorted again, impatience in his eyes.","“Divine Marquis Mammoth, who do you think you are? Since when is it your turn to speak?” The red-robed bald man sneered.","“Hong Ye! You’re looking for death!”","“You’re courting death!” The man with the braids, who was known as Divine Marquis Mammoth, was enraged. He raised his axes and hacked at the bald man!","“Da Feng Divine Kingdom, kill with me!!!”","His eyes flashed with a murderous glint as a violent divine power gushed out from his axes and he chopped down on the bald man’s head!","This Divine Marquis Mammoth was an almost invincible Ultimate Ruler!","As soon as he finished speaking, the dozens of Ultimate Rulers behind him immediately charged at the nine-star sacred land that Hong Ye belonged to!","When Hong Ye saw this, his eyes narrowed and he sneered, “Mammoth, it seems that you’ve really forgotten about the time when I hunted you down twenty thousand years ago.”","With that, Hong Ye flicked his right hand, and a curved blade appeared in his hand. He dodged the attack, and then slashed out a blade light toward the giant Divine Marquis Mammoth!","On the other side, the heavily-armored commander of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom twisted his neck expressionlessly. He looked down at the Ruler Mountain Shaker and coldly said, “I’ve long heard of Commander Mountain Shaker’s reputation as the ‘Immovable Buddha’. I’ll take advantage of today to experience it.”","His right hand, which was holding the Fangtian Ancient Halberd, swept across, and the tip of the halberd instantly drew a cold light.","After taking a deep breath, Commander Mountain Shaker only said one word, “Kill!”","With that, Commander Mountain Shaker charged toward the Da Feng Divine Kingdom’s camp like a sharp knife!","“Blood Sword, it’s our turn. Follow me closely!” He said.","“Kill!” Ruler Grotto Profound’s eyes flickered, and he flipped his right hand, producing a strange-looking Turtledove blade. He followed behind Commander Mountain Shaker and charged at the Great Sun Army!","Jian Wushuang nodded. He did not use Wuqi Divine Sword and followed behind Ruler Grotto Profound calmly.","A bloody battle had begun!"]},{"number":4252,"title":"Chapter 4252 The Killing","paragraphs":["4252 The Killing","Kill!!!","For a moment, the sound of battle filled the air as spell techniques and sword glows surged up into the sky!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","From the beginning of the battle, it had entered a state of white heat.","!!","Mountain Shaker went straight for the heavily-armored commander from the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, who was holding a halberd.","The two of them were almost invincible Rulers. As they fought, they turned the area within a thousand feet into a forbidden area, and the aftermath of their battle swept in all directions!","“Splitting the heavens and splitting the earth!”","“Die!” The Da Feng Divine Kingdom’s commander shouted coldly. The heavenly halberd in his hand instantly swept across the sky, bringing with it a heavy force as it struck down on Commander Mountain Shaker!","“Unmoving as a mountain!”","Looking at the halberd light that seemed to be able to cut off the sun and moon, Commander Mountain Shaker’s face sank. His entire body glowed with a faint golden light, and his feet seemed to be rooted to the ground. The cold halberd light was unable to move him at all.","“Do you only know how to get beaten up?”","The commander of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom stomped his right foot with an apathetic expression and immediately hacked at the man with his halberd!","...","On the other side.","“Die!” Ruler Grotto Profound wielded that strange-looking Turtledove blade and charged through the Da Feng Divine Kingdom’s camp!","There were no rules to this battle. It was a head-on battle between the two Ultimate Rulers!","Peng, peng, peng, peng!","Countless divine arts and techniques exploded. If this was the outside world, the battle between the two forces would be enough to blow up a galaxy. Even in the Ancient Path of Stars, where there were rules and space was extremely stable, it was still like a disaster had descended. The earth trembled and countless huge pits were blasted.","Jian Wushuang followed behind Ruler Grotto Profound, so he was not in any danger. From time to time, he would casually slash out a sword light to help Ruler Grotto Profound block the hidden arrows that came from all directions.","“Blood Sword, it seems that you’re not bad.” Ruler Grotto Profound turned to look at Jian Wushuang and laughed.","“It’s so-so.”","Jian Wushuang smiled.","At this moment.","“Go to hell, you little bastards under the Overlord!”","A bare-chested man with a mustache, wielding a large saber, slashed down at Ruler Grotto Profound!","The terrifying blade light mixed with the laws of the universe roared in the sky!","“Remember, the one who killed you is a subordinate of the fourth Army of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, commander barren. He is Ruler Cold Disaster!”","Ruler Grotto Profound’s face instantly turned grave.","He had noticed this person a long time ago. In the Da Feng Divine Kingdom’s camp, he was an expert only below the commander. In just a short while, he had killed no less than three of the Overlord’s Ultimate Rulers!","“Blood Sword, hide behind me. Be careful!”","Ruler Grotto Profound took a deep breath and tightened his grip on the dagger. He growled, “Thunder slash!”","“BOOM!”","The turtledove blade in Ruler Grotto Profound’s hand immediately began to coil with lightning snakes, and balls of lightning began to condense at the tip of the blade!","Slash!!!","“Die!” Ruler Grotto Profound’s expression was solemn as he stomped down with his right foot, sending his entire body soaring into the air as he slashed down with his saber at Ruler Cold Disaster!","The two blade auras collided with each other!","Bang!","The lightning exploded and a light wave spread out from where the two of them fought!","“Retreat!” Ruler Cold Disaster’s body trembled, while Ruler Grotto Profound was forced back ten-some steps.","“Oh? You’re pretty good.”","Ruler Cold Disaster raised an eyebrow in surprise.","Ruler Grotto Profound had a solemn expression on his face. He didn’t say anything, only stared at Ruler Cold Disaster.","He understood that he had to hold this person back. Otherwise, once he charged into their camp, no one would be able to stop him!","In group battles like this, a single expert was enough to tilt the tide of the battle. Commander Mountain Shaker and Commander Barren Creek were currently locked in a stalemate. If they could not stop Ruler Cold Disaster, the consequences would be unimaginable!","“However, that’s all there is to it.”","Ruler Cold Disaster laughed coldly as he raised his saber and charged forward once more!","The cold black blade light was like a sun-devouring snake, instantly turning into thousands of blades and attacking like a storm!","“Blood Sword, be careful!”","Ruler Grotto Profound gritted his teeth, turned around, and warned Jian Wushuang. then, he braced himself and charged at Ruler Cold Disaster!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","“Bang bang bang bang!”","The two of them exchanged thousands of blows in an instant. The cold saber light and the lightning on the turtle-head ring saber collided, causing the ground to rumble.","One could tell that in terms of battle-power, Ruler Grotto Profound was slightly weaker than Ruler cold. Under the saber-light of Ruler Cold Disaster, he could only continuously retreat. He was only able to defend, not fight back.","Fortunately, however, Ruler Grotto Profound had a deep foundation of divine power. Ruler Cold Disaster really wouldn’t be able to do anything to him for a while.","This was also Ruler Grotto Profound’s goal.","He didn’t hope to kill Ruler Cold Disaster. He only wanted to stall him for a while so that Commander Mountain Shaker could decide the outcome of the battle. At that time, the outcome would be decided!","Ruler Cold Disaster clearly understood this as well. His eyes flashed, and he laughed coldly. “Little brat, I’ll get even with you after I’ve killed the other trash under your Overlord.”","After saying that, his eyes flickered as he searched for a new target.","Then, he fixed his eyes on Jian Wushuang.","“Oh? There’s still a piece of trash here who’s trying to fish in troubled waters. In that case, I’ll start with you.”","“Hehe!” Cold Disaster laughed and stomped his foot, turning into a black light. He flew past the panting Grotto Profound God and charged at Jian Wushuang!","“Blood Sword, be careful!”","Ruler Grotto Profound’s expression changed and he shouted at Jian Wushuang behind him.","The thing he was most worried about had happened.","It was already extremely difficult for him to deal with Ruler Cold Disaster. How could he have the energy to save others?","“It’s you, kid, go to hell!”","“Hehe!” Cold Disaster grinned hideously. The saber in his hand turned into a black python that could devour the world as he slashed down at Jian Wushuang!","Ruler Grotto Profound’s face instantly turned extremely ugly to behold.","In the distance, Commander Mountain Shaker had also noticed this scene.","“Kid, if you want to survive in the back eight cities, this is something you have to go through. You’re on your own.”","Commander Mountain Shaker muttered to himself as he shook his head. He then once again engaged in battle with commander Huangchuan.","Jian Wushuang looked at the incoming saber light and suddenly let out a sigh.","“Why do you want to kill me?”","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang’s right hand shook slightly and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","Then, Jian Wushuang raised his right hand and looked at the grinning Ruler Cold Disaster. He calmly said, “Split open the sky.”","As soon as he finished speaking, there was no brilliant sword light or soaring sword intent.","“Die!” A calm streak of sword-Qi shot out from Wu Qi toward Ruler Cold Disaster.","After breaking through to the fourth level of the origin of sword principle, Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship had suddenly returned to the state of simplicity.","“Hahahaha, this soft sword Qi, is it an embroidery needle?”","“Hahaha!” Ruler Cold Disaster laughed disdainfully. He didn’t care about Jian Wushuang’s sky-splitting strike at all."]},{"number":4253,"title":"Chapter 4253 Killing With a Single Sword","paragraphs":["4253 Killing With a Single Sword","Even Ruler Grotto Profound’s heart sank to the bottom of the abyss upon seeing this soft sword.","“Ah, what a pity.”","He sighed in his heart, but he immediately put on a serious expression. After being in the last eight cities for so many years, he was used to seeing people die and geniuses die. What he needed to do now was to recover his divine power immediately. He had to stop Ruler Cold Disaster later!","Just as everyone was lamenting that Jian Wushuang, who had just arrived at the back eight cities, was about to die...","!!","A change happened!","The heaven-opening sword Qi that Jian Wushuang wielded was like a surging river, getting bigger and bigger!","In the beginning, Jian Wushuang’s sword Qi was as thin as a hair. However, in just a few seconds, Jian Wushuang’s heaven-opening sword Qi swept across the world like a galaxy, piercing through the sun and the moon with endless roaring power!","The surging sword Qi surged in all directions and turned into an earth-shaking sun and moon sword light, which swept across the sky!","The wailing of gods and demons and the low chanting of Buddhas came from the Wuqi Divine Sword.","For a moment, the sword light attracted everyone’s attention!","Everyone raised their heads and looked at the sword light that cut through the sky!","“What...how is that possible?”","Ruler Cold Disaster’s body trembled, and a look of shock appeared in his eyes. He then took a deep breath, and a sharp light appeared in his eyes. “It seems that i have underestimated you!”","“Secret skill, mountain break!!!”","BOOM!","Mysterious runes emerged from the black blade in his hand and expanded to a thousand feet. Its power was no weaker than Jian Wushuang’s as it slashed at his heaven-opening sword light!","“Brat, die!”","He stared at Jian Wushuang with a sharp light in his eyes.","As for Jian Wushuang, he had put away the Wuqi Divine Sword with an indifferent expression.","The outcome had been decided the moment he had drawn his sword!","BOOM!","The heaven-splitting sword-light collided with the Ruler of cold calamity’s Mountain-breaking blade gate!","Just as everyone thought that a world-shaking battle was about to break out between Jian Wushuang and Ruler Cold Disaster...","A scene that made everyone’s jaws drop happened!","When the powerful mountain-breaking saber radiance met the sky-opening sword radiance, it was like ice meeting hot oil. It didn’t even last for a second before it began to collapse.","Ka-chak.","The heaven-splitting sword projection crushed the mountain-splitting saber projection before finally landing on cold disaster’s body!","Bang!","An earth-shattering explosion erupted, setting off white waves that filled the sky.","After the White waves dispersed, there was no trace of Ruler Cold Disaster.","All that was left was a black saber that had been broken into two and was floating in the air.","With one sword, Cold Disaster died!","In an instant, everyone turned their heads, opened their mouths, and looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","“Blood...the Blood Sword...”","Ruler Grotto Profound’s entire body turned stiff and petrified. He looked at Jian Wushuang and subconsciously swallowed.","That Ruler Cold Disaster, who had forced him to the point where he couldn’t fight back at all and whom he viewed as a major threat that could affect the entire battle, had been killed with a single sword strike?","Not even a trace was left behind?","“I was just lucky.” Jian Wushuang smiled at him.","“Is this a fluke?”","Ruler Grotto Profound was dumbfounded. Then, he shuddered and punched Jian Wushuang’s chest. He laughed and said, “Blood Sword, you’ve really hidden it well, kid!”","Jian Wushuang laughed and did not argue back.","Ruler Grotto Profound took a deep breath and turned to look at the terrified Da Feng Divine Kingdom’s camp. A smile appeared on his face, and he said in a clear voice, “Follow me and kill!!!”","Without Cold Disaster, the remaining Rulers from the Da Feng Divine Kingdom were unable to withstand a single blow. Coupled with their fear of Jian Wushuang, they were immediately defeated.","In just a few moments, the Da Feng Divine Kingdom’s camp was utterly defeated.","The distant Commanders Mountain Shaker and Grotto Profound, who were battling, also noticed this.","“Good boy!”","Commander Mountain Shaker looked at Jian Wushuang and praised him loudly. His eyes were shining.","As for Ruler Barren River, his face was extremely grim.","“Useless trash.” He snorted in a low voice, but no one knew who he was talking about.","Then, he took a deep breath, looked at Commander Mountain Shaker, and said, “Mountain Shaker, you’re lucky this time. I don’t want this God Sealing Tablet.”","Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang coldly with killing intent in his eyes, “Kid, you’re good. I’ll remember you. Don’t worry, I’ll come and find you!”","Even though he was praising her, his tone was extremely cold.","The hearts of all the Ultimate Rulers present could not help but tremble when they heard this.","“Sure, you’re welcome to come and find me anytime.”","Jian Wushuang looked at Ruler Barren River without avoiding his gaze and smiled.","When the Ruler Barren River heard this, he was so enraged that he began to laugh.","“Good, good, good. Brat, you can be as arrogant as you want now! I hope you can still smile the next time we meet!”","“Let’s go!” After saying this, Ruler Barren River flicked his sleeve and shot off into the distance with a cold look on his face, completely ignoring the fate of the other Ultimate Rulers who had come with him.","Soon, the Ruler Barren River had turned into a black dot, disappearing into the horizon.","Commander Mountain Shaker heaved a sigh of relief and then walked toward Jian Wushuang.","“Lord Commander.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands.","Commander Mountain Shaker nodded and then looked at Jian Wushuang again with an unfamiliar gaze.","“After the battle of The Investiture of the Gods is over, you’ll come with me to see the conqueror.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang thought for a moment, then nodded and replied, “Alright,” he said.","Commander Mountain Shaker smiled and looked into the distance.","On the other side, the battle between Nine Stars Holy Land and Da Feng Divine Kingdom had also gradually come to an end.","Compared to the battle between Jian Wushuang and the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, the battle between Nine Stars Holy Land and Da Feng Divine Kingdom was much more intense!","The giant Divine Marquis Mammoth was almost skinned alive by the red leaves!","Red strings appeared between Hong Ye’s fingers, and with a single grab, he took away a large portion of the Divine Marquis Mammoth’s divine power. It was extremely cruel.","“Mammoth, I’ve said it before, this is not the place for you to be impudent.”","Hong Ye stood in the air and looked down at the giant Divine Marquis Mammoth.","“Hong Ye!”","“Hmph!” Divine Marquis Mammoth gasped for breath, his body in tatters and dismembered.","He glared at Hong Ye, his eyes filled with extreme anger as he roared.","“The incapability of the weak.”","Hong Ye shook his head and turned into a red light as he charged toward the Divine Marquis Mammoth.","“The Divine Marquis Mammoth is about to fall.”","Commander Mountain Shaker squinted his eyes as he observed this scene.","Then, he turned to look at Jian Wushuang, Ruler Grotto Profound, and the others. He said in a deep voice, “Get ready.”","“We have to get this God Sealing Tablet!”"]},{"number":4254,"title":"Chapter 4254 Hidden Seal","paragraphs":["4254 Hidden Seal","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","The battle between the giant Divine Marquis Mammoth and Hong Ye had turned into a one-sided battle.","Hong Ye’s figure was like a red line as he moved around the Divine Marquis Mammoth.","Roar! Roar! Roar!","!!","“Die!” Divine Marquis Mammoth roared as he swung his axes!","However, Hong Ye’s movement technique was too strange. After the giant Divine Marquis Mammoth’s axes hit Hong Ye, his divine body collapsed and then reformed.","“Brainless boor.”","Hong Ye laughed coldly. Red snakes coiled around his fingers, and with every swipe of his claw, he would wipe out a portion of divine power from the body of the Divine Marquis Mammoth.","No matter how much Divine Marquis Mammoth roared, he could not do anything to the Hong Ye.","After a while, the voice of the Divine Marquis Mammoth gradually weakened.","Just as Mountain Shaker had said, Divine Marquis Mammoth was no match for Hong Ye. He did not even have the chance to escape. He was skinned alive by Hong Ye!","A Ruler who was close to being invincible had fallen next to the God Sealing Tablet.","“Damn it! The Da Feng Divine Kingdom’s Ultimate Rulers were immediately terrified. Some chose to side with Hong Ye, while the others were all killed by Hong Ye’s Ultimate Rulers.”","A moment later, only Ruler Hong Ye and Commander Mountain Shaker remained beside The Investiture of the Gods.","Hu hu hu.","A gust of Cold Disaster blew past, ruffling the battle robes of the Rulers on both sides.","Commander Mountain Shaker’s face darkened. Just as he was about to start the battle, Hong Ye waved his hand and interrupted him with a faint smile, “Mountain Shaker, our two sides just experienced a big battle. It’s quite boring to continue fighting like this. Why don’t we change the way we play?”","“Change the way you play?” Commander Mountain Shaker frowned and said, “What kind of game?”","Hong Ye laughed, “Apart from you and me, we’ll each send out three Ruler experts. Let them fight one-on-one. We’ll win two out of three. How about it?”","When Commander Mountain Shaker heard this, a thoughtful look flashed across his eyes.","He agreed with Hong Ye’s suggestion. Firstly, this could prevent more casualties. Secondly, if they lost in a one-on-one battle, he believed that they would not win even if they went to war.","Against Hong Ye, he did not have the confidence to win.","After thinking for a moment, Commander Mountain Shaker nodded and said, “Sure.”","When Hong Ye saw this, a smile appeared on her face. She said, “Mountain Shaker, let’s each prepare for the time it takes an incense stick to burn. We’ll select three Rulers from our subordinates, and then we’ll begin. What do you think?”","Naturally, Commander Mountain Shaker had no objections. After nodding, he turned to look at the Ruler under him.","“Which one of you is willing to fight?”","Said the Mountain Shaker commander in a low voice as he swept his gaze across the Rulers under his command.","“We’re waiting...I’m willing to fight!”","“Yes!” Ruler Grotto Profound and the others agreed. Jian Wushuang was also among them.","When Commander Mountain Shaker saw this, a gratified look flashed in his eyes.","He swept his gaze across the Rulers under him, then fixed it on Ruler Grotto Profound. “How about you go first?”","“I feel honored!” Ruler Grotto Profound cupped his hands.","Commander Mountain Shaker nodded. He looked at the square-faced, heavy-browed Ruler who was holding a spear. He hesitated for a moment before saying, “Ruler Earthfury, why don’t you go for the second round?”","The Ruler Earthfury nodded and stepped out of the crowd. He said in a deep voice, “Don’t worry, commander. We’ll do our best!”","“Good, good, good!”","Commander Mountain Shaker nodded in satisfaction. Then, he began to select the third candidate.","He glanced at the Rulers under his command and finally fixed his eyes on Jian Wushuang.","Just as Jian Wushuang thought that Commander Mountain Shaker would choose him to fight, he hesitated and said, “The third candidate is still to be determined. Anyway, it’s best of three. Maybe there’s no need for a third round and the battle will be decided.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Since Commander Mountain Shaker did not need him to fight for the time being, he naturally would not force himself to fight.","The time it takes for an incense stick to burn passed by quickly. Commander Mountain Shaker turned around and looked at Hong Ye. He said in a clear voice, “Hong Ye, we have decided on the candidates.”","Hearing this, Hong Ye nodded and extended a finger. “Mountain Shaker, I’ve already decided on the candidate. We’ll only send one person,” he said with a smile that was not a smile.","“A person? Are you serious?”","Commander Mountain Shaker’s face instantly sank, while a hint of anger flashed across the faces of Ruler Grotto Profound and the others.","Did Hong Ye think that he could take on three of them by himself?","Hearing this, Hong Ye smiled and replied with his hands behind his back, “Of course. As long as the three of you can defeat him, I will admit defeat.”","“Cang Feng, come out.”","A plain-looking middle-aged man wearing plain clothes and wielding a blue sword walked out from behind Hong Ye.","“Who is this person?”","Ruler Grotto Profound and the others all frowned and looked at each other.","The latter eight cities were neither small nor big. They had all heard of the Rulers who were famous and had superior strength.","They had never seen this Ruler called Cang Feng before.","Commander Mountain Shaker looked at the middle-aged man called Cang Feng. For some reason, he had a bad feeling in his heart.","“Dongxuan, be careful.” He warned Ruler Grotto Profound.","Ruler Grotto Profound nodded with a solemn expression. Since this person had been entrusted with the important task of fighting against three by Hong Ye, he naturally proved that his strength was extraordinary.","Commander Hong Ye and Commander Mountain Shaker’s forces both retreated, leaving enough space for the Rulers of the two sides to fight.","Cang Feng walked to the center of the room, casting a cold glance at the Ruler Grotto Profound and the others. “All of you, come at me together.”","Like a stone stirring up a thousand waves, the Ruler Grotto Profound and the others were all enraged.","“You’re so arrogant!”","Ruler Grotto Profound let out an angry laugh as he flew out and shot toward Cang Feng!","“Secret skill, thunder slash!”","Boom!","Lightning snakes coiled around the sphere, and it gathered on Ruler Grotto Profound’s Turtledove saber with a terrifying momentum!","From the very start, Ruler Grotto Profound had directly used his most powerful technique!","“Die!!!”","“Die!” Ruler Grotto Profound bellowed, and the lightning balls on his saber began to roll down toward Cang Feng!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","Thunderbolts exploded, filling the entire hall with white light!","Cang Feng slowly raised his head and glanced at the Ruler Grotto Profound.","“You’re just like clay chickens and pottery dogs.”","Clang!","Following a loud sword cry, Cang Feng’s blue sword was unsheathed!","A dark blue sword light instantly slashed out like a waterfall. It was extremely stunning and extremely fast!","This sword-light was like a white dragon emerging from the ocean. With a crisp sword cry, it ruthlessly hacked at Ruler Grotto Profound!","Before the sword light touched the seethrough, the sharp sword Qi had already annihilated the exploding thunderbolts!","Ruler Grotto Profound’s face instantly changed."]},{"number":4255,"title":"Chapter 4255 Unparalleled","paragraphs":["4255 Unparalleled","“This...”","Ruler Grotto Profound’s body trembled as he took a step forward, planning to retreat and put some distance between them.","However...","“There’s no chance.” Cang Feng shook his head.","As soon as he finished speaking, the sword-light completely blasted away the lightning. Other than the sword-light dimming a little, it continued to shoot toward Ruler Grotto Profound.","Clang!","In an instant, the sword light viciously stabbed into Ruler Grotto Profound’s chest, piercing through his divine body!","Pfft!","With a muffled sound, Ruler Grotto Profound’s entire body was like a torn sack. He streaked through the air in an arc and fell into the distance.","“Die!” Ruler Grotto Profound’s body was obliterated by large amounts of divine power, and his face was deathly pale. This sword had almost taken his life.","“Dongxuan!”","“What?” Ruler Mountain Shaker was startled, and he immediately rushed over to Ruler Grotto Profound’s side and helped him up. He poured all of his divine power into his divine body, helping him erase the sword Qi.","Under the divine power of Commander Mountain Shaker, the Ruler Grotto Profound’s injuries gradually recovered. His pale face also became better, but it was still a sallow color.","“L-Lord Commander, I’m sorry. I lost in my first battle and let you down...” Ruler Grotto Profound forced himself to sit up and spoke with some difficulty.","“Shut up. Take care of your body. I’m waiting for you to kill with me in the future. As for defeat, it’s not your problem.”","The Mountain Shaker commander interrupted him. He took a deep breath and looked at Cang Feng with fear. Then, he turned to Hong Ye and said, “Hong Ye, you’re really good at scheming. This Cang Feng probably already has an unrivaled commander-level battle prowess, right?”","Hearing this, Hong Ye smiled faintly and replied, “Mountain Shaker, you don’t need to care about his fighting strength. As long as he’s a Ruler under me, he’s in line with the rules. Do you understand?”","Commander Mountain Shaker snorted heavily upon hearing this. He knew that there was no way to refute Hong Ye’s words. As long as Cang Feng was one of Hong Ye’s subordinates, there was nothing he could do, even if he was an Invincible Ruler.","Taking a deep breath, the commander continued in a deep voice, “Hong Ye, we admit defeat. You can take the God Sealing Tablet.”","After he finished speaking, Commander Mountain Shaker planned to lead his team and leave.","He knew that the Ultimate Rulers under him were no match for Cang Feng. Even if they did, they would only be throwing their lives away.","In that case, the outcome would be the same, so he might as well hand over the God Sealing Tablet.","Although Commander Mountain Shaker was unwilling, he could only lower his head in the face of circumstances.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave with Commander Mountain Shaker, Hong Ye suddenly said, “Hold on,”","“What?”","Commander Mountain Shaker stopped in his tracks. He turned around and looked at Hong Ye. His expression was not very good as he said, “Hong Ye, we have already admitted defeat. What else do you want?”","Hong Ye put on a fake smile. “Mountain Shaker, our rule is three rounds of competition. How can you leave before the competition is over?”","“I, Ping Sheng, hate those who don’t follow the rules the most,” Hong Ye continued after a pause.","After he finished speaking, the Ultimate Rulers behind him all surged with divine power and vaguely pulled apart the formation. It was as if they would attack if Commander Mountain Shaker dared to take another step.","“Hong Ye, you’ve gone too far!”","Commander Mountain Shaker glared at Hong Ye. His eyes were extremely cold.","Hong Ye looked down at Commander Mountain Shaker from above and said with a playful smile, “Mountain Shaker, I’m already giving you a chance. Otherwise, if we really started fighting, do you think we could leave this place alive?”","Commander Mountain Shaker took a deep breath and pondered for a moment. He then slowly said, “Alright, then let’s continue.”","After saying that, he looked at the Ruler Earthfury, who had a grave expression on his face, and said, “Earthfury, when you fight Cang Feng, just admit defeat and save your life.”","The Ruler Earthfury nodded and replied solemnly, “Alright,” he said.","He was not a brainless brute. He could naturally tell that Cang Feng’s power had already reached the commander-level of an invincible Ruler. He was no match for him at all.","“Then let’s start.” Hong Ye smiled and waved his hand.","Instantly, the battle started again.","The Ruler Earthfury walked toward the empty space in the middle with heavy steps.","Cang Feng, who had his eyes closed and was hugging his sword, slowly opened his eyes upon hearing this. He looked at the Ruler Earthfury and said, “You won’t have the same luck as that person just now.”","Ruler Earthfury frowned, not understanding what he meant.","However, he did not plan to think too much about it. He followed the instructions of Commander Mountain Shaker and said, “Cang Feng, I admit defeat for this battle...”","However, before he could finish his sentence.","“You want to admit defeat?” Cang Feng sneered coldly as he pulled out the blue divine sword. With a single step, he transformed into a sword radiance and lunged forward!","“You’ll have to ask the sword in my hand if it agrees!”","Boom!","“Die!” Cang Feng’s speed was extremely fast, and he immediately flew over on his sword. He transformed into a shocking sword-light, and blue sword Qi slashed out in all directions as he slashed toward the Ruler Earthfury.","“You!”","Ruler Earthfury’s expression changed. He had already admitted defeat, but Cang Feng still refused to let him go!","“Hong Ye, what do you mean by this?”","Seeing this, Commander Mountain Shaker also flew into a rage and glared at Hong Ye.","As for Hong Ye, he only smiled and did not respond.","“Secret technique, star fall!”","Ruler Earthfury let out an angry roar as the spear in his hand flashed with a cold light and stabbed toward Cang Feng!","Clang!","The tip of Ruler Earthfury’s spear collided with Cang Feng’s sword light. Starting from the tip, the spear began to crack.","The difference in strength between the two of them was too great!","After the spear shattered, Cang Feng laughed coldly as the Ruler Earthfury watched in horror. The blue divine sword in his hand slashed down once more, directly splitting the Ruler Earthfury in half!","“No!”","“Arghh!” Ruler Earthfury let out a miserable scream.","However, Cang Feng did not show any mercy at all. the sharp sword Qi exploded once again, directly killing the Ruler Earthfury’s divine body that had been split in half!","When Commander Mountain Shaker saw this, he was so angry that his eyes were about to burst. A wave of anger rushed to his head.","As for Cang Feng, he kept his sword and the cold smile on his face disappeared.","“Cang Feng, my Ruler has already admitted defeat. Why do you still want to take his life?” The Mountain Shaker commander glared at Cang Feng and panted heavily in anger.","Cang Feng looked at him indifferently and replied, “He’s not strong enough, he can’t blame me.”","“What a good...not strong enough!”","Commander Mountain Shaker laughed in anger. The veins on his forehead twisted as he said, “Cang Feng, what sort of skill do you have to bully a Ruler under my command? If you have the guts, come fight me. Whether we live or die will depend on our own strength. How about it?”"]},{"number":4256,"title":"Chapter 4256 Jian Wushuang Takes Action","paragraphs":["4256 Jian Wushuang Takes Action","Hearing this, Cang Feng’s eyes narrowed as he stared at the Mountain Shaker commander. He sneered, “Why wouldn’t I?”","Before he could finish his sentence, Hong Ye waved his hand with a smile and said, “Alright, I’m done. Zang Feng, Mountain Shaker is an old-school Omega Ruler who has lived through multiple chaos cycles. He’s not someone you can fight against.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Hong Ye turned to look at Commander Mountain Shaker and continued, “Mountain Shaker, hurry up and send out the third candidate.”","It was obvious that Hong Ye had already won this competition.","Commander Mountain Shaker’s face was extremely gloomy. He understood that if they wanted to leave this place alive, they could only follow Hong Ye’s rules.","Taking a deep breath, Commander Mountain Shaker turned his head and looked at the Ultimate Ruler under him.","Under his gaze, everyone could not help but shrink their heads and take a few steps back.","Cang Feng had won two battles, while Ruler Grotto Profound and Ruler Earthfury had lost one to another. His might was simply too great, and they had long since been scared out of their wits.","“Who is willing to fight?” Commander Mountain Shaker asked in a deep voice.","The many Ultimate Rulers in the crowd looked at each other in silence, as quiet as cicadas in winter.","It was true that they were working for the Overlord, but that did not mean that they would still go up even if they knew that they would die.","Commander Mountain Shaker’s heart sank when he saw this. He could not help but laugh bitterly, but he did not blame them.","“Cang Feng, as you can see, none of the Rulers under my command dare to accept my challenge,” Commander Mountain Shaker took a deep breath, turned his head, and said mockingly.","“Oh?”","Cang Feng’s brows twitched as his lips curled into a mocking smile, “Are the Overlord’s subordinates all such a bunch of cowards?”","Shaking his head in boredom, Cang Feng narrowed his eyes and glanced at the faces of the many Ultimate Rulers behind Commander Mountain Shaker. “If that’s the case, then I’ll choose my own partner.”","Faced with Cang Feng’s gaze, the hearts of the many Ultimate Rulers turned cold. They could not help but take half a step back, as if they were afraid of being picked.","Seeing this, the mockery in Cang Feng’s eyes grew.","At this moment.","His gaze stopped on the face of a black-robed, black-haired, cold-looking young man.","Under his gaze, everyone unconsciously took a step back. only this person remained standing there indifferently, his face expressionless. No one could tell whether he was happy or sad.","“Who are you?” Cang Feng asked with interest.","“Blood Sword.” Jian Wushuang glanced at him and replied indifferently.","“Why didn’t you retreat when you saw me?” Cang Feng continued to ask.","“Why should I retreat?” Jian Wushuang’s expression was neither happy nor sad as he asked.","“Hahahaha, interesting.”","When Cang Feng heard this, it was as if he had just heard a joke. He twisted his neck and said, “Blood Sword, it’s you. You are the candidate for the third battle!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the Ultimate Rulers behind Commander Mountain Shaker trembled and looked at Jian Wushuang with sympathy.","“Blood Sword, you’ve done enough to defeat Cold Disaster,” said Commander Mountain Shaker. “You don’t have to fight.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “It’s fine.”","When the Mountain Shaker commander heard this, he was about to say something when Cang Feng provoked him, “Blood Sword, I see that you’re holding a sword. You must be a sword cultivator, right? We sword cultivators press forward with indomitable will and have no fear in our hearts. What can you achieve by dawdling?”","Jian Wushuang laughed and looked at Cang Feng, “Do you really want to fight me that much?”","Hearing this, Cang Feng laughed in disdain, “Blood Sword, hurry up and attack. If I’m in a good mood, I might even give you a few pointers on the way of the sword.”","Pausing for a moment, Cang Feng seemed to have thought of something and added, “Blood Sword, you’re also a sword cultivator, so you should know the origin of the way of the sword, right? Let me remind you that my comprehension of the origin of the way of the sword has already reached the third stage!”","“Give me some pointers? Third-level essence of the Dao of the sword?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but feel speechless. Then he shook his head and sighed.","“As you wish, then.”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward.","When Commander Mountain Shaker saw this, he knew that there was no way to change it. He could only helplessly warn, “Blood Sword, Cang Feng is much stronger than Cold Disaster. You must not force yourself. Once you realize that you are no match for Cang Feng, I will admit defeat immediately. As long as you admit defeat, I will protect you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded to show that he understood.","Looking at Jian Wushuang, Cang Feng’s lips curled up and he asked, “Blood Sword, are you ready?”","Jian Wushuang did not answer but said calmly, “Cang Feng, I’ll only use three strikes. If you can take all three, I’ll admit defeat.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone was stunned and looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief. They wondered if they had heard wrong.","Even Hong Ye, who was smiling triumphantly, was stunned.","‘This kid, did he know what he was saying?’","“Arrogant!”","Cang Feng laughed in anger. Without any hesitation, he stomped his foot and shot into the sky!","“Secret skill, sword flower water moon!”","Boom!","An extremely sharp sword light slashed out from Cang Feng’s blue sword. A terrifying sword intent spread out in all directions, and everyone’s hearts shivered as cold sweat appeared on their foreheads.","The next moment!","Cang Feng laughed coldly as he swung his sword at Jian Wushuang!","“Go to hell!”","Jian Wushuang’s black hair was loose and his expression was calm. He spat out three words, “The first strike.”","Chi!","With a soft sound, Jian Wushuang casually struck out a crimson sword light.","It was a simple stroke without any power, but it seemed natural and flawless, as if swordsmanship was supposed to be like this.","The blood-red sword radiance quickly met the sharp sword radiance in Cang Feng’s hand.","However, such an ordinary sword strike was like breaking dry weeds and smashing rotten wood. It instantly reduced Cang Feng’s gaudy sword radiance to dust!","Like an egg hitting a stone, the sword light could not stop Jian Wushuang’s sword at all and broke into pieces!","“How is this possible?!!!”","Cang Feng’s pupils contracted as he exclaimed.","Bang!","The blood-red sword projection landed on Cang Feng’s body, directly cleaving him down from the sky. The sword projection drew an arc in the air before crashing heavily into the ground, creating a huge crater!","Dust and dirt filled the air as Cang Feng’s hair and face became disheveled. He could no longer maintain his calm, his face filled with fear.","A few hair-like cracks appeared on the blue divine sword in his hand.","“How could this be? How could this be?”","He knelt on the ground and raised his head to look at Jian Wushuang. His eyes were full of fear and disbelief.","He was an almighty expert of the Dao of the sword who was close to the level of an invincible Ruler!","“Nothing is impossible. The impossible doesn’t just come from your ignorance.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and spoke again with a calm expression, “The second strike.”"]},{"number":4257,"title":"Chapter 4257 Three Swords Out, Seal Gu","paragraphs":["4257 Three Swords Out, Seal Gu","“The second strike.”","“Split open the sky.”","As soon as Jian Wushuang finished speaking, the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand trembled thousands of times. A sword light gradually condensed and then, like a rolling river, it crushed toward Cang Feng with a muffled Boom!","In the beginning, the sword was only as thick as a strand of hair. As the sword Qi condensed, it gradually became as thick as an arm. When the sword really crossed the sky, it was as if the sky river was hanging upside down, and the sun and moon were connected. It was extremely amazing!","The brilliant might of the heavens, guided by the sword!","At this moment, everyone raised their heads to look at the sword, their expressions horrified!","“Godly swordsmanship!”","This is a true sword cultivator!!","“Who is this person? Why wasn’t he famous before?”","This sword instantly caught everyone’s attention. Even Hong Ye and Commander Mountain Shaker had a flash of surprise in their eyes.","This...this is the aura of fourth level sword principle!","Cang Feng’s breathing quickened as he stared at the heaven-opening sword ray. His eyes were filled with horror as if he had seen a ghost.","Only those who were also sword cultivators could understand the horror of this sword!","He could clearly feel that Jian Wushuang’s heaven-opening sword light had far surpassed his comprehension of sword principle!","It was the aura of a fourth level sword principle!","Even a Supreme martial artist might not be able to deduce his own Dao to the fourth level!","“I’m not his match, I have to run!”","Cang Feng’s mind whirred as he made up his mind. he took a step forward and was about to escape!","However, before he could rise from the pit...","Bang!","The heaven-opening sword ray descended!","“Get lost!”","Cang Feng roared as he raised the blue divine sword above his head to block the heaven splitting sword radiance!","Chi chi chi!","Countless sparks flew as Cang Feng’s clothes were torn apart, revealing his muscular body.","All the divine power in his body surged and poured into the blue divine sword in an attempt to block the sky-opening sword radiance.","However, no matter if it was the strength of Jian Wushuang’s divine power, his comprehension of the sword principle, or the grade of the Wuqi Divine Sword, Jian Wushuang was far superior to him. How could he block it?","In the face of absolute strength, all resistance would not be able to withstand a single blow!","Kacha! Kacha!","Cracks began to appear on the blue divine sword.","The crack began to spread rapidly!","Break!!!","Cang Feng gritted his teeth and roared!","Cha cha cha!","More and more cracks appeared!","In the next moment, the blue divine sword was completely shattered into countless pieces.","The heaven-opening sword ray landed on Cang Feng’s shoulder!","Bang!","Cang Feng was forced back into the crater by the heaven-opening sword radiance. It was as if there was a huge force that wanted to press him under the five finger mountain!","Ka ka ka!","His legs could not withstand the huge force from the sky-opening sword ray, and his knees gradually bent.","Bang!","Following a loud explosion, Cang Feng knelt on the ground, his knees creating two craters in the ground!","The sky-opening sword ray was still on his shoulder, pressing down!","The sharp sword essence kept exploding in his body!","After a while, the heaven-opening sword light finally dissipated.","Cang Feng kneeled on the ground, his aura was extremely weak, his divine power was like a lamp without oil, he was clearly on the verge of death.","With one sword, the blue shattered and Cang Feng knelt!","When countless people saw this scene, they felt a chill run down their spines to their heads, as if they had fallen into an ice cellar.","They turned their heads stiffly and looked at Jian Wushuang in shock. The disbelief in their eyes turned into shock.","Even Commander Mountain Shaker’s mouth was wide open, and his eyes were wide open.","Ruler Grotto Profound stood there in a daze, even forgetting that he had been heavily injured.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang was like the sun in the sky, and everyone looked up to him.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm and emotionless. It was as if he had just done something insignificant to him.","He looked at Cang Feng and said indifferently, “The third strike.”","With that, Cang Feng’s eyes flashed with a look of fear as he looked at Hong Ye for help. He raised his head with great difficulty and said weakly, “Hong...Hong Ye, save me...”","Hong Ye’s eyes flickered as she stepped in front of Cang Feng and extended her hand, “Stop! We admit defeat in this battle, and you can take this God Sealing Tablet!”","As soon as he finished speaking, a touch of joy flashed in the eyes of Mountain Shaker and the others. They quickly turned to look at Jian Wushuang and said, “Blood Sword, it’s done.”","However, Jian Wushuang seemed to ignore it and said indifferently, “I said three swords, and I mean three swords. no one can block it.”","The third sword, Sundering Stars!","“Whoosh!”","In an instant, time seemed to have stopped. The surging wind, floating clouds, and floating dust in the void all turned into the purest energy, shooting from all directions like a hundred rivers flowing back. Finally, they all gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hand and turned into a silver sword rainbow that was a thousand feet long!","Jian Wushuang spread his fingers and held the sword rainbow. There seemed to be an invisible force between heaven and earth that lifted him up.","At this moment, he no longer concealed his aura. A sharp sword essence shot up into the sky as if it was going to shatter the chaos and split the world!","Jian Wushuang was like the sword God Ling Chen!","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang said coldly.","In an instant, the thousand-foot sword rainbow slashed down!","This sword was vast and mighty, directly splitting the sky nearly 10000 feet apart!","“This?”","Hong Ye’s expression changed drastically. Even he felt a sense of powerlessness in the face of this sword.","A sense of threat that was like a piercing light enveloped him!","For the first time, apart from facing a powerful being, Hong Ye felt like he was about to die!","“This person...I can’t block it.”","Hong Ye took a deep breath, and a serious look appeared in his eyes.","He then turned to Cang Feng and shook his head, “Cang Feng, you’re on your own.”","After saying that, Hong Ye actually took a step and fled.","“No!”","Seeing this, Cang Feng let out a howl of despair.","Bang!","The Sundering Stars sword finally slashed down!","Under this sword, it was as if the heavens were angry and doomsday disasters were coming. The earth began to crack and split, and bottomless chasms appeared!","The violent sword Qi swept in all directions, setting off a storm that razed everything to the ground!","Everyone’s expression changed drastically, and they retreated thousands of feet!","The might of a single sword is so terrifying!!","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air and thought of the same thing.","In the middle of the storm, Jian Wushuang had put away the Wuqi Divine Sword in his Interspatial Ring.","The storm gradually dissipated, only to see that the thousand-foot area where the seal was hidden was in ruins.","There was no trace of Cang Feng’s life there. Under this sword, Cang Feng’s body and soul were completely destroyed. He could not be more dead!"]},{"number":4258,"title":"Chapter 4258 Meeting the Overlord","paragraphs":["4258 Meeting the Overlord","Hu hu hu.","Gusts of wind gradually blew away the smoke and dust.","Everyone who saw this scene trembled all over, and their hair stood on end.","No one spoke. Everyone was still immersed in Jian Wushuang’s amazing sword.","The scene turned into a dead silence.","This sword attack had far surpassed their knowledge and understanding of the sword doctrine.","This sword-strike was comparable to an invincible Ruler’s!","Under the might of the sword, Hong Ye fled while Cang Feng perished.","“H-how can this person be so powerful?”","“Zang Feng is a Ruler who’s almost at the invincible level!”","“Three sword strikes! This person really only used three sword moves! And these three swords killed Cang Feng!”","“This person is the Overlord’s subordinate. It’s the Overlord’s blessing!”","He killed the cold disaster, retreated the red leaves, and destroyed the hidden seal. This person is invincible!","Countless people trembled as they discussed.","However, the discussion was a little different.","The Ruler who belonged to the Nine Stars Holy Land camp was chattering his teeth. His voice was filled with fear, and his face was ashen.","They looked at Jian Wushuang in shock and trembled. They did not dare to move, for fear that Jian Wushuang would kill them all with another stroke if he was unhappy.","They believed that if Jian Wushuang wanted to kill them, it would not be more difficult than killing Cang Feng.","Although the Overlord’s subordinate, the creator, was shocked, he was also rejoicing.","“Good, good, this Blood Sword is from our side. Otherwise, who could stop him?”","“With this Blood Sword, who will I be afraid of in the future?”","Ruler Grotto Profound’s mouth was wide open, and a sense of absurdity welled up in his heart.","It was this person. He actually said that he would give him some pointers? Tell him to hide behind his back and not provoke others?","Looking at Jian Wushuang, Ruler Grotto Profound’s face turned red, and he wanted to find a hole to hide in.","“The Blood Sword...”","Even Commander Mountain Shaker swallowed his saliva.","Under this sword, even he could not guarantee in his heart whether he, who had astonishing defensive power, had the confidence to take this Sundering Stars sword.","At the center of the storm.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void with his hands behind his back. His eyes were bright and his jet-black hair was loose on his shoulders. The breeze gently blew his loose black robe.","He was so ordinary, but at this moment, he was as dazzling as the stars in the sky.","Countless gazes gathered.","It was as if even billions of starlights were inferior to him.","“I want the God Sealing Tablet. Do you have any objections?”","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked down at the remaining Ultimate Rulers of the Nine Stars Holy Land.","“I don’t dare, I don’t dare.”","The remaining Ultimate Rulers immediately waved their hands, not daring to look into Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“Good.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and walked down from the sky into the crowd of Overlord’s subordinates.","“Blood Sword, you really bring me one surprise after another.”","Said Commander Mountain Shaker with a bitter smile.","In this world, the strong were respected, and the current Jian Wushuang was on equal footing with him, or even higher than him.","“I was just lucky.”","Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Commander Mountain Shaker laughed bitterly and said no more.","‘Good luck?’","‘Do you think I’m stupid?’","Taking a deep breath, the commander turned to the remaining Ultimate Ruler of the Nine Stars Holy Land and said in a deep voice, “I’ll give you two choices now. The first is that you will all die here for the Nine Stars Holy Land. The second is to forsake the dark and join the light, and join us, the Overlord!”","The remaining Ultimate Rulers of the Nine Stars Holy Land were all overjoyed.","As long as they did not exterminate them, they could do whatever they wanted.","“We are willing to serve the Overlord!”","“Yes!” The remaining Ultimate Rulers of the Nine Stars Holy Land immediately cupped their hands in respect.","Seeing this, Commander Mountain Shaker nodded in satisfaction and said, “In that case, follow me to see the Overlord.”","A moment later, Commander Mountain Shaker put away The Investiture of the Gods, and the group of people swept toward the 12th city.","The overlord was in the Eleventh City.","...","After returning to the First City, Commander Mountain Shaker first made arrangements for the Ultimate Rulers of the Nine Stars Holy Land. Then, he looked for Jian Wushuang.","“Blood Sword, I’ve told the overlord about you. He’s very curious about you now, so he sent me to invite you to his palace to reward you.”","Said Commander Mountain Shaker with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Then I’ll have to trouble Commander Mountain Shaker to lead the way.”","“It’s no trouble at all. It’s what I should do.”","Commander Mountain Shaker waved his hand with a smile and led Jian Wushuang to a group of palaces.","This group of palaces was extremely magnificent and huge. There were no less than a thousand ordinary palaces. In the center of the palace, there was an extremely towering hall.","The hall was made of divine crystals and white jade, and the words ‘Conqueror’s Divine Palace’ were engraved on the card in gold. The strokes were vast and bold, and it was full of a sense of Majesty.","The two of them quickly arrived outside the hall.","“Greetings, Commander Mountain Shaker!”","“Yes!” The two Ultimate Rulers in charge of guarding the palace cupped their hands.","Commander Mountain Shaker nodded in response. He then looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Blood Sword, I’ll go in and report first. You wait here for a while.”","“Go,” Jian Wushuang replied with a calm expression.","Commander Mountain Shaker no longer hesitated. He strode into the overlord’s divine palace.","After about the time it took for an incense stick to burn, a long cry came from inside.","“Lord Blood Sword, the Overlord has invited you.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed and he immediately stepped into the Overlord Divine Palace.","The Overlord’s building was extremely spacious and Grand. It was supported by four pillars that reached to the sky, and golden dragons coiled around it.","Jian Wushuang looked up and saw a golden dragon throne made of top divine materials in the center of the hall. There were six big chairs under it, and six people were sitting on the wooden chairs in a row.","Commander Mountain Shaker was sitting in the second seat on the left.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the six people. Their cultivation was almost at the invincible level of Rulers.","These six people must be the six great commanders under the Overlord.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes did not stay on the six people for long. he looked at the dragon throne in the center of the hall.","There, an extremely burly giant with twisted muscles was sitting on the dragon throne.","This person’s skin was covered in mysterious golden runes. He had a square face and heavy brows. His eyes were bright and filled with a sense of power without being angry. With just a glance, one could not help but feel fear.","This person was one of the Nine Magnates in the depths of the Ancient Path of Stars. He possessed the undying tyrant body, the Overlord!","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes slightly. This person’s Qi and blood were extremely strong. Even from such a distance, Jian Wushuang could feel the violent power contained in this person’s body.","When Jian Wushuang looked at the man, the man also looked at Jian Wushuang.","“You are the Blood Sword?”","The overlord said in a low voice.","“Blood Sword greets the Overlord.”","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts, cupped his hands and replied in a neither humble nor overbearing manner."]},{"number":4259,"title":"Chapter 4259 The Seventh Commander’s Blood Sword!","paragraphs":["4259 The Seventh Commander’s Blood Sword!","In the Overlord’s Divine Palace.","The six commanders sat in a row and looked at Jian Wushuang curiously. They wanted to see what was so special about this newcomer who could kill an almost invincible Ruler and force Hong Ye to retreat with three moves.","However, they were disappointed. Jian Wushuang’s aura was ordinary. They could not tell how strong or weak he was. It was as if he was just an ordinary person among the masses.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm and his heart was calm. He was just speculating about the Overlord’s strength.","The Overlord’s Blood Qi was as dazzling as the sun, and no one dared to look directly at him. Most likely, cultivators who were close to the level of invincible Rulers would not even have the right to get close to him.","“Is this the strength of a big shot?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed.","The great conqueror’s strength was definitely one of the strongest among the unparalleled Rulers. He was much stronger than Lord Zhennan, the Third Prince, and the others who had been in the Tarot Ruins.","It could be said that among all the Ultimate Rulers that Jian Wushuang had met, this person could be called the strongest, except for the Ninth Kalpa King!","Even when facing the Ninth Kalpa King who was at the Ultimate Ruler realm, this person’s strength was only a little weaker.","“Blood Sword, there’s no need to be so polite with this King.” The Overlord said indifferently.","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and nodded.","“Blood Sword, according to Mountain Shaker, you have contributed a lot to his success in obtaining the deification tablet. If you didn’t kill Cold Disaster and Cang Feng and force Hong Ye to retreat, the deification tablet would have fallen into his hands.” The Overlord continued.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled and said humbly, “Overlord, you must be joking. I only did a little bit of my power. It wasn’t enough to affect the overall situation.”","“Oh? Blood Sword, you’re a strange person. Other people are trying to take the credit for themselves, but you’re acting as if you’re afraid of being rewarded.” The Overlord was a little dumbfounded.","Usually, when he met the Rulers under his command, almost all of them would try their best to show off their abilities in front of him, bragging about how strong they were. No matter how big or small the credit was, they would try their best to take it on themselves, just hoping that he would look at them with respect.","As for Jian Wushuang in front of him, from the moment he entered the sect, not only did he not show any excitement on his face after seeing him, but even when he took the initiative to praise him, Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm from beginning to end, without the slightest bit of complacency.","The Overlord could not help but think highly of Jian Wushuang.","To remain calm even when flattered or insulted, to remain calm even when Mount Tai collapses in front of you, this was the appearance of a great person.","The Overlord looked at Jian Wushuang again. Just as he was about to say something, the words that were on the tip of his tongue suddenly stopped. As if he had discovered something incredible, his expression changed slightly.","Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang with a three-inch golden light in his eyes!","The next moment, the Overlord retracted the golden light in his eyes and said in a deep voice, “Blood Sword, if I’m not wrong, you’re only a fifth stage Ruler, right?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the entire hall was shocked!","“What? A fifth-stage chief Ruler?”","“Impossible! A fifth-stage chief Ruler killing an almost invincible chief Ruler? that’s completely impossible!”","“A fifth stage great emperor killing an almost invincible Ruler is unprecedented! I’ve never heard of it!”","“I’ve never heard of a fifth stage great Ruler killing an almost invincible great Ruler! Even the Supreme existences who rule the universe today might not be able to do it when they were fifth stage great Rulers!”","“I think the overlord must have seen wrong! Yes, that must be it!”","The expressions of the six commanders were all very serious.","Even Commander Mountain Shaker was shaking his head in disbelief.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. He had not expected that the Overlord would see through his hidden cultivation.","After pondering for a while, Jian Wushuang decided not to hide it anymore. He nodded and replied, “Yes.”","As soon as he finished speaking, an aura belonging to a fifth stage Ruler immediately spread out from Jian Wushuang’s body.","Feeling this aura, the six commanders felt as if they had been struck by lightning, and their bodies trembled violently.","“It really is a fifth stage great Ruler!”","“As a fifth-stage Ruler, he killed an almost-invincible Ruler with three sword strikes! How could there be such a monstrous person in this world?”","“This is crazy!”","In an instant, the entire Conqueror’s Divine Palace was in an uproar!","The six commanders were all dumbfounded, their eyes almost popping out of their sockets.","Even the Overlord had a look of bewilderment in his eyes after getting Jian Wushuang’s confirmation.","“He really is a Ruler of the fifth level.” The Overlord exclaimed in surprise.","Jian Wushuang killing Cang Feng with three moves was already terrifying enough. Jian Wushuang was only a stage five great emperor. What kind of concept was that?","Everyone knew that there was a huge gap between the fifth level and the Ultimate Ruler’s sword.","Once a fifth stage Ruler became an Ultimate Ruler, nine laws would merge, and his strength would increase by leaps and bounds!","Jian Wushuang was only a fifth-level Ruler, but he could easily kill you, who was almost invincible. What would happen when he advanced to the Ultimate Ruler?","Instantly, the six commanders felt a chill all over their bodies, and they did not dare to think further.","The Overlord took a deep breath and his expression gradually became calm. He was one of the strongest Rulers in the entire universe. Although he was shocked that Jian Wushuang, a Ruler of the fifth level, had killed a Ruler of an almost invincible level, it was not to the extent that he could not speak.","“Blood Sword, it’s my blessing that you’re under my command.”","The conqueror smiled and continued, “Blood Sword, the fact that you were able to kill Cang Feng means that your battle-power is close to that of an unparalleled Ruler. In the last eight cities, people who are close to the unparalleled Ruler level of battle-power are referred to as commander-level battle-power, and those who possess this level of battle-power are often given the position of commander-level in any faction! This king’s subordinates are naturally the same.”","“I wonder if you are willing to become the seventh commander under me?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and then nodded with a smile, “Thank you for your appreciation for the Blood Sword, Overlord.”","“Hahaha, don’t ever say the word ‘love’ again. It’s nothing more than you and this King having the same goal, so we can win together.”","The Overlord laughed and got up from his Dragon Throne. He looked out of the hall and said in a deep voice, “Men, pass down this King’s orders! From today onwards, I will grant Blood Sword the position of commander. Feng Blood Sword will be the seventh commander under me!”","“Yes!”","Suddenly, a long cry came from outside the door.","A God armor guard set up a black gold chair and placed it beside the six commanders.","After Jian Wushuang took his seat, the Overlord spoke again in a deep voice, “I’ll also bestow Blood Sword with 10 million Universe Origin Stones, 100 godly medicines, and three top-tier law Cardinal treasures!","“Yes!” A long voice came from outside again.","A God armor guard respectfully walked over with a jade plate in his hands.","On the jade plate was a black cosmos ring!","The Interspatial Ring represented Jian Wushuang’s status as a commander of a region. The 10 million Universe Origin Stones and 100 divine medicines that he had given to the universe were all in it.","Even Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly and was surprised by such a grand gesture.","And this was not the end.","The Overlord’s voice was heard again.","“Three Blood Swords and one piece of The Investiture of the Gods!”"]},{"number":4260,"title":"Chapter 4260 Bestowing","paragraphs":["4260 Bestowing","“Three Blood Swords and one piece of The Investiture of the Gods!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the Overlord waved his hand and a square stone tablet suddenly appeared in his hand.","The stone tablet expanded in the wind and soon, it was like a small mound, sitting in the center of the hall.","Jian Wushuang looked at it carefully and saw that the stone tablet was dark and the words ‘Investiture of the Gods’ were written on it.","“Commander Blood Sword, please accept this God Sealing Tablet,” the Overlord laughed heartily.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang did not refuse and put The Investiture of the Gods into his Interspatial Ring.","“We congratulate Commander Blood Sword. In the future, the seven of us will have to take care of each other and work together.” When the six commanders saw this, they congratulated him.","“Of course,” Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","The Overlord saw this scene and could not help but nod to himself. He then said to the six commanders, “Buxu, Mountain Shaker, Cold Disaster...the six of you will each select ten Omega Rulers from your subordinates and hand them over to Commander Blood Sword.”","“Yes!”","The six commanders quickly acknowledged.","After that, the Overlord gave some more instructions and ordered them to retreat.","After Jian Wushuang and the other seven commanders left, the Overlord Divine Palace fell into silence.","The smile on the Overlord’s face gradually disappeared. He looked at the empty hall and said indifferently, “Fei Ying, what do you think of this Blood Sword?”","As soon as he finished speaking, a thin black shadow walked out from behind the Overlord.","His entire body was covered in a black robe, making it impossible to see his appearance. He knelt down on one knee and replied in a hoarse voice, “Lord Overlord, I can’t tell how powerful this Blood Sword is, but I can roughly estimate that it’s probably already at the threshold of an unparalleled Ruler.”","“The threshold to becoming an invincible Ruler, huh?”","The Overlord squinted his eyes and raised his head to look into the distance. No one knew what he was thinking, but his fingers rhythmically tapped on the armrest of the Dragon Throne, making a ‘du du du’ sound.","The black-robed figure continued, “Lord Overlord, and...I can sense that the Blood Sword has discovered me.”","The Overlord nodded and did not reply. After a long while, he slowly said, “This Blood Sword isn’t a simple person. I don’t believe that someone who can kill an almost invincible Ruler as a fifth-stage great Ruler would remain unknown in the universe.”","“Fei Ying, go out and investigate this Blood Sword for me. You must find out what kind of divine being this Blood Sword is.”","“Yes!”","The black-clothed figure’s voice sank as he planned to fly out.","“Wait.”","The Overlord opened his mouth again and called out to him. His eyes flickered as he said, “Don’t alarm anyone for this investigation. I have something to tell you.”","“What is it? You can speak your mind, my Lord.”","“Make a trip to the tenth city and find the person who broke through to the eighth level in the God Refining Tower! If you find this person, you must lower your attitude and tell him that this King has invited him to meet.”","“Yes, sir!”","After the black-clothed figure left, the Overlord sat on the Dragon Throne. A thoughtful look flashed through his eyes, and then he slowly closed his eyes.","...","In just one day, Jian Wushuang’s seventh governor’s mansion was completed. It was built with various divine materials and looked extremely luxurious.","That night, the night wind was blowing. Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in a wing room, holding the Interspatial Ring that the Overlord had given him today, and a playful look flashed in his eyes.","Today, in the hall, the Overlord seemed to be bold and generous. In fact, Jian Wushuang could feel that the Overlord was obviously suspicious of him. Behind the Overlord, there was a pair of cold eyes staring at him.","However, Jian Wushuang did not take it to heart. After all, his appearance and rise were too sudden. If it were anyone else, Xin Zhou would have some thoughts.","“In a few more days, when the Wuqi Divine Sword is completely repaired, I’ll leave this place.”","Jian Wushuang was deep in thought. he had not entered the eight cities on the Ancient Path of Stars to risk his life for others.","Then, Jian Wushuang turned over his right hand and the Wuqi Divine Sword was placed in front of his knees.","The Wuqi Divine Sword was stained with spots of poison, which were caused by the venom of the Heavenly Snake Playboy when it dripped on the Wuqi Divine Sword.","However, after Jian Wushuang had nourished it with divine power day and night during this period of time, more than half of the poisonous spots had been removed. There were only some marks left.","It would not take long for the Wuqi Divine Sword to be completely repaired.","Jian Wushuang flipped his right hand again and two poisonous fangs floated in front of him.","The two venomous fangs were the essence of Heavenly Snake Playboy. When Heavenly Snake Playboy was killed by Jian Wushuang, only these two venomous fangs were left.","These two venomous fangs can probably be refined into three drops of venom, and just one drop of venom is enough to kill a weaker invincible Ruler like Lord Zhennan. When the three of them are used together, even the Conqueror, who has the undying Overlord body, will have to retreat.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he immediately began to refine the two venomous fangs.","Time flew by, and three months passed in the blink of an eye.","One day, while Jian Wushuang was cultivating, Commander Mountain Shaker’s hearty laughter suddenly came from outside the door.","“Blood Sword, the six of us have finished selecting the final Rulers. Come out and take a look.”","In the wing room, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a light flashed in his eyes.","Back then, the Overlord had said that each of the six commanders would choose ten Ultimate Rulers from their own subordinates and hand them over to Jian Wushuang. It seemed that the six commanders had already completed their selection and were here to send the people over.","“They’re here.”","Jian Wushuang replied indifferently. Then, he took a step forward and disappeared from the room.","...","...","At the same time, at the entrance of the tenth city.","A black shadow condensed. Then, a hunchbacked monster with spikes on its back appeared at the entrance of the Tenth City’s passage.","“So this is the Tenth City? There doesn’t seem to be anything special about it.” The monster’s white eyes rolled slightly as it looked up at the Tenth City and clicked its tongue.","This person was Qiu Long!","“Hey, you dog slave. You said that the Blood Sword has arrived in the tenth city, right?”","Beside him was a grey-haired old man who was being held by a black chain.","The old man with white hair and a white beard had both his hands and feet on the ground. He looked at Qiu Long with fear in his eyes.","If Jian Wushuang had been there, he would have realized that the old man was the City Lord of the Ninth City! A veteran Ultimate Ruler!","“It’s...yes, but I don’t know if the Blood Sword has left the Tenth City and entered the last eight cities.”","The Ninth City’s City Lord said in a trembling voice.","“Hehe, it’s fine. I can take my time to look for him.”","Qiu Long grinned, revealing two rows of sharp and cold teeth"]},{"number":4261,"title":"Chapter 4261 The Tenth City","paragraphs":["4261 The Tenth City","The Tenth City.","Qiu Long held the Ninth City’s City Lord’s hand as they strolled down the streets of the Tenth City. They immediately attracted a lot of attention.","“Who is this person?”","“Then...why does the old man who’s being held by the hand look so familiar?”","“Not good! This old man is the Ninth City’s City Lord, Divine Lord Qian Qi!”","“Divine Lord Qian Qi is a veteran Ultimate Ruler. How could he be a slave?”","“What’s this person’s background?”","Immediately, after the white-haired old man’s identity was recognized, it immediately caused a burst of exclamations in the crowd. Everyone quietly moved back a little, keeping a distance from Qiu Long.","But there were also some Ultimate Rulers who could not stand it. They immediately stood up, and one of them said with a cold face, “Sir, Divine Lord Qian Qi has always been on good terms with others and has never gotten involved in disputes. I wonder how he has offended you for you to treat him like this? As if you’re a pig or a dog?”","As a veteran Ultimate Ruler, Divine Lord Qian Qi had stayed in the Ancient Path of Stars’ Ninth City for tens of thousands of years. He was also a good person and was naturally popular.","The people who stood out to speak were the people who had received Divine Lord Qian Qi’s favor in the past.","When Qiu Long saw that, he chuckled and patted Divine Lord Qian Qi’s head casually, causing his head to produce loud slapping sounds. He squinted his eyes and said, “Dog slave, I didn’t expect you to be so popular in a place full of trash.”","Divine Lord Qian Qi’s heart trembled. He did not know what had happened to him. Despite being humiliated by Qiu Long, there was not any anger on his face. Instead, it was filled with fear.","“Dog slave, I think these people are too noisy. What do you think?” Qiu Long raised his head and looked at the few Ultimate Rulers who spoke up for justice and chuckled.","When Divine Lord Qian Qi heard that, he nodded his head in agreement, just like a dog wagging its tail to its owner to please him.","“Hahaha, you’re becoming more and more like a slave.”","“Haha!” Qiu Long laughed and stretched out his right hand, grabbing at the few Ultimate Rulers who had spoken out for justice.","“I’ll get them to accompany you!”","Whoosh!","Qiu Long’s arm suddenly stretched out, and his five fingernails turned black and sharp like five ribbons. Then, he clawed down!","“You’re looking for death!”","Instantly, the expressions of the few Ultimate Rulers changed. Divine power surged from their bodies, and they struck at Qiu Long’s arm!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Like stones sinking into the ocean, the attacks of these Ultimate Rulers landed on Qiu Long’s arm and were obliterated without even causing a ripple.","The next moment!","Bang!","Qiu Long’s five fingers suddenly grabbed the neck of one of the Ultimate Rulers.","“Come over here!”","“Hehe!” Qiu Long sneered, and in an instant, he grabbed the Ultimate Ruler.","No matter how he, the Ultimate Ruler, struggled, the five fingers of the Dragon-trapping prisoner were like five towering mountains, rendering him unable to move.","“I think I heard you criticizing me just now? Hehe.” Qiu Long chuckled, and then a bone spike shot out from his back. It transformed into a pitch-black chain that bound the neck of the Ultimate Ruler.","“Since you care so much about this dog slave, then you can accompany him!”","“Run!” The remaining Ultimate Ruler’s expression changed upon seeing this, and he immediately turned to flee.","However, the next moment...","Whoosh! Whoosh!","On the back of the dragon, the black bone spikes turned into black chains again and shot toward the Ultimate Rulers!","In the space of a few breaths, the black chains had pierced through the bodies of these Ultimate Rulers.","Then, the Ultimate Rulers all fell and turned into dust amid their shrill howls.","All of a sudden, on the streets of the Tenth City, Qiu Long’s strange laughter and mournful wails sounded one after another.","On another street.","Ruler Hao Jin wielded a spear and was dressed in godly armor as he patrolled the area.","After Jian Wushuang had left, he had sought refuge with Lord Blue. Now, he was working under Lord Blue as a divine armor guard while he trained himself and improved his cultivation. He wanted to pass the God Refining Tower trial as soon as possible, enter the back eight cities, and rely on Jian Wushuang.","Ruler Hao Jin frowned when he heard the screams from the nearby streets. He decided to go over and take a look.","Ruler Hao Jin walked to the side of the street and immediately saw the scene of Qiu Long killing several other Rulers.","“Eh, another one.”","Qiu Long’s white eyes turned slightly as he looked at the approaching Ruler Hao Jin. The corners of his mouth slowly curled up into an evil smile.","Ruler Hao Jin’s heart instantly turned cold. He wasn’t a slow-witted person. When he saw this, he immediately realized that this person was far from someone he could fight against. He immediately turned to flee.","“This person is quite clever.”","Qiu Long shook his head. Just as he was about to let Ruler Hao Jin off, Divine Lord Qian Qi suddenly said, “Master, aren’t you looking for the Blood Sword? I remember that the person just now was the Blood Sword’s partner. If we can capture him, we’ll definitely know where the Blood Sword is.”","“Oh?”","“You’re courting death!” Qiu Long raised an eyebrow, and he immediately shot out a large hand to grab Ruler Hao Jin, who had already fled a thousand kilometers.","Ruler Hao Jin’s expression changed drastically, but he knew that struggling was useless. He resigned himself to his fate and allowed the Dragon to grab him.","“You...what do you want to do?” Ruler Hao Jin’s lips trembled as he looked at Qiu Long.","Qiu Long sized up Ruler Hao Jin and chuckled. “I ask you, do you know where the Blood Sword is?”","“You’re looking for Lord Blood Sword?”","Ruler Hao Jin’s heart instantly trembled.","...","At the same time, in the 12th city.","After Jian Wushuang flew out of the governor’s mansion, he immediately saw the six commanders, including Commander Mountain Shaker, coming over together. There were also sixty Ultimate Rulers standing behind them.","Seeing Jian Wushuang come out, except for the ten Ultimate Rulers behind Commander Mountain Shaker, who looked extremely reverent because they had seen Jian Wushuang fight, the other fifty Ultimate Rulers looked at Jian Wushuang with disdain. They did not show any respect.","“Blood Sword, I’ve brought you the person. We still have important matters to attend to, so we’ll take our leave first.” Mountain Shaker and the other six great commanders greeted him with a smile.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang nodded.","The few of them chatted for a while more before the six commanders left, leaving Jian Wushuang and the sixty Ultimate Rulers.","At first, with the six commanders present, the fifty Ultimate Rulers didn’t dare to be too presumptuous. However, after the six commanders left, the fifty Ultimate Rulers looked at Jian Wushuang with disdain.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head in his heart. He knew that these people were disdainful of him. He also knew that they were dissatisfied with the sudden transfer from their original commander and wanted to give him a chance to show off his power.","However, Jian Wushuang did not bother to argue with them. He said indifferently, “You can do whatever you want. I won’t restrict you too much, as long as you don’t disturb me.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang turned around and walked away. Now that the Wuqi Divine Sword was about to be repaired and the two venomous fangs of Heavenly Snake Playboy were about to be refined, it was time for him to leave."]},{"number":4262,"title":"Chapter 4262 A Battle Bet","paragraphs":["4262 A Battle Bet","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave.","“I heard you’re only a fifth stage Ruler, Blood Sword?” A bald man walked out of the crowd and looked down at Jian Wushuang with his chin.","Jian Wushuang stopped and turned back to look at the bald man. He said indifferently, “That’s right. I’m only a fifth stage great Ruler. But so what?”","The moment he finished speaking.","The crowd burst into laughter.","“Hahahaha, a mere fifth-stage chief Ruler wants to command us ultimate chief Rulers? What a joke.”","“A fifth-stage chief Ruler? I can kill a group of them with a single slap!”","“Hmph, if word of us being led by a mere fifth stage great Ruler like you were to spread, wouldn’t we become a laughing stock?”","The Ultimate Rulers all laughed coldly.","When the ten Ultimate Rulers, led by Commander Mountain Shaker, saw this, their faces filled with anger.","They were very grateful to Jian Wushuang. They knew that if it were not for Jian Wushuang, they would not even be able to stand here, let alone get the God Sealing Tablet.","“What are you guys talking about? Lord Blood Sword might only be a fifth stage Ruler, but his battle-power was definitely at the peak of Rulers! Ceng Sanjian killed Cang Feng, who was nearly invincible!” One of the ten Ultimate Rulers immediately retorted.","However, this person’s voice was too small and was quickly drowned out by the loud laughter.","“A fifth-stage chief Ruler killed a chief Ruler who was almost invincible? You believe such a ridiculous joke?”","The bald man looked at the ten angry Ultimate Rulers with disdain. Then, he looked straight at Jian Wushuang and sized him up. He sneered, “If this Blood Sword really had such battle power, it would’ve been famous in the universe long ago. The way I see it, this is a trap set up by the other camps to target our Lord Overlord. They deliberately put on such a show so that Blood Sword can enter the Overlord’s camp and be entrusted with an important task.”","“Shut up! When Lord Blood Sword killed Cang Feng, we all saw it with our own eyes!” The Ultimate Ruler did not wait for him to finish speaking. His face was cold.","When the bald man heard this, he immediately curled his lips and replied indifferently, “Who knows if you guys have already been assimilated by the other factions?”","As soon as he said this, the ten Ultimate Rulers led by Commander Mountain Shaker changed their expressions.","The entire place was so silent that even a pin drop could be heard.","The power of these words was too great. It was almost as if they were saying that the ten of them were spies sent by the subordinates of other big shots.","Seeing this, the bald man felt that he had made a mistake and said again, “Of course, I was just casually saying it. I didn’t mean to target you.”","As for the ten Ultimate Rulers, they could not hold back any longer. In an instant, their divine power began to surge.","For a moment, the atmosphere at the scene was tense and dangerous.","Jian Wushuang looked at the scene and frowned.","Now that he was about to leave, he did not want to get involved too much. He turned a blind eye to these sixty Ultimate Rulers who had been assigned to him. As long as these people did not go too far, he would listen.","However, this did not mean that Jian Wushuang was weak and easily bullied!","It did not mean that Jian Wushuang would allow others to challenge his dignity!","“What’s your name?” Jian Wushuang looked at the bald man and said expressionlessly.","The bald man did not show any fear on his face. He stuck out his chest and sneered, “I never change my name. You can just call me Divine Lord Xue Peng!”","“Divine Lord Xue Peng?” Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “Since you’re not convinced that I’m able to take the commander’s position, why don’t we have a battle?”","“Oh? You want to bet with me?” Divine Lord Xue Peng raised his eyebrows when he heard that. He then laughed and said jokingly, “Little fellow, how do you want to bet with me?”","“It’s simple. I’ll only use one finger. If you can take it, you’ll be the commander from now on. I, Blood Sword, will follow your orders without any objections.” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang’s voice suddenly turned cold.","“If you can’t take it, then...I will take your life!”","When he said that, Jian Wushuang had already exerted some pressure. In an instant, Divine Lord Xue Peng’s heart turned cold and he had the illusion that he wanted to kneel down and submit.","After taking a deep breath, Divine Lord Xue Peng made up his mind and sneered, “You’re just a mere fifth stage great Ruler, why wouldn’t I dare?”","After hearing that, Jian Wushuang remained expressionless while the ten Ultimate Rulers brought by Commander Mountain Shaker had already mourned for Divine Lord Xue Peng in their hearts.","They looked at each other and could see the joy in each other’s eyes.","It was obvious that they had hated Divine Lord Xue Peng to the core!","“Then let’s start.”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He raised his finger and pressed it between Divine Lord Xue Peng’s eyebrows.","Sharp sword Qi began to gather at Jian Wushuang’s fingertips.","“Returning shield!”","Although Divine Lord Xue Peng looked reckless and rude, he did not really look down on Jian Wushuang as he appeared to be. He quickly took out a top grade defense law Cardinal treasure from his Interspatial Ring.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Streams of sword Qi gathered on Jian Wushuang’s fingertips and the entire governor’s manor started to tremble.","It was as if a storm of sword Qi had formed at his fingertips!","At that moment, the expressions of the many Ultimate Rulers present changed drastically. They could clearly feel the terrifying power contained in Jian Wushuang’s fingertips!","This finger was enough to blow up a planet!","“Retreat!”","“Retreat!” The dozens of Ultimate Rulers immediately growled and retreated!","As for Divine Lord Xue Peng, who had been targeted by Jian Wushuang’s finger, his expression turned pale and beads of sweat the size of beans appeared on his forehead.","He gritted his teeth and stared at Jian Wushuang’s finger that was getting closer and closer to him. He trembled in fear.","He wanted to escape with those Ultimate Rulers, but he felt an invisible and extremely powerful aura suppressing him, making him unable to move at all!","“What...how could this be?” Divine Lord Xue Peng said in disbelief.","Gradually, the finger pressed on the shield of returning origin that was in front of him.","Kacha!","Without any resistance, the origin returning shield, which was known for its strong defense, cracked and finally fell apart with a bang!","The next moment!","The finger kept enlarging in Divine Lord Xue Peng’s eyes. It grew bigger and bigger...","In the end, the finger landed on his forehead!"]},{"number":4263,"title":"Chapter 4263 Closed-Door Cultivation for 60 Years","paragraphs":["4263 Closed-Door Cultivation for 60 Years","After Jian Wushuang’s finger touched the place between Divine Lord Xue Peng’s eyebrows, Divine Lord Xue Peng felt a huge pressure from Jian Wushuang’s finger. His legs went soft and he knelt down in front of Jian Wushuang with a plop.","“No...no, Lord Commander, I know I was wrong.” His throat kept rolling, and bean-sized beads of sweat dripped down his forehead.","“It’s too late.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head when he heard that. From his fingertips, sharp sword essence shot into Divine Lord Xue Peng’s divine body.","Bang!","An earth-shattering explosion rang out!","Immediately, Divine Lord Xue Peng’s body was crushed and there was no breath of life!","Apart from the people brought by Commander Mountain Shaker, the remaining dozens of Ultimate Rulers were all shocked as if they had seen a ghost, and their bodies trembled.","“This...what kind of heaven-defying combat strength is this?”","Everyone was terrified. Those who had provoked Jian Wushuang earlier were so frightened that they almost fell to the ground.","Naturally, no one who could make it to the last eight cities on the ancient path of starry sky was weak. In the outside world, they would be the proud sons of heaven in their respective sects and Holy Lands. As for Divine Lord Xue Peng, he dared to take the lead to stir up trouble because he was confident in his own strength. Among the dozens of Ultimate Rulers, he was considered one of the top experts.","In the end, such an expert had been killed by Jian Wushuang with just one finger?","Just how powerful was this Blood Sword?","Everyone did not dare to continue thinking.","As for the ten Ultimate Rulers that Commander Mountain Shaker had brought with him, they looked at each other and smiled. There was no surprise on their faces. Even Cang Feng, who was almost an unrivaled Ruler, had been killed by Jian Wushuang with three sword moves. Xue Peng was only a top expert among the Ultimate Rulers. How could he still be alive?","However, they had never expected that Jian Wushuang would kill Divine Lord Xue Peng with just one finger without even using his sword.","This raised Jian Wushuang’s status in their hearts to another level.","“Do you have any objections to me being the seventh commander?” Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back. He glanced at the dozens of Rulers and said with a faint smile.","“I don’t dare, I don’t dare.”","The Rulers immediately shook their heads like rattle-drums.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang ignored them and slowly walked toward a wing room.","“Without my order, no one is allowed to come within thirty meters of this room.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the two wooden doors of the room opened automatically. Jian Wushuang stepped in and then closed the door tightly with a muffled bang.","...","...","Time passed and spring and autumn changed.","Sixty years passed.","Sixty years was already more than half of a mortal’s life, but to cultivators, it was just a snap of the fingers.","In the depths of the seventh commander’s manor, a muffled sound suddenly came from a side room that had been sealed for sixty years.","A black-robed, black-haired, cold-looking young man was sitting cross-legged in the room. His eyes were closed, and an ancient sword manual was placed in front of him.","The word ‘Tarot’ was carved into the sword manual. This was the famous Tarot sword manual from 300 chaos cycles ago!","In the next moment, the black-haired young man slowly opened his eyes, which were filled with joy.","Although the sixty-year-long closed-door cultivation was not long, or rather, extremely short, it had helped Jian Wushuang improve greatly.","In the past sixty years, Jian Wushuang had not only repaired the Wuqi Divine Sword, but also refined the two venomous fangs into three drops of Supreme venom that could kill an unparalleled Ruler.","This meant that Jian Wushuang had one more trump card.","Once the three drops of venom were used at the right time, they could easily kill low-level invincible Rulers such as Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince. Jian Wushuang would then be able to get rid of the awkward situation where he could only kill invincible Rulers by relying on the sword technique ‘eternal night’.","Even the nine great overlords in the depths of the Ancient Path of Stars, the Rulers of the universe, would die to these three drops of poison if they were careless.","However, this was nothing to Jian Wushuang’s improvement.","Jian Wushuang’s greatest improvement in the sixty years was his sword principle!","After breaking through to the fourth level of sword principle origin, Jian Wushuang had not had the time to sort out his own sword principle origin.","In the past sixty years, Jian Wushuang had relied on the fourth level of the universe sword principle origin to not only sort out and deduce all the sword principle super powers he had learned along the way, but also to make up for the gaps and make the ‘star slashing’ sword move advance from the great completion to the completion!","Furthermore, he continued to study ‘eternal night’ and truly mastered it.","Jian Wushuang believed that once he used the ‘eternal night’, his power would increase by leaps and bounds!","Even the Ninth Kalpa King, who had been the number one master at the Ultimate Ruler of the universe, would have to avoid facing the current ‘eternal night’.","“It’s a pity that I still can’t comprehend the second move of the Tarot sword manual, daybreak.”","Jian Wushuang sighed. However, he also understood that the five super powers recorded in the Tarot sword canon were all Supreme unique skills. He was already very lucky to be able to comprehend ‘eternal night’. If he wanted to comprehend the other sword moves, he would have to at least reach the Ultimate Ruler realm to have a chance.","“However, this is already enough.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. He was now confident that if it was not for the presence of the unparalleled Ruler, ordinary Ultimate Rulers would not pose any threat to him. Even if it was an unparalleled Ruler, only the unparalleled Rulers of the Nine Magnates could make him fight with all he had.","“It’s about time to leave this place.” After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang’s eyes began to flicker.","He had joined the Conqueror’s camp because he wanted to find a place to settle down and figure out the rules of the last eight cities. Now that he had almost completely figured out the situation, it was time to leave and find The Investiture of the Gods himself.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave, he received a message from Commander Mountain Shaker in his mind.","Commander Blood Sword, come to the Conqueror’s Divine Palace. Five Investiture of the Gods have been found in the sixteen cities!","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows when he heard the message.","Five God Sealing Tablets?","The God Sealing Tablet represented the qualification to participate in the Great Clan Gathering. The more God Sealing Tablets one obtained, the more likely one would be to enter the Great Clan Gathering and strive to become a child under that lord and have the qualification to listen to the Dao.","Now, more than half of The Investiture of the Gods had fallen into the hands of the Nine Magnates. There were only twenty to thirty Investiture of the Gods that had yet to appear.","This time, five Investiture of the Gods appeared at the same time, which was enough to shake the entire eight cities!","One must know that even the Nine Magnates only had ten pieces of the investiture tablet.","“Forget it, let’s just wait and see.”","Jian Wushuang made up his mind and immediately flew toward the Overlord Divine Palace."]},{"number":4264,"title":"Chapter 4264 Setting off to Fifteen Cities","paragraphs":["4264 Setting off to Fifteen Cities","Soon, Jian Wushuang arrived at the Overlord divine Palace.","In the hall, the Overlord sat at the head of the table with a solemn expression. Below him, the six commanders sat upright and still, their eyes fixed on the ground. Their faces were also extremely serious.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and cupped his hands, “Greetings, overlord.”","“Sit down,” the Overlord said indifferently, nodding.","After Jian Wushuang sat in the seventh seat, the Overlord took a deep breath and glanced at them one by one. He said in a deep voice, “I’m sure you know the reason why I’ve gathered you here. That’s right, there are five Investiture of the Gods in the Sixteenth City!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the pupils of the six commanders shrank slightly when they received the Overlord’s confirmation.","One had to know that five God Sealing Tablets was not a small number.","Although there were a total of ninety-nine God Sealing Tablets in the eight cities, each of the Nine Magnates only had about ten. Including those that had yet to be born and those that had been taken away by lone travelers, there were even fewer of them in the hands of the Nine Magnates.","From this, one could see how important the five Investiture of the Gods were!","“Now, all the people in the last eight cities of the ancient road of stars are rushing to the 16 cities to fight for the God Sealing Tablet. We naturally can’t miss this.”","The conqueror’s eyes flickered as he slowly said, “This time, besides Commander Buxu who is guarding the Overlord Divine Palace, the other six commanders, commander Hanfeng and commander Mountain Shaker...Commander Blood Sword, quickly lead your Rulers to the sixteen cities and fight for the God Sealing Tablet!”","“Yes!”","After the Overlord finished speaking, Jian Wushuang and the other seven people stood up and cupped their hands in acknowledgment.","“Yes, I’m sure the Nine Magnates have all rushed to the sixteenth city. Don’t waste any time and set off today! You may leave.”","After leaving the Conqueror’s Divine Palace, the six great commanders returned to their respective commander’s manors to summon their Rulers. They agreed that they would set off together after six hours.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. He had originally planned to leave today, but now that the five investiture tablets had appeared, he changed his mind. Before he left, he would get the five investiture tablets first.","After returning to the seventh commander’s mansion, Jian Wushuang stood in the void and said in a deep voice, “Seventh commander’s mansion, listen up! Come out of seclusion and follow me to the Sixteenth City to fight for The Investiture of the Gods!”","As soon as he finished speaking, rays of light shot up into the sky from the seventh commander’s mansion and stood behind Jian Wushuang respectfully.","Jian Wushuang glanced back at them and nodded in satisfaction. He said, “Five Investiture of the Gods have appeared in the 16th city. We must get them!","“Yes! We will obey the commander’s orders!”","“Yes!” The dozens of Ultimate Rulers responded respectfully, their voices echoing through the clouds.","Six hours later, Jian Wushuang, Mountain Shaker, Han Feng, and the other six commanders gathered and rushed to the Sixteenth City!","...","High above the nine heavens, the strong wind whistled.","Jian Wushuang and the other six commanders, as well as more than a hundred Ultimate Rulers, strode through the air, covering the sky and the sun.","“Blood Sword, I’m sure all the powerful people in the last eight cities won’t let go of this opportunity. They’ll all rush to the Sixteenth City, and some of them might even be unparalleled Rulers. We must be careful and not underestimate our enemy.” Commander Mountain Shaker said.","He was afraid that Jian Wushuang would become arrogant after killing Cang Feng and underestimate the heaven’s favorites from the last eight cities.","“An invincible Ruler?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“That’s right. The latter eight cities gather all the Ruler-level experts of the entire universe. The Nine Magnates aren’t the only unparalleled Rulers. The Nine Magnates are merely the strongest among the unparalleled Rulers.”","With a solemn expression, Commander Mountain Shaker said in a deep voice, “There are even unparalleled Rulers under the Nine Magnates. For example, the young Emperor of Da Feng Divine Kingdom has an unparalleled Ruler who’s been famous for a long time. However, these unparalleled Rulers rarely make a move, but now that five investiture tablets have appeared, I’m sure they’ll definitely join the battle.”","Jian Wushuang could not help nodding.","The universe was vast and boundless, and there were countless geniuses and heroes. The eight cities behind the Ancient Path of Stars were where all the geniuses of the universe gathered. It was normal for there to be other unparalleled Rulers besides the Nine Magnates.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting intent!","To him, ordinary Ultimate Rulers were nothing more than stinky fish and rotten prawns. He could crush them with a finger. Even the almost invincible Ultimate Rulers could not last more than a few moves in front of him.","Only an unparalleled Ruler could stir up Jian Wushuang’s battle intent!","Everyone chatted as they quickly flew toward the 16th city.","The closer Jian Wushuang got to the sixteenth city, the more he could feel the violent aura in the air.","Next to them were powerful Ultimate Rulers who hurried past them.","Three days later, they finally arrived at the 16th city where The Investiture of the Gods had appeared.","Five Investiture of the Gods stood on the peak of a giant mountain like pillars supporting the sky, exuding a terrifying power.","The void around the five God-sealing monuments was filled with Ultimate Rulers from all camps. Countless experts stood in the void, and the endless black mass released divine power fluctuations that made the void tremble.","The flags that represented the various major factions fluttered in the strong wind.","Commander Mountain Shaker looked at them, and his heart immediately sank.","The young emperor of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, the Prince of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, the Saint of the Nine Stars Holy Land, the Blood God of the Blood Sky Palace, the young clan leader of the Moluo Clan...other than Lord Blue, who is guarding the Tenth City, the camps of the Nine Magnates have all come!”","Jian Wushuang also looked at the expert standing in the void and could not help but exclaim.","In this crowd, he actually saw a familiar face.","It was none other than Moluo Yangu, whom he had once fought against.","However, the aura of the current Moluo Yangu was much stronger than when he had met him in the Eighth City. Just by standing there, he gave off a strong sense of deterrence.","It was likely that the current Moluo Yangu’s injuries had already completely healed.","He was the leader of the Moluo Clan in the fight for the God Sealing Tablet.","When Jian Wushuang looked at him, Moluo Yangu also fixed his eyes on Jian Wushuang!","“It’s him?”","Moluo Yangu’s huge eyes squinted.","The next moment, he twisted his neck, and a surging battle intent appeared on his face.","In the last battle with Jian Wushuang, he had only recovered half of his strength, so he was suppressed by Jian Wushuang.","And this time, he would truly go all out in battle!","“Let’s go over too.”","Commander Mountain Shaker took a deep breath and walked toward the five Investiture of the Gods in the air with heavy steps."]},{"number":4265,"title":"Chapter 4265 The Gathering of the Rulers","paragraphs":["4265 The Gathering of the Rulers","The 16th city, where the five Investiture of the Gods appeared.","Countless Ultimate Rulers stood in the air, exuding wisps of divine power.","As far as the eye could see, flags covered the sun, and a black mass of Ultimate Rulers was present.","Mountain Shaker, Jian Wushuang, and the other six commanders were not weak among the countless forces. When they stepped toward the void around the five God sealing monuments, some Ultimate Rulers’ pupils shrank and they hurriedly retreated.","“Han Feng, are you the Overlord’s leader this time?”","The leader of Blood Sky Palace was a devilish young man in a blood-red robe. He sat on a big chair and looked at Mountain Shaker, Jian Wushuang, and the other commanders one by one. Finally, he fixed his eyes on Commander Han Feng, who was in charge of leading the Overlord’s camp, with a mocking expression.","Commander Han Feng was the first commander under the Overlord. Before Jian Wushuang had joined the Overlord, he had been recognized as the strongest expert.","Commander Han Feng was in charge of the competition for the five God Sealing Tablets.","According to Jian Wushuang’s understanding, Commander Han Feng was the first to join the Overlord’s team. He had the longest experience and had been used by the Overlord as a trump card. He rarely fought.","Commander Mountain Shaker’s evaluation of this person could only be described in four words-unfathomable!","Commander Han Feng’s face darkened when he heard the question, and a cold killing intent flashed in his eyes.","“Bloodrein, let’s cut to the chase. Let’s settle all our grudges in this battle for the God Sealing Tablet,” Commander Han Feng replied coldly.","“Hahaha, don’t worry. When the guy from the Chiyang Divine Kingdom comes, I’ll fight you even if you don’t say it.” The devilish-looking youth named bloodrein covered his mouth and laughed.","“Blood Sword, Commander Hanfeng and Bloodrein have been enemies since the Ancient Path of Stars. When the people from the Chiyang Divine Kingdom arrive and the battle begins, you’ll join us and kill Bloodrein first. Otherwise, he’ll be a great threat.” Commander Mountain Shaker sent a message to Jian Wushuang.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded. Bloodrein’s evil aura was soaring. In terms of pressure, he could be one of the most dazzling experts present. If he was not an unparalleled Ruler, he would be a top expert who was only half a step away from being an unparalleled Ruler.","Rumble!","Just as everyone was discussing the countermeasures, a muffled boom suddenly came from the sky.","A carriage pulled by a three-legged golden crow was approaching from the distance.","This carriage was extremely majestic. It was pulled by a huge three-legged golden crow, and its gilded wheels were carved with dragons and phoenixes. Wherever the wheels passed through the void, they left two long traces of fire.","From afar, it looked like a blazing sun was pushing forward.","On both sides of the carriage were several dozen more Ultimate Rulers with powerful auras. They had solemn expressions as they guarded the sides and strode over.","At the very front of the carriage hung a huge flag with the words ‘Chi Yang’ written on it!","The carriage’s appearance immediately attracted the attention of everyone present. Everyone raised their heads and looked over with a serious expression.","“The people of one of the Nine Magnates, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master, have arrived!”","“Isn’t this Golden Crow Carriage the Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s personal carriage?”","“Could it be that the Scarlet Sun Demon Master is personally taking action? Impossible, the Nine Magnates have an agreement. They can’t attack now!”","“I wonder who the Scarlet Sun Demon Master will send to fight for the God Sealing Tablet this time?!”","Besides Lord Blue, who is guarding the Tenth City, all the experts under the Nine Magnates are here!","The crowd was in a heated discussion.","The moment the Golden Crow Carriage appeared, Jian Wushuang also looked over. However, what was different from others was that Jian Wushuang’s eyes looked through the curtain of the carriage and saw the person sitting in it.","This person’s golden hair was casually tied up with a hairband, and a few strands of hair hung down from his forehead. His handsome face was filled with coldness and pride.","Just as Jian Wushuang looked at him, the man seemed to have sensed something and turned to look at Jian Wushuang.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang felt two raging flames shooting into his eyes. He could not help but narrow his eyes.","“This person...he’s definitely an invincible Ruler.”","Jian Wushuang retracted his gaze and a thoughtful look flashed across his face.","If not for the unparalleled God, this person definitely would not have been able to notice his gaze, much less see him through the void.","In the carriage, the golden-haired young man noticed that Jian Wushuang’s gaze had left and he snorted.","A moment later, the Golden Crow Carriage arrived next to The Investiture of the Gods.","“Let’s go!” An Ultimate Ruler standing guard on either side of the carriage strode to the side and lifted the curtain.","Then, a tall, cold-looking young man in golden armor with two tridents in his hands stepped down from the carriage.","His gaze swept across the entire area, not stopping for anyone. It was as if no one in the entire area was worthy of his attention.","“How could it be him!”","“This...he’s from the Golden Crow Clan, the current Prince of the Golden Crow Grand Emperor!”","“I didn’t think that the Scarlet Sun Demon Master would send him here to fight for the God Sealing Tablet!”","“Tsk, tsk. Although the Golden Crow Prince isn’t one of the magnates, he’s as powerful as the Nine Magnates. Under normal circumstances, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master can’t order him around. I wonder what kind of benefits the Scarlet Sun Demon Master promised him when he sent him to fight for the God Sealing Tablet!”","“The Golden Crow Prince has always had the reputation of ‘not a Big Shot, but he’s better than a Big Shot’. He’s publicly acknowledged as the number one person under the big shots in the last eight cities of the Ancient Path of Stars!”","“He’s here to join the battle. Who can stop him?”","All the Ultimate Rulers present were in an uproar when they saw this person.","Even Bloodrein and the other leaders of their respective camps had uncertain expressions.","No one had expected that The Fiend Lord of the Chiyang Divine Kingdom would send the Golden Crow Prince for five pieces of The Investiture of the Gods!","“Blood Sword, we’re in trouble this time. The Golden Crow Prince truly has the battle-power of an invincible Ruler, and he’s on par with major powers. although he’s under the Scarlet Sun Demon Master, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master has never been able to order him around. I wonder what price the Scarlet Sun Demon Master paid to get him to help!”","Commander Mountain Shaker took a deep breath and said solemnly.","Jian Wushuang did not reply, but the battle intent in his eyes surged!","That was right, this was the Ancient Path of Stars path that he wanted to see!","The Rulers were gathered, and all races were competing!","If it was just some rotten fish, prawns, chickens, and dogs, what was the point?","The appearance of the Golden Crow Prince was only the beginning.","A few more powerful experts who had clearly stepped into the realm of unparalleled Rulers began to fly over!","These masters were usually reclusive and had never taken refuge in any of the big shots. But today, they had come from all over the world for the five Investiture of the Gods!","With the arrival of these experts, the 16th city suddenly became turbulent and turbulent.","Although the battle had yet to break out, the oppressive feeling that faintly filled the void was almost tangible, giving people a feeling that a storm was coming!","Everyone knew that once the battle broke out, it would be earth-shattering!"]},{"number":4266,"title":"Chapter 4266 The Curtains of the Battle Open!","paragraphs":["4266 The Curtains of the Battle Open!","One expert after another flew through the air, and many of them were old monsters who had been famous throughout the universe for over a hundred chaos cycles. Their arrival caused quite a stir.","There was a strange Rabbit Buddha in a kasaya with a rabbit head, a Titan race giant who ruled over a part of the universe, and a descendant of the dark demon from the abyss of the universe. All of them had extremely powerful auras.","It was an eye-opening experience for Jian Wushuang. The vastness of the universe far exceeded his imagination.","If he had not been a perfect-level special living being, he would not have been able to fight against these geniuses.","“I’m afraid it’ll be difficult to get the God Sealing Tablet this time.” Commander Mountain Shaker shook his head, his expression extremely grave.","Apart from the future Commander Buxu, there were a total of six great commanders under the Overlord who had come to fight for the God Sealing Tablet. Each of them was an expert close to the level of an unparalleled Ruler. Among them, the first commander, Han Feng, had unfathomable strength and was probably comparable to an unparalleled Ruler.","In the universe, as long as a Supreme-being did not appear, such a powerful force would basically be invincible. However, in the 16th city, it did not pose any threat at all.","The smell of fire in the air was getting stronger and stronger. Everyone was biding their time, holding back their momentum.","At this moment.","“I’ll take three of these five Investiture of the Gods. I don’t care how you fight for the other two,” the Golden Crow Prince said expressionlessly.","Then, the Golden Crow Prince reached out his right hand and grabbed the five Investiture of the Gods.","In his hand, countless golden flames gathered and formed a giant arm, which crossed the void and grabbed The Investiture of the Gods!","When everyone saw this, their faces were filled with hesitation.","As the eldest son of the Emperor Jin Wu, Emperor Jin Wu’s strength was unfathomable, and he was strong enough to rival the big shots. No one wanted to be the first to attack and offend Emperor Jin Wu.","“Commander Mountain Shaker, are we just going to let him take the three pieces of The Investiture of the Gods?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","Commander Mountain Shaker’s expression flickered. He glanced at Commander Han Feng, who did not speak, and replied, “We’ll listen to Commander Han Feng.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and continued to look at Emperor Jin Wu.","Although the Golden Crow Emperor was strong, there were also a few whose auras were not weaker than his. He believed that someone would stop him.","As expected.","Just as the Golden Crow Prince’s flaming hand was about to touch The Investiture of the Gods, a cold and deep voice suddenly sounded.","“Golden Crow, aren’t you being a little too optimistic?”","Bang!","In the next moment, a huge black waterfall slashed out from the crowd!","This ribbon seemed to come from the nine serenities hell, full of coldness and evil. It directly shattered the Golden Crow Prince’s flaming hand!","“Oh?”","The Golden Crow Prince raised an eyebrow and turned his head to look at the place where the bolt of lightning had come from.","A tall man in black armor and carrying a giant axe walked out of the crowd.","This man had a pair of red eyes and a horned helmet. His face was extremely ugly, as if he was a demon from hell.","“A descendant of the dark demons in the abyss?” The Golden Crow Prince narrowed his eyes.","The abyss was located in the extreme north of the universe. It was desolate all year round, and no one dared to set foot there.","The only thing there was a river of blood that had flowed for countless chaos cycles. The river of blood was so incredibly corrosive that even Rulers would be completely corroded in the space of a few breaths, their bodies and souls destroyed.","The land of the abyss was also known as the forbidden land of the universe. Only the descendants of the dark demons born from the blood river could survive there.","“You want to stop me?” The Golden Crow Prince’s voice gradually turned cold.","The dark demon descendant twisted his neck and took out the giant axe on his back. He said in a deep voice, “I’ve killed more than one or two Golden Crows. Come, let this Lord see what’s so different about the Golden Crow Royal Clan!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the descendant of the dark demon took a step forward and his body shot forward. The giant axe in his hand was like pangu splitting open the sky as he hacked down at the Golden Crow Prince!","On his back, a pair of blood wings spread open!","“You’re looking for death!”","The Golden Crow Prince’s expression turned cold, and the two tridents in his hands were instantly covered in golden flames. He streaked a beautiful trail of flames in the air toward the dark demon descendant!","In an instant, the battle between the Golden Crow Prince and the descendant of the dark demon was like a fuse that lit up, and the entire battlefield was filled with the sounds of battle!","“Kill!!!”","At this moment, countless Ultimate Rulers roared and charged at the five God sealing monuments!","The massacre began!","This battle was bound to shake the heavens and earth!","Only the strongest among the Rulers could live to the end of this battle. They could step over the piles of corpses and write a glorious epic to obtain the God Sealing Tablet!","...","“Blood Sword, it’s our turn!” Commander Mountain Shaker said in a deep voice with a solemn expression.","In the distance, the Blood God’s forces, led by Bloodrein, were already charging over!","“Han Feng, five hundred thousand years ago, you managed to escape with your life in crooked Cloud Star area. Let’s see how you escape this time!” Bloodrein’s lips curled into a devilish smile as he looked at commander freezing wind with a mocking gaze.","Commander Han Feng did not reply. He only coldly said, “Kill!”","In an instant, the two camps were engaged in a fierce battle!","Peng peng peng!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","Countless magical powers and secret skills were cast, causing the void to explode.","At that moment, he saw Moluo Yangu leading a group of Moluo clansmen and walking toward Jian Wushuang.","Instantly, the six commanders’ expressions changed.","It was already extremely difficult for them to face the Blood God’s camp. How could they have any energy left to face the Moluo clan?","“Could it be that the Moluo clan has allied with the Blood God?”","Commander Mountain Shaker’s expression was extremely ugly.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing beside him, took a deep breath, shook his head and said, “No, I’m not. They’re here for me.”","“Is he here to find you?”","“Blood Sword, did you offend the Moluo clan?” The commander was startled and asked hesitantly.","Jian Wushuang did not reply. Instead, he clenched his right hand and the repaired Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and his entire body suddenly soared into the sky. He flew past the two camps that were fighting each other and faced the approaching Moluo Yangu.","Moluo Yangu stopped in his tracks. He then twisted his neck and said, “Little guy, the last battle in the Eighth City doesn’t count. Let’s try again this time!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Then come.”","Whoosh!","A ray of heaven-opening sword light condensed on the Wuqi Divine Sword and slashed toward Moluo!","Moluo looked at this seemingly familiar sword. His pupils first contracted before he burst out laughing,","“Hahaha, Blood Sword, it seems that you have improved again during this period of time!”"]},{"number":4267,"title":"Chapter 4267 The Battle of All Sides","paragraphs":["4267 The Battle of All Sides","The 16th city had been completely reduced to a battlefield.","Explosions kept coming from the void, and the earth was in a mess. From time to time, one could see the Ultimate Rulers fall.","This scene was extremely spectacular. The Ultimate Ruler, who could dominate a region in the outside world, was like a cabbage on the street in the sixteenth city, worthless.","Jian Wushuang and Moluo Yangu stood opposite each other while the other members of the Moluo clan guarded the side. They seemed to have a tacit understanding to prevent the flames of war from spreading over and affecting the battle between Jian Wushuang and Moluo Yangu.","Jian Wushuang could feel that the aura of Moluo Yangu was much stronger than when he was in the Eighth City. The boy, Hei Teng, who was sitting on his shoulder, had changed from his pale face to a solemn one. He was like a reincarnated Buddha, full of holy intent.","“Split open the sky!”","Jian Wushuang shouted and no longer concealed his aura. The aura of the fourth level origin of sword principle burst out and the sharp sword essence shot up to the sky, as if it could break the sky!","A blood-red sword light condensed on the Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand. It drew a beautiful arc in the air and slashed toward Moluo Yangu!","What rang out were the wails of gods and devils, and the low groans of Buddhas!","“Good!”","A glint flashed across Moluo Yangu’s eyes. He roared in anger and stomped his right foot heavily on the ground!","“Moluo trampling!!!”","Boom!","Immediately, an extremely violent force gushed out, and the entire earth began to tremble and split. A vibrating light wave spread out like a halo.","At this moment, countless Ultimate Rulers who were fighting around the two of them could not help but spring up. Some of the weaker ones even had their divine bodies instantly collapse.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the middle of the light wave, could not help but frown. This move was once again used by Moluo Yangu and it was several times stronger than before.","“Suppress!”","Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot heavily and the divine power in his entire body instantly gushed out. He resisted the waves of shock waves that swept over wave after wave.","At the same time, the heaven-opening sword light that Jian Wushuang had released earlier had already landed on Moluo Yangu’s body.","In the past few years, not only had Moluo become stronger, but Jian Wushuang had also not wasted any time. His power had also improved greatly.","Bang!","The sky-opening sword radiance instantly slashed down on the right arm of Moluo Yangu, forcing him to take a few steps back. A trace of dark golden blood seeped out from his arm.","He looked down at his arm and then looked up at Jian Wushuang with a touch of admiration in his eyes. He said, “Blood Sword, I have to say that you’re the most powerful Sword Master I’ve ever met. If it wasn’t for Heavenly Snake, you would have become the best friend of my Moluo clan.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled slightly. From the bottom of his heart, he had a good impression of this Moluo Yangu. Although he was his enemy, he did things in an open and aboveboard manner. He did not take advantage of the fact that there were other Moluo clansmen here to bully others.","“Enough nonsense, let’s fight to our heart’s content!”","Universe law, tenfold willpower!","Jian Wushuang laughed loudly. He did not hold back his divine power and released it all. Along with the tenfold will power given to him by the laws of the universe, he slashed out thousands of sword Qi like a splash of ink.","Seeing this, Moluo Yangu laughed out loud. A huge force gathered in his arms and he punched Jian Wushuang!","“Alright, Blood Sword! After this battle, if you and I can both survive, I’ll definitely invite you to drink to your heart’s content!”","The two of them instantly engaged in battle. Waves of destructive power and sword intent that tore the sky intertwined and collided, exploding into brilliant sparks on the battlefield of the 16th city!","Jian Wushuang felt extremely carefree and his attacks became fiercer.","At this moment, the entire battlefield of the 16th city was already in a state of chaos. gradually, as the Ultimate Ruler fell, some people began to stand out!","“Almsgiver, the Buddha is merciful. Please do not commit the sin of murder again.”","There was a strange Rabbit Buddha with a rabbit head in a blood-red cassock. His expression was solemn, and his eyes were filled with compassion, as if he was pitying the people of the world.","In the next moment, he waved the Buddhist staff in his hand and directly smashed the head of an expert who was close to an invincible Ruler!","“Sigh, this poor monk has saved another killing sin. Buddha is merciful.” He let out a soft sigh and continued to walk toward the other Ultimate Ruler.","The surrounding Ultimate Rulers’ eyes began to twitch.","This guy was telling them to kill less while he was smashing other people’s divine bodies. In just a few minutes, the number of Ultimate Rulers that had died at his hands could not be counted with two hands.","“Where did this abnormal person come from?” Everyone was terrified.","On the other side, a handsome young man wearing a snow-white robe and a snow-white vest on his left shoulder with a pale blue crescent moon between his eyebrows slashed out with a thin blade in his hand. Waves of blade light flashed continuously, and the area within a hundred feet of him had been completely turned into a dead land.","“He...I think he’s The Fiend Blade, Moonslayer!”","“Moonslayer? The god of death who once slaughtered the three major galaxies?”","“Why is he here!”","Further away.","It was extremely close to the center of the God Sealing Tablet area.","The Golden Crow Prince and the dark devil’s descendant continued to fight!","The Golden Crow Prince’s eyes had already turned into golden flames. As he swung the two tridents in his hands, they brought with them the power to burn the world. One after another, apocalyptic fire dragons roared out from the tridents, burning the void.","“A dirty and pitiful worm that only deserves to live in the abyss. You are so lowly. Do you think you are worthy of stopping me?” The Golden Crow Prince looked down at the dark demon descendant with an indifferent expression.","The dark demon descendant waved his giant axe in the air and hacked the fire dragon into pieces. He had a pair of huge blood wings on his back and a river of blood flowed under his feet.","The next moment.","He twisted his neck, making a cracking sound, and then laughed in a low voice, “Put away your disgusting sense of superiority and obediently die!”","“Roar!”","He stomped his right foot heavily and his entire body shot up into the sky. The giant axe in his hand instantly glowed brightly as he hacked down toward Emperor Golden Crow!","“Hmph,” he snorted.","The Golden Crow Prince snorted coldly, squinted his eyes and shouted, “Innate divine ability, eye of the burning flame!”","Whoosh!","At the center of his brows, a golden vertical eye suddenly opened!","...","The battle was getting more and more intense, and the dark mass of Ultimate Rulers that had blotted out the sky was rapidly being reduced in number.","Those who were still fighting on the battlefield were all supreme Ultimate Rulers.","Han Feng, Mountain Shaker, and the other five commanders attacked bloodrein together. Bloodrein was not at a disadvantage even though he was facing five people.","“The Blood Sword...”","After the battle, Commander Mountain Shaker turned to look at Jian Wushuang, who was fighting with Moluo Yangu, and a hint of worry flashed in his eyes."]},{"number":4268,"title":"Chapter 4268 Moluo’s Fury","paragraphs":["4268 Moluo’s Fury","“Moluo’s charge!”","“Sundering Stars!”","Bang!","The Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand collided with the sharp and curved horns of Moluo Yangu.","Suddenly, a deafening sound rang out!","The star slashing swordsmanship, which had been pushed to perfection by Jian Wushuang, instantly turned into a five-thousand-foot sword rainbow that pressed across the void and pierced through the sun and moon!","The brilliant sword power destroyed everything!","The sword slashed at the pair of sharp and curved horns on Moluo Yangu’s head, instantly severing them!","Like a knife cutting through tofu, a section of Moluo’s pair of ox horns was directly cut off!","Divine blood spurted all over the sky, and a rain of blood fell on the battlefield of the 16th city.","“Commander Yangu!”","“Commander Yangu!”","In an instant, the expressions of the other members of the Moluo clan who were guarding at the side changed. They cried out anxiously and immediately wanted to rush over to help Moluo Yangu.","“I’m fine.”","A stream of divine blood flowed out of his mouth. He waved his hand at the people of the Moluo clan, indicating that it was fine. Then, he took a deep breath, looked at Jian Wushuang, and said in a deep voice, “Blood Sword, it’s time for you to see the innate divine ability of our Moluo clan!”","He then turned to look at Hei Teng and said, “Blackpeak, I’ll leave the rest to you.”","After he finished speaking, he slowly closed his eyes.","At the same time, the eyes of the boy with braids sitting on his shoulder opened.","Jian Wushuang frowned and a faint sense of fear welled up.","The boy’s eyes were black, and there was a small white dot in the center of his eyes.","“Blood Sword, our Moluo clan doesn’t cultivate any remarkable abilities or secret techniques. We only rely on our innate physical strength and the accompanying black armored child!”","The next moment.","The boy with plaits spoke. However, the strange thing was that he was silent when he spoke. On the other hand, although Moluo Yangu did not speak, the voice came from his mouth.","His voice was no longer as low as before, but it had become a little sharp.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and his expression turned serious.","“Blood Sword, as long as you can withstand one of my moves, we will be even. From then on, you will be a friend of the Moluo clan!” Moluo Yangu continued.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang nodded. He held the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand tightly and waited quietly for the strongest move of Moluo Yangu!","“Innate divine ability, Moluo’s wrath!!!”","“Die!” Moluo Yangu raised his head and roared in anger. The black-armored child on his shoulder began to rapidly form hand seals!","As the black-armored boy began to form hand seals, the space in front of his chest began to compress!","An extremely concentrated black light wave began to congregate on the chest of Moluo Yangu!","“Blood Sword, take it!”","“Die!” Moluo Yangu roared in anger and stomped his right foot forward. In an instant, the black light wave was like a laser that could destroy space and shot toward Jian Wushuang!","The black laser was as thick as a bucket and was extremely fast. everything that was touched by the black laser was turned into nothing!","An unlucky Ultimate Ruler reacted slightly slower and was grazed by the black laser. He died and turned into dust.","“Is this the innate divine ability of the Moluo clan?” Jian Wushuang’s expression was solemn as he used his own talent!","Innate divine power, original universe!","Innate divine ability, life intimidation!!","Immediately, two realms with extremely strong suppressive forces descended!","In this realm, Jian Wushuang slowly raised the Wuqi Divine Sword. The fourth level of sword principle origin, mixed with an extremely high level of universe law, exploded!","“Slash...star!”","Bang!","The silver sword rainbow condensed once again. However, this time, the silver sword rainbow had already expanded to 10000 feet under the various forces!","What kind of concept was a sword rainbow that was ten thousand feet long?","This sword directly covered the entire void of the battlefield of the 16th city, covering the sky and the sun. It was mighty to the extreme!","“Slash!”","Along with Jian Wushuang’s shout, the sword rainbow that covered the sky suddenly slashed down!","Pu chi chi!","The silver-white sword beam and the black laser beam collided together!","At that moment, the world seemed to have been divided into two images. On the left was the image of Moluo Yangu, who was covered in black laser light, and on the right was Jian Wushuang, who was holding a silver-white sword rainbow that was nearly ten thousand feet long!","The silver sword rainbow, which had always been successful, finally met its match this time!","The two continued to wrestle. Jian Wushuang’s right foot stomped heavily on the ground, but he was forced to retreat by the huge force of the black laser!","As for Moluo, he was in an even worse state. He kept growling and his huge body started to crack bit by bit.","At that moment, many of the Ultimate Rulers who were fighting in the sixteenth city stopped fighting and looked at Moluo and Jian Wushuang.","“Buddha is merciful. These two must have killed many people.” The Rabbit Buddha held the Buddhist staff in his hand and put his palms together. He let out a long sigh, bemoaning the state of the universe and pitying the fate of mankind. Later on, let this poor monk save them from their sin of killing.","On the other side.","The handsome young man in a snow-white robe and a Marten fur waistcoat on his left shoulder raised his head to look at the battle between Jian Wushuang and Moluo after killing an Ultimate Ruler with one stroke of his blade. His eyes narrowed.","“What a terrifying sword intent.”","Not only the two of them, but there were also gazes from all directions that were fixed on Jian Wushuang and Moluo.","Bang!","In the end, a huge explosion sounded, setting off white waves.","Jian Wushuang and Moluo were both blocked by the smoke and dust that filled the air.","They were surrounded by violent and chaotic divine power, and no one dared to get close.","The smoke and dust gradually dispersed.","A shocking scene happened.","He saw that Moluo Yangu was half-kneeling on the ground. A long stream of divine blood was flowing out of his mouth.","The Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand stopped just a few inches above the head of the ancient flame.","Victory or defeat, victory or defeat, it was obvious at a glance!","“Blood Sword, you win.” Said Moluo Yangu as he panted heavily and raised his head with some difficulty.","“Thanks for letting me win.”","Jian Wushuang smiled slightly but did not intend to kill him. Instead, he turned his eyes and looked in the direction of the five God sealing monuments.","The battle between the Golden Crow Prince and the dark demon descendant was already drawing to an end.","Both of them were unrivaled Rulers, but it was a pity that the Golden Crow Prince was the eldest son of the Golden Crow great emperor, a descendant of the dark devil born from the Blood River, but he was still a bit weaker.","“Die, you filthy and lowly worm.”","The golden crow’s eyes were blazing with fire. He glanced indifferently at the dark demon descendant’s body, which was riddled with holes and on the verge of collapse. His voice was neither happy nor sad, and it did not contain any emotion.","The dark demon descendant’s giant axe was already broken into two. He raised his head and looked at the Golden Crow Prince, his eyes full of unwillingness.","Just as the Golden Crow Prince was about to kill the dark demon descendant...","Suddenly!","A sword shadow rode the divine sword and shot toward the five Investiture of the Gods!","The sword shadow was Jian Wushuang, who had defeated Moluo Yangu!"]},{"number":4269,"title":"Chapter 4269 Obtaining the God Sealing Tablet!","paragraphs":["4269 Obtaining the God Sealing Tablet!","“Who is it?!!","Emperor Jin Wu was so furious that he reached out his hand to grab Jian Wushuang!","However, Jian Wushuang’s speed was so fast that he missed.","“You’re looking for death!”","“You...” The Golden Crow Prince was instantly enraged. His handsome face could no longer remain calm as he stared at the sword shadow that was flying toward him.","Not only the Golden Crow Prince, but also the Rabbit Buddha, the demon blade, the Moonslayer, and the Nine Magnates all stopped what they were doing and looked at The Investiture of the Gods!","Jian Wushuang rushed to the five Investiture of the Gods and looked down at the five Investiture of the Gods, which were emitting a faint pressure. With a wave of his hand, he put the five Investiture of the Gods into his Interspatial Ring.","So far, he had five God Sealing Tablets!","In addition to the previous Investiture of the Gods, Jian Wushuang had a total of six Investiture of the Gods. It could be said that he was the person who had obtained the most number of Investiture of the Gods, apart from the nine Giants!","The next moment, Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at the people below him.","“Who is this person?”","“Kill him! Take back the God Sealing Tablet!”","“How audacious!”","“Hand over the God Sealing Tablet and we’ll spare your life!”","On the battlefield of the 16th city, there were roars of anger.","Endless killing intent swept toward Jian Wushuang.","Under the impact of this killing intent, even an ordinary Ultimate Ruler would be unable to stand steadily.","“Blood Sword.”","Commander Mountain Shaker looked at Jian Wushuang with a dumbfounded expression. He did not expect that Jian Wushuang would be so bold as to take the five investiture of the gods for himself!","There were so many people present, and no one was a fool. They knew how to take the initiative and seize the God Sealing Tablet.","The reason why he did not do so was because he did not want to be the target of everyone and be besieged.","Therefore, everyone had a tacit understanding not to take the five Investiture of the Gods, because even if they did, they would not be treasures, but talismans that would hasten their death!","Even the Golden Crow Prince only dared to take three pieces of The Investiture of the Gods and kept two.","Even so, he still did not succeed.","This was like a delicious cake that countless people were fighting for. The first thing to do was to kick out the weak, and then the last strong one would be eaten one by one. Everyone would then share it based on their strength.","What did Jian Wushuang do?","Not only did he take the cake for himself, he even flipped the table!","There was no way to continue the game!","Thinking of this, the commander looked at Jian Wushuang with worry.","Although the Blood Sword is strong, it’s still too young. He let out a long sigh in his heart.","Commander Han Feng, who was in charge of leading the team this time, shook his head and said, “Blood Sword, you were too reckless this time.”","The situation was just as Commander Mountain Shaker had guessed.","Countless Ultimate Rulers roared and charged at Jian Wushuang!","Fortunately, the Rabbit Buddha, the moon Slayer, the Golden Crow Emperor, the dark Demon descendant, and the other unparalleled Rulers, who had recovered during the break, did not rush to attack Jian Wushuang. They stood in the void and looked at Jian Wushuang coldly.","Kill!!!","Countless Ultimate Rulers rode their escape lights toward Jian Wushuang. among them were the leaders of the eight magnates, including Bloodrein. Jian Wushuang even saw a few familiar faces.","For example, the Ruler Grotto Profound, who had said that he would kill Jian Wushuang the next time he saw him, and Hong Ye, who had been scared away by his sword.","“Blood Sword, I had originally decided not to be your enemy after seeing your battle with Moluo Yangu. Unfortunately, you just had to break the rules! And those who break the rules often don’t have a good ending!” Overlord Barren River, clad in black armor and holding a heavenly halberd, took the lead and slashed down at Jian Wushuang’s head!","“Splitting the heavens and splitting the earth!”","Even the Overlord’s subordinates, who were on the same side as Jian Wushuang, remained silent and only dared to watch from a distance when faced with the large group of aggressive Ultimate Rulers.","Commander Mountain Shaker opened his mouth to say something, but when he saw Commander Han Feng’s cold expression, he tactfully swallowed the words that were already at the tip of his tongue.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. Looking at the black mass of at least hundreds of Ultimate Rulers, he took a deep breath and lowered his head to look at the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand.","The current situation had already been within his expectations when he decided to snatch the God Sealing Tablet.","He was already mentally prepared.","“Then come.” Jian Wushuang lowered his head and muttered to himself.","The next moment!","He suddenly raised his head, and the fighting spirit in his eyes was condensed to the extreme!","He could even faintly feel that his blood, which had been dormant for a long time, was starting to boil!","Only a carefree battle could make him feel the desire in the depths of his soul!","A swordsman was born to fight and was mad for the sword!","Cang Feng had once said that sword cultivators should press forward with indomitable will and have no fear in their hearts!","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang uttered a cold word.","In the next moment!","Jian Wushuang moved!","His first target was the halberd-wielding Ruler Barren River!","“Blood Sword, die!” Ruler Barren let out a Savage laugh.","However, before he could strike with his halberd, Jian Wushuang had already brushed past him.","A moment later, the savage smile on the Ruler Barren River’s face froze.","“How is that possible?”","This was the last thought that flashed through the Ruler Barren River’s mind.","Then, his thoughts fell into a deep sleep in the endless darkness.","Jian Wushuang spat out three words.","“The first one.”","This was just the beginning.","Jian Wushuang moved nimbly and the Wuqi Divine Sword followed him, mercilessly reaping the lives of the Ultimate Ruler.","Jian Wushuang fully activated the fourth level of sword principle origin. Wuqi was covered with a layer of blood, which was the sign of the completion of slaughter sword principle!","“The second one.”","“The third one.”","“The fourth one...”","The massacre began. When Jian Wushuang fought without restraint, the Ultimate Rulers were as easy as chopping melons and vegetables in his eyes.","In the battlefield of the Sixteenth City, Jian Wushuang held the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and slaughtered his way through the crowd. Every time Jian Wushuang slashed with his sword, he would take a life.","Among them were some geniuses from the major races of the universe.","God’s blood covered the earth and dyed the sky red.","“89.”","When Jian Wushuang used ‘Sundering Stars’ to kill Bloodrein and spat out such a number, everyone was terrified.","They held their treasures tightly and did not dare to attack Jian Wushuang.","Hualala.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward, and they took a step back.","If one were to look down from the sky, they would be able to witness this extremely shocking scene.","Facing Jian Wushuang, who was alone, the dense mass of Ultimate Rulers was actually being pushed back by Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4270,"title":"Chapter 4270 The Arrival of Qiu Long","paragraphs":["4270 The Arrival of Qiu Long","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and his black hair was flowing down. His divine body was also covered with cuts from knives and axes.","However, with Jian Wushuang’s great divine power, the wounds recovered very quickly.","Even the Rabbit Buddha, the Moonslayer, and the Golden Crow Emperor, who had not made a move yet, frowned slightly at this scene.","“No wonder this person was so arrogant. He has the battle-power of an invincible Ruler.”","!!","“Not only that, even an ordinary unparalleled Ruler wouldn’t be able to do this.”","“That’s right...tree will wither and die, and. man’s strength will run out. An ordinary Ruler’s divine power won’t be enough to last for so long. He’s a special life form!”","“A special life form?”","“Yes, only the divine power of special creatures is far beyond that of cultivators in the same realm. They can achieve the state of this person, where their divine power is endless.”","The Rulers were all discussing this matter.","This was the depths of the universe, and special life forms were no longer strange.","However, although they were praising him, they did not look too serious. After all, which of those who could reach the level of an unparalleled Ruler didn’t have their own unparalleled trump cards?","Although Jian Wushuang’s performance was strong, it was not enough to make them treat him seriously.","They were merely peak Ultimate Rulers. If they wanted to, they could kill them at any time.","“That’s good,” the Golden Crow Prince sneered. “Let this man clean up the trash first, so I don’t have to dirty my hands.”","The Rabbit Buddha heaved a long sigh and put its palms together. “The people of the world are foolish and have committed the sin of killing. It seems like I can only wash away the sins of the world with my devil-subduing zen staff.”","“Sigh, it’s too difficult for me,” he said, shaking his head.","The handsome Moonslayer gently stroked the demonic sword at his waist with his thumb. He could feel that his demonic sword was almost unable to suppress its desire to kill Jian Wushuang!","...","At the same time.","at the entrance of the eleventh city.","A hunched monster with spikes on its back and green skin gradually formed.","This person was Qiu Long!","However, at this moment, the Ninth City’s City Lord and the others who were being led by Qiu Long had disappeared. Instead, there was a black sandalwood box in his hand.","The black sandalwood box was covered with mysterious divine patterns. It was tightly covered, so no one could see what was inside.","As usual, when the people of the Nine Magnates saw the newcomers arriving in the eight cities, they surrounded them and tried to invite Qiu Long to join their camp.","Hearing the noisy invitations, Qiu Long gradually frowned.","“You guys are really quarreling.” As soon as he finished speaking, before they could react, Qiu Long had already attacked!","“So, I’ve decided to make you all shut up!”","The massacre had begun!","A moment later, all the Ultimate Rulers at the entrance of the eleventh city had died, leaving only Qiu Long standing.","The Cold Disaster blew past, lifting his loose, sticky hair. He shook his head in boredom.","“Why are you all so weak? Can you tell me why?”","He sighed and opened the black sandalwood box in his hand.","What was inside the box was a head!","And this head was none other than Ruler Hao Jin!","Ruler Hao Jin had not died yet. His face was ashen as he glared at Qiu Long, his eyes filled with shock and anger.","“Hehe, kid, didn’t you want to enter the back eight cities to find the Blood Sword? Now that you’re here, tell me, how are you going to thank me?” Said Qiu Long with a chuckle.","“You monster, let me tell you, once I die, Lord Blood Sword will not let you off!”","Ruler Hao Jin gritted his teeth, squeezing these words out of them.","“Hahahaha, you won’t let me go?”","“Hahahaha!” Qiu Long laughed arrogantly before his voice turned cold. “Then I’m really looking forward to it.”","He closed the wooden box and looked around with interest.","“So, these are the eight cities? Hmm...let’s see where that Blood Sword is hiding.”","Qiu Long’s eyes flickered as if he was a Hunter looking for his prey.","Then, he shook his head and said, “Fine, let’s search city by city.”","“Blood Sword, you better hide well. If I find you, the game will be over.”","...","On the battlefield of the 16th city.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold as he used the star slashing sword again. With this sword, he killed more than thirty Ultimate Rulers.","In the end, the final Rulers collapsed and retreated.","Jian Wushuang did not give chase. Instead, he sat down cross-legged and placed the Wuqi Divine Sword in front of his knees to recover his divine power.","Beneath him, countless non-humankind corpses had already piled up into a mountain, forming a mountain.","Countless people looked at the jingguan, which was made of piles of corpses, and felt a chill go straight to the top of their heads, their livers and galls splitting.","Ruler Hong Ye was also mixed in with the retreating crowd, a look of relief on his face.","“Good, good, I didn’t fight this person for Cang Feng last time.”","In the void.","Jian Wushuang sat down with his legs crossed. His wide black robe had turned blood red. He looked like an Asura from hell, but his expression was still cold.","As for Commander Mountain Shaker and the others, they were already dumbfounded.","Even though he had repeatedly overestimated Jian Wushuang’s combat power, he only realized now that he had still greatly underestimated Jian Wushuang!","Although Jian Wushuang only had the cultivation of a fifth stage Ruler, he definitely had the fighting power of an unrivaled Ruler!","In fact, he even had an extremely absurd thought in his mind.","“Even if the Overlord came, he wouldn’t be able to deal with so many Ultimate Rulers as easily as Jian Wushuang, right?” He smacked his tongue and thought to himself.","As for the Golden Crow Prince and the Rabbit Buddha...where Moonslayer and the other unparalleled Rulers were standing.","“Are you just going to watch him take the five God Sealing Tablets?”","The dark demon descendant glanced at the Golden Crow Prince and said sarcastically.","“He can’t take the God Sealing Tablet away.” Emperor Jin Wu glanced at him indifferently and then strode toward Jian Wushuang.","With one step, Emperor Jin Wu was already standing in the void in front of Jian Wushuang.","He was handsome and had the mark of a golden crow between his eyebrows. He held two tridents in his hands and looked like a god.","He looked down at Jian Wushuang and said indifferently, “No matter who you are, I’ll give you two choices. First, submit to me and I’ll give you a piece of The Investiture of the Gods. Second, I’ll kill you and take all the God Sealing Tablets from you.”"]},{"number":4271,"title":"Chapter 4271 Exchanging Blows","paragraphs":["4271 Exchanging Blows","After him, the Rabbit Buddha, the Dark Demon Descendant, and the other unparalleled Rulers also moved.","No one wanted to let the Golden Crow Prince be the first.","“Benefactor, I see that you’ve committed heinous sins and will soon be plagued by karmic fire. Therefore, I advise you to quickly turn back, hand over the deification tablet, and convert to Buddha.” The Rabbit Buddha put its hands together and said with a fake smile.","“Brat, you have another choice. You can cooperate with me. We’ll kill our way out and then divide the God Sealing Tablet equally. What do you think?” The Dark Demon Descendant laughed sinisterly.","!!","However, he knew without even thinking that if Jian Wushuang really cooperated with him as he had said, the first person the Dark Demon Descendant would kill would be him.","The last invincible Ruler, Slayer, was expressionless. His five slender fingers slowly grasped the handle of the Demon Sword at his waist.","He had proven his Dao through killing and had once slaughtered three major star areas. This time, he had come to the last eight cities just to kill and drink blood.","Jian Wushuang raised his head slowly and looked at them.","“Do you really want this God Sealing Tablet?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“You’re Blood Sword, right?” The Golden Crow Prince frowned. “I hate it when people play tricks in front of me. I’ll give you three breaths to make your choice. After three breaths, I’ll kill you regardless of whether you submit to me or not. you, do you understand?”","Then, the Golden Crow Prince raised a finger and said coldly, “One breath...”","“Two breaths...”","Without waiting for him to finish counting, Jian Wushuang laughed out loud, slapped the void with his right palm, and soared into the sky.","“If you want the God Sealing Tablet, then use your strength!”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and shot away like a cannonball.","The Golden Crow Prince’s eyes turned cold and he said, “You don’t know how to appreciate favors.”","Bang!","Emperor Jin Wu also took a leap and chased after Jian Wushuang.","The two of them formed two beams of light in the air and shot into the distance.","“The Buddha is merciful, but he also has thunderous means. Benefactor, why are you so focused on your appearance?” The Rabbit Buddha sighed softly, but a crimson light flashed in its eyes. It took a step forward and suddenly turned into a bolt of lightning.","After the Rabbit Buddha, the Dark Demon Descendant and killer also turned into a blood river and a cold moon, chasing after Jian Wushuang.","At this moment.","The four unrivaled Rulers were chasing after Jian Wushuang at the same time!","Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at them indifferently. A murderous intent flashed in his eyes.","The four unrivaled Rulers were strong. Any one of them was far stronger than Lord Zhennan and the Third Prince, whom Jian Wushuang had killed in the Tarot ruins.","Even Jian Wushuang himself did not know if he could defeat the four unrivaled Rulers without using ‘eternal night’.","The reason why he had attracted these four people was so that if he was really forced to use his trump card, he could perform the sword move ‘eternal night’ without being discovered.","There were too many people here, and it was inevitable that some of them would recognize the Tarot Sword Manual. once the outside world knew that Jian Wushuang had the Tarot Sword Manual, the whole universe would be shaken and rush to him.","“Blood Sword, you can’t escape.”","With two tridents in his hands, Emperor Jin Wu followed Jian Wushuang closely with a cold expression.","Jian Wushuang looked back at him and did not say anything. He just pulled out a cold smile.","At the battlefield of the 16th city.","“Commander Han Feng, what should we do now?” Commander Han Shan asked as he looked at Jian Wushuang, Emperor Jin Wu, and the others who were flying away.","“What can we do?” Commander Han Feng shook his head, a hint of helplessness flashing in his eyes.","The combat power of these people had far exceeded the scope of what they could contend with.","“Commander Han Feng, Blood Sword is on our side after all. Are we just going to watch him get killed by the Golden Crow Prince and the others?” The Commander Han Shan asked again unwillingly.","Commander Han Feng was silent for a moment before he said indifferently, “Mountain Shaker, if you want to die with the Blood Sword, then go alone. I still have to consider the lives of the others.”","He paused.","Commander Han Feng continued, “Blood Sword was confident that his cultivation was high. He did not follow our orders. Now, he is being hunted down. It is his own fault. If he really dies, he can only blame himself.”","When Commander Mountain Shaker heard this, a hint of hesitation flashed across his face.","However, in that moment of hesitation, Jian Wushuang and the others had already disappeared into the sky.","Commander Mountain Shaker could only sigh dejectedly and say no more.","...","At the same time, in the Eleventh City.","Outside the Overlord’s Divine Palace.","A hunchbacked, skinny monster with spikes on its back walked over with a black sandalwood box in its hand.","“Who are you? This is the Overlord’s territory. Those who are idle, quickly retreat!” The two ultimate Rulers who were responsible for guarding the gate of the Divine Palace frowned. They crossed their spears and blocked Qiu Long’s way.","Qiu Long lifted his hair that was hanging down from his cheeks and squinted at the four majestic words ‘Overlord Divine Palace’. He then turned to the two ultimate Rulers and said with a smile, “Little guys, I want to ask you about a person.”","“Who is it?” The two ultimate sovereigns, upon hearing this, frowned and asked back.","“Is the Blood Sword in this Divine Palace?”","The two ultimate sovereigns immediately sneered, “So you’re looking for Lord Blood Sword. Lord Blood Sword is our seventh commander, and you can’t ask about him. I’ll give you one last piece of advice. If you leave now, I’ll pretend that nothing happened. Otherwise, don’t blame us for being impolite with our divine spears!”","Qiu Long laughed when he heard that. He looked at the two of them with interest and asked, “Oh? How impolite?”","The two ultimate Rulers looked at each other and grinned hideously. They raised their divine spears high and hacked down at Qiu Long!","“You’ll know it now!”","Looking at the two divine spears, Qiu Long let out a low laugh. “What an interesting little fellow.”","Clang!","The two divine spears struck Qiu Long’s body, but not even a white mark could be seen.","The two ultimate Rulers’ expressions changed. Before they could change their moves, two black chains shot out from behind Qiu Long and pierced through them!","“Since the two of you aren’t willing to talk, then I’ll find someone who’s willing to.” Qiu Long raised his head, glanced at the four words ‘Overlord’s Divine Palace’, and then walked inside step by step.","After a while.","Hualala!","Countless divine armor guards held divine spears and shot over from all directions, looking at Qiu Long with solemn expressions.","The Overlord has ordered that anyone who dares to trespass the Overlord’s Divine Palace will be killed without mercy!","Commander Buxu stood at the head with a cold expression.","With a wave of his hand, the divine armor guards all charged at Qiu Long!","Qiu Long looked at the divine armor guards and chuckled, “You’re really courageous.”"]},{"number":4272,"title":"Chapter 4272 Fighting Four Invincible Rulers!","paragraphs":["4272 Fighting Four Invincible Rulers!","“Whoosh!”","Countless black chains shot out from Qiu Long’s back like javelins and smashed at the godly armor guards!","In an instant, the Overlord’s Divine Palace was filled with screams.","God’s blood filled the air, and shrill cries of despair rose and fell.","!!","Commander Buxu’s entire head was forcefully broken off, and he tossed it around like a ball.","The great Overlord’s Divine Palace was a sea of blood and corpses. with his hands behind his back, Qiu Long leisurely walked toward the great hall where the great Overlord was.","The heavily-guarded Overlord’s Divine Palace was like a walk in the park under Qiu Long’s feet. No one could stop him for a moment.","It was as if he had entered a no-man’s land!","After half an incense’s time.","Qiu Long stepped into the Overlord’s shrine.","This was where the Overlord was.","At this moment, the Overlord Divine Palace was quiet. the seats of the seven commanders were all empty.","The Overlord sat on his Dragon Throne with his eyes closed. His qi and blood were boiling like the sun.","Clatter...tap tap...","Clatter...tap tap...","Hearing the footsteps, the Overlord’s eyes suddenly opened, and a divine light flashed through his eyes.","“Eh? You didn’t stop him?” The Overlord’s brows furrowed, and a look of displeasure flashed across his face.","So many people, yet they could not stop a single person?","However, he did not care much about it. Or rather, as one of the nine magnates, there were only a few people in the eight cities that he cared about.","However, Qiu Long was obviously not in this category.","Qiu Long raised his head and looked at the Overlord. He shrugged and said with a smile, “Big guy, your men are really rude. I only wanted to say one sentence and they wanted to kill me. Tell me, how are you going to compensate me?”","“Compensation?” Hearing this, the Overlord was so angry that he laughed. This person had killed all of his subordinates, and now he was asking for compensation?","Also, he was the possessor of the undying Overlord body, one of the nine big shots of the last eight cities, and this person actually called him big guy?","“Go to hell!”","The Overlord sneered and stomped with his right foot. His whole body suddenly flew up and his right fist condensed into a sun, smashing towards Qiu Long!","This punch was just a casual punch from the Overlord, but it was like the beating of the ancient heavenly court’s war drum. It caused the space to shake and a few cracks to appear!","This punch was enough to directly blow up a star!","This punch was filled with the might of an invincible Ruler!","However...","Qiu Long just stretched out his palm and grabbed at the Overlord’s right fist!","Bang!","With a muffled sound, the Overlord’s punch hit the Dragon’s palm. The huge force spread out and directly shattered the Overlord’s Divine Palace!","With the two of them as the center, the ground within a hundred feet collapsed!","Such a terrifying punch landed on Qiu Long’s outstretched palm, but it could not advance any further.","“What?” The Overlord’s expression changed.","“You’re also rude.”","Qiu Long shook his head and clenched his fingers. He then grabbed the Overlord’s fist and threw it out!","In an instant, the Overlord was sent flying, and his body smashed a long ravine on the ground.","The Overlord jumped up from the dust, his face extremely gloomy.","“What do you want?” The Overlord asked coldly.","At the same time, the power in his body began to condense, and his skin began to be covered with mysterious runes that were filled with a vast and ancient aura.","He had activated the immortal tyrant body!","“I’m asking you, where is the Blood Sword?” Qiu Long twisted his neck and asked.","“You’re looking for the Blood Sword?” The Overlord’s eyes narrowed.","...","...","On the battlefield of the 16th city.","Several escaping lights chased after Jian Wushuang and flew quickly above the Nine Heavens.","“I’d like to see where you can escape to,” the Golden Crow Prince said with an indifferent expression.","Just as he finished speaking.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s charging figure suddenly stopped!","“Oh? You’re not running?”","The Golden Crow Prince laughed scornfully and stopped as well.","...","The Rabbit Buddha, the Moonslayer, the Dark Demon Descendant, and the others changed their figures and surrounded Jian Wushuang in a square.","“When did I say I was going to escape?” Jian Wushuang stood in the void with his hands behind his back and his eyes swept across the faces of the four people.","“Blood Sword, I’ve given you a chance, but you didn’t cherish it. Now, don’t blame me for being merciless.”","“Let’s go!” Emperor Jin Wu said indifferently. Then, he took a step forward and charged at Jian Wushuang with two tridents in his hands.","He waved his halberd and countless divine flames surged out from the two tridents, turning into a sun-swallowing Fire Dragon that roared across the world!","The Golden Crow race was born in the sun and stars. They bathed in the divine sun fire all year round and grew by absorbing the divine sun fire. They were the strongest race in the universe!","As for the Golden Crow Emperor, he was the eldest son of the Golden Crow monarch, a Supreme expert!","From this, one could see how terrifying his halberd was!","If it was in the outside world, it was enough to burn a galaxy into nothingness!","“The Buddha is merciful, I can’t bear to kill.” The Rabbit Buddha heaved a long sigh and looked as if he was bemoaning the state of the universe and pitying the fate of mankind. However, he did not hesitate to smash the demon subduing Zen staff in his hand toward Jian Wushuang!","This strike was simple and heavy, and the golden ring on the staff made a strange sound.","...","Then, the sound of Buddha surged as if a Great Buddha had descended between heaven and earth. He struck down with his giant hand to punish evil!","The Dark Demon Descendant laughed wildly. He pulled with both hands and a Blood River was drawn out from the void and surged toward Jian Wushuang.","As for the handsome young man, the Demon Blade, Moonslayer, he did not say a word. Instead, he pulled out the Demon Blade in his hand.","A flash of coldness flashed across Moonslayer’s face. Then, an extremely fast saber light, like a lightning tearing the night sky, quickly folded the void and slashed at Jian Wushuang!","In an instant, the four unrivaled Rulers attacked Jian Wushuang at the same time!","Jian Wushuang’s black hair was flying in the air. Facing the shocking attacks that came from four directions, although his eyes were full of fighting intent, his heart was extremely heavy and he did not relax at all.","“Sundering stars!”","Jian Wushuang shouted coldly and his eyes were as sharp as an eagle’s. He immediately activated his divine power that was more than twelve thousand times stronger and the willpower that was ten times stronger given by the laws of the universe. He turned into a silver sword rainbow that was nearly ten thousand feet long!","Jian Wushuang flipped his right hand and the sword rainbow in his hand swept out to meet the four unparalleled Rulers’ shocking attacks!","Boom!","However, the star slashing sword rainbow, which was usually invincible, only lasted for a few breaths of time when facing the joint attack of these four people before it was instantly defeated.","But...","A few breaths of time was enough!","Jian Wushuang took advantage of this gap and stomped his right foot heavily, charging toward the Dark Demon Descendant!","Of the four unparalleled hegemons, the Golden Crow Imperial Prince was the strongest, and the Dark Demon Descendant was already a bit weaker than them. Moreover, he had also been heavily injured, making him the easiest to kill!","“Divine power ignition!”","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang performed the Dragon-destroying secret skill and his strength increased greatly!","In a flash, he appeared in front of the Dark Demon Descendant.","“What?”","While the Dark Demon Descendant was still in a daze, Jian Wushuang’s Wuqi Divine Sword had already slashed down at him!","“The first one to die will be you!”"]},{"number":4273,"title":"Chapter 4273 One Versus Four!","paragraphs":["4273 One Versus Four!","The Dark Demon Descendant’s expression changed slightly when he saw this menacing sword.","He had not expected that he would be the first target of Jian Wushuang.","Whoosh!","Without waiting for the Dark Demon Descendant to react, Jian Wushuang’s speed was extremely fast and the sharp sword light directly slashed down, splitting the Dark Demon Descendant into two!","!!","However, the strange thing was that before Jian Wushuang’s sword essence could burst out and mince the Dark Demon Descendant’s divine body, his body automatically disintegrated and turned into a pool of blood.","In the next moment, the pool of blood retreated, and the Dark Demon Descendant’s body reappeared.","“Blood Sword, you deserve to die.” The Dark Demon Descendant’s face turned gloomy. He grabbed with his right hand, and a blood-red spear condensed in his hand.","At the same time, a hint of shock and anger flashed through his heart.","If it were not for the fact that the Dark Demon clan was nurtured by the blood river and could disperse into blood water at any time, Jian Wushuang’s sword attack would have really made him fail.","However, although Jian Wushuang’s stroke did not kill him, he had to pay a heavy price for using the blood river secret skill.","At this time, the Golden Crow Prince and the others had arrived again!","The Golden Crow Imperial Prince’s body was burning with flames, and the Golden Crow mark on his forehead became more and more demonic. He held two tridents in his hands, and like a god of war from the ancient heavenly court, he stepped forward and slashed!","“Blood Sword, give up your futile struggle. It’s your honor to die under my halberd.” The Golden Crow Prince said coldly.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed. First, he slashed three times to force the Dark Demon Descendants away. Then, he suddenly turned around and looked at the shocking attack that was coming at him. He sneered and said, “It’s your honor to die under my sword.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang pointed his Wuqi Divine Sword at Emperor Jin Wu. He did not retreat but instead, he attacked him!","“You’re so stubborn.”","A cold look flashed across the Golden Crow Prince’s face. The Golden divine fire on his two tridents became more and more fierce.","The Golden Crow godly fire was one of the top three godly fires in the universe. It was so powerful that it could melt the sky.","“Incinerate the heavens!”","“Fire Dragon!” The Golden Crow Imperial Prince said. In an instant, his two tridents turned into a Fire Dragon!","“Split open the sky!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and his divine power burst out. He instantly activated the sky-opening sword and slashed down at Emperor Jin Wu’s head!","Boom!","As the two of them clashed, countless Golden Crow divine flames exploded and landed in the void, burning him.","“Eh? You’re actually able to force me back?”","The Golden Crow Prince’s eyes flickered and he took half a step back. He looked down at his numb palm and praised, “Blood Sword, with this one strike, you will have a place in the eight cities. Unfortunately, you should never have thought of taking the investiture of the gods for yourself.”","Although he was complimenting, the killing intent between his brows was getting colder!","This kid must die today!","Otherwise, if he were to let this brat escape, it would be difficult to kill him in the future.","Jian Wushuang did not have time to reply. Instead, he turned his eyes and looked coldly at Moonslayer.","The Moonslayer held the demon sword’s hilt diagonally and moved as fast as a phantom. With one step, a second Moonslayer suddenly appeared in the void not far in front of him.","Then, a third, a fourth, a fifth...","This was the afterimage that was created by Moonslayer’s speed!","It was only when Moonslayer appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and slashed at him with the demonic blade that the first afterimage of Moonslayer disappeared.","“What a fast speed!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. This person’s speed was much faster than Heavenly Snake Playboy’s!","Huala!","When Moonslayer slashed down, Jian Wushuang was about to raise his sword to block it. However, he saw that Moonslayer’s right hand turned over and instantly changed from a slash to a diagonal slash. The demonic blade directly cut through Jian Wushuang’s body!","Buzzzzzz!","Immediately, a deep cut appeared on Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at the knife marks on his divine body. Countless divine power spread out and his divine body recovered instantly. His face was filled with surging battle intent.","Although Moonslayer had not said anything from the beginning to the end, in terms of strength, he was probably no weaker than the Golden Crow Emperor. Moreover, this person’s understanding of saber Dao had also reached the fourth origin of cosmic saber Dao.","“As expected, those who have reached the invincible Ruler realm are not simple characters.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. The fighting intent in his eyes suddenly increased by three inches and he shouted in a low voice, “Again!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang performed Gale sword principle and charged at Moonslayer!","In terms of speed, Jian Wushuang was no match for him even with the help of the sword principle of Gale. However, he had other means!","“Dragon-destroying secret skill, divine power ignition!”","Boom!","The vast divine power that had calmed down in Jian Wushuang’s body started to burn madly again.","Under the burning of divine power, his strength instantly increased!","“Blood Sword, you’ve made me excited.” Moonslayer’s calm expression changed. He laughed and slashed at Jian Wushuang with his saber!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The two of them were extremely fast, and they exchanged hundreds of moves in the void in an instant. The Wuqi Divine Sword and the Demon Blade in Moonslayer’s hand kept clashing. Every time they collided, a series of sparks would be created, and a shocking explosion would be heard!","Their understanding of sword principle and blade principle were on the same level, but Jian Wushuang’s use of universe law and the total amount of divine power was much stronger than that of killer!","...","Soon, the Moonslayer was at a disadvantage.","When the Golden Crow Prince, Rabbit Buddha, and the others saw this scene, their faces turned grave.","“Golden Crow, Rabbit Buddha,” the Dark Demon Descendant said indifferently, “this Blood Sword’s comprehension of the sword doctrine has already reached the realm of great success. If you continue to hold back and allow him to continue fighting, I dare say that we will be defeated one by one!”","Hearing this, Golden Crow Emperor and Rabbit Buddha both frowned. However, they knew that the Dark Demon Descendant was telling the truth. The most important thing now was to get The Investiture of the Gods. There was no need to fight with Jian Wushuang.","“Let’s work together to kill this person first to prevent any accidents.” Emperor Jin Wu’s words were equivalent to a hammer announcing Jian Wushuang’s death sentence.","“Innate divine ability, Golden Crow devours the sun!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the illusionary image of a huge Golden Crow appeared behind him!","The Golden Crow was thousands of feet tall and was bathed in the sun. Its wings were made of fire and it let out a clear cry that shook the world!","Seeing this, the Dark Demon Descendant also said, “Innate divine ability, abyssal Blood River!”","Hualala!","A huge Blood River appeared around the Dark Demon Descendant. This Blood River seemed to be real as it kept flowing and gave off a loud rumbling sound.","...","“The Buddha is merciful.”","The Rabbit Buddha put its palms together and spoke word by word.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Heaven and earth began to shake, and countless clouds were torn apart. First, an inch of golden light shot out through the dark clouds.","Then, more and more golden lights appeared!","In the next moment, the entire sky was filled with multicolored light as countless rays of buddhist light shone on the earth!","A giant Golden Buddha appeared and sat in the void."]},{"number":4274,"title":"Chapter 4274 The Reappearance of the Divine Body","paragraphs":["4274 The Reappearance of the Divine Body","This Golden Buddha was shining with golden light, looking solemn and full of a holy and inviolable feeling.","The strange thing was that this Golden Buddha head was a rabbit head with red eyes. It had an additional gloominess to it in the holy aura.","“Go!”","The three of them waved their hands and in a split second, three destructive attacks were launched at Jian Wushuang at the same time!","!!","The sun-swallowing Golden Crow flapped its wings and countless flames fell from its wings like molten lava. It opened its mouth and bit at Jian Wushuang!","Then, the Blood River gushed toward Jian Wushuang like a rising tide.","Finally, the Giant Buddha stretched out its five fingers and pressed down on Jian Wushuang!","Each of these five fingers was as tall as a mountain. When they pressed down, they immediately covered the sky and the sun, causing the void to explode with all kinds of sound barriers.","Jian Wushuang and Moonslayer watched the joint attack of the three unrivaled Rulers and could not help but stop their movements.","Moonslayer, who had been suppressed by Jian Wushuang and could only parry, shook his head and said, “Blood Sword, your comprehension of sword principle is no less than my comprehension of saber principle. It’s a pity that the situation doesn’t allow me to continue fighting with you.”","With that, Moonslayer took a step back and said, word by word, “Secret skill, God-stepping slash!”","Boom!","This slash seemed to split the heavens and earth, dividing them into two worlds, yin and yang. The saber Qi swept across the entire area!","“Kill!” The four Rulers did not hold back at all, and they all used secret arts and divine abilities!","Looking at the four destructive attacks that carried the power of heaven and earth, Jian Wushuang’s expression turned grave and he took a deep breath.","“Divine body, appear!”","A power that came from the deepest part of his soul and belonged to the perfect level of life emerged!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body emitted a burst of crackling sounds like beans being fried!","Then, Jian Wushuang’s divine body started to expand inch by inch!","One miles...ten miles...a hundred miles...a thousand miles...","Ten thousand miles...thirty thousand miles...sixty thousand miles!","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang had turned into an unparalleled giant who held the sun, moon, and stars in his hands and stepped on the earth!","His body was surrounded by immortal light, making it impossible to see his face clearly. He looked like a chaotic Immortal King, and an indescribable terrifying power spread out from his body.","In front of this chaos Immortal King, the Golden Crow Prince and the others were as small as ants. Even the giant Golden Buddha sitting in the void was like a young boy, not even reaching his knees.","“Suppress.”","Jian Wushuang said with a muffled voice.","the next moment, Jian Wushuang moved.","He first reached out his palm and slammed his five fingers at the Golden Buddha. Then, he spread out his other hand and grabbed the Golden Crow’s hand like a little chick. He raised his feet and stepped on the Blood River of the Dark Demon Descendant and the shocking blade light of the moon-killing!","Jian Wushuang’s divine body suppressed four unrivaled Rulers at the same time!","Bang!","No words could describe the collision!","Under this collision, it was as if the world had fallen into an apocalypse. Mountains and rivers were overturned, heaven and earth were reversed, and a shocking wave of air was set off!","A huge shock wave spread out, filling up all the nearby mountains!","Immediately, an explosion sounded, as if thousands of thunderbolts had exploded at the same time!","“What?”","The Golden Crow Imperial Prince’s pupils contracted, and for the first time, his cold and emotionless face was filled with disbelief.","The Rabbit Buddha and Moonslayer were not any better. Their faces were filled with shock.","As for the weakest Dark Demon Descendant, he was directly hit by the shock wave and almost fell from the sky.","“Is this the power of Aberrants?”","The four of them looked at each other, their eyes filled with extreme shock.","Not only the four of them, but even Commander Mountain Shaker and the others in the distance could sense the earth-shaking explosive power!","“Who could be so terrifying?” Commander Mountain Shaker cried out in shock.","Commander Han Feng took a deep breath and replied with bright eyes, “No matter how terrifying the power is, it’s obvious that the battle between Blood Sword and the Golden Crow Prince must be extremely intense!”","...","The surging air waves that filled the sky gradually dissipated. Jian Wushuang, who had been hit by the four shocking divine abilities and secret skills, had thousands of cracks on his divine body. The four great divine abilities and secret skills had already disappeared.","Hu hu hu.","As the strong wind blew, Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the four people coldly.","“Now, it’s my turn.”","He rubbed his hands together, and the Wuqi Divine Sword floated in front of his chest, turning into a silver sword rainbow that was nearly 10000 feet long!","“Sundering stars!”","Immediately after, this silver sword rainbow that was close to 10000 feet long locked onto the Dark Demon Descendant and quickly slashed down!","Seeing this, the Dark Demon Descendant almost spat out blood in anger. He roared, “Blood Sword! Why don’t you kill anyone else, but just keep harping on me?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold and he did not answer.","He could sense that the amount of divine power required to support his divine body was simply too terrifying. Even if he was a perfect-level special lifeform with more than 13000 times his divine power, he would be close to running out. He would probably only be able to last for ten more breaths.","...","Thus, he had to take advantage of his peak condition and kill one of the four invincible Rulers in ten breaths!","The Dark Demon Descendent was obviously the best choice!","In the first breath, a silver sword rainbow that was ten thousand feet long condensed!","In the second breath, the silver sword beam slashed down at the Dark Demon Descendant!","“Secret skill, blood lotus platform!”","The Dark Demon Descendant looked at the silver sword rainbow and let out a furious roar.","His hands quickly formed a seal, and in the void in front of him, blood-colored lotus flowers appeared. These blood-colored lotus flowers intersected with each other, and each of them was absorbing the power of heaven and earth, rapidly growing.","In just three breaths’ time, the lotuses intertwined together and formed a blood-red lotus platform that spun toward the silver sword rainbow!","“Golden Crow, Rabbit Buddha, and Moonslayer, if I die, can you stop him?” The Dark Demon Descendant turned around and shouted.","Hearing this, the expressions of Emperor Jin Wu, Rabbit Buddha, and Moonslayer changed. They knew Jian Wushuang’s intention.","He took a deep breath and said in a low voice, “That’s right, this Blood Sword has already matured. We must gather the strength of the four of us to kill him! Everyone, don’t hold back and block this sword!”","...","The Golden Crow Prince flipped his right hand, and a net woven from the Golden Crow’s wings shot out to protect the Dark Demon Descendant.","The Golden Crow wings were clearly very precious, and even the Golden Crow Prince felt a pang of pain in his heart.","The Rabbit Buddha hesitated for a moment before spitting out a five-colored relic from its mouth. The five-colored relic collided with Jian Wushuang’s silver sword rainbow!","“It’s really too difficult for this poor monk.” He shook his head and sighed.","Without any hesitation, killer unsheathed his sword again and slashed out a shocking blade light."]},{"number":4275,"title":"Chapter 4275 Crushing Everything","paragraphs":["4275 Crushing Everything","The 10,000-foot-long silver sword rainbow was like the reverse of the heavenly River, slashing down at the Dark Demon Descendant. The sword rainbow was so vast that it swallowed the blood-red lotus throne and the five-colored relic like a flood. Even the clouds in the sky were split 5000 feet apart by Jian Wushuang’s sword, forming a long and narrow white line!","Bang!","Under the silver sword rainbow, the blood-colored lotus platform was the first to collapse. The lotus leaves began to break and the lotus platform began to crack. With an explosion, the blood-colored lotus platform shattered!","“What a terrifying sword rainbow!”","!!","The Dark Demon Descendant felt as if he had been struck by a hammer. His chest caved in, and he spat out a mouthful of blood.","At this point, six breaths had passed since Jian Wushuang had used the star slashing sword rainbow.","The five-colored relic that the Rabbit Buddha had spat out was spinning continuously, blocking the silver sword rainbow that was crashing down like a flood. However, in just half a breath’s time, the five-colored sarira could no longer hold on and let out a series of unpleasant cracking sounds. Finally, with a muffled ‘bang’, it broke into pieces!","The Rabbit Buddha’s body trembled violently and he retreated several steps. There was a hint of pain in his eyes.","He had spent countless hours and energy to produce this five-colored relic. In just a few more chaos cycles, it would very likely transform into an ultimate nomological treasure. However, all his efforts had failed at the last step.","Only the demonic blade in killer’s hand turned into a shocking blade light that cut into the silver sword rainbow. The blade light went in for dozens of meters, but it was like cutting leather. The deeper he went, the harder it was to enter. In the end, the silver sword rainbow’s terrifying sword intent completely shattered the blade light.","On the other hand, killer was instantly sent flying backward and crashed into a mountain far away.","As for the silver sword rainbow, after breaking through all the obstacles, it finally struck the head of the Dark Demon Descendant!","The net of wings that was given to him by the Golden Crow Prince quickly flew out and caught the silver sword rainbow!","However, the ‘star slashing’ sword rainbow, which was supported by Jian Wushuang’s divine power, the will of the universe, the burning of divine power, the fourth level of the origin of sword principle, and other powers, was too terrifying. After most of the sword Qi was destroyed by the winged net, the winged net woven by Emperor Jin Wu’s wings failed and broke with a loud bang after a mournful cry.","In the end, the silver sword rainbow was unstoppable. Under the furious roar of the Dark Demon Descendant, it cut him in half like a knife cutting through tofu!","This time, the Dark Demon Descendant was not so lucky. Before he could use the Blood River Division secret skill, his divine body was completely ground into pieces by the sharp sword intent, turning into fine powder.","At this point, ten breaths had passed.","The Dark Demon Descendant, one of the four unrivaled Rulers, had fallen!","The Golden Crow Prince, the Rabbit Buddha, and the Moonslayer’s expressions changed.","Jian Wushuang had broken the joint attack of the four of them with one stroke.","“Hiss!”","Emperor Jin Wu and the other two gasped. They were certain that Jian Wushuang had the battle strength of a big shot!","The four of them were the strongest among the unparalleled Rulers. In terms of fighting power, they were much stronger than the third Prince and the others that Jian Wushuang had met in the Tarot ruins. Emperor Jin Wu was even known as the strongest person under the nine Overlords.","With the four of them working together, even a big shot would have to retreat!","“Where did this abnormal person come from?” The three of them looked at each other, their hearts filled with shock.","High up in the sky, Jian Wushuang’s aura began to fall rapidly. His divine body gradually shrank and finally returned to its normal shape.","Jian Wushuang laughed bitterly as he felt the excruciating pain in his bones. The price of using divine body was too high.","However, the good thing was that it was still much better than the last time he used his divine body. He did not lose his combat power immediately.","Jian Wushuang grabbed with his right hand and took out dozens of supreme-grade divine herbs from his interspatial ring. He did not care how expensive the divine herbs were. With a single thought, he destroyed them all. It was converted into the purest divine power to replenish his energy.","Seeing this, the Golden Crow Prince took a deep breath and replied, “Everyone, this kid is taking turns to attack. I believe the price he has to pay is also huge. Let’s not hold back anymore and kill him together!”","The Rabbit Buddha and the Moonslayer nodded slightly.","In an instant, three earth-shattering killing intents exploded, turning into a turbulent wind that shattered the clouds!","Jian Wushuang’s expression was still cold, but his eyes were surging with battle intent!","The curtains of this world-shocking battle had once again drawn!","“Boom!”","With a loud explosion, Emperor Jin Wu, the Moonslayer, and the Rabbit Buddha stepped on the void and charged at Jian Wushuang again!","The trident in Emperor Jin Wu’s hand disappeared and his arms turned into a pair of flaming wings. His eyes were replaced by divine fire. With a flap of his wings, he appeared in the air above Jian Wushuang.","“Roar!”","The Golden Crow Prince opened his mouth and let out a cry that shook the nine heavens and ten hells.","Then, he spat out a fireball. At first, the fireball was only the size of a fist. But after it came out of his mouth, it grew bigger and bigger. When it came down on Jian Wushuang’s head, the fireball had turned into a golden sun!","This sun was vast and boundless. Not to mention the flames burning inside, just the heat it emitted was enough to dry up the earth of the 16th city.","The Rabbit Buddha, on the other hand, closed its eyes. Its blood-red sword began to shatter into pieces.","In the next moment, he turned into a thousand-handed evil Buddha!","Countless arms reached out from various parts of his body, each hand holding a different dharma treasure. There was an alms bowl, a scripture book, a staff, a sarira, and so on!","A wicked smile appeared on his face. Then, his lips moved up and down as he began to chant a strange Buddhist sutra.","Under the influence of the Buddhist scripture, the magic weapons in his thousands of arms all rose into the air and condensed into a swastika Buddha seal, which pressed toward Jian Wushuang!","On the other hand, killer closed his eyes, and a strong wind started to blow with him as the center.","“Secret skill, God Slayer!”","He opened his mouth and slowly spat out these five words!","The next moment, he took a step forward and slashed out with his saber!","This blade was like a half-moon, full of imperceptible momentum. It was the embodiment of all his comprehension of the path of the blade!","After this slash was unleashed, it directly tore apart the vast sky and destroyed the heavens and earth!","A fireball as bright as the sun, a swastika Buddhist seal that blotted out the sun, a terrifying blade aura that tore the sky apart...","Three waves of power, like three heavenly rivers, smashed down with unparalleled power!","..."]},{"number":4276,"title":"Chapter 4276 The Eternal Night","paragraphs":["4276 The Eternal Night","Facing the three unrivaled unique skills, Jian Wushuang’s serious expression gradually returned to calmness.","He let go of the Wuqi Divine Sword and spread his arms as if he was embracing heaven and earth. He raised his head and took deep breaths.","The next moment, he lowered his head and stared at the three of them.","“Tarot Sword Manual, first move, eternal night!”","!!","Weng.","After he finished speaking, time and space seemed to have stopped.","There was no earth-shaking explosion, nor was there any explosion that could make the world lose its color. It was as if a tiny stone had been thrown into a calm lake, raising circles of ripples.","The Wuqi Divine Sword, which was floating in front of him, started to disappear from the tip of the sword to the hilt.","“What the hell is Blood Sword doing?”","“What does he want to do?”","The Golden Crow Prince and the Rabbit Buddha furrowed their brows tightly. They could feel a strange force starting to erode them.","This strange power was like a pair of invisible hands hidden in the dark. It shakily reached out from behind them and grabbed their necks.","Coldness, suffocation, darkness, dullness, stiffness...","All kinds of negative emotions gushed out.","The colors of the world started to fade rapidly, and the light in the sky gradually disappeared. Everything was so silent and natural.","Without realizing it, the world in their eyes had lost its color. The world was only left with a thick, hazy gray.","The gray color continued to deepen, as if it was going to drag them into an eternal dark abyss.","Feeling this power, the Golden Crow Prince and the Rabbit Buddha felt a strong sense of uneasiness in their hearts.","There was clearly no danger, but their innate intuition made them hate everything in front of them and want to escape.","Out of the three of them, only Slayer seemed to have realized something. He was stunned and looked at the scene in a daze. His lips trembled in fear.","“This...this energy is the recorded Tarot Sword Manual!”","In an instant, his face turned deathly white, and his entire body swayed, almost falling from the sky.","“H-How could this be? Wasn’t the Tarot Sword Manual long lost? Why did it appear in his hands?” He mumbled to himself in confusion, his body trembling violently.","The Golden Crow Prince noticed this and asked with a frown, “What’s wrong, Moonslayer?”","Upon hearing this question, Moonslayer suddenly woke up and shouted at the top of his lungs, “Quickly run!!!”","Both the Golden Crow Prince and the Rabbit Buddha were stunned. They did not know what the Moonslayer was up to.","However, their innate caution made them subconsciously escape first.","Unfortunately, it was all over.","When the eternal night began, the space that the three of them were in no longer belonged to the ancient path of stars. Instead, it belonged to the domain of eternal darkness that the eternal night had created.","Jian Wushuang looked at the scene with an emotionless expression. He said softly, “Strip me of my power.”","Wisps of black mist spread out from Jian Wushuang’s feet and slowly crawled toward the three of them. Finally, they intertwined and formed a huge black ball that wrapped the three of them. To outsiders, the black ball looked like it would break with a single poke, but to the three princes, it was a boundless pitch-black kingdom.","This was not Ninth Kalpa King’s One Thought Divine Kingdom, but Jian Wushuang’s one sword to form a kingdom!","In the dark space, the expressions of the Golden Crow Prince, the Rabbit Buddha, and the Moonslayer changed. They could feel that there was an invisible force in the eternal darkness that was taking away their divine power and vitality!","The joint attack that they had launched earlier was also wrapped up in this Dark Kingdom.","In this Dark Kingdom, the attack that could destroy a planet and shatter a galaxy seemed to have been sucked out of it. The originally terrifying power began to weaken at a speed visible to the naked eye.","In just a few breaths, the three forces completely disappeared.","Peng peng peng peng.","The Moonslayer demon saber and the Rabbit Buddha’s thousands of Supreme treasures all disappeared. They turned into ordinary weapons and fell into the endless darkness.","“How is that possible??”","The Golden Crow Prince and the Rabbit Buddha’s pupils shrank and for the first time, they were overwhelmed with shock.","“What kind of power is this? That’s my origin divine flame, and not even the profound glacial nether water can put it out. How did this happen?” The Golden Crow Prince asked in disbelief.","The Rabbit Buddha was also in shock. He had spent countless years collecting these nomological Supreme treasures, and every one of them was his painstaking effort!","At this moment, hundreds of law treasures were damaged. He could not help but roar, “Blood Sword, I will kill you!”","Out of the three of them, only slayer had a bitter smile on his face. He shook his head helplessly, not looking surprised at all.","From the moment he recognized this move, he knew that the outcome was already decided.","Break!!!","“Die!” The Golden Crow Prince bellowed, unleashing several divine flames.","However, it was useless. The moment the divine flame was thrown out, it was absorbed by the surrounding void.","The Golden Crow Prince discovered an even more terrifying fact. He found that the divine power that he had relied on to suppress the heavens and remain undefeated in the Eternal Night Kingdom was gradually dissipating.","The ultimate Ruler...Rulers of the fifth level...a Ruler of the fourth level...the master of the natural order...","In just a few short moments, the Golden Crow Imperial Prince had fallen from being an unparalleled Ruler who could command the universe to the mortal world!","His old and handsome face began to droopy and wrinkle.","The eternal night technique could strip everything!","Not only did it take away his divine power, but it also took away his lifespan!","...","In an instant, the Golden Crow Imperial Prince seemed to have experienced the birth, aging, sickness, and death of mortals. He turned from a handsome and powerful ultimate Ruler into an old mortal.","In the end, the Golden Crow Prince could not even change his form. He turned into a three-legged Golden Crow that was exhausted.","At the same time, the Moonslayer and the Rabbit Buddha had turned into two dried corpses under the force.","Seeing this, the Golden Crow Prince was in despair. At the last moment of his life, he shakily reached out and crushed a token hanging on his waist. He raised his head with difficulty and said, “Father...save me!”","Boom!","An ancient and majestic cry of a Golden Crow that seemed to have transcended the primeval era of the universe suddenly sounded!","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang felt an indescribable heat and terror. With Emperor Jin Wu as the center, it exploded!","This power was far beyond Jian Wushuang’s knowledge. It was a supreme power that he could not resist even if he used all his strength!","Under the mighty force, Jian Wushuang’s Eternal Night Kingdom was torn apart!","..."]},{"number":4277,"title":"Chapter 4277 Great Emperor Jin Wu","paragraphs":["4277 Great Emperor Jin Wu","“Pfft!”","Under the indescribable, terrifying power, Jian Wushuang retreated crazily and his arms exploded!","The Eternal Night Kingdom formed by the Eternal Night swordsmanship was shattered!","“What kind of power is this?” Jian Wushuang looked over in shock.","!!","The Golden Crow Prince’s eyes were tightly shut and his energy was extremely weak. He was on the verge of death and seemed like he would die at any moment.","However, behind him, countless flames suddenly surged.","The flame gathered behind him and slowly turned into a human figure. He then reached out his hands and lifted the Golden Crow Prince up.","The flaming figure’s face could not be seen clearly, but it had a pressure that could make the world lose its color and make all races submit to it!","The pressure was extremely terrifying. Under the pressure, Jian Wushuang’s divine body could not help but be torn apart.","After the pressure passed Jian Wushuang, it swept out in all directions. Wherever the pressure passed, the void would explode!","What kind of power?!!","“The aura of a Ruler!”","Under this pressure, the entire last eight cities were shocked!","Countless people were shocked and rushed over, looking at this place.","Some of these gazes even came from the nine magnates!","However, after seeing the flaming figure, the nine big shots, who had always been all-powerful in the back eight cities, all put away their unscrupulous sizing up and became extremely respectful and obedient.","“Who dares to hurt my son?”","The flaming figure raised his head slowly and looked at Jian Wushuang. Then, he spoke in a deep voice that was so majestic that no one could resist.","It was as if he was a heavenly God who controlled the life and death of the universe, holding the power to kill!","In the eyes of the flaming figure, there were two balls of divine fire. The two balls of divine fire were like two suns embedded in them. No one could look at them directly. Under the gaze of the flaming figure, the void seemed to be unable to hold on and was about to collapse. Jian Wushuang’s body was trembling as if his divine body was about to explode.","“Great Emperor Golden Crow!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with anger and his pupils shrank.","Jian Wushuang did not have to guess to know that the flaming figure was the famous great Emperor Jin Wu!","The great Emperor Jin Wu had made his name 500 chaos cycles ago. He was one of the most senior top-tier Supremes in the universe. His strength ranked in the top ten among the universe Supremes. He dominated the heavens and his name shook all races. The name ‘Great Emperor Jin Wu’ was definitely one of the most terrifying names in the universe!","Even the Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe could only be considered juniors in front of the Golden Crow. They had to show respect to the Golden Crow.","“Was it you who hurt my son?”","Great Emperor Jin Wu’s gaze was fixed on Jian Wushuang’s face. Although he was asking a question, his domineering tone was unquestionable.","Jian Wushuang felt Emperor Jin Wu’s gaze was like a terrifying divine fire that was about to burn through him.","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and did not reply.","He was not a stupid and reckless person. Even though he was extremely aggrieved, he knew that at this moment, rather than arguing, it was better to remain silent and use silence to express his attitude.","In this world, the strong were respected.","No one would try to reason with an ant that could be crushed with a finger.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, was like an ant that could be crushed with one finger.","The Golden Crow narrowed his eyes and looked up at the sky. “Little guy, this Lord will not argue with you this time for the sake of that Lord. However, you won’t be so lucky next time.”","After saying that, the flaming figure of great Emperor Jin Wu and the Golden Crow Prince, whose eyes were closed, turned into fine sand from their feet. In the end, a breeze blew by and the two disappeared into the eight cities behind the Ancient Path of Stars.","It was not until there was only the strong wind in the sky that Jian Wushuang finally relaxed and let out a long breath.","“Is this how terrifying a top-tier Supreme-being in the universe is?”","Jian Wushuang laughed bitterly. He had originally thought that although the Supremes were terrifying, they would not be so terrifying. For example, he had previously met the Black Eagle Supreme from the Cosmos Temple, the White floating Supreme from the great void God temple, and so on. Although he was far from being a match for them, they would not be so terrifying that his soul would tremble with just a look.","This was the first time he had faced a top-tier Supreme Being in the universe, and the oppression and suffocation coming from the depths of his soul made him feel like he was looking up at the endless sky when he was young.","That feeling made him feel so small.","Moreover, the flaming figure was not the real great Emperor Jin Wu. It was just a divine power mark left by the great Emperor Jin Wu on the Golden Crow Emperor.","How terrifying would the real great Emperor Jin Wu be?","Jian Wushuang did not dare to think any further.","...","...","At this moment, in the solar star system that was extremely far away from the depths of the universe.","This was the habitat of the Golden Crow Tribe.","The nine huge fireballs were arranged in a formation of nine stars, forming a circle of light, like the stars surrounding the moon. In the middle of these nine fireballs, there was a sun that was a hundred times larger than these nine fireballs, suppressing the starry sky.","This sun was so huge that it was impossible to describe it with words. Ordinary stars were as small as dust in front of it. The flames it emitted lit up the surrounding dozens of star areas.","Gulp.","On the sun in the center, there were countless streams of boiling lava flowing and rolling. huge bubbles emerged, giving off terrifying burning sounds. every time a bubble burst, countless divine flames would splash out.","Any random wisp of this divine flame could kill an ultimate sovereign!","“Father, what’s wrong with big brother?”","At this moment, a three-legged Golden Crow that was ten thousand miles long flew out from one of the nine small Suns. It flapped its wings and came to the huge sun in the center.","“It’s none of your business. Don’t ask, don’t ask.” A deep, majestic, and ancient voice came from the depths of the central Sun.","...","When the three-legged Golden Crow heard this, his body trembled and he did not dare to ask any more questions. He quickly took his leave.","In the depths of the sun, in the endless lava, a pair of huge scarlet eyes suddenly opened.","“The Ancient Path of Stars this time around is quite interesting.”","“Hmm...the aura I sensed earlier, that little fellow who was exiled by the dragon clan, seems to have gone too?”","“Interesting.”","With a faint smile, the pair of huge scarlet eyes slowly closed.","The great Emperor Jin Wu fell into a long slumber once more.","The unconscious Golden Crow Imperial Prince slowly rose from the depths of the lava.","His flabby and wrinkly skin began to recover gradually under the nourishment of the lava. His dissipated divine power was also restored at an astonishing speed.","The next moment!","The Golden Crow Prince’s eyes suddenly opened. He took a heavy step and rushed out of the lava.","...","“Blood Sword, how dare you kill me? I will definitely kill you!”","A shrill roar suddenly exploded in the solar star area!"]},{"number":4278,"title":"Chapter 4278 Jian Wushuang’s Death (Part One)","paragraphs":["4278 Jian Wushuang’s Death (Part One)","The Ancient Path of Stars. Sixteenth City.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in the void, quietly recovering his divine power and divine body.","Some of the Ultimate Rulers who had rushed over after hearing the news looked at Jian Wushuang with complicated expressions from a distance.","Although they had not witnessed the battle between Jian Wushuang and the four unparalleled Rulers, they had been watching it in secret.","!!","They had thought that with the four unrivaled Rulers attacking, even a top figure would not be able to escape death. They had not expected that Jian Wushuang would be able to counterattack and reverse the outcome! He had turned the tide with his own strength and killed four invincible Rulers!","What kind of terrifying combat power was this?","Commander Han Shan, Commander Han Feng, and the others also looked at Jian Wushuang from afar. There was no longer fear and horror in their eyes, but deep respect.","Others only knew that Jian Wushuang’s battle strength was unparalleled and that he could fight against four people alone. they did not know that Jian Wushuang was only a fifth stage Ruler!","With the power of a fifth-stage Ruler, he had killed four invincible Rulers!","This kind of thing was simply unheard of since ancient times. Not only was it unprecedented, it would probably never be heard of again!","“There’s something terrifying about Blood Sword!” Muttered Commander Mountain Shaker.","There were even more people staring at Jian Wushuang with burning eyes.","“After this battle, Blood Sword will become a god and his name will shake the universe!”","“From now on, the power structure of the last eight cities of the Ancient Path of Stars will change because of Blood Sword. He will become the tenth magnate of the last eight cities!”","“Unparalleled! Blood Sword God seal!”","“Blood Sword, ascend to the throne of the giants on the Ancient Path of Stars!”","Countless people were secretly amazed.","Just as the crowd was boiling with excitement, suddenly, an extremely discordant low laugh sounded from the outermost part of the crowd.","“Oh, it’s so lively.”","A hunched man with spikes on his back and a pale face walked in with a sandalwood box in his arms.","This person was Qiu Long!","“Where did this person come from?”","This person is barging in and out of his way. How rude.","“Hmph, where did this brat come from? Get lost.”","“You’re courting death!” An Ultimate Ruler, who was almost invincible, frowned and looked displeased. He reached out to grab Qiu Long, trying to pull him behind him.","Before he could touch Qiu Long...","“Get lost!”","“Die!” Qiu Long casually slapped out and sent this near-invincible Ultimate Ruler flying ten thousand feet away. He fell from the sky like a cannonball and smashed into the great emperors, raising a cloud of dust.","When everyone saw this scene, their throats rolled and they swallowed their saliva. They did not dare to make a sound.","Just like that, Qiu Long walked out from the crowd and raised his head to look at Jian Wushuang, who was sitting cross-legged in the void.","He first took out a Mystic Light mirror from his waist and looked at it as if he was verifying his identity. Then, he looked up at Jian Wushuang and chuckled, “Blood Sword, I’ve finally found you.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and frowned, “Is there something you need?”","Hearing this, Qiu Long let out a strange smile and said, “It’s nothing. I just want to borrow something from you.”","“You want to borrow something from me?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said, “What are you borrowing?”","Qiu Long was not in a hurry to reply. Instead, he stepped on the void with his right foot and soared into the sky. He stretched out his hand and slapped at Jian Wushuang!","He laughed in a low voice, “Let me borrow your head!”","Boom!","Before he could land his palm on Jian Wushuang, the spikes on his back had already turned into countless black chains and shot toward Jian Wushuang!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The speed of these spikes was extremely fast, like countless cannonballs, creating a series of intense sonic booms in the air!","“What?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. Although he did not know who this person was or why he suddenly attacked him, his subconscious battle experience made him instantly take a step back. In a flash, he had already appeared a thousand feet behind him.","“You’re quite fast.”","Qiu Long chuckled and instantly turned into a black shadow, dashing toward Jian Wushuang again!","The dense black chains floated behind his back and bombarded Jian Wushuang continuously!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand. He moved quickly and slashed at Qiu Long!","Clang clang clang clang clang!","“Bang bang bang bang bang!”","Jian Wushuang instantly swung thousands of swords at the black chain, causing a long trail of sparks.","Weng!","Jian Wushuang retreated rapidly, his legs leaving two long white marks in the air.","“What a terrifying power.” Jian Wushuang’s pupils could not help but shrink. He looked down and his purlicue became numb.","That was nothing. Most importantly, Jian Wushuang and the four Ultimate Rulers had used their divine bodies by force and the Eternal Night Kingdom had been destroyed. Their divine bodies were already riddled with holes. After the battle, the pain of their divine bodies being torn apart was extreme.","“Not bad. Again!”","...","Qiu Long Zhang Kuang laughed sinisterly as he charged at Jian Wushuang again with a crazy battle intent in his eyes!","“Go die die die die die die die die die die die!!!”","“Peng peng peng!”","Countless black chains charged at Jian Wushuang at an even faster speed!","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened and he quickly slashed out with the Wuqi Divine Sword. Every time he hit the chain, Jian Wushuang felt his body shake violently.","Every time the chain smashed down, it was extremely heavy!","“We can’t continue like this!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and shouted with a serious expression, “Split open the sky!”","In an instant, the sky-opening sword radiance turned into a roaring river and slashed down at Qiu Long!","“Who can such soft power kill?”","Qiu Long sneered and grabbed the sky-opening sword light.","...","The sharp sword will burst out and kept cutting at Qiu Long’s palm, but it could not even break his defense!","The next moment!","Qiu Long opened his mouth and bit the sky-opening sword light.","Kacha kacha kacha!","The sky-opening sword ray was chewed up and swallowed.","“How is that possible?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically and he could not believe it.","“Blood Sword, it’s my turn next.”","Qiu Long stuck out his spiky tongue and licked his lips cruelly. He then let out a strange smile and stretched out his arms as if he was hugging the heavens and the earth!","“Dragon! God! Cannon!”","Boom!","At his chest, countless divine power condensed and formed a blue ball of light that had been compressed to the extreme!","This blue ball of light was extremely terrifying. Its chaotic and brutal divine power spread out, and even the void cracked.","The next moment!","Qiu Long thrust out his chest and the blue light ball immediately flew toward Jian Wushuang like a missile!","The moment this blue ball of light appeared, it streaked through the air and turned countless space into dust!","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank and his expression became extremely serious. He could not care about the pain coming from his divine body and shouted, “Sundering stars!”"]},{"number":4279,"title":"Chapter 4279 Jian Wushuang’s Death (Part Two)","paragraphs":["4279 Jian Wushuang’s Death (Part Two)","Bang!","The silver sword rainbow reappeared in the world. Like the water of the sky and the divine Thunder of dawn, it slashed toward Qiu Long with infinite power!","“Look! Blood Sword killed the Dark Demon Descendant with this sword!”","“Who in the world can block such a sword?”","The elegance of this sword is truly like a sword God descending from the heavens.","Countless people exclaimed.","There was also a swordsman whose eyes were burning and whose face was full of fascination. He sighed and said, “This is how sword cultivators like us should be.”","Hhowever, only Jian Wushuang himself knew that his divine power was completely exhausted and his divine body was riddled with holes. If the star slashing sword had even half of its usual power, it would be a blessing.","“I’m afraid there will be trouble today.” Jian Wushuang shook his head with a bitter smile.","Bang!","Sundering stars and the dense blue ball of light collided together!","A deafening explosion was heard. Then, the silver sword rainbow began to collapse and finally disappeared!","As for the blue ball of light, after its brightness dimmed a little, it went straight for Jian Wushuang again!","Pfft!","There was a muffled sound. Before Jian Wushuang could react, the blue light ball had pierced through his divine body and left a huge hole!","Jian Wushuang’s face instantly turned extremely pale. He actually swayed and almost fell from the sky.","His divine body had suffered an unprecedented injury!","The entire place instantly fell into a dead silence.","Everyone looked at this scene in a daze and forgot to speak for a moment.","One second ago, Jian Wushuang had fought against four of them and killed four invincible Rulers. In the next second, he had been defeated by this strange man who had come out of nowhere!","Immediately, they reacted and glared at Qiu Long.","“Despicable! Take advantage of Blood Sword’s weakest moment and attack!”","“Taking advantage of the situation, hehe, what a good method.”","“Shameless!”","A series of indignant and mocking voices could be heard. Qiu Long shrugged his shoulders nonchalantly and spread his hands. He glanced at Jian Wushuang and said in disdain, “Weak, weak, weak, Blood Sword, you’re too weak.”","After saying that, Qiu Long laughed out loud, then he shook his head and said, “I really don’t know what Bing Ye is thinking. He’s just a piece of trash. How can he be worthy of my help?”","Jian Wushuang remained expressionless, but his eyes grew colder.","He could feel that the divine power in his body was not even enough to heal the wounds on his divine body.","“You’re not talking? Tsk, tsk, tsk, how boring.”","Qiu Long spread out his hands and with a flash of his body, he appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“So fast!”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank. He raised his arm with difficulty and tried to block the Wuqi Divine Sword.","However, Qiu Long had already thrown out his leg and kicked Jian Wushuang’s waist like a nine-section giant whip.","“Trash should have the attitude of trash.”","Bang!","This kick directly threw Jian Wushuang off the nine-layered cloud ridge and he smashed into a mountain rock, creating a human-shaped pit!","“What? He’s like an ant that can be easily crushed.” Qiu Long pouted his mouth and then slowly descended, flying toward Jian Wushuang.","Deep in the mountain.","Jian Wushuang was lying on the ground, gasping for air like a drowning man.","It hurt! Intense pain!","Every bone in his body, every inch of his skin, and every vein felt like they were about to shatter, and he was in excruciating pain.","Not only did Qiu Long’s kick destroy the divine power and divine body that he had recovered with great difficulty, but it also put him in a precarious situation.","“Can still fight...”","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth. Although he was in great pain as if his body was about to fall apart, the coldness and determination in his eyes did not decrease at all. His hand trembled as he held the hilt of the Wuqi Divine Sword beside him. The tip of the sword was on the ground as he stood up shakily.","Qiu Long’s deep and evil voice sounded again outside the rock.","“Oh, that’s right. Blood Sword, I’ve also prepared a gift for you. I think you’ll like it very much.”","Whoosh!","A greenish-gray arm suddenly shot from outside the mountain rock, then grabbed Jian Wushuang’s neck and pulled him back fiercely.","Qiu Long’s fingers clutched Jian Wushuang’s neck tightly and lifted him up. He said with a smile, “Blood Sword, when I passed by the tenth city, a young man said that he was one of your men. He also said that if I dared to come to you, I would die an ugly death. Guess who that person is?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","In the next moment, Qiu Long flipped his right hand, and a black sandalwood box appeared in his palm.","The black sandalwood box slowly opened, and a head with a livid face and wide eyes appeared in front of Jian Wushuang!","“Haojin?”","“Lord Blood Sword?”","...","Two voices rang out at the same time.","Ruler Hao Jin glanced at Jian Wushuang and then turned his head to look at Qiu Long. He roared angrily, “You monster, what did you do to Lord Blood Sword?”","“What did you do? Are you questioning me?” Qiu Long chuckled and continued, “Watch how Lord Blood Sword, who you think is invincible, begs for mercy in front of me.”","Bang!","A violent divine power suddenly surged from Qiu Long’s hands. Then, Jian Wushuang’s legs exploded.","He licked the corner of his bloodthirsty mouth and said with a fake smile, “Blood Sword, your game is over. I will crush your divine body from your feet to your head, inch by inch! Hahaha, despair, beg for mercy, and roar!”","Jian Wushuang did not say a word and looked at him with a cold expression. His divine body started to explode and then dissipate. Even so, Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change at all!","“Lord Blood Sword!”","Ruler Vast Ember immediately let out a heart-rending roar upon seeing this, his eyes filled with hatred.","“Blood Sword!”","In the distance, Commander Mountain Shaker’s expression changed drastically, and he instantly dashed over.","...","However, before he could even take two steps...","Commander Han Feng’s figure flashed and he was already standing in front of commander Han Shan. He extended his hand to stop him and scolded with a cold face, “Han Shan, be clear about your own strength. If you rush up now, not only will you not be able to help Blood Sword, you will only end up losing your life!”","Commander Mountain Shaker clenched his fists tightly and gritted his teeth so hard that they made cracking sounds. He squeezed out a sentence from between his teeth. “Han Feng, Blood Sword is on our side. Are we just going to leave him be?”","Hearing this, Han Feng’s expression softened a little. He sighed and said, “The weak are prey to the strong, and strength reigns supreme. This is how the world is, and it’s not something we can stop.”","Commander Han Shan gasped for breath after hearing what Qiu Long said. He turned around and could not bear to see Jian Wushuang being killed by Qiu Long."]},{"number":4280,"title":"Chapter 4280 Jian Wushuang’s Death (Part Three)","paragraphs":["4280 Jian Wushuang’s Death (Part Three)","“Lord Blood Sword.”","Ruler Hao Jin looked at Jian Wushuang with a trembling gaze. His eyes were filled with self-blame and guilt.","If he was stronger and could share Lord Blood Sword’s burden, would Lord Blood Sword not have ended up like this?","If he had not said those harsh words, would this weirdo have let Sir Blood Sword go?","Ruler Vast Ember ground his teeth so hard that they made cracking sounds. This was the first time he had ever hated himself for being so weak.","Jian Wushuang forced a smile on his pale face when he heard the voice. He smiled at Ruler Hao Jin and said, “It’s not your fault.”","After that, Jian Wushuang turned to look at Qiu Long and said coldly, “Tell me, who are you?”","“Me?” Qiu Long pinched Jian Wushuang with one hand and thought for a while. Then, he said with a fake smile, “Fine, since you are going to die anyway, I will tell you. I am Qiu Long from the Great Void Temple!”","“Alright, Blood Sword, die in peace!”","Qiu Long laughed hideously, and suddenly, divine power gushed out from his five fingers.","“Infinite gravity!”","Bang!","In an instant, the power of heaven and earth was mobilized and it squeezed toward Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang’s divine body exploded inch by inch under the heavy pressure!","In the end, with a loud bang, Jian Wushuang’s divine body collapsed completely and turned into countless divine power that dissipated in the air.","In an instant, the entire place fell into a dead silence.","“Dead?”","Countless people looked at this scene in a daze, their hearts shaking.","Jian Wushuang, who had killed four invincible Rulers in a row, had died just like that?","Everyone looked at each other and felt as if they had fallen into an ice cellar.","Commander Mountain Shaker clenched his fists so tightly that his nails dug into his flesh.","Only Ruler Vast Ember froze, a pensive look on his face as if he had discovered something.","“Hahahaha, from today on, the entire Ancient Path of Stars can only hear one voice, and that is the voice of me, Qiu Long!”","In the sky above the 16th city, Qiu Long’s arrogant laughter came.","He stood in the air and looked down at the surroundings with an evil and overbearing gaze.","The crowd looked up at Qiu Long and felt their hearts tremble.","...","Time passed, and in the blink of an eye, ten years had passed.","The news of Jian Wushuang killing four unparalleled Rulers, obtaining five God sealing monuments, and then being killed by Qiu Long on the ancient road of stars gradually spread.","The entire universe was shaken. A fifth-level Ruler killing four unrivaled Rulers was enough to bring glory to the ages and stun the world!","For the first time, the name of Blood Sword shook the universe, and someone even named Jian Wushuang the number one genius in the universe!","However, Jian Wushuang’s death made more people sigh.","“If Blood Sword doesn’t die, it’ll definitely have the potential to break through to the Supreme martial artist realm!”","In the history of our universe, there has only been one such monstrous genius. It was a pity that he has fallen just like that.","“Whether Blood Sword dies or not, it’s enough to be recorded in the history books!”","“That’s right. There should be a place for Blood Sword on the eternal prodigy roll!”","Countless people exclaimed.","As the news of Jian Wushuang’s death spread further and further, the Divine Life Palace was shocked!","The Divine Life Palace, within the Ruler Temple.","The Blood Wave Supreme sat on his big chair with a gloomy expression. He had just gone to check and found out that the lamp of life that Jian Wushuang had left behind had been extinguished!","Bang!","With a casual palm, he directly smashed the armrest of the big chair into pieces. With a dark expression, he said, “Investigate! Investigate for this Lord! I want to know the identity of the person who killed Jian Wushuang, Qiu Long!”","“Yes!”","Several black-robed figures kneeled at the feet of the Ruler Blood Wave. When they heard this, their hearts trembled. They knew that the Ruler Blood Wave was truly angry. They hurriedly acknowledged respectfully before taking a step forward and disappearing from the Supreme divine Hall.","Even after doing all this, the frost on the Blood Wave Supreme’s face did not lessen in the slightest. His eyes were filled with killing intent.","Supreme Giant Axe was sitting next to him, his expression similarly ugly to the extreme.","It could be said that Jian Wushuang carried the hopes and expectations of the two of them. He was the person they thought would be on equal footing with them in the future and even lead the Divine Life Palace!","Supreme Giant Axe did not refute the Ruler Blood Wave’s words.","Although he was not good with words, it did not mean that Jian Wushuang did not cherish him.","As long as it was a fair fight, they would allow Jian Wushuang to be defeated or even die on the ancient road of stars. However, they would never allow anyone to take advantage of Jian Wushuang’s difficulties and attack him secretly!","“Once I find out who is behind Qiu Long, I will make him pay the price no matter who he is!”","The Ruler Blood Wave said coldly, his eyes flashing with an icy light.","When a Supreme martial artist was enraged, billions of corpses would be buried!","He wanted to let the person behind Qiu Long know the price of angering a Supreme martial artist!","...","Supreme Giant Axe raised his head, and a cold killing intent flashed in his eyes!","The Divine Life Palace had been dormant for dozens of chaos cycles. By the looks of it, it was time for them to properly inform the rest of the world.","Any disciple of the Divine Life Palace was not to be humiliated!","...","...","The Great Void Temple was dark all year round and was covered by a shadow.","Under a Black Tower.","Palace Master Bing Ye, who had already become the current Emperor God of the Great Void Temple, stood quietly in front of the window with his hands behind his back. His face was emotionless, and no emotions could be seen.","Outside the window, countless bolts of lightning interweaved and exploded. The blazing white lightning illuminated Palace Master Bing Ye’s face, making it flicker.","In his hand, he was holding a message that had just arrived.","The contents of the message were simple.","...","“After Blood Sword killed the four unrivaled Rulers, he was killed by Qiu Long!”","“Xu ‘er, Jian Wushuang is dead. I’ve avenged you. Rest in peace.”","Palace Master Bing Ye muttered to himself before turning around and walking toward the darkness of the black Spire.","The letter in his hand fell, and a divine fire ignited and burned it to ashes.","...","At the same time.","In the depths of the Ancient Path of Stars.","The Ninth Kalpa King sat cross-legged on the peak of a mountain with his eyes closed. His white hair fluttered slightly in the wind, and his white clothes were dyed red by the Supreme divine blood.","In the next moment, he slowly opened his eyes and looked up at the sky. His ancient and indifferent gaze seemed to penetrate the starry sky and look into an unknown distance.","In his hands, he held the most recent universe information.","“Dead?”","He lowered his head to look at the message in his hand, and a look of disdain flashed through his eyes. A surge of godly power surged out from his hand, directly crushing the universe message into dust, which scattered with the wind.","“He’s someone who’s defeated this seat before, how could he die there?”","He took a deep breath and shook his head in disdain.","He was still waiting for Jian Wushuang to break through to the Supreme level and fight with him. He was still looking forward to the meeting of all races in the universe.","He would never allow Jian Wushuang to die!","The world returned to silence.","After a long time, a faint mutter was heard.","“Jian Wushuang, if you really die and Qiu Long kills one of you, I will kill his entire clan to be buried with you.”","His voice was very soft.","But it was very cold!"]},{"number":4281,"title":"Chapter 4281 Heart Observation","paragraphs":["4281 Heart Observation","That day, after the news of Jian Wushuang’s death spread.","All the major powers in the depths of the universe began to make their moves.","In the solar system, the Golden Crow Prince’s laughter could be heard.","“Hahaha, Blood Sword, an eye for an eye. You killed me, so someone will naturally kill you! It’s just that I can’t personally take your head off!”","The Golden Crow Imperial Prince, who had recovered from his injuries, flew up from the sun. His entire body was covered in flames and he looked like a god.","His handsome face, however, was filled with resentment and pleasure.","...","Just as the entire universe was in turmoil because of Jian Wushuang’s death...","A trace of divine power was wandering aimlessly on the Ancient Path of Stars.","The divine power was Jian Wushuang!","That day in the sixteen cities, Jian Wushuang’s divine power was almost exhausted and his divine body was crushed by Qiu Long.","If it were anyone else, they would have died.","It was a pity that Jian Wushuang was a perfect chaotic lifeform.","At that critical moment, Jian Wushuang made a prompt decision and finally used the second innate ability that he had awakened, divine power disintegration!","Divine power disintegration was not an earth-shattering killing move. It was the last trump card that Jian Wushuang had.","It could break down Jian Wushuang into the most primitive divine power particles and attach them to anything.","As long as there was a trace of divine power, Jian Wushuang would not die. However, the life lamp in the Divine Life Palace would shatter.","In the end, Jian Wushuang used this gifted super power to absorb the Tarot divine sword and Qian Kun ring into the divine power. In the end, under the explosion, the divine power was dispersed and a trace of it shot far away.","However, for some reason, Jian Wushuang had not woken up after a hundred years. Instead, he was wandering in the void in a daze.","As time passed, he kept floating and wandering in the void like a rootless duckweed, rolling with the waves. He was also like a lost child who could not find his way home.","No one noticed him. Jian Wushuang had been floating in the Sixteenth City for a hundred years.","He followed the wind, crossing countless mountains and seas, crossing many battlefields, and witnessing one slaughter after another.","He was like the loneliest passerby in the world, who had seen the rise and fall of the tide, life and death.","Finally, he floated out of the Sixteenth City.","In the dark, there seemed to be something guiding him to a certain place.","The 15th city...","The 14th city...","The 13th city...","Five hundred years had passed, but Jian Wushuang was still unconscious. He floated in the void in a daze and passed by several cities.","He did not know where he was going. He just followed the will of the unseen world and floated further away.","Finally.","He had returned to the tenth city.","When he reached the Tenth City, the guidance became even more intense. He floated around and once again arrived in front of the God Refining Tower.","Several hundred years had passed, but the God Refining Tower had not changed. Many Ultimate Rulers gathered in front of the God Refining Tower, their faces filled with eagerness. They hoped that they could get a good ranking in the God Refining Tower.","And at this moment, no one noticed a trace of divine power brush past them. Then, with a ‘xiu’ sound, it quickly entered the God Refining Tower.","When he entered the God Refining Tower this time, perhaps it was because Jian Wushuang had passed through the tower before, he did not encounter any obstacles. He passed through the first seven levels and arrived at the eighth level.","God Refining Tower, eighth level.","This was also the last level that Jian Wushuang had passed.","Here, he had met a ‘Jian Wushuang’ who looked exactly like him and had perfectly replicated all his swordsmanship super powers. In the end, Jian Wushuang had used all his skills to kill him.","When he arrived at the ninth floor, he did not even have time to take a look before he felt a huge force coming out and directly driving him out.","Boom! Boom!","In the void of the eighth level of the God Refining Tower, space was constantly being torn apart. A pitch-black whirlpool black hole appeared.","An invisible force was drawn out of the black hole, as if it was summoning Jian Wushuang in.","The next moment!","The divine power that Jian Wushuang had turned into shot straight into the sword!","...","The Tenth City.","Lord Blue, the guardian of the Ancient Path of Stars, was in a private room in the fortress of the tenth city.","A blue-robed figure with a veil covering her face was sitting cross-legged on a futon.","Suddenly, the figure seemed to have sensed something, and her long eyelashes twitched.","Then, a pair of beautiful eyes slowly opened, and a strange light flashed in them.","“You’re back, as expected.”","Lady Blue chuckled under her veil. Then, she stood up and walked out of the room. Turns out Lord Blue was a female!","Bang!","...","The door of the room opened automatically, and a series of respectful greetings came out.","“We respectfully welcome Lord Blue out of seclusion!”","“We welcome Lord Blue’s exit of seclusion!!”","Lord Blue nodded slightly and said, “Someone, sort out all the information on the Ancient Path of Stars and hand it to me.”","“Yes!”","The divine armor guards dispersed.","Lord Blue stood with her hands behind her back as a look of contemplation flashed through her eyes. With a flash, she disappeared from the fortress and headed toward the God Refining Tower.","...","Ninth level of the God Refining Tower.","The divine power that Jian Wushuang had transformed into turned into Jian Wushuang after a moment of blurriness and distortion.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang, who had fallen into a deep sleep, suddenly woke up!","...","“I, Jian Wushuang!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes and a sharp light flashed in his eyes.","Then, he looked around and was shocked.","“Where is this place?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils contracted and a look of disbelief filled his face.","He was surrounded by a chaotic void and the heavens and earth were dark. It was as if the chaos was created when yin and yang were separated and the universe was born. Countless traces of the most primitive laws of origin energy were flowing in the air.","Wind, rain, thunder, lightning, earth, firmament, sword Dao, saber Dao...","There were countless laws here, and they were all the purest and most ancient laws of origin energy in the world, born at the beginning of the universe!","The most primitive and pure power of the origin of rules was like a vast ocean. It was extremely dense and enveloped Jian Wushuang.","It was a pity that the origin power could be seen and touched, but it seemed to be sealed by a force and Jian Wushuang could not absorb any of it.","“What’s going on?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a thoughtful look as he looked at the void.","In the void, countless origin source laws condensed and finally formed two words.","Heart Observation.","“Heart Observation?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and looked at the two words with rapt attention. His eyes gradually lit up with a thoughtful look.","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself thoughtfully. Then, he sat down cross-legged and began to meditate quietly.","The greatest good fortune in the God Refining Tower had begun!"]},{"number":4282,"title":"Chapter 4282 Comprehension","paragraphs":["4282 Comprehension","The ninth level of the God Refining Tower was filled with origin laws.","The law aura here was far more concentrated than anywhere else on the Ancient Path of Stars. Even the river of enlightenment in the Divine Life Palace could not compare.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged quietly and looked at the two words ‘Heart Observation’. A thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","“If I’m not wrong, the test of the ninth level should be to comprehend the two words ‘Heart Observation’.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and started to carefully review every level of the God Refining Tower that he had passed.","!!","He remembered that the first level of the God Refining Tower had the energy devouring beasts. When he was killing the energy devouring beasts, he had used the Wuqi Divine Sword to crush and obliterate them.","The second level was the bandaged swordsman. On this level, although Jian Wushuang was still using the most ordinary swordsmanship, the divine power and origin of sword principle that he exerted were far higher than those on the first level.","Then, the Headless Commander on the third floor, the Gale Swordsman on the fourth floor, the Ancient Sword Saint on the fifth floor, Divine General Fei Hong on the sixth floor...the further he went, the more divine skills Jian Wushuang used. When he defeated Divine General Fei Hong, he had used all his divine skills except for the trump cards!","Every time he broke through a level, Jian Wushuang could feel that the aftermath of his divine power and some divine power were absorbed by the void in the God Refining Tower.","On the seventh floor, another ‘Jian Wushuang’ that looked exactly like him appeared.","His ‘simulacrum’ could accurately use every divine power he had used in the first few levels. Jian Wushuang had used all his skills and finally defeated it with the ‘Eternal Night’.","After that, it was the eighth floor.","There was no more opponent on the eighth floor, only a sword stone.","There was a sword mark on the sword stone, but no one knew who had left it. Even with Jian Wushuang’s amazing talent in sword principle, it took him nearly 60 years to comprehend the true meaning.","In the end, Jian Wushuang arrived at the ninth floor. Before he could see anything, he felt his vision go black as he was expelled by a huge force. It was as if heaven and earth could not contain him and he was out of place.","This time, Jian Wushuang had transformed into the most original divine power and entered the ninth level of the God Refining Tower that no one had ever stepped into before.","Perhaps from the start, this God Refining Tower was not a place for trials. Instead, it was a gift from the Ancient Path of Stars. The so-called trials were just different gifts that were decided according to everyone’s different Dao.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he lowered his head and muttered, “However, only those who can reach the top of the God Refining Tower have the right to receive this gift.”","“Well then. This means...”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked at the two words. He said in a deep voice, “As long as I can comprehend these two words, I’ll be able to devour and absorb all of the origin laws here. Once I do, I’ll be able to break through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm, or even higher!”","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and started to think.","Heart Observation.","If his guess was correct, the main point should be the word ‘heart’.","Heart...what was it?","Jian Wushuang slowly closed his eyes.","The heart should be referring to the original heart, the Dao that one had advocated in the depths of one’s heart!","Gradually, Jian Wushuang’s mind became empty, as if he had returned to the ancient world, back to the Tianzong Dynasty, back to the Sword Marquis mansion in Bashui Commandery, Tianyan province.","That was the place where he began his sword Dao.","That was the first time he had held the hilt of his sword tightly when he was young.","That was his original intention when he first started to practice the sword.","Jian Wushuang started to search for the original heart that he had long forgotten and had no idea where it went.","Time flew by, and in the blink of an eye, thousands of years had passed.","Jian Wushuang was still immersed in the search for his ‘original heart’ and was in the deepest level of comprehension. Meanwhile, the outside world had already changed.","On the Ancient Path of Stars, the biggest change was when Qiu Long challenged eight Overlords and won eight of them. He became the new king of the eight cities!","...","The 18th city on the Ancient Path of Stars was also the final city.","A grand ceremony for the coronation of a new king was about to begin.","Qiu Long was sitting on a throne. Except for Lord Blue, the rest of the eight magnates were sitting under him. Some of them were trying to please him, some of them were expressionless, and some of them had mixed expressions.","The Overlord was also among them. However, at this moment, there was no trace of overbearing majesty on his face. He was like a vulture to the extreme, lowering his head and not saying a word.","The last time they fought in the Overlord’s Divine Palace, it ended with his defeat.","Under Qiu Long’s strange power, his indestructible Overlord body was completely suppressed, and he was no match for Qiu Long.","In the end, he had no choice but to tell Jian Wushuang where he was going and let Qiu Long leave after destroying his Overlord Divine Palace.","“Everyone, to be honest, it’s really hard to reject the public’s sentiment for me to hold the coronation ceremony this time. Otherwise, with my humble and low-key personality, I wouldn’t have liked such an extravagant thing.”","Qiu Long tilted his head, his right elbow supporting the throne, and the back of his hand supporting his chin as he said with a smile.","The Overlord, the young clan leader of the Moluo clan, the Nine Stars Saint Son, and the other emotionless big shots twitched their lips when they heard this. They finally witnessed how shameless Qiu Long was.","However, they all remained silent and did not say anything.","They knew that the reason why Qiu Long suddenly gathered them was not to witness him ascend to the throne. He must have a plan.","The young emperors of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the young princes of the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, and the Blood God and Scarlet Sun Demon Master of the blood sky hall all chimed in with a smile. the new king’s seat will naturally be occupied by the strong. Lord Qiu Long’s strength is outstanding, so he should be sitting on the throne.","After Qiu Long had defeated the eight Overlords, these people had announced their allegiance to him.","When Qiu Long heard this, he immediately laughed and said, “The four of you are the most sensible.”","After saying that, Qiu Long turned his eyes to the Overlord and the others. He laughed sinisterly and said, “Ladies and gentlemen, have you prepared any gifts for my ascension to the throne?”","The Overlord, the young clan leader of the Moluo clan, and the Nine Stars Saint narrowed their eyes. They knew that Qiu Long was about to reveal his true intentions. They cupped their hands and said, “Lord Qiu Long, we have prepared. Look, I have prepared a Supreme-grade divine medicine that can increase one’s divine power by 30%...”","Before he could finish, Qiu Long raised his head and interrupted him with a cold expression, “Supreme-grade divine medicine? Are you trying to fool this Lord? How can you even take out that kind of trash?”","The Nine Stars Saint’s face turned ugly. He suppressed his anger and asked, “Then may I ask what you want, Lord Qiu Long?”","Qiu Long laughed.","...","His gaze swept across the faces of the Nine Stars Saint Son, the Overlord, and the young clan leader of the Moluo clan. He licked the corner of his mouth cruelly and said with a fake smile, “I want all the God Sealing Tablets you have!”"]},{"number":4283,"title":"Chapter 4283 The Undercurrent Surges","paragraphs":["4283 The Undercurrent Surges","“What?”","The expressions of the Nine Stars Saint Son, the Overlord, and the others changed.","The God Sealing Tablet was their only purpose for coming to the Ancient Path of Stars. They had paid too much for it.","If he handed over the God Sealing Tablet now, wouldn’t all his efforts on the Ancient Path of Stars go down the drain?","!!","This Qiu Long really had a big appetite!","“Lord Qiu Long, please forgive us for not being able to hand over the God Sealing Tablet.” The Nine Stars Saint suppressed his anger and cupped his hands.","“Oh? So you’re not giving me face?” Qiu Long twisted his neck, making ‘ka ka ka’ sounds, and said with a fake smile.","The First Prince and the Young Empress, who were standing on both sides of him, had cold glints in their eyes.","A wave of overwhelming coldness was directed at them!","The Nine Stars Saint Son, the Overlord, and the young clan leader of the Moluo clan were all shocked. The young clan leader of the Moluo clan, who had the worst temper, slammed the table in front of him and stared at Qiu Long. He said, “Qiu Long, don’t go too far!”","The Nine Stars Saint Son and the Overlord stood up as well. They stood behind the young clan leader of the Moluo clan, exuding their own pressure.","Seeing this, the smile on Qiu Long’s face gradually disappeared and he said indifferently, “So what if it’s excessive? So what if I don’t go too far?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiu Long made his move. A chain shot out from his back and was flung toward the neck of the young clan leader of Moluo!","“Good!”","The young clan master of the Moluo clan let out a loud roar. His arm, which was as thick as a giant tree, instantly shot out. It carried a terrifyingly huge force as it blasted toward the chain.","The Moluo clan only cultivated their physical body and not their divine abilities. They were born with divine strength and their strength was extremely terrifying. As soon as this punch was thrown out, the void trembled!","This punch was enough to overturn mountains and seas, crack the earth, and shatter the heavens!","Bang!","A huge explosion sounded at the point of collision. The terrifying force of the punch directly broke the chain!","Qiu Long licked the corner of his mouth and hissed. Before the force of the Moluo’s punch could be completely dispersed, thousands of chains had already appeared behind his back and were once again thrown at him!","Just as the two of them were about to start a world-shaking battle, the Nine Stars Saint suddenly transmitted a message, “Moluo, don’t be reckless. We are not Qiu Long’s match. Let’s retreat first!”","Looking at the thousands of chains that were charging toward him, Moluo’s expression changed. He knew that Qiu Long had yet to make a move. He let out a low roar and used Moluo’s power again to break the chains. After that, he stomped on the ground and flew into the distance.","The Overlord and the Nine Stars Saint’s faces also darkened. They each performed their secret skills and left instantly.","The First Prince, Blood God, and the others were about to give chase when they saw the three of them disappear. However, Qiu Long waved his hand and said lazily, “Let them go. Anyway, there are still tens of thousands of years before the Grand Clan Gathering begins. If they all die, who’s going to bring me joy?”","“Yes!”","The First Prince and the others smiled and agreed.","Qiu Long raised his head and looked at the Overlord and the others who had turned into black dots in the sky. A hint of mockery flashed in his eyes.","...","...","At the same time, outside the Ancient Path of Stars, the entire universe was in a turmoil because of Jian Wushuang’s death.","Divine Life Palace, Supreme Divine Palace.","The Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe were sitting in the main seats, and the black-clothed men who had been sent to find out about Qiu Long had returned and knelt respectfully at their feet.","“Blood Wave Supreme, Supreme Giant Axe, we’ve found information on Qiu Long.”","“Eh? Tell me the details.”","The Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe exchanged a cold look.","“Yes!”","The few men in black lowered their heads and quickly began to narrate.","After the time for one incense stick to burn.","The black-robed men turned into black shadows and left the Supreme shrine.","The Supreme shrine fell silent, and only the sound of Supreme Blood Wave tapping on the armrest could be heard.","“Blood Wave, if Qiu Long is really as the Shadow Guard said and is the dragon clan member who lost his Divine Ruler Realm when he failed to seize the throne, then it will be a little difficult to deal with. it’s not like you don’t know that the dragon clan has its own rules. the members of the dragon clan can only be killed by the dragon clan. otherwise, the Emperor God of the Great Void Temple would not have just sealed him and not killed him after he committed such a sin in the Great Void Temple.” Supreme Giant Axe frowned as he spoke.","The Ruler Blood Wave’s face was expressionless when he heard this. He indifferently replied, “So what if he’s a member of the Dragon Clan? He has already been expelled from the Dragon Clan because of the great taboo. He is no longer a member of the Dragon Clan. He is now just a stray dog.”","After a pause, the Blood Wave Supreme continued, “Furthermore, the incident on the Ancient Path of Stars was not planned by the Dragon Clan. I am not looking for the Dragon Clan, I am looking for the Great Void Temple.”","Supreme Giant Axe pondered for a moment, but a decisive look flashed in his eyes. He then laughed heartily and said, “Fine, then I’ll go crazy for Jian Wushuang. What’s wrong with that?”","He said it was difficult, not impossible!","He, Giant Axe, had never been someone to be afraid of!","The Ruler Blood Wave chuckled upon seeing this. It had been many years since he and his old friend had fought side by side.","This time, the two of them would probably start a massacre again!","Alright, then we will go to the Great Void Temple now and seek justice for Wushuang! The Ruler Blood Wave laughed and stood up, preparing to leave the Divine Life Palace.","Supreme Giant Axe’s eyes narrowed, and killing intent began to condense as he stood up.","Just as the two of them were about to leave the Divine Life Palace, a disciple of the Divine Life Palace quickly rushed over.","“Milords, please hold on. Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu has some words for me to pass to you.”","Supreme Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe frowned upon hearing this. Could it be that Supreme Fu was going to stop them?","“What do you mean?” The Ruler Blood Wave said indifferently.","...","The disciple of the Divine Life Palace quickly said, “My Lords, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu said that he won’t stop you from leaving the Divine Life Palace this time. He won’t ask what you want to do, but you can’t use the Divine Life Palace’s banner. Everything you do will be based on your personal preferences and has nothing to do with the Divine Life Palace.”","The Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe exchanged a smile.","They naturally understood what this meant.","“Alright,” he said.","The two of them nodded. The Blood Wave Supreme seemed to have recalled something and instructed, “By the way, regarding Jian Wushuang’s death, just like before, you can’t reveal any information to his cultivation partner, understand?”","“Yes!”","The disciple of the Divine Life Palace cupped his hands and replied.","The Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe did not hesitate any longer. They looked up at the sky and reappeared thousands of miles away.","The Divine Life Palace was located in the shrine where the Supreme was located.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu sat cross-legged on a yin-yang futon, surrounded by a few exquisite incense burners. Wisps of mind-cleansing smoke rose from the incense burners and dispersed in the air, turning into a thin mist.","“Little fellow, this is all I can do for you.”","...","An old voice came out of his mouth."]},{"number":4284,"title":"Chapter 4284 The Breakthrough Begins","paragraphs":["4284 The Breakthrough Begins","Time continued to flow, and 5000 years passed in the blink of an eye. As the Blood Wave Supreme and Supreme Giant Axe fought their way to the Great Void Temple, the entire universe was filled with the smell of smoke.","And on the ancient starry sky Road, in the tenth city, in the ninth level of the God Refining Tower.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in the chaotic void with his eyes closed and his brows furrowed.","At this moment, he did not know where he was, nor did he know how much time had passed.","!!","He only knew that he had fallen into the long river of time, and his life of hundreds of thousands of years had begun to reflect.","In the long river of time, he was looking for the original heart that he had long lost.","Why did he cultivate? Why did he practice the sword?","Jian Wushuang wanted to give him an answer.","In the long river of time, he saw his own youth wielding a sword, saw his own high spirits, saw his own desperate counterattacks, saw his own ups and downs...","After a long time, Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes!","Like a Divine Dragon that had just woken up from a deep sleep or a lightning bolt that streaked across the night sky, Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly shot out three inches of divine light!","He had found his original heart!","His original intention was to rebel!","Even in the face of endless darkness, he could still split it open with a sword and see the light again without fear!","Even if the heavens wanted to suppress him, he would split the heavens. Even if the earth wanted to stop him, he would crush the earth and face death with equanimity!","Even if they were deep in the swamp, they had to move forward with heavy weights. They gritted their teeth and persevered, never giving up!","This was Jian Wushuang’s defiance!","However, as Jian Wushuang’s strength continued to improve, NI’s name continued to shake the universe.","Jian Wushuang could not find it.","However, it had never gone far. It was just stored in a place that Jian Wushuang had forgotten, quietly waiting for Jian Wushuang to come.","And now, Jian Wushuang had finally found it!","“I’m sorry to have kept you waiting.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and then looked up at the two words ‘Heart Observation’.","Bang!","The two words ‘Heart Observation’ were broken!","In an instant, the countless origin rules on the ninth floor surged toward Jian Wushuang wave after wave.","Under the dense origin rules, Jian Wushuang’s broken divine body recovered quickly. His exhausted divine power was also replenished at an extremely fast speed.","Jian Wushuang quietly absorbed the most primitive aura of rules and started to break through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm!","He believed that once he broke through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm, he would be able to shock the heavens when he came out of seclusion!","...","As Jian Wushuang began to break through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm, a great battle between the supremes broke out in the universe!","The Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe both charged into the Great Void Temple!","The might of a Supreme martial artist was simply unstoppable!","Furthermore, Blood Wave Supreme and Supreme Giant Axe were the top Supremes in the universe!","The moment the two of them attacked, they swept across the entire great void galaxy. Other than Supreme Bing Ye and a few of the top-ranked Hall Masters on the Ancient Path of Stars, the other four Hall Masters of the Great Void Temple also attacked and killed the Blood Wave Master and the Giant Axe Master!","This battle was simply earth-shattering. Countless stars and galaxies were shattered, and countless star domains were flattened. The starry sky near the Great Void Star Domain was even shattered. Countless disciples of the Great Void Temple had died at the hands of the Blood Wave Master and the Giant Axe Master.","This battle lasted for several years and finally ended with the defeat of the four Palace Masters.","When this news came out, the entire universe was shocked and dumbfounded.","Only now did everyone realize how terrifying the Divine Life Palace, which had been silent for dozens of chaos cycles, could be once enraged!","At this moment, at the entrance of the Temple of Life.","The Blood Wave Supreme was expressionless, and his robes were stained with the supreme divine blood. His blood-red hair fluttered in the wind, and countless disciples of the Great Void Temple trembled as they watched from afar.","As for the Supreme Giant Axe, he had transformed into a towering giant with an axe in his hand. He was like an ancient god who had split the heavens and earth apart. A terrifying aura that could shake the nine Heavens and ten lands and crush the ancient times emanated from his divine body.","The four Hall Masters were all injured as they stood guard outside the Great Void Temple. Their expressions were extremely ugly.","“Blood Wave, Giant Axe, you want to start a war between the Great Void Temple and the Divine Life Palace just for Jian Wushuang?”","A silver-haired young man strode out from the Great Void Temple. His face was ashen and the coldness in his eyes was enough to freeze the stars!","It was Supreme Bing Ye!","“Bingye, when you sent Qiu Long to kill Jian Wushuang, a disciple of the Divine Palace, did you ever think of starting a war?” The Blood Wave Supreme said indifferently with his hands behind his back. His expression did not change at the sight of Supreme Bing Ye.","Supreme Bing Ye sneered and replied, “I’m just giving him a taste of his own medicine. Back then, Jian Wushuang could kill my disciple in the Tarot ruins. Now, I can naturally send someone to kill him. Could it be that in this world, only Jian Wushuang killed my people and my people can’t kill him? This is ridiculous.”","The Ruler Blood Wave narrowed his eyes and looked at him indifferently. He raised his eyebrows and replied, “So what if I am?”","“You!”","Supreme Bing Ye was so angry that he laughed and replied, “Blood Wave, don’t go too far.”","Supreme Blood Wave replied indifferently, “So what if I’m bullying you today?”","When Supreme Bing Ye heard this, he immediately burst into laughter.","“So what if you’re bullying me!”","...","After laughing, he suddenly lowered his head and looked at the Ruler Blood Wave. His eyes were extremely cold as he said, “Blood Wave, it seems like we can only fight!”","As soon as he finished speaking, an earth-shattering aura erupted from Supreme Bing Ye!","This aura was extremely powerful. It was as if he could crush the firmament with a stretch of his hand and crush the universe with a step!","The might of a Supreme martial artist was truly terrifying.","“Alright, I heard that you are the new emperor God of the Great Void Temple. I would like to see how powerful you are.” The Ruler Blood Wave replied indifferently.","“Then come!”","Supreme Bing Ye snorted coldly. With a stomp of his right foot, he instantly disappeared from the Great Void Temple and headed toward a remote part of the universe.","The Ruler Blood Wave’s expression was calm as he similarly chased after Supreme Bing Ye.","Both of them were top-tier supreme beings in the universe. Once they fought, the surrounding star fields would be destroyed. Therefore, they had to find a remote place in the universe.","“Supreme Bing!”","Emperor God Bing Ye!!","...","The faces of the other four Palace Masters changed. Just as they were about to give chase, they saw the Supreme Giant Axe stomp down, and a terrifying axe light streaked across in front of them. With a cold expression, he said, “As long as I’m here, no one is allowed to interfere with their battle.”","...","Just as the Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe were about to attack the Great Void Temple...","A similarly shocking piece of news spread from the Supreme Ancient Path of Stars.","The Ninth Kalpa King had killed two Deputy Hall Masters of the Great Void Temple in succession on the ancient Sovereign Road of stars!","The seventh Palace’s Deputy Palace Master, Whitefloat, and the fifth Palace’s Deputy Palace Master, Qing Yuan, had both died at the hands of the Ninth Kalpa King!","The entire universe was once again in shock!"]},{"number":4285,"title":"Chapter 4285 The Battle of All Sides","paragraphs":["4285 The Battle of All Sides","Although the Seventh Vice Palace Lord Whitefloat and the Fifth Vice Palace Lord Qing Xiao were both ordinary autarchs, they had broken through to the autarch-god level dozens of chaos cycles ago. Their qualifications and foundations were unfathomable.","However, these two Supreme martial artists had been killed by the Ninth Kalpa King alone!","What kind of terrifying battle record was this?","Autarchs were incredibly precious in the universe, and it was likely that no Autarch would ever perish in a single chaos cycle!","However, including Supreme Dingguang, more than three Supremes had died at the hands of the Ninth Kalpa King!","When this news was spread, the universe was shocked and countless people were terrified. The Ninth Kalpa King’s impressive battle achievements were shocking!","At this moment, on the Ancient Path of Stars.","In a wild plain.","The white-haired and white-robed Ninth Kalpa King had an indifferent expression as he walked with his hands behind his back.","He was naturally aware of the praises that the universe was giving him. However, his expression did not change much, as if he had done something insignificant.","Whether it was praise in front of others or ridicule in the shadows, he had heard far too many of them in the past hundred chaos cycles. He had long since become completely unmoved by them.","He had experienced too many ups and downs in his life. When he was still a mortal, Supreme Master Gai Fu had brought him back to the Divine Life Palace from a remote and desolate star field. He had then tested him for a rare perfect chaotic lifeform. The entire Divine Palace had cheered for him and regarded him as the successor of the Divine Life Palace’s Palace Master.","He had been stuck at the Omega sovereign level for dozens of chaos cycles, and countless people had mocked him behind his back for having reached the end of his potential and for being a fallen genius. Even Autarch Gai Fu, who he had viewed as his master, had found it hard to conceal his disappointment.","In the end, he broke through to the Supreme-being realm and killed three great Supremes in a row, causing a stir in the universe.","His Dao heart had long been tempered to be extremely calm.","Whoosh!","Just as the Ninth Kalpa King’s thoughts were like a tide, suddenly, an old man wearing a cloak, holding a black cane, and with the word ‘great void’ embroidered on the back, landed in front of him.","“Ninth Kalpa King.” The old man looked at him indifferently and blocked his way.","“What?”","The Ninth Kalpa King stopped, squinted his eyes, and looked at the old man with the crutch.","The black cloak was a divine robe that only the Hall Master of the Great Void Temple, who was a high level Supreme martial artist, was qualified to wear.","“Let me introduce myself. I am Feng Nan, the Hall Master of the Fifth Hall of the Great Void Temple. I reached the Divine Ruler realm 130 chaos cycles ago. The Ruler Green Phoenix you killed was my Deputy Hall Master.” The South River Supreme Martial Artist said indifferently.","“Oh, what’s the matter?” The Ninth Kalpa King looked at him and said calmly.","“Hehe, you killed my Vice Hall Master. Why do you think I’m looking for you?” A hint of playfulness flashed in the eyes of the South River Supreme Martial Artist.","“You want to kill me?”","Upon hearing this, the corners of the Ninth Kalpa King’s mouth gradually curled up, forming an arc that was not a smile.","“That’s right, but I’m not in a hurry to kill you. I have something to ask you first.”","The South Region Supreme martial artist nodded, then shook his head and said, “Ninth Kalpa King, do you know that the entire universe is in chaos now? Your Divine Life Palace’s Supreme Blood Wave and Supreme Gai Fu have already attacked the Great Void Temple. The so-called incident is because of Jian Wushuang’s death. This is not difficult for me to understand. After all, as far as I know, Jian Wushuang was brought to the Divine Life Palace by Supreme Blood Wave. He can be considered half a disciple of Supreme Blood Wave, and Supreme Giant Axe is a close friend of Supreme Blood Wave.”","After a pause, the South River Supreme Martial Artist looked at the Ninth Kalpa King’s face and said, “But what I don’t understand is that, as far as I know, you are arrogant and cold by nature. You don’t have a good relationship with Jian Wushuang either. They even had a battle in the trial field of the Divine Life Palace. That battle ended with your defeat and you lost all your face in the Divine Life Palace. With your character, you won’t make enemies for him, right?”","Upon hearing this, the Ninth Kalpa King smiled faintly.","“You’re right. I don’t really like Jian Wushuang. He’s my biggest opponent in history.”","Hearing this, a look of doubt appeared on the face of the South River Supreme Martial Artist. He said, “Then you still...”","Without waiting for him to finish, the Ninth Kalpa King turned to him and said calmly, “But a person with slow talent like you won’t understand. A true opponent is so rare and valuable.”","“Oh? Is this the appreciation between geniuses?”","A look of contemplation flashed in the eyes of the South River Supreme Martial Artist. Then, the corners of his mouth curled up into a cruel arc. He turned his head and said, “Alright, I’ve got what I wanted to know. Ninth Kalpa King, you’ve killed two vice hall masters of my Great Void Temple in a row. prepare to die now.”","After he finished speaking, the South River Supreme Martial Artist lightly tapped the ground with the walking stick in his hand.","In an instant, a huge map of the galaxy appeared at the spot where the walking stick of the Xunan Supreme Being was pointed!","As for the figure of the South River Supreme Martial Artist, he slowly disappeared.","In the sky, countless stars were hanging, the moon was splashing the galaxy, and the sun was slowly rising, hanging on both sides of the Sky.","On the ground, countless mountains rose from the ground, and great rivers flowed without end, full of vitality.","The entire wilderness instantly transformed into a world of its own!","“Ninth Kalpa King, watch closely. This is my Supreme Divine Art! In this place, this Lord is the Heavenly Dao. If this Lord wants you to die, you can’t live. If this Lord wants you to live, you can’t die!”","The words of the South River Supreme Martial Artist resounded in the heavens and earth at the same time. It was like the voice of the heavens, deafening even the deaf!","It was as if at that moment, the South River great master was the embodiment of the Heavenly Dao that controlled the power of heaven and earth!","“A Heavenly Dao technique?”","The Ninth Kalpa King raised his head and looked at the sky. Then, a sneer appeared on his face.","“The heavens decide, not me.”","“I make the decision, not the heavens!”","BOOM!","“Yinian...a divine kingdom!”","An ambush had begun!","...","Three days had passed since the battle between the Blood Wave Supreme and the ice brilliance Supreme in the Great Void Temple, while the Ninth Kalpa King was engaged in battle.","No one knew the outcome of this battle. Everyone was waiting to see who would emerge victorious between the Bing Ye and the great master Blood Wave.","...","One was the former first Hall Master of the Great Void Temple, a new emperor God of the great void. The other was the first seat of the Divine Life Palace, a special life form with ancient qualifications.","However, no matter what the outcome of the battle was, everyone had reached a consensus in their hearts!","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace should not be humiliated!","At this moment, in a galaxy far away from the Great Void Temple.","Supreme Bing Ye stood in mid-air with an icy peak divine sword in his hand. His silver hair and silver brows were covered in frost. Under his feet, countless wisps of ice spread out and actually froze the entire starry sky!","Under the power of this ice, countless stars and galaxies were frozen and stopped rotating, forming an extremely shocking scene.","The Ruler Blood Wave was expressionless as he stood with his hands behind his back. Traces of dark red blood dripped from his body, melting the ice beneath his feet.","‘No matter how strong the wind is, I will not move.’"]},{"number":4286,"title":"Chapter 4286 Ultimate Ruler, Complete!","paragraphs":["4286 Ultimate Ruler, Complete!","“Blood Wave, what do you want? do you really want to fight to the death with this seat?” Supreme Bing Ye’s face was gloomy as he coldly spoke.","The two of them had been fighting for three days. In terms of offensive power, he was slightly stronger than the Ruler Blood Wave. Unfortunately, the Ruler Blood Wave was a special lifeform, and in terms of Ruler divine power, he was much stronger than the Ruler Blood Wave. No matter how hard the Ruler Blood Wave attacked, he was unable to defeat him.","Now that the Grand ceremony of all races in the universe was about to begin, he, Bing Ye, was very likely to become one of the Dao-listening children under that Lord. He did not want to continue fighting with the Blood Wave Supreme.","The Ruler Blood Wave’s expression was indifferent as he replied, “I don’t want to do anything. What I want is to seek justice for the disciples of the Divine Life Palace.”","“Justice? Don’t tell me you want me to apologize on Jian Wushuang’s behalf?” Supreme Bing Ye looked as if he had heard a joke, and a mocking look appeared on his face.","However, the Ruler Blood Wave nodded and replied, “Yes, that’s exactly the case.”","Hearing this, the sneer on Supreme Bing Ye’s face gradually disappeared. His eyes turned cold as he coldly said, “Blood Wave, you’re too naive. Who do you think I am? What was Jian Wushuang’s identity? Is he even worthy?”","From the beginning to the end, Supreme Bing Ye had never thought that Supreme Blood Wave would start a war with him over a mere Jian Wushuang, regardless of the overall situation!","After all, in his opinion, those who had not become Supremes were still ants. It would not affect the overall situation if he killed Jian Wushuang.","The Ruler Blood Wave shook his head and said, “Whether he’s worthy or not is not for you to decide.”","“Alright. Blood Wave, since you want to die, don’t blame me.”","Supreme Bing Ye’s eyes turned cold. He could no longer suppress the anger in his heart. A sharp Ice Dragon that was tens of thousands of feet long rose from the ground and swept toward the Ruler Blood Wave with a roar.","The void shattered instantly!","“Hmph!” The Ruler Blood Wave’s eyes narrowed as he snorted coldly. A vast amount of blood condensed at his fingertips, forming a light wave that shot toward the Frost Dragon!","Just as the two of them were about to fight again, two deep and ancient voices sounded in their minds.","“You guys, have you had enough?”","“Alright, Blood Wave, stop.”","The eyes of both the Blood Wave Supreme and the brilliance ice flickered when they heard this voice.","“Sir Divine Emperor!”","“Autarch Gai Fu.”","...","Just as Jian Wushuang’s death created a storm that swept across the entire universe...","On the Ancient Path of Stars, within the God Refining Tower of the tenth city.","Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough had also reached a critical point.","Countless auras of the origin laws became chaotic and violent. Like the rising tide of the sea, they swept toward Jian Wushuang in waves.","The ninth rule was gradually forming in his body.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were wide open as he continued to absorb the origin rules like a whale sucking in water!","At that moment, if someone was on the ninth level of the God Refining Tower, they would realize that in the chaotic ninth level, a huge whirlpool had formed with Jian Wushuang as the center!","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in the center of the whirlpool. He absorbed the surging divine power and formed the ninth rule in his body!","With the formation of the ninth rule, Jian Wushuang’s aura became more and more powerful and terrifying. He was gradually stepping into a completely new realm!","In fact, there was indeed such a person who was quietly watching Jian Wushuang.","Outside the God Refining Tower, Lord Blue stood with her hands behind her back. Only her beautiful eyes that were like autumn water were exposed. It was as if she had passed through the God Refining Tower and seen Jian Wushuang, who was trying to break through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm.","Images of Jian Wushuang flashed in the depths of her eyes and were recorded.","Her face flashed with splendor as she muttered to herself, “He’s a good seedling.”","...","Time flew by, and sixty years had passed in the blink of an eye.","Outside the universe, even though the battle between Supreme Bing Ye and Supreme Blood Wave had ended, a barrier had naturally formed between the Great Void Temple and the Divine Life Palace.","The people from the two forces kept clashing with each other.","On the Ancient Path of Stars, the winds and clouds were also changing.","The nine Overlords no longer existed. On the Ancient Path of Stars, only Qiu Long was left!","Most of the Ultimate Rulers in the last eight cities had already become Qiu Long’s subordinates.","Only the Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint Son, and the young clan leader of the Demonic Luo Clan joined forces to resist Qiu Long. However, the situation was not good. They were chased around by the other powerful figures under Qiu Long like stray dogs and could only struggle bitterly.","Even if the three of them joined forces, the situation was still precarious.","Of the Overlord’s six great commanders, some had died, and some had surrendered. Only Commander Mountain Shaker and Commander Han Feng were still alive.","Even Moluo’s subordinate, Moluo Yangu, who had fought with Jian Wushuang before, had died in the back eight cities at the hands of the young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","Just as the three of them began to feel despair and wondered if they should join Qiu Long’s side...","No one knew that within the God Refining Tower’s Tenth City.","“Ultimate Ruler, done!”","Jian Wushuang, who was surrounded by countless origin rules, suddenly opened his eyes. A ray of divine light that shocked the world flashed across his eyes!","His divine body made a series of cracking sounds.","As if he had become an immortal, Jian Wushuang had reached the realm of completion with the integration of the ninth rule!","Be it the strength of his divine power or his divine body, Jian Wushuang could feel that he had become unprecedentedly powerful!","Compared to a Ruler of the fifth level, Jian Wushuang’s power had increased by at least a hundred times!","At that moment, he was far from what he had been when he was a stage five great emperor.","...","“The current me...how strong are they?”","Jian Wushuang opened his palm and looked down. He muttered to himself, “I don’t even know how strong I am now.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He was in no hurry to leave the ninth level of the God Refining Tower. Instead, a look of deep thought flashed across his eyes.","“Right now, I’ve already reached the Ultimate Ruler Realm. Why don’t I try to push the ‘Eternal Night’ sword-art to the ‘minor success’ realm in one go? I can also try to grasp the Tarot sword and comprehend the second move of the Tarot Sword Manual, dawn.”","Jian Wushuang immediately put his thoughts into action. With a flip of his right hand, the Tarot Sword Manual, which exuded an ancient aura, suddenly appeared in front of him.","He flipped to the second page of the Tarot Sword Manual, and the introduction to ‘daybreak’ immediately appeared in his mind.","When night fell and the world fell into endless darkness and suffering, the first beam of light that cut through everything in the deepest darkness.","It was called the light of dawn-daybreak!","Boom!","The world in front of Jian Wushuang suddenly changed!","In the endless dark night, a beam of golden light shot over from a distance!","...","At first, this golden light was only as thick as a strand of hair, but when it reached its destination, it became an unrivaled force and turned into a golden sword light that shot up to the sky, tearing the endless dark night apart!","The entire world was split into two!","Endless light shone down, and the world returned to chaos!"]},{"number":4287,"title":"Chapter 4287 The Tenth City, the Storm Rises","paragraphs":["4287 The Tenth City, the Storm Rises","“Daybreak. It’s an invincible killing move that can eliminate all evil and darkness in the world!”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and a flash of understanding appeared in his eyes.","Daybreak was a variant killer move of Eternal Night.","If Eternal Night was said to be a sword that formed a country, a move that combined trapping and killing enemies into one, then dawn was the most powerful killing Divine Art that gathered all divine power!","In terms of pure offensive power, daybreak’s offensive power was far greater than Eternal Night’s!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and closed the Tarot Sword Manual. He continued to deduce the sword move ‘Eternal Night’ and tried to push it to the initial realm.","...","...","Time flowed by, and another five thousand years passed.","The Ancient Path of Stars was in a state of chaos, but in the back eight cities, Qiu Long’s reputation was already at its peak, and no one dared to disobey his orders.","The Overlord and the others were gradually losing their breath under the suppression of the Dragon prison. They could only retreat in defeat.","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint Son, and the young clan leader of the Moluo clan had no choice but to act separately to prevent Qiu Long from seizing the opportunity to capture them all.","At this moment, at the entrance of the Eleventh City.","The great Overlord was covered in blood as he panted heavily, his eyes fixed on the First Prince and Scarlet Sun Demon Master.","In the past, the three of them had been part of the nine great leaders of the Ancient Path of Stars. However, with the rise of Qiu Long, the First Prince, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master, and the others had joined him. He, the great Overlord, had become a stray dog, while these two had become Qiu Long’s thugs.","The First Prince and the scarlet sun demonic lord both had faint smiles on their faces as they looked at the great Overlord, who was at the end of his rope. “Overlord, a wise bird chooses a tree to perch on. Now that Lord Qiu Long is very powerful, I’ll give you a kind reminder since we were polite before. Quickly join Lord Qiu Long’s Army. This is the only clear path for you.”","The Overlord’s expression was cold. He had activated the immortal Overlord body to its limit, but even so, his breath had been exhausted to the extreme. If it were not for the fact that the immortal Overlord body was an extremely strong physique rarely seen in the ancient times, he would have been unable to hold on and died at the hands of the two.","“Hmph, I, the great Overlord, have always been indomitable. I’ve never been submissive to anyone. He’s not qualified to make me submit to Qiu Long.” The Overlord’s eyes were cold as he said proudly.","Even though he was covered in wounds, his back was still straight, like a spear that would not fall.","He was the Overlord and had been undefeated throughout his life. He had suppressed the last eight cities on the Ancient Path of Stars. How could he be willing to be under someone else?","“Stupid stubbornness.”","The First Prince shook his head, his eyes cold and sharp. “If that’s the case, then Overlord, you should be prepared to go.”","“Scarlet Sun Demon Master, do it!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he flipped his right hand, and a Dragon-patterned Jade seal appeared in his hand. Then, he pressed it toward the Overlord!","“Brahma seal, suppress!”","This jade seal was extremely domineering. The moment the jade seal pressed down, it was as if a mighty Emperor had appeared. His mouth contained the wrath of the heavens, and he descended with the wrath of thunder. He shook the world and punished the world!","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s eyes flashed as well. He pulled with his hands, and a black ball covered in black demonic fire appeared, pressing down on the Overlord’s head.","The two of them were the strongest of the unparalleled Rulers, and their attacks were so earth-shattering that the earth began to crack.","Seeing this, the Overlord squinted his eyes, and a hint of solemness flashed through them.","In terms of combat strength, he believed that he was not inferior to either of these two, and he could even kill either of them. But now, his indestructible tyrant body had long been overwhelmed by the long-term pursuit, and he was afraid that he would not be able to continue fighting.","Bang!","Finally, the joint attack of the First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master Blueded heavily on where the great Overlord was standing, and the eleventh city trembled.","In the eleventh city, countless Ultimate Rulers hid in their palaces and trembled as they watched the scene.","“Eh? Where is he?”","The First Prince raised an eyebrow and let out a soft gasp.","Where the Overlord was standing, there was no one. The Overlord’s figure had disappeared.","“First Prince, this is the connecting passage between the Tenth and Eleventh Cities. I think the Overlord has already escaped to the Tenth City.” The Scarlet Sun Demon Master said slowly.","The First Prince’s eyes narrowed and a cold smile appeared on his lips. He said coldly, “You want to escape? Let’s go!”","Bang!","The two of them took a step forward and disappeared at the entrance of the Eleventh City.","...","At the entrance to the Tenth City.","Pfft!","The Overlord opened his mouth and spat out a mouthful of divine blood. His face turned pale.","Just now, he had activated the passage scroll in time and dodged the joint attack of the First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master.","But even so, he was still grazed a few times, and the scars on the undying tyrant body increased.","“Hmph, when I recover, I’ll definitely turn these two into ashes!” The Overlord’s expression was gloomy as he said hatefully.","He was one of the strongest among the nine magnates. He did not think that the First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master, who he usually looked down on, would be able to force him into such a situation with the power of the Imprisoned Dragon.","“We can’t continue like this. Otherwise, we’ll probably die today,” the Overlord took a deep breath, and his expression gradually calmed down. A thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","He understood that he only had two choices if he wanted to live.","The other option was to submit to Qiu Long, like the First Prince and the others, and become his subordinates.","The other option was to completely leave the Ancient Path of Stars. At that time, he would be free to fly in the sky and swim in the sea, and the First Prince and the others would definitely not come after him.","The first choice was directly rejected by the Overlord. If he wanted to surrender to Qiu Long, he would have surrendered a long time ago, and things would not have ended up like this.","If the second option was to leave the Ancient Path of Stars, he would be very unwilling.","...","Once he left the Ancient Path of Stars, it would mean that everything he had done before would be for naught. He would be completely disqualified from the universe myriad race gathering.","“Something’s wrong! I still have a third option!”","Just as the Overlord was deep in thought, he suddenly saw a ‘lyu’ shaped pagoda from the corner of his eye, and his face lit up.","“That’s right, i can escape to the God Refining Tower first!”","At the thought of this, the Overlord no longer hesitated and flew toward the God Refining Tower.","As soon as the Overlord left, the First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master appeared at the entrance of the passage.","“First Prince, where do you think the Overlord will run to?” The Scarlet Sun Demon Master asked with a frown.","The First Prince narrowed his eyes when he heard that. He then pointed at the God Refining Tower and said with a smile that was not a smile, “If this Highness’ guess is correct, he should have gone to the God Refining Tower.”","With that, the two of them turned into two rays of light and shot toward the God Refining Tower.","In the tenth city, many Ultimate Rulers looked up at this scene, and they were shocked.","The three magnates had arrived in the tenth city at the same time!","..."]},{"number":4288,"title":"Chapter 4288 Jian Wushuang Comes Out of Seclusion!","paragraphs":["4288 Jian Wushuang Comes Out of Seclusion!","God Refining Tower, ninth level.","The originally dense and surging origin source law aura had almost completely dissipated.","All that was left was a black-robed, black-haired statue that seemed to have existed since ancient times. It sat cross-legged in the void, and waves of extremely powerful aura spread out from it, sweeping in all directions and squeezing the entire chaotic space of the ninth floor.","“After 5000 years, I’ve finally reached the initial stage of the ‘Eternal Night’ sword technique.” A deep voice came from the black-robed, black-haired sculpture.","!!","In the next moment, the statue suddenly opened its eyes!","An earth-shattering and extremely sharp divine light flashed through the eyes of the statue!","He was Jian Wushuang!","In the close to 10000 years that he had spent in the God Refining Tower, not only had he broken through to the realm of an Ultimate Ruler and grasped the second move of the zenith sword canon, Daybreak, he had even deduced the ‘Eternal Night’ sword move to the small success realm!","The current him, one sword could be a world!","The sword fell, and Eternal Night descended!","And this was far from his greatest improvement.","“The Tarot divine sword...”","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and saw a dark golden sword full of mysterious runes floating in front of his knees. There was a closed vertical eye on the hilt of the sword.","Then, he opened his palm, and his five well-defined fingers grabbed the hilt of the Tarot divine sword!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang felt as if his heart and blood were connected.","Puchi!","The eye on the hilt of the Tarot divine sword suddenly opened!","An extremely evil aura was emitted from the vertical eye!","The vertical eye was covered in cobweb-like blood vessels. The black eyeball was spinning, and it was filled with a sinister feeling.","“Even though I can only use a trace of the Tarot divine sword’s true power, it’s enough.” Jian Wushuang smiled and a look of satisfaction flashed in his eyes.","The Tarot divine sword was the peerless divine weapon that Tarot Supreme had used to dominate the universe. In terms of grade, it was far beyond the level of a law Supreme treasure. It had reached a level that Jian Wushuang could not understand.","Even if he could only use a trace of its power, it would surpass all of Jian Wushuang’s current sword principle super powers.","Jian Wushuang flipped his hand and put the Tarot divine sword back into the sandalwood sword case on his back. Then, he slowly stood up.","Ka-chak.","His divine body made crackling sounds like beans being fried.","“Qiu Long, don’t let me down.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself in a cold voice.","...","Outside the God Refining Tower.","Just as the Overlord arrived and was about to step into the God Refining Tower.","“Whoosh!”","Two rays of light pierced through the heaven and earth from the distance. They were a step ahead of him and landed at the entrance of the God Refining Tower.","As the light gradually dissipated, the First Prince stood in front of the God Refining Tower with his hands behind his back. The corners of his lips curled up in a mocking smile as he said, “The great Overlord has actually fallen to the point where he needs to escape into the God Refining Tower to save his life?”","The Overlord’s expression changed as he turned around to look.","Scarlet Sun Demon Master was expressionless, and he blocked his way with a long black saber in his hand.","Seeing this, the Overlord’s heart sank, and his face turned ugly.","In the Tenth City, the many Ultimate Rulers saw this and could not help but sigh.","“Fate makes fools of people, and heroes meet their end.”","A powerful being at the level of a big shot has actually fallen to the point of being hunted down.","“It seems like we can’t stay on the Ancient Path of Stars any longer.”","They naturally knew about the changes that happened in the last eight cities. Qiu Long had killed those who disobeyed him, which was true to the saying, ‘those who follow me live, and those who resist me die’.","In the last eight cities, apart from those who had submitted to Qiu Long, the other Ultimate Rulers had basically been killed.","Fortunately, they were weak and Qiu Long did not care about them, so no one came to find trouble with them. He did not know if he should be glad or smile bitterly...","“Let’s hurry up and leave. When the big shots fight, I’m afraid we’ll be caught in the crossfire.”","After sighing, these Ultimate Rulers all soared into the sky, planning to leave.","When the First Prince and the others saw this, they did not care. They were just a bunch of small fries, and they did not care to deal with them.","“Overlord, just surrender.” The First Prince’s gaze turned and finally locked onto the Overlord.","A majestic aura rose with him as the center, and the terrifying pressure directly crushed all the houses within a ten-mile radius!","Behind the great Overlord, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master twisted his neck and released his own pressure, as if an ancient demonic god had descended.","The Overlord took a deep breath and knew that there was no way to end this peacefully. Fortunately, he had a fierce and ambitious personality. A look of determination flashed in his eyes as he said in a deep voice, “Then come!”","“Alright, I’ll fulfill your wish.”","The First Prince licked the corner of his lips, a sickly cruelty on his face.","Just as he and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master were about to attack and kill the great Overlord with one strike...","All of a sudden!","...","“Rumble!!”","As if the sky was falling and the earth was cracking, the entire Tenth City, a region of nearly 100000 miles, started to tremble!","At this moment!","The ground cracked and the sky changed colors. Gusts of wind howled, and the entire Tenth City seemed to have fallen into a raging sea!","An extremely powerful pressure descended with a bang, threatening all directions!","in front of this pressure, the First Prince’s and Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s pressure was like a stream in a mountain facing an ocean. They were so insignificant that they were on completely different levels!","In just a breath, he was crushed!","“What’s going on?”","The First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master exclaimed in shock.","Even the Overlord was shocked. He, who had the immortal Overlord body, felt like a little chick shivering in front of this destructive pressure.","Only at the fortress where ‘Lord Blue’ of the Tenth City was located, she, who had been resting with her eyes closed, opened them. a smile appeared on her face as she said softly, “He’s finally out.”","...","Bang!","At this moment, the God Refining Tower’s bronze door that had been sealed for close to ten thousand years suddenly shattered!","Countless dragon-like sword Qi shot out from it!","“Who’s causing trouble?”","The First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master roared as they used their divine power to block the sword Qi!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","However, when the dragon-like sword Qi hit them, they were sent flying hundreds of meters away, leaving countless deep sword marks on the ground.","The First Prince and Scarlet Sun Demon Master were both shocked and furious as they glared at the God Refining Tower.","Da da da da.","Da da da da.","A heavy sound of footsteps came from the God Refining Tower.","Following that, they saw a cold-looking young man dressed in black with his jet-black hair hanging down loosely. He was carrying a sword case on his back as he walked out from the darkness of the God Refining Tower.","“Who is he?”","When the grave-looking young man walked out of the darkness of the God Refining Tower, the First Prince and Scarlet Sun Demon Master trembled in disbelief.","Even the Overlord was dumbfounded. It was as if he had been struck by lightning.","“Jian Wushuang!”"]},{"number":4289,"title":"Chapter 4289 Instant Kill With One Sword","paragraphs":["4289 Instant Kill With One Sword","When Jian Wushuang walked out of the God Refining Tower.","The entire Tenth City fell silent.","Not only were the First Prince, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master, and the Overlord dumbfounded, but even the many Ultimate Rulers who were planning to leave the Ancient Path of Stars were so shocked that their eyes almost fell out of their sockets. They looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze.","The next moment.","!!","The First Prince and the others shuddered and stared at Jian Wushuang. The First Prince even shouted in a low voice, “Impossible! There’s no way you’re still alive!”","“I saw you being killed by Qiu Long with my own eyes! How can you still be alive?”","“Who are you? Speak! Who the hell are you?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and said, “Are you very unhappy to see me alive?”","The First Prince gritted his teeth.","Speaking of which, he and Jian Wushuang had some history.","Back then, in the Tarot ruins, his Third Brother, the Third Prince, had been killed by Jian Wushuang.","Although the Eldest Prince was happy that the third prince had been killed, he pretended to be heartbroken. He even said that he would take Jian Wushuang’s head personally to offer it to the Third Prince’s spirit in heaven.","Later, when Jian Wushuang killed the Golden Crow Prince, the Rabbit Buddha, and the other four unparalleled Rulers on the Ancient Path of Stars, he knew that he was no longer Jian Wushuang’s opponent. He no longer mentioned that he would take the Third Prince’s head.","Things should have ended here.","However, at that moment, Qiu Long came out and Jian Wushuang died.","The First Prince took this opportunity to announce to the public that Jian Wushuang was lucky. Otherwise, he would have died in his hands.","What he did not expect was that not only was Jian Wushuang not dead, but judging from his momentum, he was even stronger than before!","Now that Jian Wushuang had been reborn, once Jian Wushuang found out, he would spread the news that he had been clamoring outside...","“Jian Wushuang, don’t be too pleased with yourself. If Lord Qiu Long can kill you once, he can kill you twice!” The First Prince’s expression was dark as he clenched his fists.","Scarlet Sun Demon Master looked at Jian Wushuang with interest. This was the first time he had seen the man who had killed four invincible Rulers.","“Blood Sword, oh, no, I should call you Jian Wushuang. I’ve always wanted to see how strong you are.” Scarlet Sun Demon Master took a step forward, looked at Jian Wushuang, and said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He remembered that he had never mentioned his name on the Ancient Path of Stars. He had been using the alias of Blood Sword.","“It seems that while I was in seclusion, a lot of things must have happened in the universe.”","Jian Wushuang thought for a moment, then looked at Scarlet Sun Demon Master and said, “You want to fight me?”","“Not bad!”","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master replied with a laugh.","At the same time, he had a plan in his heart. Now that Jian Wushuang had died and come back to life, it would definitely cause a great uproar in the universe. If he killed Jian Wushuang, he would not only gain Qiu Long’s appreciation, but he would also become famous in the universe.","Even if he was no match for Jian Wushuang, he believed that he could escape with his strength. When the time came, he would report the news to Qiu Long and it would be a great merit.","“Then I’ll do as you wish.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and his five well-defined fingers grabbed the hilt of the Wuqi Divine Sword at his waist.","Seeing this, the Overlord’s expression changed and he quickly shouted, “Jian Wushuang, don’t be reckless. When I recover, we’ll join forces...”","Bang!","Before he could finish.","Jian Wushuang had already drawn his sword!","Wuqi Divine Sword was unsheathed three inches!","Clang!","A light ring.","The next moment, a sword light that made the world wail flashed!","Hurry up! It was too fast!","The crowd only saw Jian Wushuang pull out his sword, and then a white sword light shot out from his scabbard and cut through Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s body like a knife cutting through tofu!","“I...”","The smile on the Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s face had not frozen yet, and he only managed to utter a single word before his body was torn into pieces!","Boom!","In the next moment, Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s divine body collapsed!","One-hit kill!","At this moment, the world seemed to be suffocating.","Everyone looked at Jian Wushuang in shock. Their eyes were dazed and their mouths were so wide open that an egg could be stuffed in.","Just now...what was happening?","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm and his black hair was loose, as if he had just done something insignificant. He looked at the First Prince and said calmly, “Do you also want to fight me?”","Puchi!","The First Prince’s eyes widened. When he heard the question, his face was filled with shock as if he had seen a ghost. His legs went soft and he almost fell to the ground.","One...one-shot kill?","The First Prince felt a chill run down his spine to the top of his head, his entire body cold.","Jian Wushuang, how did he become so terrifying?","...","Gulp.","The sound of someone’s throat moving was heard.","Everyone in the Tenth City swallowed their saliva unconsciously. They looked at Jian Wushuang, who wore a calm expression and had black hair. All the hair on their bodies stood on end.","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master was a famous and unparalleled Ruler in the universe. He was one of the nine great Overlords of the Ancient Path of Stars, an existence that countless people looked up to!","However, such an unrivaled Ruler had been killed by Jian Wushuang with one stroke?","This was not the most terrifying thing. The most terrifying thing was that the divine sword on Jian Wushuang’s waist seemed to have not been completely unsheathed!","What kind of terrifying combat strength was this?","At this moment, countless people were terrified.","“Jian Wushuang, don’t be too pleased with yourself. No matter how strong you are, Lord Qiu Long on the Ancient Path of Stars can still deal with you!” The First Prince gritted his teeth.","He was not stupid. Since Jian Wushuang could kill Scarlet Sun Demon Master with one strike, he must be much stronger than him.","The only thing he could do now was to use Qiu Long to make Jian Wushuang hesitate.","...","“You want to use the Dragon prison to suppress me?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and said indifferently, “Crown Prince, I didn’t want to kill you, but since you’ve brought up Qiu Long, I’m sorry, but you can’t leave today.”","When the First Prince heard this, his expression changed greatly. As he stealthily retreated, he opened his mouth and chided, “Jian Wushuang, do you think that you can fight against Lord Qiu Long just because you have come back to life? Let me tell you, Lord Qiu Long’s strength is far beyond your...”","Bang!","At this point, the First Prince saw that the distance between him and Jian Wushuang had increased. He stepped heavily with his right foot and immediately shot toward the entrance of the Tenth City!","Escape! He had to escape!","“I said, you can’t leave.”","At this moment, a calm voice sounded in his ear.","“When did you come over? How could he be so fast!”","The First Prince’s scalp went numb.","Pfft!","The next second, a half-moon sword energy slashed across his body!","The First Prince’s divine body was sliced through like paper by the half-moon sword light!","“No!”","The First Prince roared in shock.","His divine body suddenly shattered!","The First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master were both dead!"]},{"number":4290,"title":"Chapter 4290 The Universe Shakes","paragraphs":["4290 The Universe Shakes","Hu, hu, hu!","Gusts of cold wind blew across the top of the Tenth City.","The noisy Tenth City was suddenly so silent that one could hear a pin drop.","Everyone’s eyes widened and they looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","!!","The First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master had both been killed by a single sword strike?","It was wrong!","They did not even see Jian Wushuang unsheathe his Wuqi Divine Sword. With just a sword drawing move, the two divine bodies were annihilated!","That was too terrifying!!!","Cold sweat broke out on the foreheads of countless people as they looked at Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the void like a sword god descending from the heavens. They all thought of the same thing.","It was as if a demonic seed had descended from the heavens. He was truly a Taisui God in the mortal world!","Even the Overlord swallowed his saliva and looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated expression.","In the past, Jian Wushuang had been the seventh commander under him, a nobody on the Ancient Path of Stars.","But now, the entire universe was stirring up a storm for him!","His life was even saved by him just now!","“Blood Sword...” The Overlord called out softly. Compared to Jian Wushuang, he was more used to using the alias ‘Blood Sword’.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and stepped down in the void. He said, “Where is Qiu Long now?”","Hearing this, the Overlord was stunned. he immediately replied, “Blood Sword, he’s in the Eighteenth City...”","Before he could say anything else, Jian Wushuang had already turned around and walked toward the entrance of the Tenth City.","A calm voice was heard.","“Let’s go, follow me to kill him.”","Hearing this, the Overlord’s body trembled and he quickly followed.","A moment later, the two of them disappeared from the entrance of the Tenth City.","The surrounding Ultimate Rulers of the tenth city finally woke up from their dream.","They looked at each other and could see the splendor in each other’s eyes.","They knew that the Ancient Path of Stars was about to change!","Then, the news that Jian Wushuang had killed the First Prince and Scarlet Sun Demon Master with one move spread like wildfire across the universe!","In an instant, the entire universe shook!","...","Within the Great Void Temple.","Supreme Bing Ye was sitting in the main hall with his eyes closed.","He had spent nearly a hundred chaos cycles building up the power of the Ruler Blood Wave, and he had used up almost all of it. it would take him countless years to recuperate.","“Blood Wave, I’ll settle this with you at the universe myriad Clan Gathering.” Supreme Bing Ye opened his eyes, and killing intent flickered in his silver pupils.","It was unknown how many years it had been, but ever since he had reached the Divine Ruler Realm, no one had dared to provoke him.","However, that day, when Blood Wave went on a killing spree in front of the Great Void Temple, he even said, “So what if I bully you?” He did not lose any face at all.","How could he not be angry?","Originally, when he became the new emperor God, it was time for him to show his might. But now, the entire universe was laughing at him, saying that he was the most useless Emperor God out of all the previous emperor gods in the Great Void Temple!","His killing intent toward the Ruler Blood Wave had almost materialized!","Suddenly.","At this moment, a long cry for an audience came from outside the door.","“Come in.”","Taking a deep breath, Supreme Bing Ye suppressed his emotions and spoke calmly.","“Yes!”","Then, a Ruler of the Great Void Temple hurried in.","“Greetings, Emperor God Bing Ye!” The Ruler half-knelt and cupped his hands.","Supreme Bing Ye nodded his head and said indifferently, “What is the so-called audience for?”","The Ruler half-knelt on the ground, his head lowered as he struggled and hesitated.","“This...”","“Speak!”","Supreme Bing Ye frowned as he rebuked in a dignified manner.","The disciple gritted his teeth and replied, “Sir Divine Emperor, there’s news from the Ancient Path of Stars that Jian Wushuang isn’t dead. He’s been reborn and killed the First Prince, Scarlet Sun Demon Master, and the others with one strike!”","After he said that, there was no thunderous anger or murderous intent in the entire Hall. Instead, it turned into a dead silence.","The deathly silence was chilling.","The disciple’s expression could not help but turn fearful.","Only after a long while did Supreme Bing Ye’s calm voice resounded in the main hall.","...","“This lord knows, you may leave.”","Hearing this, the disciple heaved a sigh of relief and quickly took his leave.","What he did not know was that Supreme Master Bing Ye’s throne, which was made of Supreme-grade divine materials, had already been shattered into pieces!","“Trash!”","Supreme Bing Ye’s expression was ashen to the extreme. A cold aura spread out from him, causing the temperature of the entire Hall to drop by thousands of degrees, and the ground to be covered with a thick layer of frost.","If Jian Wushuang did not die, then the Great Void Temple would become the biggest joke in the entire universe!","...","At the same time, in the Divine Life Palace.","The Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe had also received the news of Jian Wushuang’s rebirth.","“Hahahaha, I knew it. This little fellow has always been tough. How could he die at the hands of a stray dog?”","The Blood Wave Supreme, who had not smiled since Jian Wushuang’s death, laughed heartily.","...","Supreme Giant Axe looked at the Blood Wave Supreme, who was laughing heartily, and a smile also appeared on his face.","He was not good with words, but when he heard that Jian Wushuang was still alive, he was just as happy as the Blood Wave Master.","“Blood Wave, the Great Void Temple has suffered a huge loss this time.” Supreme Giant Axe laughed and shook his head.","...","On the Ancient Path of Stars.","The Ninth Kalpa King’s figure flashed rapidly as he chased after an old man from da Qian.","“Didn’t you want to kill me to avenge your vice Palace Master?”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s expression was indifferent, and he gave a calm smile as he chased.","“Pervert! A monster! You’re crazy!”","The old man gritted his teeth and his face was filled with fear as he continued to fly forward.","This person was the river south Palace Master who had come to kill the Ninth Kalpa King!","It was just that they did not know when, but the two of them had changed their identities between hunting and being hunted.","“The Autarchs of special life from the Divine Life Palace are far superior to us ordinary Autarchs! Especially when the Ninth Kalpa King has a perfect life form.”","The thoughts of the South River Supreme Martial Artist spun rapidly in his mind. He began to frantically plan how to escape from the pursuit.","However, at this moment.","The Ninth Kalpa King, who was originally chasing him, suddenly stopped in his tracks.","“Oh? Jian Wushuang didn’t die?”","The Ninth Kalpa King clasped his hands behind his back, a look of surprise on his face.","He had just received a message from the Blood Wave Master, telling him that not only was Jian Wushuang not dead, but he had also killed the First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master with one stroke!","“That’s true. He’s someone I, the Ninth Kalpa King, acknowledge as my opponent. How could he die?”","The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head and smiled. He looked at Hall Master Feng Nan and said indifferently, “Fine, I’ll spare your life today.”","...","At the same time.","Jian Wushuang and the Overlord had already stepped into the Eleventh City.","“Blood Sword...Jian Wushuang, listen to me. If I’m not wrong, Qiu Long should have already known that you’re not dead. Now, the entire back eight city is under his command. If you break in rashly, he will definitely set up an ambush and send people to kill you. In my opinion, why don’t we find the Nine Stars Saint Son and the young clan leader of the Moluo clan first, and then we can think of a plan to deal with Qiu Long together?”","Otherwise, if you enter the last eight cities like this, you will definitely make enemies with the whole world.","The Overlord followed Jian Wushuang, slightly behind him, and said carefully.","The current Jian Wushuang naturally could not be treated with the same attitude as before.","Even when he spoke, he had to think twice to see if it was appropriate.","“Enemies of the whole world?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and then shook his head. He said calmly, “Then, let’s make the whole world our enemy.”"]},{"number":4291,"title":"Chapter 4291 Killing All Enemies in the World With a Single Sword","paragraphs":["4291 Killing All Enemies in the World With a Single Sword","In the depths of the Ancient Path of Stars, in the 18th city.","Qiu Long sat on a throne. The young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the Blood God, and a woman with an enchanting figure and charming looks stood on his sides.","He was holding a brief message in his hand. It was an urgent battle report from the Ruler of the Tenth City.","The letter recorded in detail how Jian Wushuang had been reborn and how he had killed the First Prince and the Scarlet Sun Demon Master with one stroke.","!!","“My Lord, what should we do now?” The Young Emperor lowered his head and asked.","Qiu Long had a playful expression on his face. He did not reply, but smiled and said, “This is interesting. Jian Wushuang was killed by me, but he still came back to life.”","He paused.","Qiu Long’s eyes swept across the young Emperor of Great Sun Divine Kingdom and the enchanting woman. He said, “Youngflame, allheaven woman, each of you will lead a hundred Ultimate Rulers to the eleventh city and kill Jian Wushuang.","“Yes!”","The Young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom agreed, while the heavenly woman kissed Qiu Long on the cheek and said with a charming smile, “Lord Qiu Long, wait for my good news.”","A moment later, the two of them led 100 Ultimate Rulers each and flew toward the Eleventh City.","Looking at the two disappearing figures, Qiu Long chuckled and said, “Jian Wushuang, don’t worry. The game between us has just begun.”","...","...","The Eleventh City.","The sky was gray.","Jian Wushuang walked on the Imperial Road of the Eleventh City. He could feel that after nearly 10000 years, the Ancient Path of Stars had become much more deserted than when he was there.","He remembered that when he had first entered the Eleventh City, there had been many Ultimate Rulers guarding the passage, inviting the Ultimate Rulers of the next eight cities to join their factions.","But now, all the liveliness and prosperity of the past had disappeared, leaving behind only a bleak and cold atmosphere.","Jian Wushuang, ever since you faked your death, the last eight cities of the Ancient Path of Stars have fallen into Qiu Long’s crazed slaughter. Now, the last eight cities of the Ancient Path of Stars are either dead or have fled. Even if there are a few who are still alive, almost all of them have submitted to Qiu Long. The Overlord, who was behind Jian Wushuang, sighed.","Back then, when the nine of them ruled the Ancient Path of Stars together, it could be said that hundreds of flowers bloomed, each of them shining with extraordinary splendor. Even if there were occasional killings, their foundations would not be hurt.","Jian Wushuang nodded and did not reply.","The Overlord continued, “I’ve already sent a message to the Nine Stars Saint Son and the demon race’s young clan leader. They’ll come and find us soon, and we’ll fight Qiu Long together.","Jian Wushuang hummed and asked after some thought, “Is Commander Mountain Shaker still alive?”","He did not care about the life and death of the others. However, commander Mountain Shaker had treated him well when he had first arrived at the eight cities behind the Ancient Path of Stars.","The Overlord smiled bitterly and replied, “Mountain Shaker is still alive, but the other commanders are all dead. It’s just a pity that we couldn’t even take care of ourselves when we were being chased by Qiu Long, so we could only scatter and flee. I don’t know where Mountain Shaker is hiding now.”","Just as the two of them were discussing.","A rumbling sound suddenly came from the sky.","Jian Wushuang looked up.","An evil-looking man wearing a royal robe embroidered with a blazing sun and a seductive woman in revealing clothes with an alluring figure were leading a hundred Ultimate Rulers each. They were like rolling black clouds as they strode over from the distance.","Their momentum was extremely great, and they were like a black mass. It was as if heavenly soldiers and generals had arrived, and they were full of oppression.","“It’s the young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom and the heavenly Spider Woman!” The Overlord’s pupils shrank.","He did not expect that Qiu Long would be so fast. They had just arrived at the eleventh city and he had already sent people to intercept them.","In the sky, the young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom looked down at Jian Wushuang with a cold expression.","Back in the Tarot ruins, Lord Zhennan had died at the hands of Jian Wushuang.","The Duke of the South was the trusted assistant he had sent to the Tarot ruins.","“Hmph, I’ll take advantage of today to end Jian Wushuang.” The Young Empress snorted in her heart.","The heavenly woman stared at Jian Wushuang. After making a sound of surprise, she covered her mouth and laughed, “Tsk, tsk, you are Jian Wushuang? You’re younger and more handsome than I thought. Why don’t you be one of my thousands of male companions? Perhaps I can even persuade Lord Qiu Long to spare your life.”","After she finished speaking, she burst out laughing.","It had to be said that the tianluo woman was extremely beautiful, and her smile was so charming that even the many Ultimate Rulers behind her were mesmerized.","The Overlord quickly said to Jian Wushuang, “Jian Wushuang, don’t listen to this demoness’ nonsense. The Sky Spider Clan is the best at bewitching. Once they bewitch someone, they will swallow their divine power and soul to nourish themselves.”","When the Shura woman heard this, a burst of anger appeared on her face and she rebuked, “Overlord, don’t you dare get injured here and slander me!”","Then, she turned to Jian Wushuang and smiled, “Jian Wushuang, have you thought it through?”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He slowly raised his head to look at her and said calmly, “Are you done?”","“What...” The heavenly alluring woman’s face froze.","“if you’re done, then prepare to die.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He patted the Wuqi Divine Sword with his right hand and the Wuqi Divine Sword was instantly unsheathed!","Bang!","An earth-shaking, ice-cold sword essence that shot up to the nine Heavens and sent chills down one’s spine instantly spread out!","This sword essence was like a hurricane, surging with endless power!","The entire 100 miles of space instantly froze.","“Jian Wushuang, come back quickly. We can’t fight such. Super Battle formation...”","The Overlord shouted.","However, before he could finish his sentence!","...","Jian Wushuang had already grasped the hilt of his sword. He took a heavy step and soared into the sky, becoming one with his sword. He turned into a half-moon sword light and rushed toward the sea of Ultimate Rulers!","This sword was extremely ordinary at the start, but as it got closer, it suddenly seemed to seize the good fortune of heaven and earth and gave off endless brilliance.","The young Emperor and the heavenly woman’s faces were cold as they shouted, “Attack with all your might and kill him!”","“Yes!”","“Yes!” The two hundred Ultimate Rulers responded.","All sorts of nomological treasures appeared, and they lit up the sky with the glow of countless spells.","The Young Emperor pulled with his hands and a huge Blood Sun was formed. Then, it pressed down on Jian Wushuang!","“Secret skill, violent Blood Sun!”","The alluring heavenly woman’s eyes narrowed and she spat out thousands of spider silk at Jian Wushuang!","The spider silk was extremely tough and was covered with purple venom. It was like a heavy javelin, breaking the sound barrier!","At that moment, thousands of spell techniques rained down!","...","As for Jian Wushuang, he had already arrived on his sword and crashed into the black mass of Ultimate Rulers!"]},{"number":4292,"title":"Chapter 4292 A Sword Light That Could Freeze 18 Cities","paragraphs":["4292 A Sword Light That Could Freeze 18 Cities","At this moment, the sword had the power to tear the sky apart and penetrate the world! It glowed with dazzling light, and as if it were slicing through butter, it cut through all of the techniques, crushing the two hundred Ultimate Rulers!","In the firmament, only this sword light was left!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The mountains shook, the sun and the moon collapsed, and chaos boiled!","!!","With earth-shaking explosions, countless divine bodies collapsed and countless Ultimate Rulers fell. It was as if a rain of blood had fallen from the sky!","It was unstoppable! It was as easy as crushing dry weeds and smashing rotten wood!","One sword could break all techniques!","The sword pierced through the young Emperor’s Blood Sun at an extremely fast speed. Then, under the Young Emperor’s disbelieving gaze, he was cut in two!","“H-How could he be so powerful?”","The alluring and beautiful heavenly woman’s expression changed drastically. She was horrified, and with a sharp scream, she transformed into a huge black spider with black legs.","She quickly weaved a net in the air, trying to block the bright sword light that Jian Wushuang had turned into by combining with his body!","However, it was all useless!","Jian Wushuang easily tore apart the net she had painstakingly woven, crushed her body, and split her into two!","This was the first move that Jian Wushuang had made after he came out of seclusion cultivation. It was destined to shock the world!","...","...","Far away from the 11th city.","Two people were rapidly approaching!","The two of them were the Nine Stars Saint Son and the young clan leader of the Moluo clan, Huang Mo.","Suddenly, the two of them stopped in their tracks as if they had seen something unbelievable. They raised their heads and looked at the horizon!","At the end of the horizon, a bright sword radiance connected the heaven and earth like a heavenly river and crashed into a black cloud. It directly cut the black cloud that was formed by divine arts and spells into two, splitting the sea and passing by!","“What a terrifying sword intent!”","The Nine Stars Saint Son and Moluo Huang Mo looked at each other, their eyes filled with shock!","“Run! The Overlord sent me a message earlier that he was with Jian Wushuang. If I’m not wrong, this sword essence should be Jian Wushuang! In other words, they have already started fighting with Qiu Long’s men!” The Nine Stars Saint took a deep breath and couldn’t help but exclaim.","Moluo Huang Mo nodded heavily.","Then, they did not dare to delay any longer. They took a step forward and turned into two rays of light, flying toward Jian Wushuang at an even faster speed!","...","Hualala!","The sword qi soared through the sky and cut through the sun and moon!","Between heaven and earth, light returned.","A spectacular scene appeared. The Young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the heavenly woman, and the two hundred Ultimate Rulers had been reduced to sand like fortresses on a beach. They had all been annihilated.","With a single strike, the Young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the heavenly woman, and two hundred Ultimate Rulers had all been annihilated!","In the 11th city, some Ultimate Rulers who survived in the cracks looked up at the sword as if they had seen a legend. Their lips trembled as they said, “The Sword God has descended! Unparalleled in the world!”","“The elegance of this sword is proof of invincibility in the world!”","“I’ve been reborn, and I’ve killed all my enemies with a single sword strike!”","“Hahahaha, our Ancient Path of Stars is saved!”","Countless people were looking at Jian Wushuang with fascination and fascination.","The Overlord also looked at Jian Wushuang. He had originally wanted to help Jian Wushuang, but he slowly lowered his arm.","He looked at Jian Wushuang, who had killed all the enemies in the world with one stroke, and a brilliant smile bloomed on his face. The smile was so carefree and hearty!","He knew that it was time for Qiu Long’s retribution!","Whoosh! Whoosh!","Two rays of light landed beside him and turned into the Nine Stars Saint Son and Moluo Huang Mo.","The two of them did not speak. They just looked at the sword light that Jian Wushuang had turned into and their expressions were extremely complicated.","Once upon a time, they were the nine magnates, while Jian Wushuang was just a nobody on the Ancient Path of Stars.","But now, they could only look up to Jian Wushuang.","“We...I’m far from him.” The Nine Stars Saint sighed.","A moment later, Jian Wushuang was the only one left in the sky. He stood with his sword in hand, his black hair flying in the wind, and his black robe was stained with divine blood. It was as if he was stepping on the sky.","“You guys wait for me here.”","Jian Wushuang looked back at them, then turned into a sword light and flew toward the entrance of the Eleventh City.","“Jian Wushuang, where are you going?” The Overlord and the others shuddered and shouted.","“Dragon slaying.”","Jian Wushuang said calmly.","Boom!","A towering sword light appeared and disappeared before their eyes in an instant. It reappeared thousands of miles away.","...","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang had disappeared from the Eleventh City.","The Overlord and the others looked at each other and quickly followed.","The 11th city, the 12th city, the 13th city, the 14th city...","Jian Wushuang’s stroke stretched for thousands of miles. Starting from the Eleventh City, it swept across the sky of various cities.","He saw the last eight cities, which had been reduced to ruins. Countless mountains had been broken, and countless lakes had evaporated.","He knew that this was all the work of Qiu Long.","In the last eight cities, countless Ultimate Rulers who were struggling at death’s door under Qiu Long’s hands raised their heads and looked at the dazzling sword light that swept across the sky.","“Jian Wushuang! He has returned!”","In the 16th city, a burly figure hiding deep underground felt the powerful sword way aura that quickly passed through the sky. His body trembled and he hurriedly broke out of the ground.","He was Commander Mountain Shaker. He knew that the day he had been waiting for so long had finally arrived!","...","...","At this moment, they were in the 18th city, the last city on the Ancient Path of Stars.","Qiu Long sat on a throne with dragon patterns. As if he had sensed something, he slowly raised his head to look at the sky, and the corners of his mouth curled up into a strange arc.","“As expected, you didn’t stop him?” He stretched his neck lazily, making a cracking sound.","“Blood God, Jian Wushuang is about to arrive. bring his old friend out.”","The Scion’s eyes narrowed, and he nodded in agreement.","He took a step forward and walked into the palace behind Qiu Long. Then, he pushed out a huge object that was covered in a black robe.","Whoosh.","The clone lifted his black robe, revealing a chubby Ultimate Ruler on a huge stone shelf made of black iron. Two black chains had pierced through his shoulder blades and nailed him to the stone shelf!","This Ultimate Ruler was, shockingly, Hao Jin!","“Little fellow, the person who will save you is coming.”","Qiu Long laughed at him and then turned his head to look at the horizon. He licked the corner of his mouth with his tongue and revealed a cruel look.","A ray of light appeared in the sky.","This light was like a bolt of lightning between heaven and earth, splitting the sky into two. It carried the power of endless thunder and quickly swept over!","The light grew faster and faster until it suddenly enlarged in Qiu Long’s eyes!","It was a sword ray!"]},{"number":4293,"title":"Chapter 4293 Dragon Slaying (Part One)","paragraphs":["4293 Dragon Slaying (Part One)","The sword light came as fast as lightning. It was not obvious at first, but as it got closer, it instantly covered the sky and ground, tearing the clouds into pieces.","The Blood God’s expression turned cold. Even though he was still a thousand miles away, he could already feel the sharp sword Qi scraping his divine body.","“So powerful.” The Scion thought to himself.","“It’s finally here!”","On the other hand, Qiu Long’s eyes flickered with excitement as he stood up from his throne.","Bang!","The sword light that Jian Wushuang had turned into did not have any intention of stopping and charged straight at Qiu Long!","“Hahaha, good!”","Qiu Long stomped heavily on the void and created two big pits. his body turned into a black light and collided with Jian Wushuang!","Bang!","A loud bang exploded!","At the center of their collision, a massive shockwave spread out, creating white waves in the air.","In the next moment, Qiu Long’s figure was seen flying backward and crashing into a mountain, causing the mountain to collapse.","The sword light gradually dissipated, revealing a thin figure in black.","He was Jian Wushuang, who had conquered 18 cities with one sword!","The stroke had accumulated Jian Wushuang’s endless divine power. It kept on accumulating and only exploded when it hit Qiu Long!","“Cough, cough, cough. Jian Wushuang, you’ve broken through to the level of Ultimate Ruler?”","Qiu Long walked out of the mountain and wiped the divine blood from the corner of his mouth. He looked up at Jian Wushuang without any fear on his face. Instead, his eyes were full of excitement.","“Not bad. Thanks to you, I’ve broken through,” Jian Wushuang nodded lightly.","Qiu Long laughed and said, “That’s good too. It’ll only be interesting if I kill you again like this.”","Jian Wushuang ignored him. Instead, he turned to look at Ruler Hao Jin with a pained look in his eyes.","Two chains had pierced through Ruler Hao Jin’s shoulder blades. His face was sallow, and he was extremely weak. His eyes were filled with decay.","However, when he saw Jian Wushuang, his hopeless eyes gradually lit up.","He looked at Jian Wushuang and opened his mouth with difficulty. He forced a smile and said, “Lord, Lord Blood Sword, I knew you would come to save me.”","When Qiu Long saw this, he let out a sinister laugh and said mischievously, “Jian Wushuang, Speaking of which, this guy who followed you is really loyal. For the past ten thousand years, I have crushed his bones again and again. Every day, I have burned his divine soul with divine fire, causing his divine body to collapse and regenerate continuously. In the end, even so, he is still unwilling to rely on me.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression gradually turned cold. He turned to look at him and said calmly, “Don’t worry, I will also crush every bone in your body inch by inch, pull out your tendons and strip your bones, and torture you day and night!”","“Hahaha, Jian Wushuang, let’s see if you have the ability to do so! Hahahaha!” Qiu Long laughed arrogantly and countless black chains surged out from behind him, flying toward Jian Wushuang like missiles!","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He had a deep impression of the black chains. Each of them was as heavy as Mount Tai!","Jian Wushuang had been helpless against this move and could only take a beating. But now, the situation was different.","Looking at the thousands of chains that were coming at him, Jian Wushuang said two words.","“Sundering stars.”","Whoosh!","A silver sword rainbow condensed in Jian Wushuang’s hand like thousands of lights in the world. With the power of thousands of troops, it slashed at the thousands of chains!","As Jian Wushuang broke through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm, the star slashing sword also had a world-shaking difference!","The star slashing sword actually formed countless illusionary stars. The silver sword rainbow was more like a magnificent galaxy. When the sword smashed down, it was as if it had absorbed a surging galaxy. The power was terrifying to the extreme.","Ding!","A series of crisp explosions rang out as the powerful black chains were shattered one by one at an extremely fast speed by the silver sword rainbow!","It did not stop there. After the silver sword rainbow cut through the countless black chains, it continued forward. Under the surprised gaze of Qiu Long, the sword slashed his body!","Bang!","Qiu Long smashed down, and a sword mark appeared on his divine body, spurting out black divine blood.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and stomped heavily on the ground with his right foot. Suddenly, like a hurricane, he leaped and appeared above Qiu Long’s head. Before Qiu Long could react, Jian Wushuang stretched out his fingers and grabbed his face. Then, he smashed Qiu Long’s face onto the ground!","“Qiu Long, you deserve to die!”","Bang!","The ground cracked open and Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. He grabbed Qiu Long’s face and smashed it into the ground continuously. His actions were extremely violent!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Again and again!","Waves of terrifying sword essence exploded in Jian Wushuang’s hands!","Jian Wushuang grabbed Qiu Long’s head and smashed it into the ground of the 18th city, creating a huge pit. Countless cracks spread out from the pit.","“Jian Wushuang, who gave you the right to hurt me?!” A low and ferocious voice came out of Qiu Long’s mouth.","Taking advantage of the gap, Qiu Long stretched out his hand and pushed Jian Wushuang hard!","In an instant, an extremely strong pushing force rushed toward Jian Wushuang. It was as if heaven and earth were rejecting him and pushing Jian Wushuang away!","In the next moment, Qiu Long’s hands were on the ground, and he pulled his head out of the deep pit.","He looked extremely miserable. His face was covered with divine blood. Jian Wushuang’s sword essence kept exploding between his fingers, covering his face with sword marks.","Huchi huchi huchi.","...","Qiu Long panted heavily, but there was no fear on his face. Instead, he licked the divine blood on the corner of his mouth and said with a deep and ferocious smile, “Is this the feeling of being injured? I’m getting more and more excited!”","Bang!","Before he could finish his words, he had already stepped on his right foot and shot out like a cannonball. His right hand formed a fist and once again smashed toward Jian Wushuang!","Pitch-black dragon scales began to cover his arm.","The entire void became distorted because of this punch.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. He slashed his right hand on the Wuqi Divine Sword and also raised his sword to attack Qiu Long!","The speed of the two was extremely fast, and they exchanged thousands of moves in an instant. They fought from the ground to the nine heavens, and then from the nine heavens to the ground.","Every time the two of them clashed, the void trembled continuously. The 18 cities seemed to have fallen into an apocalyptic disaster. The stars shifted and the divine Lands sank within a radius of a million miles!","“Is this...is this still a battle between Ultimate Rulers?”","When the Scion of the Blood God saw this, a look of shock flashed across his face.","Just by standing at the edge of the battle between Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long, he could feel the violent pressure from the two of them, forcing him to step back.","..."]},{"number":4294,"title":"Chapter 4294 Dragon Slaying (Part Two)","paragraphs":["4294 Dragon Slaying (Part Two)","“Jian Wushuang, die die die, die die!!!” Qiu Long sneered and his eyes were filled with excitement. His mouth suddenly split open, revealing two rows of cold teeth, and he bit down on Jian Wushuang!","Boom!","At this moment, Qiu Long seemed to have transformed into a huge black dragon, exuding endless dragon might.","A stinky gust of wind came out of Qiu Long’s mouth. Jian Wushuang’s eyes glowed with divine light and he slashed out several sword lights of ‘sky-opening’, forcing back Qiu Long’s huge mouth!","Qiu Long roared in pain, his white pupils twisted, and he laughed, ”","“Jian Wushuang, is this your strength after your breakthrough? I don’t think so.” He stretched out his palm from a distance and his five fingers were slightly bent as if he was going to grab Jian Wushuang.","“Absolute gravity!”","As his voice fell, it was as if the entire world had fallen into the hands of Qiu Long, turning into a country that solely belonged to him.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Qiu Long slowly clenched his fingers. In an instant, countless mountains and lakes were moved and pressed toward Jian Wushuang.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils could not help but shrink slightly. Ten thousand years ago, he had died because of this spell.","This time, the spell reappeared and the pressure was much stronger than when it killed Jian Wushuang last time!","It was as if the entire heaven and earth were targeting Jian Wushuang. The violent power of heaven and earth was about to crush Jian Wushuang into meat paste.","“Is it similar to the heavenly Dao technique of the One Thought Divine Kingdom?” Jian Wushuang’s mind was racing. He could feel that the surrounding void had turned into a realm that belonged to Qiu Long!","Under this pressure, he felt as if his legs were made of molten iron, becoming extremely heavy. Even moving a step was extremely difficult.","“Hahaha, Jian Wushuang, this is the realm technique that I comprehended when I was still in the Supreme divine realm. Feel it well! Hahahahaha!” Qiu Long laughed wildly as his eyes flickered with excitement.","Whoosh! Whoosh!","At this moment, several beams of light flew over from the distance.","The conveyance light landed and turned into the Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others.","Commander Mountain Shaker was also among them.","“Oh no, Jian Wushuang’s condition is not good. We have to help him quickly!” The Overlord’s face changed and he was about to help Jian Wushuang.","“It’s rumored that Qiu Long was at the Divine Ruler Realm back then. However, he lost the fight for the position of the dragon clan’s Crown Prince and was stripped of his Divine Ruler Realm, falling to the Ultimate Ruler Realm and being exiled from the dragon clan. Although Jian Wushuang is strong, he’s still a little lacking when compared to a former Supreme.”","The Nine Stars Saint Son and Moluo Huang Mo looked at each other, their expressions were also extremely grave.","Just as the three of them were about to join forces to block Qiu Long one and two for Jian Wushuang...","Commander Mountain Shaker looked at Jian Wushuang and said in a deep voice, “Lord Overlord, Lord Saint Son, Lord Young Clan Leader, please believe in Jian Wushuang. This is his own battle. I think he doesn’t want others to interfere.”","“But...” The Overlord frowned and was about to say something.","Commander Mountain Shaker smiled and said, “Overlord, please believe in Jian Wushuang. I know him. He is a man who can create miracles.”","Hearing this, the Overlord was stunned. He was about to step out, but he slowly retracted his foot.","“Mountain Shaker, you’re right.”","“This is a battle that belongs to him.”","...","Facing the heavy gravity, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He had to admit that Qiu Long was the strongest Ultimate Ruler he had ever met. Even the Ninth Kalpa King, when he was in the realm of Ultimate Ruler, gave him less pressure than the current Qiu Long.","Of course, this was also because the Ninth Kalpa King had never really made a move on him.","If Jian Wushuang had not broken through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm, he might have really died today. However...the current Jian Wushuang was invincible in the Ultimate Ruler Realm!","“Divine body, appear.”","Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s divine body started to expand!","Streaks of immortal radiance surrounded him, and countless nebulas rose from his feet. A power that came from the deepest part of his soul exploded!","One mile...two miles...three miles.","Fifty thousand miles...sixty thousand miles...seventy thousand miles...","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang had turned into a chaos giant that was seventy thousand miles tall, with his head touching the sky and his feet stepping on the ground. He regarded the sun as a pellet and the galaxy as a bathtub!","It was as if he could break the universe with a raise of his hand and sink the divine lands with a step!","However, this was not the end.","His divine body was still expanding!","Eighty thousand miles... Ninety thousand miles...","It only stopped growing when Jian Wushuang’s divine body grew to ninety-eight thousand miles.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s face was covered by the endless celestial brilliance Nebula and it was hard to see clearly. He looked like a Demon God in the chaos and a Celestial King from the ancient times. With every breath he took, there was a rumbling thunder and a space storm.","Under Jian Wushuang’s divine body, which was ninety-eight thousand miles long, the heavy pressure was insignificant. It was like a thin rope trying to tie up a mammoths. It did not affect him at all.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang said calmly, “Eternal Night.”","Whoosh!","The Wuqi Divine Sword instantly disappeared and turned into countless black mist that was as thick as ink, surging toward Qiu Long.","Time and space seemed to have stopped at this moment.","“What is this?”","“Huh?” Qiu Long was not surprised by Jian Wushuang’s divine body. As one of the most powerful races in the universe and the successor of the dragon clan, he had seen and heard a lot. He naturally knew that special creatures could activate divine bodies.","...","However, the black mist that was constantly surging toward him made him a little confused.","These wisps of black mist were clearly visible but not tangible. However, no matter how he blasted out his abhijna in an attempt to destroy the black mist that was constantly surging over, the abhijna that was enough to destroy the heavens and earth would just pass through the black mist.","The next moment.","The black mist attacked him directly, intertwining and gathering to form a pitch-black ball that enveloped him.","In the blink of an eye, the world in front of him had changed dramatically.","Jian Wushuang and the 18th city had disappeared. Everything he could feel and see had turned into the deepest eternal darkness.","A force of deprivation slowly crept into his body, as if a pair of hands in the darkness had begun to take away everything that belonged to him.","His cultivation base, his power, his lifespan, and even...it was the bloodline of his dragon clan!","Under this force of deprivation, his aura gradually began to weaken.","At this moment, even the outside world could feel that Qiu Long’s life aura was gradually weakening.","“Is Qiu Long finally going to die?”","...","Just as smiles appeared on everyone’s faces and they were celebrating.","Jian Wushuang’s face, which was shrouded by countless celestial brilliance and nebulas and high up in the nine Heavens, was expressionless.","He could feel a terrifying aura that could shake the heavens and earth, and make all races submit to it. It was gradually rising in the Eternal Night Kingdom.","It was the purest aura of the dragon race.","A giant dragon was beginning to truly awaken!"]},{"number":4295,"title":"Chapter 4295 Dragon Slaying (Part Three)","paragraphs":["4295 Dragon Slaying (Part Three)","Rip!","The sound of glass shattering came from the black ball, and cracks gradually appeared on the surface of the black ball.","A terrifying aura that could not be described with words gradually rose.","“W-what’s going on?”","“This aura! It’s the aura of the dragon clan!”","“Dragon might! This is the purest Dragon might of the dragon clan!”","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint Son, and the others’ smiles had yet to fade when they suddenly froze on their faces and were all replaced by horror.","Bang!","Finally, after a loud explosion.","Jian Wushuang’s Eternal Night Kingdom suddenly shattered!","A pitch-black Dragon that was tens of thousands of feet long, as large as a mountain range, soared into the sky!","The Dragon was covered in palm-sized scales that glowed with a dark luster. Black clouds swirled around its five claws, and its two horns were forked like sharp swords that could pierce through the sky.","Whoosh!","The Wuqi Divine Sword flew back and was held in Jian Wushuang’s hand. The sword trembled.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless as he raised his head to look at the Black Dragon.","The Dragon race was one of the strongest races in the universe. They were born at the Principles Master realm and had an innate bloodline suppression when facing people from other races.","Jian Wushuang, you are the first person to force me to use my original form. You should be proud. Qiu Long’s eyes were cold as he twisted his huge body in the clouds and said to Jian Wushuang coldly.","After saying that, Qiu Long stepped on the void with his five claws and suddenly hit Jian Wushuang!","The speed of this collision was extremely fast, and a terrifying explosion sound was produced in the void.","Jian Wushuang twisted his neck and stretched out his hand that covered the sky. His five mountain-like fingers formed a fist and he punched at Qiu Long!","Qiu Long and Jian Wushuang, one was a hundred thousand feet long and the other was ninety-eight thousand miles tall. After the collision, the entire eighteenth city shook violently as if it had fallen into a catastrophe.","Countless palaces and buildings collapsed, and the earth split open. In an instant, the entire eighteenth city seemed to turn into chaos. Violent divine power and pressure spread out without restraint, destroying everything in sight!","“He’s too strong!”","“This is still a battle between Ultimate Rulers?”","“We’re all Ultimate Rulers, but we don’t even have the right to interfere in this battle!”","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others all raised their heads to look at this scene and were shocked.","Even the Blood God was dumbfounded.","As one of the nine Overlords, the top heaven’s favorites in the universe, they were all at the peak of the Ruler realm. However, at this moment, they were all shocked. The battle between Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long was far beyond their understanding.","The words ‘comparable to a Supreme martial artist’ appeared in their minds!","Although Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long were still at the Ultimate Ruler Realm, they definitely had the power of a Supreme!","One was a Dragon that had fallen from the Supreme divine level, while the other was a special life form that was a perfect chaotic lifeform. Such a battle was simply rare in the world!","“Bang bang bang!”","Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long kept clashing with each other in the sky. Each time they clashed, there would be a huge blast. If they were not fighting on the Ancient Path of Stars but in the universe, the entire star area would have been destroyed!","Jian Wushuang, you will die today!","Qiu Long roared ferociously and his five claws, which were like five sharp divine swords, cut through the sky and grabbed at Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were also filled with killing intent. He knew that only one of them would survive today!","“Qiu Long, you are the one who will die today!”","Jian Wushuang grabbed Bai Shan with his backhand. He lifted a mountain with his five fingers and smashed it at the head of the Qiu Long with surging divine power!","As the two exchanged blows, they both retreated several steps.","With every step they took, the 18th city trembled violently as if an earthquake was triggered.","The buildings in the eighteenth city had all disappeared. Millions of miles of land were in ruins.","“Innate divine ability, Dragon’s might!”","“Roar!” Qiu Long opened his mouth and roared. In an instant, a mighty pressure from the depths of his bloodline descended!","The Dragon race was also known as the leader of all races. They had an innate suppression over all the other races in the universe!","Under this pressure, even the Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others, who were far away, felt like they were going to kneel down and bow to Qiu Long.","“Is this the might of the dragon clan?” The pupils of the Overlord and the others contracted.","Jian Wushuang snorted and said, “Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”","A power that came from the deepest part of his soul suddenly spread out with Jian Wushuang as the center!","This was also the power of pressure!","Under this pressure, time and space seemed to have frozen!","In the next moment, the pressure of the dragon clan from Qiu Long and the pressure from Jian Wushuang’s perfect chaotic lifeform suddenly collided!","Although these two pressures were invisible, they seemed to have condensed into a physical form at this time. They turned into two opposing auras, constantly pressing and colliding!","Peng peng peng!","In the void, there was an unpleasant sound of friction. Then, everyone saw that the pressure of the dragon clan that belonged to Qiu Long was being pushed back by Jian Wushuang’s pressure!","...","No matter how strong the Dragon was, how could it suppress a perfect chaotic creature?","Under the intimidation of Jian Wushuang’s life force, Qiu Long felt for the first time that the bloodline in his body was submissive.","It was the look of a higher life form looking down on a lower life form!","“Qiu Long, I told you, you’re the one who’s going to die today.” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and grabbed Qiu Long’s tail with his two hands. Then, he smashed Qiu Long’s tail in the most primitive and brutal way.","The ten-thousand-Zhang-long Qiu Long was like a mudfish in Jian Wushuang’s hand. He had no power to resist at all.","Along with Qiu Long’s angry roar, a burst of Golden Dragon blood sprayed from the sky.","When everyone saw this scene, they could not help but be dumbfounded.","Jian Wushuang!","Qiu Long let out a deafening roar and with a violent shake, he broke free from Jian Wushuang’s hands.","Then, he stomped on the ground with his five claws and pulled away from Jian Wushuang. He stared at Jian Wushuang with his huge eyes. There were no other emotions in his eyes, only madness and ruthlessness.","...","“Secret skill, pillar of fire Dragon, breath of destruction!!”","Qiu Long let out a low roar, opened his mouth, and spat out boiling lava.","The lava was terrifying to the extreme. Just a drop of fire was enough to burn a bottomless pit in the ground!"]},{"number":4296,"title":"Chapter 4296 Dragon Slaying (Part Four)","paragraphs":["4296 Dragon Slaying (Part Four)","At the same time.","In the tenth city, where Lady Blue was.","Lady Blue, dressed in blue and wearing a blue veil on her face, had her hands behind her back. Her beautiful eyes narrowed as she looked at the sky in the distance.","It was as if her gaze had pierced through the entire Ancient Path of Stars and saw Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long who were fighting.","“Interesting.”","Lady Blue’s face, which was covered by the veil, showed a smile. She said to herself, “Master, this time, I’ve found two good seedlings for you.”","After saying that, a look of contemplation flashed across Lady Blue’s eyes. With a wave of her right hand, a Mystic Light mirror appeared in her hand.","The dark light mirror expanded in the wind and shot straight at the 18th city.","“All the races in the universe should watch such a battle.” A faint voice came out of her mouth.","The next moment!","In the depths of the universe, regardless of whether it was the Great Void Temple, the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the Da Feng Divine Kingdom, or the Divine Life Palace, an image appeared in the sky above all the great powers.","In the image, there was a giant that looked like a chaos demonic god and a huge Dragon that covered the sky. They were fighting continuously, and the sky and earth were shattered!","The two people were Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long!","...","Within the Great Void Temple.","Emperor God Bing Ye was sitting on the throne. Suddenly, he seemed to have sensed something. He took a step and appeared in the center of the Great Void Temple.","The void there twisted, and a battle scene appeared.","“Jian Wushuang?” The Ice Blaze Divine Hall’s Master’s eyes narrowed and a cold light flashed through them.","“Hmph, they’ve forced Qiu Long to use his true form. No wonder the Divine Life Palace values him so much that they’re even willing to start a war with the Great Void Temple.”","“If this kid doesn’t die, he’ll definitely become a problem in the future.”","...","Within the Divine Life Palace.","Supreme Blood Wave, Supreme Giant Axe, and Supreme Gai Fu raised their heads at the same time and looked at the void.","The video of the battle between Qiu Long and Jian Wushuang was also sent to the Divine Life Palace.","The Blood Wave Supreme looked at Jian Wushuang, who was suppressing Qiu Long, with a smile.","“Giant Axe, this little fellow has grown quite a bit stronger.” He tilted his head and smiled at Supreme Giant Axe.","Supreme Giant Axe raised his head to look at this scene and could not help but gently nod his head. He laughed heartily and said, “Blood Wave, I think the current Jian Wushuang is even stronger than the Ninth Kalpa King when he was in the Ultimate Ruler Realm.”","Supreme Blood Wave did not answer, but he agreed with Jian Wushuang. In the entire Divine Life Palace, he was the only one who knew that the Ninth Kalpa King was a perfect-level special life form, while Jian Wushuang was a special life form that had surpassed the perfect-level!","“Giant Axe, it looks like we two old guys have to work harder. Otherwise, we’ll be surpassed by these juniors sooner or later.” The Ruler Blood Wave laughed.","“Hahaha, isn’t that good?” Supreme Giant Axe laughed.","Supreme Master Gai Fu, who was sitting cross-legged in the void, did not make a sound. However, when he raised his eyes to look at the battle scene, a smile appeared on his old face.","...","In the deepest part of the universe.","Cosmos Temple.","They had also seen the battle between Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long.","At that moment, in a hall, all the Supreme-beings in Cosmos Temple were staring at Jian Wushuang with extremely ugly expressions.","At the head of the hall, a dignified middle-aged man wearing a black-gold crown and a black-gold dragon suit coldly glanced at the group of Supreme martial artists below him and questioned, “When did Jian Wushuang appear? Why don’t I know about it?”","All the Supreme martial artists in the hall were silent.","After a long while, one of the black-robed Supreme martial artists said hesitantly, “Hall Master, I met this man when Nine Phoenix Great Star Area was facing the great calamity. However, he was only a third-level Ruler at that time. I didn’t expect him to reach this level in just tens of thousands of years.”","“Oh?” The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple narrowed his eyes and asked indifferently, “Black Eagle Ruler, why didn’t you kill him back then?”","Upon hearing these words, a look of hatred appeared on the face of the Black Eagle Ruler. “Hall Master, when I was about to kill this man, Supreme Heart Slayer from the Nine Emperor Pavilion saved him.”","“Heart Slayer from the Nine Emperor Pavilion?” The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple muttered to himself, and a cold look flashed in his eyes.","After a long while, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple looked at Supreme Black Eagle and said coldly, “Black Eagle, I order you to go to the entrance of the Ancient Path of Stars. Once Jian Wushuang comes out, kill him on the spot!”","In the Divine Life Palace, a Ninth Kalpa King has already appeared, but another Ninth Kalpa King is not allowed to appear!","Otherwise, Cosmos Temple will be in deep trouble!","“You, do you understand?”","When Black Eagle Supreme saw the cold gaze of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, he felt a chill in his heart. He quickly cupped his hands and replied, “I understand.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Black Eagle did not dare to delay any longer. He took a step forward and left Cosmos Temple, shooting toward the Ancient Path of Stars.","The Cosmos Temple fell silent.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple raised his head again and looked at Jian Wushuang on the battle screen. A murderous intent flashed in his eyes.","...","The 18th city on the Ancient Path of Stars.","This...this is the most powerful abhijna of the fire Dragon!","“If I’m not wrong, Qiu Long should belong to the fire Dragon bloodline of the dragon clan!","...","“Jian Wushuang, you’re in trouble. The breath of destruction is the trump card of the fiery dragon. I’ve read about it before. A Supreme level fiery dragon of the dragon clan turned ten great star areas and billions of lives into ashes with one breath.”","The Overlord and the others looked at Qiu Long and discussed in a low voice. They were all worried about Jian Wushuang.","Ruler Hao Jin clenched his fists, his heart in his throat.","“Lord Blood Sword will be fine! It definitely won’t!”","He kept telling himself this in his heart.","Above the Nine Heavens.","“Jian Wushuang, you are indeed very strong. You are the strongest Ruler that I have ever seen since the ancient times. Even if I were to encounter you when I was still in the Supreme divine realm, I’m afraid that I would be in a difficult situation.”","“Amazing!” Qiu Long exclaimed, but the coldness in his eyes did not decrease at all. Instead, it became even colder.","He knew that if Jian Wushuang did not die this time, he would be the next one to die!","Countless lava gushed out from the deepest part of his body and condensed in his mouth.","“It’s a pity that you’ve encountered me. Alright, Jian Wushuang, die!”","...","“Secret skill, pillar of fire Dragon, breath of destruction!”","Boom!","A pillar of fire that could destroy the world shot out from his mouth!","This pillar of fire was extremely terrifying. The destructive aura it emitted was enough to make the heavens and earth tremble and the chaos boil!","This was the last super power of Qiu Long and it was also the strongest killing move that he had prepared for Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang’s black hair flew in the air and his entire face was slightly red from the reflection of the fire. He looked at the raging fire pillar that was engulfing heaven and earth and destroying the world. His divine body began to shrink continuously until it returned to its ordinary appearance.","The next moment.","His five well-defined fingers gripped the hilt of the Wuqi Divine Sword and said calmly, “Qiu Long, in the past ten thousand years, I have specially prepared a sword for you. Watch this sword.”","“The name of this sword is-”","“Daybreak!”"]},{"number":4297,"title":"Chapter 4297 Destroying a City With a Single Sword Strike!","paragraphs":["4297 Destroying a City With a Single Sword Strike!","Weng.","A golden light suddenly appeared!","As soon as Jian Wushuang finished speaking, he lifted the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand. In an instant, he and the Wuqi Divine Sword turned into a soaring golden light and rushed toward the pillar of fire!","The speed of the golden light was extremely fast. Like a bolt of lightning, it split the sky into two and slammed into the pillar of fire!","!!","No words could describe the horror of this sword. The pillar of flames that emitted a destructive aura was directly split in the middle when it met the golden light, as if it was a knife piercing through tofu!","Sharp!","There was nothing special about this sword except that it was so sharp that it could cut the world apart!","If the Eternal Night was the deprivation that was hidden behind the darkness, then this sword attack was the crushing and crushing from the front!","In the void, there was a whistling sound. The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others felt the dazzling golden light. They could not help but step back and cover their eyes.","At this moment, under the dazzling golden light, the sun that hung high in the sky seemed to have dimmed.","Puchi!","With a muffled sound, the pillar of fire that reached the sky was completely broken apart!","“How is that possible?” Qiu Long’s pupils contracted, and for the first time, a look of disbelief appeared on his face.","However, before he could react, the golden light had already flashed across his neck like a golden lightning!","Behind Qiu Long, the golden light that Jian Wushuang had turned into stopped. Then, the light dispersed, revealing a black-haired and expressionless Jian Wushuang.","The strong wind made Jian Wushuang’s Black clothes and black hair flutter. Jian Wushuang turned around slowly with an indifferent expression.","When everyone saw this scene, they could not help being stunned.","It seemed...it was as if nothing had happened?","However, at this moment!","“Roar!”","Qiu Long let out an extremely shrill roar. A line of blood suddenly appeared on his neck, and endless dragon blood spurted out!","Clang.","The entire dragon head fell to the ground!","This sword directly chopped off Qiu Long’s head!","This was not the end. The sky and the earth began to shake violently!","Rumble!","Under everyone’s horrified eyes, the earth and the sky began to split!","A huge sword mark gradually appeared!","Under this sword mark, the entire 18th city, 100000 miles of mountains and rivers, were penetrated by the sword mark and divided into two sides!","The Daybreak sword not only cut off the head of the Qiu Long, but also split the 18 cities into two!","One sword to destroy the city!","Hiss!","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others gasped. They were all shocked to the extreme.","Only the Rulers on the Ancient Path of Stars knew what kind of concept it was to be able to create such terrifying power with a single sword strike!","“This sword strike is enough to kill any Ultimate Ruler in the world!” The Overlord’s eyes were focused as he said in a deep voice.","He had the rare immortal Overlord body, which had amazing defensive power. Even when he had fought with Qiu Long, Qiu Long could not do anything to him for a while without using his trump card.","However, he was now absolutely certain that even if there were ten of him, he would not be able to withstand this sword!","As for the Blood God, he had already fled madly, afraid that Jian Wushuang would settle the score with him.","At this moment, it was not just on the Ancient Path of Stars.","Countless top forces outside the Ancient Path of Stars were watching the battle. Their eyes shone brightly and they exclaimed in surprise.","“This sword is comparable to a Supreme martial artist!” The Blood Wave Supreme and the Supreme Giant Axe exclaimed in surprise.","Even Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu let out a soft gasp of surprise as a look of surprise appeared on his face.","“This sword...it’s somewhat familiar.”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu seemed to have thought of something, and a thoughtful look flashed across his eyes.","...","Within the solar Star field.","This was the habitat of the Golden Crows.","The battle between Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long was also shown here.","The Golden Crow Prince’s expression was dark, and he clenched his fists without saying a word.","Suddenly, a deep and majestic voice sounded behind him. “Lin ‘er, don’t find trouble with this person anymore. He...you can’t defeat him.”","Hearing this, the Golden Crow Prince quickly turned around and cupped his hands, “Father!”","The person who had just spoken was none other than the great Emperor Jin Wu!","“Yes, this kid has grown up. From this sword, it can be seen that if this kid dies without any accident, he will definitely have a place among the peak people of the universe in the future.” The deep and majestic voice came again.","“But, but I almost died in his hands. If I don’t get my revenge, I won’t be able to accept it...”","...","The Golden Crow Prince clenched his fists and gritted his teeth. He did not dare to struggle.","“Idiot! You’re the son of the great Emperor Jin Wu. If you don’t have this much magnanimity, what great things can you achieve?”","The great Emperor Jin Wu snorted coldly. After a moment of silence, he continued, “Of course, you don’t have to be afraid of him. It’s fine as long as you don’t deliberately provoke him. After all, you’re the Prince of my Golden Crow clan and can’t lose your status. If this child dares to provoke you... Hmph, as long as I’m alive, no one in this world will be able to bully you!”","“My son...I understand!”","The Golden Crow Prince took a deep breath, and a look of enlightenment flashed in his eyes. He lowered his head and replied respectfully.","“Mhm, he’s able to accept what he’s got, this is the attitude that the Prince of the Golden Crow clan should have.”","The Golden Crow’s eyes glinted with relief before he changed the topic. “Let’s continue watching. Those guys from the dragon clan probably can’t sit still any longer.”","...","Within the Ancient Path of Stars.","Although Qiu Long’s head was cut off by Jian Wushuang, he did not die easily. Dark golden Dragon blood gushed out of his mouth as he stared at Jian Wushuang without saying a word.","“Qiu Long, I’ve said it before. You’re the one who’s going to die today, not me. I, Jian Wushuang, always keep my word.” Jian Wushuang walked down from the sky, looked down at Qiu Long, and said indifferently.","...","Qiu Long stared at Jian Wushuang and suddenly laughed.","A strange look appeared in his eyes.","“Jian Wushuang, do you believe that you can’t kill me?”","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm. He held the Wuqi Divine Sword upside down and walked toward him step by step.","A great amount of divine power started to gather in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","“It seems like you don’t believe me?”","Qiu Long chuckled and shook his head, “Jian Wushuang, you won’t understand. We, the members of the dragon clan, can only be killed by the dragon clan and buried in the Dragon graveyard. Even if I’m expelled by the dragon clan, this will not change.”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He raised his arm and slashed at Qiu Long’s head with the Wuqi Divine Sword!","Ding!","However, at this moment, a huge resistance force suddenly came from Qiu Long’s body!"]},{"number":4298,"title":"Chapter 4298 Qiulong Dies","paragraphs":["4298 Qiulong Dies","The Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand seemed to have hit an invisible wall and could not fall any further.","“Jian Wushuang, I told you. You can’t kill me.” A mocking look appeared on Qiu Long’s face as he laughed fearlessly.","The next moment!","A huge shadow appeared behind him.","!!","This phantom was wearing black armor with mysterious patterns on it. The waistcoat was formed by two dragon claws, and it had a dragon head and a human body.","The Black Eagle had an indifferent expression. He glanced at Jian Wushuang indifferently and said indifferently, “Human, I’m Dragon Nine, the law enforcer of the dragon clan. The members of the dragon clan must be handed over to the dragon clan to deal with. I’ll give you the time it takes for an incense stick to burn to send Qiu Long out of the Ancient Path of Stars. The dragon clan will send someone to pick up Qiu Long and bring him back to the dragon clan.”","“The dragon clan’s law enforcer?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and then, as if he didn’t hear anything, divine power poured into the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and pressed down on the Qiu Long’s head inch by inch!","“Ka ka ka!!!”","In an instant, the void above the Qiu Long’s head was filled with the sound of glass breaking.","In an instant, Qiu Long and the dragon clan’s law enforcer’s faces changed.","“Human, I’m talking to you. Did you not hear me?” The illusionary figure of the Dragon Clan’s law enforcer squinted his eyes, which emitted a cold and sharp light.","“You’re too noisy!”","Jian Wushuang shouted coldly and continued to stab at Qiu Long’s head with the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand!","When the Dragon Clan’s law-enforcement officer saw this, he was instantly enraged to the extreme. He opened his mouth and scolded sternly, “I’ll give you the last three breaths. Now! Immediately! He immediately stopped what he was doing! After that, we’ll send Qiu Long out of the Ancient Path of Stars and let him be punished by our Dragon Clan!”","“Impudent! Human, are you challenging my authority? Are you challenging the dignity of the Dragon race?”","When the dragon clan’s law-enforcement officer saw this, he was instantly enraged to the extreme. He opened his mouth and scolded sternly, “I’ll give you the last three breaths. Now! Immediately! He immediately stopped what he was doing! After that, we’ll send Qiu Long out of the Ancient Path of Stars and let him be punished by our dragon clan! Otherwise, you will bear the consequences!”","“Three!”","“Two!”","“You’re too noisy.”","Without waiting for him to finish, Jian Wushuang slashed his sword and shattered the illusionary shadow of the Dragon Clan’s enforcer!","“You’re just a mere consciousness Phantom without any divine power. Even if you were here in person, you wouldn’t be able to stop me from killing someone!” Jian Wushuang sneered and with a flip of his hand, the Wuqi Divine Sword stabbed toward Qiu Long’s head again!","“Qiu Long, you will die today.”","This time, Qiu Long’s expression finally changed drastically.","“Jian Wushuang, stop! Do you know what you are doing now?” Qiu Long was shocked and angry.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s lips curved into a mocking arc and he said indifferently, “Are you afraid now?”","Qiu Long’s expression was livid, and he replied, “Jian Wushuang, do you know the consequences of killing me? The dragon clan’s enforcer represents the dignity of the dragon clan. You have shattered his consciousness shadow, so the dragon clan will never let you off. They will definitely allow anyone who has provoked the dragon clan to live!”","After a short pause, Qiu Long’s expression softened and he continued, “The only way for you to survive is to let me go. I promise that when I return to the dragon clan, I will be able to speak to you. How about it?”","“Not much.”","Jian Wushuang laughed sarcastically and without any hesitation, he stabbed the Wuqi Divine Sword into Qiu Long’s head!","“Roar!”","As Qiu Long roared in pain, he began to struggle violently and smashed the surroundings madly.","Jian Wushuang held the hilt of the sword tightly with both hands and stabbed it into the Wuqi Divine Sword on Qiu Long’s head. Waves of sharp sword Qi burst out continuously and shattered the divine power that belonged to the dragon clan in Qiu Long’s body!","Countless drops of dragon blood splattered on Jian Wushuang’s face, but he did not react at all. He was extremely indifferent to Qiu Long’s cries.","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others were all stunned by this scene. Their lips trembled as they said, “Tu...Dragon slaying! Jian Wushuang is killing a Dragon!”","“I don’t know how many years it has been, but it hasn’t left the universe. Who would dare to kill a member of the dragon clan?”","“This is the dragon clan! The dragon clan will be in charge of the dragon clan. This is a rule set at the birth of the universe. Jian Wushuang actually dared to break this rule!”","“Even the Great Void Temple only suppressed Qiu Long and did not kill him because they were considering the reaction of the Dragon Tribe! Now, Jian Wushuang has destroyed the illusionary Shadow of the Dragon clan’s law enforcer and killed Qiu Long...”","The Overlord and the others were not the only ones who were shocked.","Even in the universe, the top forces were watching this scene with their eyes shining.","“Hmph, Jian Wushuang is really stupid.”","In the Great Void Temple, Supreme Bing Ye snorted coldly as he had already sentenced Jian Wushuang to death in his heart.","A Dragon had a reverse scale that would kill anyone who touched it!","The dragon clan’s reverse scale was his high and mighty prestige.","Whoever dared to challenge the dragon clan’s dignity had to be prepared to die!","...","In the Cosmos Temple, the Palace Master, who was wearing a black gold crown and a purple gold royal robe, also smiled.","“The sins of the heavens can be forgiven, but the sins of one’s own can not be lived. Now it seems that the little guy from the Divine Life Palace is already dead without the help of Cosmos Temple.”","All of a sudden, the entire universe was abuzz with discussions about Jian Wushuang killing the dragon.","Some people sneered. “Jian Wushuang was cutting off his own future and acting on impulse.” Some people sighed. “If Jian Wushuang had let Qiu Long go, the dragon clan wouldn’t have let him go easily based on what he had done. However, Jian Wushuang had put himself in danger.”","Only a burst of hearty laughter came from the Divine Life Palace.","“Hahahaha, this little guy doesn’t even give face to the dragon clan. He’s really different from ordinary people. I’m really more and more fond of him.”","The Ruler Blood Wave laughed in a carefree manner.","On the other hand, Supreme Being Giant Axe seemed a little worried and said, “Blood Wave, I’m afraid the dragon clan won’t let Jian Wushuang go so easily.”","...","The Ruler Blood Wave narrowed his eyes and sneered. “Jian Wushuang is a member of the Divine Life Palace and he is considered half a disciple of mine. If the dragon clan finds trouble with him, I, Blood Wave, will take the blame for him! What’s there to fear?”","Supreme Giant Axe could not help but smile wryly. He shook his head and did not say anything.","...","In the universe, there were many discussions about Jian Wushuang.","Meanwhile, in the 18th city on the Ancient Path of Stars.","As the sword essence of the Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand continued to burst out in Qiu Long’s head, finally, Qiu Long’s struggle gradually weakened.","At the last moment, Qiu Long no longer looked like he was struggling. Instead, he stared at Jian Wushuang and said with hatred, “Jian Wushuang, it doesn’t matter if I die. Don’t worry, you will come down to accompany me soon.”","Bang!","With a loud explosion, the Dragon’s body completely collapsed. Starting from the dragon’s tail, it dissipated inch by inch."]},{"number":4299,"title":"Chapter 4299 The Number One Expert on the Ancient Path of Stars","paragraphs":["4299 The Number One Expert on the Ancient Path of Stars","Qiu Long was dead!","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, Qiu Long’s body completely collapsed. Starting from his tail, he disappeared inch by inch. Finally, like a sand painting being blown by the wind, he turned into dust and disappeared from the world.","At this moment, the entire Ancient Path of Stars became deathly silent, leaving behind only the sound of heavy breathing.","Everyone raised their heads and looked at the black-robed figure standing in the void.","!!","His expression was indifferent, and he held a sword in his right hand. His handsome face was cold, and there was no joy or sorrow on it. However, such an ordinary and thin figure was like a god in their eyes at this moment, so bright that they could not see him.","There were many invincible Rulers in the universe, but only at this moment could Jian Wushuang be called truly invincible!","“I knew it. He can always create miracles.” Commander Mountain Shaker let out a long breath.","It was only when Qiu Long died that his heart truly fell.","Ruler Hao Jin’s face was filled with excitement, and he clenched his fists. Lord bloodsword was still the same Lord bloodsword. He would never disappoint anyone.","Weng.","With Qiu Long’s death, an interspatial ring also broke, and countless precious divine materials dropped from it. The most eye-catching ones were dozens of God sealing monuments.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed and he put the countless divine materials and origin stones, as well as the dozens of Investiture of the Gods, into his Interspatial Ring.","Then, Jian Wushuang walked down from the void.","break! he flicked his sleeve, and the two black chains binding Ruler Hao Jin’s shoulder blades were instantly shattered. Before Ruler Hao Jin could even fall from the stone shelf, an invisible force lifted him up.","“Thank you, Lord Blood Sword.”","Ruler Hao Jin’s body trembled, and his eyes couldn’t help but turn red.","No one knew how much torture he had suffered in the past 10000 years. His divine body was constantly crushed and reassembled, and his divine soul was burned by flames. If it were anyone else, they would have collapsed long ago.","The reason why he had persisted for so long was none other than the words that Jian Wushuang had sent to his mind before he died.","“Wait for me.”","He had waited for Jian Wushuang for ten thousand years just because of these three words.","Finally, Jian Wushuang came.","“Don’t call me Lord Blood Sword. Just call me Jian Wushuang.” Jian Wushuang looked at Ruler Hao Jin with an apologetic look. If it weren’t for him, Ruler Hao Jin wouldn’t have come and been tortured by Qiu Long for such a long time.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang placed his right hand on Ruler Hao Jin’s shoulder. A gentle divine power flowed through Jian Wushuang’s right hand and into Ruler Hao Jin’s divine body, helping him heal his injuries and recover his divine power.","“Hao Jin, from now on, as long as I’m here on the Ancient Path of Stars, you won’t be bullied in the slightest.”","“Thank you, Lord Blood Sword!”","Ruler Hao Jin dropped to his knees, tears of gratitude streaming down his face.","Jian Wushuang shook his head. He reckoned that it was impossible for Ruler Hao Jin to change his mind now. He did not force the issue. He turned to the Overlord and the others and said, “All of you, come over. I want to restore order on the Ancient Path of Stars!”","“Yes!”","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint Son, and the young clan leader of the Moluo clan looked at each other. They were all nervous.","Now, Jian Wushuang’s strength was enough to sweep the entire Ancient Path of Stars. No one could keep him in check.","Jian Wushuang had already become the first person on the Ancient Path of Stars!","If Jian Wushuang wanted to kill them all like Qiu Long, they would not be able to do anything.","I hope Jian Wushuang will not be the second Qiu Long.","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others all sighed in their hearts.","...","...","Within the powers of the universe.","As Jian Wushuang killed Qiu Long, the image in the void stopped.","In an instant, the entire universe was in an uproar!","The name ‘Jian Wushuang’ had completely spread far and wide, causing a sensation in the entire universe!","Everyone knew that an extraordinary figure had appeared in the Ultimate Ruler Realm.","At this moment, the Divine Life Palace was in an uproar.","Jian Wushuang killed Qiu Long and became a God in one battle!","Jian Wushuang is the number one on the Ancient Path of Stars. No one can stop him!","Jian Wushuang is the only Dragon Slayer in the same realm since ancient times!","Jian Wushuang will become the second strongest person in the Ruler realm after the Ninth Kalpa King!","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace were all extremely excited, and they ran around telling each other.","The Divine Life Palace was one of the top powers in the universe and had been silent for far too long. However, this time, Supreme Blood Wave and Supreme Giant Axe had attacked the Great Void Temple first to inform the entire universe that no disciple of the Divine Life Palace should be humiliated! Later on, Jian Wushuang had succeeded in killing the dragon and became the number one on the Ancient Path of Stars!","They had never felt the power of the Divine Life Palace before.","“How fortunate, how glorious!”","These words were deeply imprinted in the minds of every disciple of the Divine Life Palace.","Meanwhile, back in the sixth mountain range.","Leng Rushuang, who had just come out of her closed-door cultivation, looked at the disciples of the Divine Life Palace flying by in the sky. She frowned when she saw their excited faces. She stopped one of the disciples and asked in confusion, “May I ask what happened in the Divine Palace? Why is everyone so excited?”","The disciple of the Divine Life Palace rolled his eyes and thought to himself, “The news of Jian Wushuang’s death was sealed by Supreme Blood Wave’s order. Now that Jian Wushuang has returned and become the No. 1 on the Ancient Path of Stars, I should be able to tell him, right?”","...","Clearing his throat, the disciple of the Divine Life Palace cupped his hands and said respectfully, “Madam, you may not know this, but your husband, Jian Wushuang, has become the first person on the Ancient Path of Stars!”","“What?”","Leng Rushuang raised her eyebrows and thought to herself, “It seems that I’ve missed a lot of things during my closed-door cultivation.”","“Senior brother, can you tell me more about it?” she asked.","“Naturally.”","...","The news about the battle between Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long spread to all parts of the universe at an extremely fast speed.","All of a sudden, all parts of the universe were filled with discussions about Jian Wushuang. Some busybodies even conferred Jian Wushuang the title of being below Supremes and above Rulers!","At this moment, in a remote star field in the universe.","This star area was called the Void Wind Star area. It was not ranked among the major star areas in the universe. The resources in this star area were scarce, and very few experts were willing to stay. The highest cultivation base among them was only the Ultimate Ruler.","In the Void Wind Starfield, in the largest astral world, the mountain Sun astral.","...","There was a mountain that reached into the clouds and the peak was covered in clouds all year round. There was a rumor in the mountain Sun Star World that there were Celestials living on this mountain.","A simple and honest-looking young man and a rather mischievous girl were sitting on the edge of the mountain, shaking their fair and tender legs.","If Jian Wushuang was here, he would have recognized them as the disciples of Water Sorcerer Ruler, whom he had met once in the zenith ruins."]},{"number":4300,"title":"Chapter 4300 The Ancient Bronze Cauldron","paragraphs":["4300 The Ancient Bronze Cauldron","“Junior Sister Qingxi, are you thinking about that person again?” Ran Gu sat down next to her, glanced at her, and said in a mischievous tone.","When Qingxi heard this, her pretty face couldn’t help but blush. She said angrily, “Senior brother, what are you saying? Don’t spout nonsense!”","She bared her fangs and brandished her claws, like a little tiger bluffing.","Upon seeing this, Ran Gu immediately laughed and said, “I didn’t even say that person’s name, how do you know who I’m talking about?”","After that, he reached out and rubbed Qingxi’s hair. He chuckled and said, “Although we haven’t had much contact with Brother Blood Sword, I can tell that he’s a dragon and phoenix among men. If you like him, why not? It can’t be considered embarrassing.”","After a pause, he continued, “Besides, didn’t master already say that he’s willing to help you find Brother Blood Sword?”","Hearing this, Qingxi’s face turned red, but she did not refute him. She just lowered her head and did not dare to look at Ran Gu. Her two lily-white hands clenched the corners of her clothes tightly.","At this moment, a beam of light shot over from the horizon.","Ran Gu and Qingxi quickly stood up.","“Master has returned from his travels.”","The escaping light dissipated, revealing the figure of an old man. It was Water Sorcerer Ruler, whom Jian Wushuang had befriended back in the Tarot ruins.","“Master, is Junior Sister Qingxi thinking about that person again? Master, have you heard any news about brother Blood Sword?” Ran Gu said with a smile.","“Master, don’t listen to senior brother’s nonsense!” Qingxi rolled her eyes at Ran Gu, but she could not hide the anticipation in the depths of her eyes.","However, the Water Sorcerer Ruler’s expression was a little strange today. He glanced at Qingxi with a complicated expression and said slowly, “Qingxi, let’s drop the matter of Blood Sword. Don’t think about it anymore.”","“Ah?”","Qingxi shuddered and hurriedly raised her head to look at Water Sorcerer Ruler.","“Let’s go!” The Water Sorcerer Ruler said expressionlessly, striding past them without another word.","“Master, why?”","“Let’s go!” Ran Gu shouted at Water Sorcerer Ruler back.","Water Sorcerer Ruler came to a halt upon hearing this question.","“There’s no reason.”","Water Sorcerer Ruler stepped into a private room.","Bang!","The door of the room was tightly closed.","Outside the room, Qingxi bit her lower lip hard, and her eyes gradually welled up with tears.","Ran Gu opened his mouth, as if he wanted to say something, but in the end, he sighed dejectedly, shook his head, and said nothing more.","He knew that since his master said so, he must have his reasons.","The two of them did not know.","Water Sorcerer Ruler was looking out the window of a private room, his hands clasped behind his back as he stared at the two with a helpless expression.","If he had no other choice, why would he say that?","“Xiaoxi, it’s not that I’m being unreasonable, but that Blood Sword is truly an important figure like a dragon in the sky. It’s not something we can reach. Rather than asking to be humiliated later, it’s better for me to cut the Gordian knot and help you remove your feelings as soon as possible.”","...","The news that Jian Wushuang had killed Qiu Long spread to every corner of the universe like a tornado.","Cosmos Temple, Great Void Temple, Nine Emperor Pavilion...","All the major forces had made a move because of Jian Wushuang.","It was said that the Nine Emperor Pavilion had already upgraded Jian Wushuang’s treatment to the highest level, comparable to that of a Supreme.","However, the dragon clan, which everyone had been looking forward to the most, had unexpectedly fallen silent.","At first, everyone had predicted that the disgraced dragon clan would launch a storm of attacks on Jian Wushuang. However, the dragon clan did not. It was as if nothing had happened. They did not mention Jian Wushuang’s name.","However, everyone knew that the more the dragon clan acted this way, the more terrifying the situation was!","As one of the most powerful races in the universe, the Dragon race would definitely not give up just like that.","The Dragon race was only preparing for a world-shaking storm that would shock the universe!","At that time, the storm would not only target Jian Wushuang, but also the Divine Life Palace, the Blood Wave Supreme, and so on.","Meanwhile, in the depths of the Ancient Path of Stars, in the eighteenth city...","Under the protection of the rules, the 18th city, which had been reduced to ruins, was gradually beginning to recover.","In a Palace.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and was quietly packing up the loot he had obtained after killing Qiu Long.","There was no need to mention the divine materials, divine medicine, and universe origin stones. As the Supreme divine realm expert of the Dragon race, Qiu Long had plundered the Ancient Path of Stars for the past ten thousand years, and the number of things he had obtained could be counted in the sea.","Just the number of universe origin stones alone was no less than a billion.","As for divine materials, divine medicines, and some top-tier nomological true treasures, they were piled up like a mountain of garbage.","Jian Wushuang did not care about these things. The treasures he had brought out from the Tarot ruins were enough for him to use up for several chaos cycles. No matter how many things he had, they were just numbers to him.","However, Jian Wushuang was quite tempted by The Investiture of the Gods.","In the past ten thousand years, Qiu Long had collected eighty-five Investiture of the Gods!","It could be said that except for the deification tablets in the hands of the Overlord and the Nine Stars Saint, the others had all fallen into the hands of Qiu Long.","Of course, all of this naturally belonged to Jian Wushuang. Qiu Long’s plundering over the past ten thousand years was just a wedding dress for Jian Wushuang.","...","“Eighty-five Investiture of the Gods, plus the six I have, I have ninety-one. It doesn’t matter if I take the ones in the Overlord’s hands or not.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he was deep in thought.","If there were no accidents, it could be said that Jian Wushuang had already received the invitation to the Great Clan Gathering. All he needed to wait for was time.","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and continued to search for Qiu Long’s relics.","Soon, the two treasures caught Jian Wushuang’s attention.","One of them was an ancient bronze cauldron that had a missing leg.","The bronze cauldron was square in shape, and its body was covered with mysterious and obscure runes. It should have had four legs, but one of them seemed to have been forcibly cut off, leaving only three legs. It was clearly incomplete.","However, after Jian Wushuang’s surging divine power fell into the ancient cauldron, it was like a stone ox entering the sea. Nothing could be detected and the grade could not be distinguished.","One should know that with Jian Wushuang’s current divine power, even if it was a universe law Cardinal treasure with extreme power like the Wuqi Divine Sword, he could instantly figure out the truth and refine it to control it.","“I’m afraid the origin of this bronze cauldron is extraordinary.” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and a thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","“However, we’ll have to wait until later to verify what this ancient bronze cauldron is.”","...","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang ignored the cauldron and put it into his interspatial ring. Then, he looked at the second item that caught his attention.","It was a black token with dragon patterns!"]}]);
